readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	A6	A6			0	om	Faayiliin kun odeeffannoo barbaachisaa waa'ee sagantaa kanaa ofkeessaa qaba. Hojii jalqabuun dura odeeffannoo kana sirriitti dubbisi.				20200411 15:09:53
readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	A7	A7			0	om	The Apache OpenOffice Community, responsible for the development of this product, would like to invite you to participate as a community member. As a new user, you can check out the ${PRODUCTNAME} community site with helpful information at <a href="https://openoffice.apache.org">https://openoffice.apache.org</a>				20200411 15:09:53
readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	A9	A9			0	om	Also read the sections below about getting involved in the Apache OpenOffice project.				20200411 15:09:53
readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	A10	A10			0	om	${PRODUCTNAME} dhuguma fayyadamaa kamiifiyyuu bilisaa? 				20200411 15:09:53
readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	A11	A11			0	om	${PRODUCTNAME} is free for use by everybody. You may take this copy of ${PRODUCTNAME} and install it on as many computers as you like, and use it for any purpose you like (including commercial, government, public administration and educational use). For further details see the license text delivered together with ${PRODUCTNAME} or <a href="https://www.openoffice.org/license.html">https://www.openoffice.org/license.html</a>				20200411 15:09:53
readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	A12	A12			0	om	${PRODUCTNAME} maaliif fayyadamaa kamiifiyyuu bilisa ta'e? 				20200411 15:09:53
readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	A13	A13			0	om	Garagalcha ${PRODUCTNAME} kana har'a gatii malee kan fayyadamuu dandeesse gumaattoonni dhuunfaa fi ispoonsaroonni xindoo ${PRODUCTNAME} waan amma tahe kana - mosajjii ofiisii madda-banaa addunyaa irratti dursaa jiru akka tahu waan saxaxani, dagaagsani, yaalani, hiikani, galmeessani, deeggarani, gabaarra oolchanii fi karaa hedduudhaan gargaaraniifi.				20200411 15:09:53
readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	A13b	A13b			0	om	If you appreciate their efforts, and would like to ensure Apache OpenOffice continues into the future, please consider contributing to the project - see <a href="https://openoffice.apache.org/get-involved.html">https://openoffice.apache.org/get-involved.html</a> for details on contributing time and <a href="https://www.apache.org/foundation/contributing.html">https://www.apache.org/foundation/contributing.html</a> for details on donations. Everyone has a contribution to make.				20200411 15:09:53
