helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488				0	om	Wanta tokko islaaydii ammaa irraa filuuf, meeshaa (xiyya adii) kabala fakkasaa irraa \<emph\>Select\</emph\> cuqaasi, kana booda wanticha cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3148610				0	om	Wanta tokko caalu filuuf, osoo cuqaastu Shift dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699				0	om	Wantaa isa wantaa kabiroo booda filuuf, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Dirqala\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> dhiibi, kan booda wanticha cuqaasi. Kabbaa keessaa wanta xabboo itti aanuu filuuf, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Dirqala \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> dhiibi, kan booda deebisii cuqaasi. Filannoo gara wantaa duraan filatameetti deebisuuf, Shift + \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Dirqala\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> dhiibi, kan booda cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3154651				0	om	Barruu wanta filatame tokkotti ida'uuf, wanticha lama-cuqaasitii, barruu kee barreessi yk galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3153812				0	om	Filannoo tokko haquuf, ala wanta filatamee bakka barbaadde cuqaasi, yk Escape dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
