helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0200.xhp	0	help	par_id3125863				0	om	Kutaan kun, ilaalcha gubbaa kamshaalee Fakkasaa $[officename] keessa jiran laata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0503.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Amalawwan Fakkasaa $[officename]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148797				0	om	\<variable id=\"main0503\"\>\<link href=\"text/sdraw/main0503.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] Draw Features\"\>Amalawwan Fakkasaa $[officename]\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975				0	om	Fakkasaan $[officename] dhangiiwwan calaqqee wajjummaa tokko keessatti, fakkasa salphaa fi xaxaa akka uumtu, akkasuumas alergiitu sidandeesiissa. Akkasuumas, fakkasaawwan kee keessatti gabateewwan, taattoowwan, foormulaawwan fi maalimaawwan kabiroo sagantaawwan $[officename] keessatti uumaman saaguu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147435				0	om	Saxaatoo Veektarii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3153142				0	om	Fakkasaan $[officename] sararawwan fi qonyoowwan veektarii herregaan qinda'ee fayyadamuun, saxaatoo veektarii uuma. Veektariin, akkaataa jomeetirii isaaniiti sararawwan, luulloo, fi rogdanee ibsa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154320				0	om	Wantawwan G3 Uumuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3145251				0	om	Wantawwan G3 salphaa kaneen akka kuboowwan, mulullee, fi akmooyyeewwan Fakkasaa $[officename] keessatti uumuu, akkasuumas madda ifaa wantichaa fooyyessuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154491				0	om	Tarsaawwan fi Qajeelchota				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3149379				0	om	Tarsaawwan fi qajeelchotnii, fakkasa kee keessatti yaddachisaa argiitu kan akka wantawwan hiriirsuu sigaragaaruu keena. Akkasuumas, wantichii akka ariitiin sarara tarsaa tokkotti, qajeelchotatti, yk gara qarree wanta kan birootti filachuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155601				0	om	Wantawwan Walqabsiissuu Hariiroo Mul'isuuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3149124				0	om	Hariiroo wantawwan gidduu jiru mul'isuuf, wantawwan Fakkasaa $[officename] keessaa sararawwan addayaa "kornyoo" jedhamee waamamu waliin walindhuu nidandeessa. Kornyoowwanii tuqaalee cufaa wantawwan fakkasaa irraa miiltoo tahan, yammuu wantawwan walqabatan siqaniis miiltoo akkuma tahetti hafa. Kornyoowwanii taattoowwan jaarmayaa fi safaka ogummaa uumuuf gargaara.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155764				0	om	Rogawwan Agarsiissuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3155333				0	om	Safakawwanii ogummaa, yeroo hedduu garawwan wanta fakkasicha keessaa mul'isu. Fakkasaa $[officename] keessatti, gara sorooroo herreguu, fi agarsiissuuf, sararawwan garaa fayyadamuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154705				0	om	Kuusaafaayaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3154022				0	om	Kuusaafaayaan, calaqqee, sochii fakkinaa, sagalee fi maalimaawwan ka biroo isa ati fakkasaa kee keessatti saaguu fi fayyadamuu dandeessu, akkasuumas sagantaawwan  $[officename] ka biroo of keessaa qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149207				0	om	Dhangiiwwan Faayilii Saxaatoo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3155112				0	om	Fakkasaan $[officename], faayilii saxaatoo wajjummaa gara dhangiiwwan hedduutti alerguu dandaa'a isaaniis, BMP, GIF, JPG, fi PNG.				20200411 15:09:53
