helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3148917				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:BezierDelete\"\>Tuqaalee filataman keessaa tokko ykn hedduu haquudhaaf, sajoo \<emph\>Delete Points\</emph\> fayyadami. Yoo tuqaalee hedduu filachuu barbaaddee, qabduu Shift gad-dhiibdee tuqaalee warra sirii tahan irra cuqaasi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
