helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157896				0	om	\<link href=\"text/shared/main0213.xhp\" name=\"Form Navigation Bar\"\>Naanna'insa Unkaa Irraa\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	om	Kabalii \<emph\>Naanna'insa Unkaa\</emph\> sajoowwan akka gabatee kuusdeetaa ykn mulannoo deetaa too'atu of keessaa qaba. Kabalichii galmee isa dirreewwan of keessaa qabu isa kuusdeetaatti walqabatee jalatti mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958				0	om	Kabalii \<emph\>Naanna'insa Unkaa\</emph\> galmeewwan keessa siquuf akkasuumas galmeewwan saaguu fi haquuf itti fayyadamuu nidandeessa. Yoo deetaan unka keessatti olkaa'amee, jijjiiramichi gara kuusdeetaatti darba. Kabalii \<emph\>Naanna'insa Unkaa\</emph\> akkasuumas fo'aa, gingilchaa, fi galmeewwan deetaatiif dalagawwan barbaachaa of keessaa qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_idN10717				0	om	Sajoo kabala Naanna'insaa, kabala Naanna'insaa \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\"\>Too'annaa Caalaa \</link\> irraa unkatti ida'uuf fayyadamuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3157910				0	om	Kabala Naanna'insaa, unkawwan kuusdeetaatti walqabataniif qofa mul'ata. Unka kan \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/04030000.xhp\" name=\"Design view\"\>Mul'annoo Saxaxaa\</link\> keessatti, kabala Naanna'insaa hinmul'atu. Akkasuumas \<link href=\"text/shared/main0212.xhp\" name=\"Database Bar\"\>Kabala Deetaa Gabatee\</link\> ilaali.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3153880				0	om	Dalagawwan fooyinsa fi gingilchuutiin mul'annoo deetaa too'achuu nidandeessa. Gabateewwanii xabboo hin jijjiiraman.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3153062				0	om	Ajajii fooyi ammaa ykn gingilchaan galmee ammaa waliin olkaa'amu. Yoo gingilchaan qindaa'ee, sajoo \<emph\>Gingilchaa Fayyadami\</emph\> kabala \<emph\>Naanna'insaa\</emph\> irraa kakaa'aadha. Amalawwanii fooyinsa fi gingilchaa galmee keessaa, akkasuuma qaaqa \<emph\>Amalawwan Unkaa\</emph\> keessatti qindaa'uu nidandaa'a. (\<emph\>Amalawwan Unkaa - Deetaa\</emph\> - Amalawwan \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"Sort\"\>\<emph\>Fooyi\</emph\>\</link\> fi \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"Filter\"\>\<emph\>Gingilchaa\</emph\>\</link\> filadhu).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3149810				0	om	Himii SQL yoo unkaaf bu'ura tahe (\<emph\>Amalawwan Unkaa\</emph\> - caancala \<emph\>Deetaa\</emph\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"Data Source\"\>\<emph\>Madda Deetaa\</emph\>\</link\> ilaali), kana booda dalagawwanii gingilchaa fi fooyii kan mul'atan yammuu himii SQL gabatee tokko qofaaf yammuu wabii tahu qofaaf, yammuu haalata SQL dhalootaa keessatti hinbarreefamne qofa.				20200411 15:09:53
