helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id3153414	2			0	om	Kabalii Haalojii, odeeffannoo waa'ee galmee ammaa fi qabduuwwan fooyii dalagawwan addaa waliin dhiyeessuu of keessaa qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
