helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3154253				0	om	Kabalii \<emph\>Durargii Fuulaa\</emph\> kan mul'atu, yammuu ati galmee ammaa haalataa durargii fuulaa keessatti mul'istuudha.				20200411 15:09:53
