helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138				0	om	Dhaggeeffataan galmaa'eera. Yommuu mudatni dhalate, dhaggeeffataa walgitaan tooftaa sirrii walquunnama com.sun.star.container.XContainerListener irraa ni waama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148922				0	om	Huddeelsoon Dhaggeeffattoota galmaa'an Basic-subroutines irraa waama. Sirni bu'uraa sa'aa-darbee Basic-subroutines yookiin faankishinoota maqaa "PrefixListenerMethode" qaban barbaaduu fi yommuu isaan argaman waamuu dha, gama biraatiin dogoggorri sa'aa-darbee ni dhalata.				20200411 15:09:53
