helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358				0	om	\<emph\>Lakkaa'aa:\</emph\> Marsaa lakkaa'aan gatii jalqabarratti gara harka mirgaa mallattoo walqixaa kaa'a. Lakkofsa jijjiramtootaa qofatu sirriidha. Marsaa lakkaa'aan ni dabala ykn ni hir'ata akkaataa jijjiiramaa Step hanga End'n darbutti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	par_id3152455				0	om	\<emph\>Jalqaba:\</emph\> Lakkoofsi jijjiiramaan gatii jalqabaa ka'uumsa marsaa irratt kan ibsuu dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	par_id3151043				0	om	\<emph\>End:\</emph\>Lakkoofsi jijjiiramaan gatii xumuraa marsaa dhumaa irratti kan ibsuu dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	par_id3156281				0	om	\<emph\>Step:\</emph\>Gatii akkataa dabaluu ykn hir'isuu lakkaa'aa marsaa qindeessi. Yoo Step'n hin ibsamne,lakkaa'aan marsa 1'n dabala.kan keessatti, End'n irra guddaa Start ta'uu qaba. Yoo lakkaa'aa hir'isuu barbaadde,End'n irra xiqqaa Start ta'uu,fi Step,n gatii nagatiivii qabaachuu qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684				0	om	marsaan \<emph\>For...Next\</emph\> himoota hundaa marsaa keessaa yeroo ta'eef irra deddeebi'a ulaagaalee ibsamaniin.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	par_id3147287				0	om	Akkuma lakka'aa jijjiiramaan hir'ateen,$[officename] Basic gatiin dhumaa qaqabuu isaa mirkaneessa.Akkuma lakkaa'aan gatii dhumaa dabarseen,marsaan ofumaan dhuma.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	par_id3159154				0	om	Hima \<emph\>For...Next\</emph\>wal keessa seensisuun ni danda'ama.Yoo jijjiiramaa hima \<emph\>Next\</emph\> aanutti ibsuu baatte,\<emph\>Next\</emph\>ofumaan hima\<emph\>For\</emph\>yeroo baay'ee dhihoo ta'e barbaada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	par_id3155306				0	om	Yoo daballii 0 ibsite,himoonni gidduu \<emph\>For\</emph\> and \<emph\>Next\</emph\> itti fufuun irra deddeebi'u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	par_id3155854				0	om	yommuu lakkaa'aa jijjiiramaan gad laakkaa'u,$[officename] Basic ol yaa'insa ykn gad yaa'insa mirkaneessa.yommuu lakkaa'aan End(gatii Step poozatiivii)caale ykn End(gatii Step nagatiivii)xiqqaate marsaan ni xumurama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	par_id3145273				0	om	Hma \<emph\>Exit For\</emph\> fayyadami osoo hin beekin marsaa keessaa bahuuf.Himni kun dirqama marsaa \<emph\>For...Next\</emph\> keessa ta'u qaba.Hima \<emph\>If...Then\</emph\> fayyadami haala bahiinsa mirkaneessuuf akka asii gadiitti.				20200411 15:09:53
