helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146121				0	om	Ulaagaalee:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020202.xhp	0	help	par_id3145749				0	om	\<emph\>FileNumber:\</emph\> Baay'ina faayilii kan deetaa dubbisuu barbaadde of keessaa qabu. Faayiliin hima banaa irraa banamuu qaba  jefuraa INPUT jedhamu fayyadamuudhaan.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020202.xhp	0	help	par_id3150011				0	om	\<emph\>var:\</emph\> Gegeedaramaa numeerikaalaa ykn diraa kan gatii faayilii banaa irraa dubbifamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020202.xhp	0	help	par_id3159153				0	om	Himni \<emph\>Input#\</emph\> gatii numeerikaalaa ykn diraa faayilii banaa irraa deetaa gegeedaramaa  tokkoo fi isaa olitti mogaafama. Gegeedaramaan numeerikaalaa hanga daangaa toorbarruu (Asc=13) (Asc=10),iddoo,qoodduu dubbisa. Gegeedaraman diraa hanga toorbarruu(Asc=13), (Asc=10), ykn qoodduutti dubbisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020202.xhp	0	help	par_id3146984				0	om	Deetaa fi akaakuu deetaa faayilii banaa keessaa tartiiba tokkoon akka ulaagaa gegeedaramaa "var" mul'achuu qaba.Yoo gatii numeerikaala hin taane gegeedaramaa numeerikaalaati moggaaste "var" gatii "0" moggaafama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020202.xhp	0	help	par_id3156442				0	om	Kuusaan qooddudhaan addan bahan gegeedaramaa diraatti hin moggafaman. Mallattoo waraabbii("") hubannoo keessaa galuu qaba.Yoo faayiliirraa arfii kana dubbisuu barbaadde sarara\<emph\> kana fayyadami hima Input#\</emph\> barruu qulqulluu  sarara sararaan dubbisuuf (faayiliin arfii maxxanfamaa qofa of keessaa qaba).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020202.xhp	0	help	par_id3147349				0	om	Yoo dhumni faayilii dhaqabame ennaa maalimni deetaa dubbifamu dogogorrii uumamee hojiin addaan kuta.				20200411 15:09:53
