helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100300.xhp	0	help	par_id3125864				0	om	Yommuu himannoo diraa jijjiirtu, guyyaa fi yeroon dirqama akka dhangii MM.DD.YYYY HH.MM.SS tti, galuu qaba,akka faankshinii walii galaa \<emph\>DateValue\</emph\> and \<emph\>TimeValue\</emph\> qindeeffame. Himannoo lakkoofsaa keessatti, gatiin harka bitaa kurniyee guuyyaa bakka bu'a, muddee 31, 1899 irraa jalqabe. Gatiin harka mirgaa kurniyee yeroo bakka bu'a. 				20200411 15:09:53
