helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153360				0	om	Faayiloota (data) itti gargaaraman ibsame uumuu fi to`achuuf Faankishinoota I/O Faayilii gargaarami.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150398				0	om	Faayiloota "walmadaala" uumuuf akka ni tajaajilan faankishinoota kan gargaarami, achiis  kuusaa tokko tokko olkaa`uu fi dabalataan lakkoofsa kuusaa isaaniin fe`uun ni danda`ama.Faankishinootni I/O Faayilii odeeffannoo kan akka hammamtaa faayilii,qindaa`inoota xurree ammee, yookiin uumuu guyyaa faayilii yookiin galoolee kennuudhaan faayiloota to`achuuf gargaara.				20200411 15:09:53
