helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010103.xhp	0	help	par_id3163712				0	om	\<emph\>Himannoo \</emph\>: hima lakkoofsa yookiin diraa maxxansamu dha. Himannoo baay`een tuq lamee addaan ba`u. Osoo qoodduudhaan aaddaan ba`an, himannoon taabii itti aanee dhaabbatuti galumsaa`a. Taabiin dhaabbatu sirraa`uu hin danda`u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153092				0	om	\<emph\>Lakkoofsa\</emph\>: Lakkoofsa bakkootaa faankishinii \<emph\>Spc\</emph\> saagaman..				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145364				0	om	\<emph\>Pos\</emph\>: Bakkoota hanga iddoon ifteessammuti saagamani dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319				0	om	Osoo tuq lameen yookiin qoodduun himannoo booda maxxanfamuuf argaman, bu`uuri $[officename] barruu sanduuqa yerommaa keessattii fi sagantaa hojjoomuu maxassa maleen itti fufa. Yommuu himni maxxansaa biroon tuq lamee yookiin qoodduu malee dhumarratti uumamu, barruun maxxansamuu qaban hundi altakkaa ni maxxansamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145272				0	om	Himannoon lakkoofsa poositiivii bakka duraa waliin  ajajamuu.ni maxxansamu. Himannoon neegatiivii mallattoo hi`isuudhaan ajajamuun ni maxxansamu. Osoo gatiiwwan  tokko tokko hangana tuqaa bololi`uuf dheeratan, himannoon lakkoofsa dara duubaan  ibsa expooneentii keessatti ni maxxansamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154011				0	om	Osoo himannoon maxxansamu dheerina tokko tokko caale, agarsiifamni ofummaan sarara itti aanu marsa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010103.xhp	0	help	par_id3146969				0	om	Faankishinii taabii saaguu, tuq lameen hammachiisuu, gidduu hima iddoo murtaa`ee bahaa yaadame, yookiin faankishinii \<emph\>Spc\</emph\> lakkoofsa bakkootaa ifteessame saaguun ni danda`ama.				20200411 15:09:53
