helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148580				0	om	Too`annaan fuula qaaqa hundaa irratti akka mul`atu gochuuf \<emph\>Fuula (Ejjatoo)\</emph\> = 0 fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146144				0	om	Fuulota qaaqa gidduu sa`atii darberratti cufuuf, Maakroo gatii \<emph\>Fuula (Ejjatoo)\</emph\> jijjiiru uumuu qabda.				20200411 15:09:53
