helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3149415				0	om	\<emph\>Lakkoofsa:\</emph\> Himata lakkofsaa kan gara diraa dhangi'ameetti akka jijjiirramu barbaaddu dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3147531				0	om	\<emph\>Dhangii:\</emph\> Diraa lakkadda dhangii lakkoofsaa adda baasu dha. Yoo \<emph\>Dhangiin\</emph\> dhiifame, Faankishiniin dhangii akka faankishinii \<emph\>Str\</emph\> 'tti tajaajila.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147561				0	om	Lakkaddawwan dhangii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3147265				0	om	Tarreeffamni armaan gadii, lakkaddawwan lakkoofsa dhangi'uuf si fayyadan ibsa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3153380				0	om	\<emph\>0:\</emph\> Yoo \<emph\>lakkoofsichi\</emph\> lakqurxa bakka 0 lakkadda dhangii keessatti qabaate,lakqurxichi ni mul'ifama; kanarraa kan hafe zeerootu mul'ifama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3151210				0	om	Yoo \<emph\>Lakkoofsi\</emph\> lakqurxa xiqqoo baay'ina zeeroowwan lakkadda dhangii gad ta'an qabaate,(gama kurnyaalee lachuutti), zeeroowwan dursan ykn itti fufan ni mul'ifamu. Yoo lakkoofsichi lakqurxa bitaa footuu kurnyaalee baay'inaan baay'ina zeeroowwanii lakkadda keessaa caale, lakqurxawwan dabalataa osoo hin dhangi'amin mul'ifamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3151176	14			0	om	Iddoowwan kurnyaalee, baay'ina zeeroowwanii kanneen footuu kurnyaalee lakkadda \<emph\>dhangii\</emph\> keessaatti aananii dhufan irratti hundaa'uun sikfama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3154123				0	om	\<emph\>#:\</emph\> Yoo \<emph\>Lakkoofsi\</emph\> lakqurxa bakka iddooqa # lakkadda \<emph\>dhangii\</emph\> keessatti qabaate, lakqurxichi ni mul'ifama. Kanarraa kan hafe, omtiyyuu bakka kanatti hin mul'ifamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3148452	16			0	om	Mallattoon kun akka 0'tti tajaajila; Yoo lakkofsi arfiilee #  lakkadii dhangii keessaa lakqurxawwan lakkoofsicha keessaa caalee,zeeroowwan jalqabaa ykn dhumaa irraan kan hafe  hin mul'ifaman.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3159150				0	om	\<emph\>.:\</emph\> Iddoqni kurnyaalee baay'ina iddoowwan kurnyaalee gara bitaa fi mirgaa footuu kurnyaalee murteessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3159252				0	om	yoo lakkaddi dhangii iddooqa # qofa gara mallattoo kanaatti qabaate, lakkoofsotni 1 gadi ta'an footuu kurnyaalee waliin jalqabu. Zeeroo jalqabaa lakkoofsota eentaa waliin agarsiisuuf, 0 akka iddooqa lakqurxa jalqabaa gara footuu kurnyaaleetti fayyadami. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3153368				0	om	\<emph\>%:\</emph\> Lakkoofsicha 100'n baaay'isee, mallattoo dhibbantaa(%) kan lakkofsichi haala lakkadda dhangiitiin dhiyaatu galcha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3149481				0	om	\<emph\>E- E+ e- e+ :\</emph\> Yoo lakkaddi dhangii xinnaatti bakka qabataa(0 or #) lakqurxa tokko mirga mallattoo E-, E+, e-, ykn e+ qabaate, lakkoofsichi dhangii saayinsaawaatiin ykn eksipooneenshiyaaliitiin dhangi'ama. Lakkoofsi iddooqa lakqurxaa mirga mallattoo, baay'ina lakqurxaa eksipoonantii keessaa beekuuf fayyada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3149262				0	om	Eksipoonantiin yoo nagatiivii ta'e, mallattoon hir'isuu  eksipoonantii E-, E+, e-, e+ wajjin dursee  kallattumaan  mul'ata. Eksipoonantichi yoo poozatiivii ta'e,mallattoon ida'uu Eksipoonantiiwwan E+ or e+ qofa dursee mul'ifama.  				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3148617				0	om	Yoo lakkaddi dhangii daangessituu kan lakqurxaa bakka qabattootan(0 or #) hammatame of keessaa qabaate, daangessituun kumaatamaa ni mul'ifamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3163713				0	om	Itti fayyadamni tuqaa akka footuu kumaatamaa fi kurnyaalee, qindaa'ina naannoo irratti hundaa'a. Yommuu kallattumaan lakkoofsa lakkadda maddaa Basic keessatti galchitu,Tuqaa akka daangessituu kurnyaaleetti yeroo mara fayyadami. Arfiin dhugaan  akka footuu kurnyaaleetti mul'ifame, dhangii lakkoofsaa sirna qindaa'ina keetii irratti hundaa'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3152887				0	om	\<emph\>- + $ ( ) iddoo:\</emph\> Ida'uu (+), Hir'isuu (-), doolaara ($), iddoo, ykn cuftuuwwan kallattumaan lakkadda dhangii keessaatti galfaman akka arfii barreeffamaatti mul'ifamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3148576				0	om	Arfiilee asiitti tarreeffamaniin ala jiran mul'isuuf, arficha haxaarroon(\\) dursuu yookiin mallattoo waraabbii(" ") keessatti hammachiisuu qabda.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3153139				0	om	\\ : Haxaarroon lakkadda dhangii keessatti, arfii itti aanu mul'isa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3153366				0	om	Arfiiwwan lakkadda dhangii keessaa kunneen hiika addaa qabaatanii yoo haxaarroodhaan(\\\\) durfaman, arfiiwwan kun akka arfiilee barreeffamaatti mul'ifamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411				0	om	Arfiileen Lakkadda dhangii keessatti haxaarroon durfaman akka arfiilee barreeffamaatti akka mul'ataniif; dhangiiwwan arfiilee guyyaa- fi yeroo- (a, c, d, h, m, n, p, q, s, t, w, y, /, :), arfiilee dhangiisuu lakkoofsaa (#, 0, %, E, e, qoodduu, Tuqaa), fi arfiilee dhangii diraa (@, &, <, >, !) fayyadama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3145749				0	om	Dhangiiwwan lakkoofsa durmurtaawaa armaan gadiittis fayyadamuu ni dandeessa. "General Number" malee, Lakkaddaawwan dhangii durmurtaawaa marti lakkoofsa akka lakkoofsa kurnyee iddoowwan kurnyee lamaatti deebisu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3150113				0	om	Yoo dhangiisuuwwan durmurtaawaatti fayyadamte, maqaan dhangichaa mallattoo waraabbii keessa galuu qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149377				0	om	Dhangiisuu durmurtaawaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3154730				0	om	\<emph\>Lakkoofsa Dimshaashaa:\</emph\> Lakkoofsotni akka galfamanitti mul'atu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3153158				0	om	\<emph\>Maallaqa:\</emph\> Fuuldura lakkoofsichatti mallattoo doolaaraa saagee lakkoofsota nagatiivii cuftuu keessatti barreessa.				20200411 15:09:53
