helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03050500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149482				0	om	\<emph\>GoTo 0:\</emph\> Disables the error handler in the current procedure.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03050500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149483				0	om	\<emph\>Local:\</emph\> "On error" is global in scope, and remains active until canceled by another "On error" statement. "On Local error" is local to the routine which invokes it. Local error handling overrides any previous global setting. When the invoking routine exits, the local error handling is canceled automatically, and any previous global setting is restored.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03050500.xhp	0	help	par_id3148619				0	om	The On Error GoTo statement is used to react to errors that occur in a macro.				20200411 15:09:53
