helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155747				0	om	Jijjiiramaawwan sharafa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153337				0	om	Jijjiiiramaawwan sharafaa akka lakkoofsota biiti 64ti (8 Bytes) ni kuufamu akasumas akka lakkoofsa kurnyee dhaabbataa kurnyee hin taane 15 wajjintii fi bakkoota kurnyee 4tti agarsiisamu. Gatiiwwan -922337203685477.5808 hanga +922337203685477.5807t ni hangaa`u.Jijjiiramaawwan sharafaa gattiiwwan sharafaa sirreefama guddaa wajjin hediisuuf gargaara. Arfii ibsa akaakuu "@" dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147296				0	om	Dim Variable@				20200411 15:09:53
