helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147264				0	om	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/01030200.xhp\" name=\"The Basic Editor\"\>Gulaalaa bu`uuraa\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145069				0	om	Gulaalaan bu`uuraa yeroo galmee barruu keessaa hojjetan fankishinii gulaali durtii siniif kenna. Fankishinii baafata \<emph\>Gulaali\</emph\> (Cut, Delete, Paste), dandeetii barruu jijjiiruu furtuu wajjin filuu, akasumas fankishinii iddoo qaree (for example, moving from word to word with \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Dirqala \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and the arrow keys) ni deggara.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154686				0	om	Sararootni dheeraan  bakkaa fi fakkaattoo jalamuraa akka sarara fakkaatoota  dhumaa lamaatti iddoo adda addaatti saagamuudhaan addaba`u. Kunis sarara tokko sarara itti aanutii fi sarara loojikii  faana walqunnamsiisa.(If "Option Compatible" is used in the same Basic module, the line continuation feature is also valid for comment lines.)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151042				0	om	Osoo sajoo \<emph\>BASIC Kaasi\</emph\> kabala \<emph\>Maakroo\</emph\> irratti dhiibdan, sagantaan hojjetamu gulaalaa Basic sarara duraa irratti calqaba. Sagantaan Sub yookiin Function duraa ni hojjeta itti aansuudhaan sagantaan hojii ni dhaabata. Hojii sagantaa irratti "Sub Main"nuun adeemsa hin fudhatu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030200.xhp	0	help	par_id59816				0	om	Yeroo jalqaba IDE bantu lakkaddaa Basic sararoota Sub Main fi End Sub gidduu saagi.Filmaataaf,sararoota hunda haqi itti aansuudhaan  lakkaddaa Basic mataakee saagi.				20200411 15:09:53
