helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id4601940				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Qaaqalee biyyoomsamuu danda`an dandeessisuu fi too`achuuf kamshaan qaaqa bu`uura gulaalaa IDE keessaa too`annaa agarsiisa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id9538560				0	om	Durtiidhaan, qaaqan kamiyyuu afaan tokkoof kan ati uumte maddoota diraa qofa ofkeessatti qabata. Tarii qaaqalee akkaataa qindaa`inoota afaan itti gargaaramaatiin ofummaan diraa biyyooman agarsiisu umuu ni barbaada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id6998809				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Diraa gulaaluu barbaadeef afaan fili. Afaanota dabaluuf sajoo Too`annaa Afaanii cuqaasi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id71413				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Afaan tokko cuqaasi, kana booda afaanicha akka durtiitti qindeessuuf Durtii cuqaasi, ykn tarree irraa afaanicha haquuf Haqi cuqaasi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id2924283				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Qaaqaa, tarree keessatti bakka ati afaan tokko ida'uu dandeessuu bana.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id5781731				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Tarree keessaa afaan isa haquudhaaf barbaadduu filadhuutii Haqi cuqaasi. Yammuu afaanoota mara haqtuu, qabeenyoota dirichaa qaaqoota biyyoomsaa kuusaa ammee keessaa qaaqoota maraa irraa haqamu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id6942045				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Afaan tokko tarree keessaa filadhuutii, afaanicha akka afaan durtiitti qindeessuuf Durtii cuqaasi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id4721823				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Afaani durtii, diraawwan afaan kabirootiif akka maddatti fayyada.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id5806756				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Diraawwan qaaqaa keetiif afaanoota walquunnama fayyadamaa WF ida'i.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	hd_id6596881				0	om	Qaaqoota biyyoomsuu dandeessisuudhaaf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id8750572				0	om	Gulaalaa qaaqaa IDA Basic keessatti, \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Mul'annoo - Kamshaalee - Afaan\</item\> filachuun kamshaa Afaanicha bani. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id2224494				0	om	Yoo kuusaan ammaa duraanuu qaaqa biyyoomsaa of keessaa qabaatan, kamshaan Afaanichaa ofumaan mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id7359233				0	om	Kamshaan Afaanii ykn kabala Sanduuqa meeshaa irraa, sajoo \<emph\>Afaanoota Taliigaa\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id2526017\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_managelanguage.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id2526017\"\>Sajoo Afaanoota Taliigaa\</alt\>\</image\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id6549272				0	om	Qaaqa Afaan Walquunnama Fayyadamaa Taliigaa agarta. Kabala mataduree irratti maqaa kuusaa ammaatu agarsiifama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id6529740				0	om	Galfata afaan tokko ida'uuf, qaaqicha keessaa Ida'i cuqaasi. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id7811822				0	om	Ejjatoon kun qaaqoonii haaraa marii akka qabeenyoota diraa biyyoomsaa of keessaa qabaatan dandeessisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id9121982				0	om	Yeroo jalqabaatiif yammuu Ida'i cuqaastuu, Qaaqa Afaan Walquunnama Fayyadamaa Durtii Qindeessi agarta. Itti deebitee yeroo Ida'i cuqaastu, qaaqi kun akka maqaa Afaan Walquunnama Fayyadamaa Ida'i qabu agarta.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id3640247				0	om	Qaaqa Afaan Walquunnama Fayyadamaa Taliigaa keessatti, akkasuma afaan durtii jijjiiruu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id3808404				0	om	Afaan tokko fili. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id4585100				0	om	Kun diraalee fooyya`aa hundaa hiikamee amaloota qaaqaf ofkeessatti qabachuuf maddoota diraa dabala. Tuutni diraalee qaaqa afaan durtii tuuta diraalee haaraatti garagalchama. Booda, afaan haaraatti jijjiirruu fi diraawwan hiikuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id2394482				0	om	Qaaqicha cufi ykn afaanoota dabalataa ida'i.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	hd_id631733				0	om	Qaaqa kee keessatti too'annaawwan biyyoomsaa gulaaluuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id2334665				0	om	Qaaqalee kee keessa takkaa diraawwan biyyoommuu danda`anniif maddoota iddoo dabaltee booda, sanduuqa tarree afaanii ammee kamshaa afaanii irraa filuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id8956572				0	om	Akka afaan durtii agarsiisuuf, saanduqa tarree Afaan Ammaa jijjiira.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id500808				0	om	Qaaqa keetti too'annaawwan lakkoofsa kamiyuu saagiitii, diraawwan barbaaddu mara galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id8366649				0	om	saanduqa tarree Afaan Ammaa keessaa afaan kabiroo fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id476393				0	om	Qaaqoota amalaa too'annootaa fayyadamuudhaan, diraawwan afaan kabiroo mara gulaali.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id2655720				0	om	Isa ida'ate kanaa afaanoota maraaf irradeebi'i.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id3682058				0	om	Yommuu diraawwan afaan keessaa mijeessaman hojjete, itti gargaaramaan qaaqa fooyya`aa %PRODUCTNAME kan itti gargaaramaa walqunnama diraa afaan itti gargaaramaa ilaaluu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id5977965				0	om	Yoo afaanii kamiyuu, fooyya'aa fayyadamaan wal hinsimuu tahe, fayyadamaan diraawwan afaan durtii arga.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id3050325				0	om	Yoo fayyadamaan qaaqoota Basictiif fooyya'aa moofaa kan %PRODUCTNAME isa qabeenya diraa biyyoomsuu hin beeknee qaba tahe, fayyadamaan diraawwan afaan durtii arga.				20200411 15:09:53
