helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154398				0	om	qindoominoota maxxansa durtii ammee galmee kaka'aa wajjiin maxxansuuf \<ahelp hid=\".uno:PrintDefault\"\>Sajoo \<emph\>Faayilii sududaan maxxansi\</emph\> cuqaasi.\</ahelp\> Kunis kan argamu qaaqa \<emph\>Qindoomina Maxxansaa\</emph\> keessatti, kan nuti ajaja baafata \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01140000.xhp\" name=\"Printer Settings\"\>\<emph\>Qindoomina Maxxansaa\</emph\>\</link\> wajjiin waamuu dandeenyudha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147275	3			0	om	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>yoo barruu ykn saxatoo filatuu barbaadde sajoo\<emph\>Faayilii sududa maxxansaa \</emph\>jedhu cuqaasi, you are prompted to print the selection or the document. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01110000.xhp	0	help	par_id9547105				0	om	Yoo maxxansi galmee ammee maxxansa duraan operating system hin beeknetti fayyadame,sajoon \<emph\>Faayilii sududa maxxansa\</emph\>jedhu\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01130000.xhp\"\>qaaqa\<emph\>maxxansaa\</emph\>\</link\>bana.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01110000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10679				0	om	Yoo maxxansi galmee ammee maxxansa duraan sirna dalagaa hin beeknetti fayyadame,sajoon \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/spadmin.xhp\"\>spadmin\</link\>, Sagantaa bulchiinsa maxxansaa, sajoo \<emph\>Faayilii kallattiin maxxansi \</emph\> qaaqa\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01130000.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Maxxansa\</emph\>\</link\> jedhu bani.				20200411 15:09:53
