helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153539				0	om	Unkaan galmee barruu ykn wardii too'annoowwan unkaa garagaraa qabu. Yoo unkaa fuula saphaphuutif uumte, dhimmamaan interneetirraan deetaa erguuf deetaa galchuu dandeessa. Deetaan unkaa too'annoowwan unkaa irraa URL ifteessun gara kaadimaa dabra akkasumas kaadimarratti adeemsifama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149283				0	om	Maqaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789				0	om	Maqaa unkaa ifteessi. Maqaa kun unkaa\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170600.xhp\" name=\"Form Navigator\"\>unkaa naanna'aa\</link\>adda baasuf gargaara .				20200411 15:09:53
