helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145065				0	om	Toftaa "Argatuu" fayyadamii, deetaa too'annoo hundaa akka jijjiirama naannotti daddabra. Gara URL unkaa keessatti siiqsama "?Too'annoo1=Qabiyyee1&Too'annoo2=Qabiyyee2&..."; arfiin diraa sagantaa kaadima fudhataarra sakatta'ama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150443				0	om	Toftaa "Dirbaasi" fayyadamuun, galmeen qabiyyee unkaatirraa uumaman gara URL iftaa'etti ergama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147275				0	om	Ergama lakkaddeessuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3159147				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_SUBMIT_ENCODING\"\>Gosa deetaa dabarsaa lakkaddeessuu ifteessa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155419				0	om	Dabarsa deetaa odeeffannoo too'annoo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153717				0	om	Weyta unkaa erginu, Too'annoowwan mara $[officename] keessatti argaman itti xiyyeessuu danda'a. Maqaa too'annoo fi gatii walgitaa, yoo argame, ni daddarba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153252				0	om	Gatii kamtu dhimma tokkoon tokkoo daddabra dhimmaWhich values are transmitted in each case depends on the respective control. For text fields, the visible entries are transmitted; for list boxes, the selected entries are transmitted; for check boxes and option fields, the associated reference values are transmitted if these fields were activated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150984				0	om	Akkamitti odeeffannoon kun toftaa dabarsa fi lakkaddaa filamerratti hundaa'ee daddabarsa. Yoo toftaa argatuu fi lakkaddeessa URL filame, fakkeenyaaf, gatii cimdii unkaa keessaa <Name>=<Value> ni ergamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3157909				0	om	Too'annoowwan dabalataan HTML keessatti yaadaaman, too'annoowwan $[officename] hayyama. Kana yaadatuu qaba, dirreewwan dhangii lakkoofsa murtaa'aa, gatiiwwan mul'atoon hin daddarban garuu dhangiiwwan durtii dhaabbataa caala. Gabateen asiin gadii kan agarsiisu akkamitti deetaan too'annoo murtaa'an $[officename] itti daddarba.				20200411 15:09:53
