helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152821	2			0	om	\<variable id=\"tabellehinzufuegentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"HID_JOINSH_ADDTAB_TABLELIST\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Gabateewwan gara wixinee fooddatti saagaman ifteessa.\</ahelp\> Qaaqa\<emph\> Gabatee Dabalaa \</emph\>keessaa, gabatee barbaadde hojii ammeef fili. \</variable\> Weyta galfata ykn galfata gabatee haaraa uumnu, gabatee galfata ykn dhiheessi gabatee agarsiisu walsimu filuuf. Weyta kuusaalee deetaa firummaan hojjatu, gabateewwan firummaa  giddutti barbaaddu ijaaruf fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760				0	om	Gabateewwan fooddaa addabahaa wixinee galfataa ykn fooddawwan firummaa keessatti argamu, tarree dirreewwan gabatee keessatti argaman wajjiin saaga.				20200411 15:09:53
