helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170902.xhp	0	help	par_id3154228				0	om	Dirree deetaa gabatee fuula duraani keessatti ibsame irraa fili, qabeentoota sanduuqa makaa ykn tarree keessatti mul'atuu qaban.				20200411 15:09:53
