helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170902.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	om	Maqaan dirree asitti kenname \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170102.xhp\" name=\"Control properties\"\>Amaloota too'annoo\</link\> keessatti akka maalimaa hima SQL dirree\<emph\>Qabeentoota Tarree\</emph\> keessatti argama.				20200411 15:09:53
