helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154317	5			0	om	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>The distance between the text and the left text frame and the position of the bullets can be determined in the dialog under \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030100.xhp\" name=\"Format - Paragraph\"\>\<emph\>Format - Paragraph\</emph\>\</link\> by entering the left indent and the first-line indent. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
