helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149283	3			0	om	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<emph\> Dirree Fuula Akkaataa \</emph\>banuuf qaaqa \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05040000.xhp\" name=\"Page Style\"\>Fuula Akkaataa\</link\> lama cuqaasi, isa akkaataa fuula ammeef gulaalu dandeenyu. Baafata halqara dirree kana keessatti, akkaataa fuulaa fayyadamuu dandeenya. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
