helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233				0	om	\<emph\>Establishing a connection\</emph\> - As soon as you select an individual table or query, a connection to the data source is established. Once the connection is opened, the name of the data source, the Queries or Tables entry, and the name of the query or table selected is shown in bold type.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154860				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Closes the connection to the data source. See \<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME Base - Connections\</emph\> in the Options dialog box.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
