helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147571				0	om	Filannoo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	om	Wanta filuuf, wanta xiyyaan cuqaasi. Wanta tokkoo ol filuuf, wantoota naannoo goodayyaa filannoo harkisi. Wanta filannotti dabaluuf, Jijjiiraa gadqabi, akkasumas wanta cuqaasi. \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CHART\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"MATH\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Wantootni waliin filaman akka \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05290000.xhp\" name=\"group\"\>garee\</link\>tti ibsama, isaanis wanta garee qeenxetti jijjiira.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	om	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CHART\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"MATH\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Maalimoota tokkoon tokkoo garee gulaaluu ni dandeenya. Akkasumas maalimoota garee \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Jijjiiraa\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+too'annoo.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>wajjiin haquu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166460				0	om	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CHART\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"MATH\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Wantoota qeenxee garee irraa lama cuqaasun filuu dandeenya, yoo jalqaba hinkaane taa'e \<emph\>Barruu gulaaluuf lama cuqaasi\</emph\> kabala \<emph\>Filannoo\</emph\> sajoo irraa.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
