helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150771				0	om	Tarjaawwan mul'isi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3159400				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_SHOWCOLS\"\>Iddoo tarjaawwan deebinee agarsiisuu barbaanne filuu dandeenyutti baafata xiqqaa waamna.\</ahelp\> Tarjaa tokko qofa agarsiisudhaaf, maqaa tarjaa cuqaasi. Tarjaawwan 16 jalqaba dhokatan qofa arguu dandeessa. Yoo tarjaawwan baay'en dhokatan jiraatan, ajaja\<emph\>Dabali\</emph\> jedhu fili qaaqa \<emph\>Tarjaa Mul'isi\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
