helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	om	Galmee filuuf \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F6 dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3161657				0	om	Too'annoo jalqabaa filuuf TOO"ANNOO+F4 gaddhiibi. Yoo too'annoon gabatee too'annoo jalqabaa ta'uu baate,hanga filamutti Cancala gaddhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3151056				0	om	Haalata gulaalu galchuuf furtuu GALCHAA gaddhiibi. Qabannoon baay'inaan handaara too'annoorraa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3154938				0	om	Haalata Gulaallii keessatti,Too'annoo+F10 gaddhiibun haalata gulaallii baafata halqara banuu dandeessa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3154365				0	om	Yoo tarjaawwan gulaaluu barbaadde, Haalata gulaallii tarjaa galchuuf Shift+Space dhiibi. Amma tartiiba tarjaawwanii furtuulee +Arrow \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> wajjiin deebitee qindeessuu dandeessa. Furtuu balleessituun tarjaa ammee balleessiti.				20200411 15:09:53
