helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	om	Akka sanduuqota tarree ykn makaa wajjiin, hantuutee xiyya xumura mirga dirreerra jiru irratti cuqaasun tarree banuu ykn cufuu dandeessa. Haa ta'uu malee, the input here can be entered either in the opened list or in the top text field. An exception is the properties that expect a list representation, for example, the property \<emph\>List Entries\</emph\>, which can be set for the control fields \<emph\>List Box\</emph\> and \<emph\>Combo Box\</emph\>. Here, you can only edit the entries when the field is opened.				20200411 15:09:53
