helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150774				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>Dirreewwan dhangi'ame; Amaloota\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Dirreewwan; Dirreewwan dhangi'ame\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Too'annoowwan; Dirreewwan dhangi'ame\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
