helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155434	107			0	om	The\<emph\> Form \</emph\>combo box is only visible if the current document is a form document with more than one logical form. It does not appear during a search in tables or queries.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151384				0	om	Galmeewwan unkaa unkaawwan yaayaa baay'ee qabaachuu danda'a. Kun qabiyyeewwan unkaa manyaa, kan tokkoonsaa gabatetti koronyate.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145086				0	om	Sanduuqa makaa \<emph\>Unkaa\</emph\> maqaawwan unkaawwan yaaya mara qaban too'annoowwan kamtu argama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159414				0	om	Dirreewan Mara				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153896				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SEARCH_ALLFIELDS\"\>Barbaachi dirreewwan mara qaxxaamura.\</ahelp\> Yoo kaka'iinsi barbaachaa gabatee keessa ta'e, dirreewwan gabatee keessaa marri ni barbaadama. Yoo kaka'iinsi barbaachaa unkaa keessa ta'e, dirreewwan unkaa yaayaa(\<emph\>Unkaa\</emph\>jalatti galchame) marri ni barbaadamu. Yoo kaka'insi barbaachaa dirree too'annoo gabatee keessa ta'e, dirree gabatee kuusaa deetaa gatiinsaa sarjaawwan mara wajjiin koronyate barbaada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054				0	om	Note that the fields of the current logical form do not have to be identical to the fields of the form document. If the form document contains fields that point to multiple data sources (that is, multiple logical forms), the \<emph\>All Fields\</emph\> option will only search for the fields linked to data sources in the form document.				20200411 15:09:53
