helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SEARCH_FORMATTER\"\>Dhangiiwwan dirree marri kan hubannoo argatu weyta galmee ammee keessaa barbaadamte ifteessa.\</ahelp\> Dhangiiwwan dirree Field formats are all visible formats that are created using the following possibilities:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150103				0	om	Amaloota dirree haalata wixinee gabatee keessaa,				20200411 15:09:53
