helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156736				0	om	If the \<emph\>Apply field format\</emph\> box is marked, the data source view of the table or form is searched using the formatting set there. If the box is not marked, the database is searched using the formatting saved in the database.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151280				0	om	Fakkeenya:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149959				0	om	Dirree guyyaa, kan  dhangii "DD.MM.YY" kuusdeetaa keessaa (fakkeenyaaf, 17.02.65) olkaa'ame qabda. Dhangiin galfata madda deetaa ilaalii keessaa gara "DD MMM YYYY" (17 Feb 1965)tti jijjiirama. Fakkeenyi armaan gadii, tarreen February 17 ofkeessatti qabatu yeroo filannoon \<emph\>Dirree dhangii hojjoomsi\</emph\> filamu qofa argama:				20200411 15:09:53
