helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149401				0	om	The following examples show possible issues when searching without field formatting. These issues depend on the database used and only occur for certain internal default formatting:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152971				0	om	Galteewwan barbaadi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154273				0	om	Sababa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153836				0	om	"5" akka yerotti "14:00:00" deebisa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156332				0	om	Dirreewwan sa`atii kuusdeetaa dBASEf hin hiikamu akkasumas dirqama suphamuu qaba. Sa`atii "14:00:00" keessatti agarsiisuuf, 5n barbaachisaa dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3157965				0	om	"00:00:00" kuusawwan dirree guyyaa baratamoo mara deebisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3146081				0	om	The database stores a date value internally using a combined date/time field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155764				0	om	"45.79" does not return "45.79" although the \<emph\>entire field\</emph\> option is selected under \<emph\>Position\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155518				0	om	The view shown does not match what is stored internally. For example, if value 45.789 is stored in the database as a field of type Number/Double and the shown formatting is set to display only two decimals, "45.79" is only returned in searches with field formatting.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148481				0	om	Dhimma kanarratti, dhangiiwwan baratamoo dhangiiwwan kuusaan keessaan kuufame agarsiisa. Inni yeroo hunda dhimmamatti hin mul'atu, keessattuu yoo gosoota deetaa fakkeessuf fayyadamte (fakkeenyaaf, dirreewwan yeroo kuusaalee deetaa dBASE keessatti). Kun kuusaa deetaa fayyadamterratti hundaa'a akkasumas gosa deetaa tokko tokkoo isaanii. Dhanga'iinsa dirreetiin barbaadun walgita yoo wanta dhugumaan mul'atuu qaban qofa barbaaduu barbaadde. Dirreewwan kun Gosa Guyyaa, Yeroo, Guyyaa/Yeroo fi Lakkoofsa/Cimdii.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154507	31			0	om	Haa ta'uu malee, barbaachi \<emph\>Dhangii dirree fayyadami \</emph\>malee kuusaalee deetaa guddaa dhimoota hin dhangi'amneen walgitan, waan saffisaa ta'eef.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153355				0	om	Yoo gatii sanduuqota makaa, fi \<emph\>Dhangii fayyadama dirree\</emph\> barbaadaa jirru banaa ta'e, Sanduuqota makaa mallattaa'ef "1" fudhachuu dandeenya, "0" sanduuqota makaa hin mallattaa'iniif, fi diraa duwwaan sanduuqota makaa hinibsaminiif. Yoo barbaachi turame \<emph\>Dhangii Dirree Fayyadami\</emph\> dhaamaa tti qindaa'e, gatiiwwan durtii maxxanaa-afaanii "DHUGAA" ykn "SOBA" ilaaluu dandeenya.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150995	119			0	om	Weyta sanduuqota makaa keessa barbaannu yoo \<emph\>Dhangii dirree fayyadi\</emph\> fayyadamne, barruu sanduuqota tarree keessatti barbaadde mul'isa. Yoo \<emph\>Dhangii dirree fayyadi,\</emph\> jedhu hin fayyadamne dhangii dirree baratamoo qabeentotaan wal gitan barbaadu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
