helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154477				0	om	The \<emph\>State\</emph\> line shows the records returned by the search. If the search reaches the end (or the beginning) of a table, the search is automatically continued at the other end.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3163720				0	om	Kuusaalee deetaa haalan guddaa keessatti, kuusaa tartiiba barbaacha faallaa barbaadu keessatti yeroo fudhachuu danda'a. Dhimma kana keessatti, kaballi haalojii kuusawwan lakkaawamee jiru si beeksisa.				20200411 15:09:53
