helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154368				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SEARCH_BTN_SEARCH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Barbaacha eegala ykn dhaaba.\</ahelp\> Yoo barbaachi milkaa'inaan xumurame, dirree walgite gabatee keessatti shoolame. Deebi'anii qabduu \<emph\>Barbaachaa\</emph\> cuqaasun barbaacha ittifufuu dandeessa. Adeemsa barbaachaa dhiisuf qabduu \<emph\>Dhiisi\</emph\>jedhu cuqaasuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
