helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151183				0	om	Yoo gabateewwan ykn unkaawwan baay'en baname, filannoowwan barbaacha gara garaa galmee tokkoof qindeessu dandeessa. Weyta galmeewwan cufne filannoowwan barbaachaa galmee dhumarratti cufame qofatu olkaa'ama.				20200411 15:09:53
