helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150040				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>unkaawwan; deetaa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>deetaa; unkaawwan fi citaunkaawwanii\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>unkaawwan; citaunkaa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>citaunkaawwanii; ibsama\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150040				0	om	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"Data\"\>Deetaa\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3147242	2			0	om	Cancalli fuula\<emph\> Deetaa \</emph\>kan ibsu amaloota unkaa gara kuusaa deetaa unkaatti koronyate agarsiisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3149398				0	om	Madda deetaa unkaan irratti hundaa'e ibsa, ykn akka deetaa dhimmamaan gulaalame ifteessa. Dalagaawwan fooyi fi gingilchaa irraa ka'uun, amaloota \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"subform\"\>citaunkaa\</link\>uumuf barbaachisan mara barbaaduu dandeenya.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154810				0	om	Madda deetaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3152349				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_DATASOURCE\"\>Madda deetaa unkaa agarsiisuu qabu ibsa.\</ahelp\> Yoo qabduu \<emph\>...\</emph\> cuqaaste, qaaqa \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01020000.xhp\" name=\"Open\"\>\<emph\>Banaa\</emph\>\</link\> waamuu dandeessa, iddoo maddaa deetaa filuu dandeessutti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146948				0	om	Qabiyyee				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3155922				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_CURSORSOURCE\"\>Qabiyyee unkaaf fayyaduu danda'an tilmaama. Qabiyyeen gabatee ykn galfata (durtumaan kuusaa deetaa keessatti uumaman) argaman ta'uu danda'u, ykn hima SQL iin ibsamuu danda'u. Qabiyyee galchuun dura qabdu gosa sirrii \<emph\>Gosa qabiyyee\</emph\>keessaa ibsuu dandeessa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3149657				0	om	Yoo takkaa "Gabatee" ykn "Galfata" \<emph\>Gosa qabiyyee \</emph\>keessaa filatte, sanduuqni gabateewwan mara tarreessa akkasumas galfawwan kuusaa deetaa keessatti filataman qindeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148755				0	om	Gosa qabiyyee				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3150541				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_CURSORSOURCETYPE\"\>Maddi deetaa akka gabatee ykn galfata kuusaa deetaa jiraataa turan ta'ee fi ta'uu baate, ykn yoo unkaan hima SQL irratti hundaa'e oomishame ibsa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	om	Yoo "Gabatee" ykn "Galfata" filatte, unkaan gabatee ykn galfata \<emph\>Qabiyyee\</emph\> jalatti ifteessite agarsiisa. Yoo galfata haaraa ykn \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"subform\"\>citaunkaa\</link\> uumuu barbaadde, filannoo "SQL" filuu qabda. Hima galfata SQL ykn citaunkaa sududaan sanduuqa \<emph\>Qabiyyee tarree\</emph\> keessaa amaloota too'annoo fuula cancala deetaa irraa galchuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3158409				0	om	Ajaja SQL xinxali				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3145171				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_ESCAPE_PROCESSING\"\>Himni SQL %PRODUCTNAME xinxalamuu fi dhabuu isaa ifteessa.\</ahelp\> Yoo gara "Eeyyee" qindaa'e, qabduu \<emph\>...\</emph\> sanduuqa tarree \<emph\>Qabiyyee\</emph\>ittaanuu cuqaasuu sandeessa. Iddoo galfata kuusaa deetaa saxatoon uumnutti kun fooddaa bana. Weyta fooddaa san cufnu, himni SQL galfata uumamee sanduuqa\<emph\>Qabiyyee\</emph\> tarree keessatti sugama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154684				0	om	Gingilchaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3150449				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_FILTER_CRITERIA\"\>Haalota deetaa unkaa keessaa gingilchuuf barbaachisan galcha. Ibsamoonni gingilchaa seerota SQL hordofan gaalee IDDOO osoo hin fayyadamin.\</ahelp\> Fakkeenyaa, if you want to display all records with the "Mike" forename, type into the data field: Forename = 'Mike'. You can also combine conditions: Forename = 'Mike' OR Forename = 'Peter'. All records matching either of these two conditions will be displayed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3156212				0	om	The filter function is available in user mode through the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12030000.xhp\" name=\"AutoFilter\"\>\<emph\>AutoFilter\</emph\>\</link\> and \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12090000.xhp\" name=\"Default Filter\"\>\<emph\>Default Filter\</emph\>\</link\> icons on the \<link href=\"text/shared/main0213.xhp\" name=\"Form Navigation Bar\"\>\<emph\>Form Navigation\</emph\> Bar\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156005				0	om	Fooyi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3163712				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_SORT_CRITERIA\"\>Specifies the conditions to sort the data in the form. The specification of the sorting conditions follows SQL rules without the use of the ORDER BY clause.\</ahelp\> For example, if you want all records of a database to be sorted in one field in an ascending order and in another field in a descending order, enter Forename ASC, Name DESC (presuming Forename and Name are the names of the data fields).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3156444				0	om	Sajoo \<link href=\"text/shared/main0213.xhp\" name=\"Form Navigation Bar\"\>kabala\<emph\>Unkaa Naannawiinsa\</emph\> irraa walsiman\</link\> haalata Dhimmamaa keessatti fooyuf gargaaran: \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12010000.xhp\" name=\"Sort Ascending\"\>\<emph\>Olfooyinsa\</emph\>\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12020000.xhp\" name=\"Sort Descending\"\>\<emph\>gadifooyinsa\</emph\>\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12100100.xhp\" name=\"Sort\"\>\<emph\>Fooyuu\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148616				0	om	Deeta qofa fili				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3153139				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_DATAENTRY\"\>Yoo unkaan deetaa haaraa qofti dabalataan hayyamamu (Eeyyee) ykn yoo amaloota biroo akka gaaritti hayyama (miti)t ilmaama.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3148575				0	om	Yoo \<emph\>Deetaa qofa dabali\</emph\> gara "Eeyye" qindaa'e, deetaa jijjiirun ykn haquun hin danda'amu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148455				0	om	Navigation bar				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3157976				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_NAVIGATION\"\>Dalagaawwan naannawinsaa kabala unkaa xiqqaa keessaa fayyadaman ifteessa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3149485				0	om	Filannoo "Unkaa Haadhoo" citaunkaawwan fayyada. Yoo filannoo kana citaunkaatif filte, kuusawwan unkaa guddaa fayyadamuun yoo qareen citaunkaa keessa qabate naannessu dandeessa. Citniunkaa gara unkaa haadhoo hariiroo 1:1 koronyate, so naannawinsaa yeroo mara kan hojjatamu unkaa haadhoo keessatti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151051				0	om	Maroo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3154944				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_CYCLE\"\>Akkamitti naannawiinsi furtuu cancalee fayyadamuun hojjatamu qaban tilmaama.\</ahelp\> Furtuu cancalaa fayyadamuun, unkaa keessa gara fuulduraa siiqsuu dandeenya. Yoo furtuu jijjiirraa walduraa duubaan dhiibaman, naannawinsi kallatti faallaa hordofa. Yoo dirree dhumaa(ykn jalqabaa) dhaqqabdee fi furtuu cancala deebitee dhiibde, galteewwan garagaraa qabaachuu danda'a. Furtuu too'annoo filannoowwan asiin gadii:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3166413				0	om	Filannoo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3150424				0	om	Hiikkaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3150417				0	om	Durtii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3157847				0	om	This setting automatically defines a cycle which follows an existing database link: If the form contains a database link, the Tab key will, by default, initiate a change to the next or previous record on exit from the last field (see All Records). If there is no database link the next/previous form is shown (see Current Page).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3153418				0	om	Kuusaawwan mara				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3152972				0	om	Filannoon kun unkaalee kuusaa deetaa qofaaf fayyada akkasumas kuusaawwan mara keessa naanna'uuf gargaara. Yoo furtuu cancalaa dirree xumura unkaarraa dhaamsuf fayyadamte, galmee ammeen ni jijjiirama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3151020				0	om	Kuusaa ka'aa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3145301				0	om	Filannoon kun unkaawwan kuusaa deetaa qofaaf fayyada, akkasumas galmee ammee keessatti naannessuuf fayyada. Yoo furtuu cancalaa dirree xumura unkaarraa dhaamsuf fayyadamte, galmee ammeen ni jijjiirama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3146913				0	om	Fuula ammee				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3150330				0	om	Unkaa dirree xumuraa dhaamsuf, qareen gara dirree jalqaba unkaa ittaanu keessatti utaaluf. Kun baratamoo unkaawwan HTMLThis is standard for HTML forms; therefore, this option is especially relevant for HTML forms.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155064				0	om	Fuula Ammee				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3154360				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_ALLOW_ADDITIONS\"\>Yoo deetaan dabalama ta'e murteessi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156054				0	om	Haaromsa Heyyami				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3156377				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_ALLOW_EDITS\"\> Yoo deetaan fooyyaa'a ta'e murteessi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149019				0	om	Barbadoomsa heyyami				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3148995				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_ALLOW_DELETIONS\"\>Yoo deetaan haqama ta'e murteessi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153714				0	om	Dirreewwan hundataa geessi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3147339				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_MASTERFIELDS\"\>Yoo \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"subform\"\>unkaa xiqqaa\</link\>uumte, dirree deetaa unkaa haadhoo walsimata haadhoo fi unkaa xiqqaa gidduu gaafatamaa godhu galcha.\</ahelp\> Gatiiwwan baay'ee galchuuf, naqa sararaa tokko booda Jijjiirraa + Galchi dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3149568				0	om	The subform is based on an \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#sql\" name=\"SQL\"\>SQL\</link\> query; more specifically, on a \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/02010100.xhp\" name=\"Parameter Query\"\>Parameter Query\</link\>. If a field name is entered in the \<emph\>Link master fields\</emph\> box, the data contained in that field in the main form is read to a variable that you must enter in \<emph\>Link slave fields\</emph\>. In an appropriate SQL statement, this variable is compared to the table data that the subform refers to. Alternatively, you can enter the column name in the \<emph\>Link master fields\</emph\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3156089				0	om	Fakkeenya asiin gadii hubadhu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3151017				0	om	The database table on which the form is based is, for example, a customer database ("Customer"), where every customer has been given a unique number in a data field named "Cust_ID". A customer's orders are maintained in another database table. You now want to see each customer's orders after entering them into the form. In order to do this you should create a subform. Under \<emph\>Link master fields\</emph\> enter the data field from the customer database which clearly identifies the customer, that is, Cust_ID. Under \<emph\>Link slave fields\</emph\> enter the name of a variable which is to accept the data of the field Cust_ID, for example, x.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3151248				0	om	The subform should show the appropriate data from the orders table ("Orders") for each customer ID (Customer_ID -> x). This is only possible if each order is uniquely assigned to one customer in the orders table. Alternatively, you can use another field called Customer_ID; however, to make sure that this field is not confused with the same field from the main form, the field is called Customer_Number.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3153537				0	om	Now compare the Customer_Number in the "Orders" table with the Customer_ID from the "Customers" table, which can be done, for example, using the x variable with the following SQL statement:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3155335				0	om	SELECT * FROM Orders WHERE Customer_Number =: x (if you want the subform to show all data from the orders table)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3163727				0	om	ykn				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3153921				0	om	SELECT Item FROM Orders WHERE Customer_Number =: x (if you want the subform from the orders table to show only the data contained in the "Item" field)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488				0	om	Himni SQL dirree \<emph\>Madda Deetaa\</emph\> keessa saagama, ykn arfii gaafataa mijataa, kan cita unka uumu uumuu ni dandeessa.  				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150648				0	om	Dirreewwan gabraa koronyeessi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3149923				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_SLAVEFIELDS\"\>If you create a subform, enter the variable where possible values from the parent form field can be stored.\</ahelp\> If a subform is based on a query, enter the variable that you defined in the query. If you create a form using an SQL statement entered in the \<emph\>Data source\</emph\> field, enter the variable you used in the statement. You can choose any variable name. If you want to enter multiple values, press Shift + Enter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3155114				0	om	If, for example, you specified the Customer_ID database field as a parent field under \<emph\>Link master fields\</emph\>, then you can define under \<emph\>Link slave fields\</emph\> the name of the variable in which the values of the Customer_ID database field are to be stored. If you now specify an SQL statement in the \<emph\>Data source\</emph\> box using this variable, the relevant values are displayed in the subform.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152778				0	om	Ctni unkaa maali?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3155579				0	om	Forms are created based on a database table or database query. They display the data in a visually pleasant fashion and can be used to enter data or edit data.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3147094	34			0	om	\<variable id=\"wozu\"\>If you require a form that can refer to the data in a table or query and can additionally display data from another table, you should create a subform. \</variable\> For example, this subform can be a text box that displays the data of another database table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3157972				0	om	A subform is an additional component of the main form. The main form can be called the "parent form" or "master". Subforms are needed as soon as you want to access more than one table from a form. Each additional table requires its own subform.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id4807275				0	om	After creating a form, it can be changed into a subform. To do this, enter Design Mode, and open the Form Navigator. In the Form Navigator, drag a form (that will become a subform) onto any other form (that will become a master).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_id3158444				0	om	The user of your document will not see that a form has subforms. The user only sees a document in which data is entered or where existing data is displayed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_idN10C2A				0	om	Specify the Link master field from the data fields in the master form. In the subform, the Link slave field can be set as a field which will be matched to the contents of the Link master field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170203.xhp	0	help	par_idN10C2D				0	om	When the user navigates through the data, the form always displays the current data record. If there are subforms defined, the contents of the subforms will be displayed after a short delay of approximate 200 ms. This delay enables you to quickly browse through the data records of the master form. If you navigate to the next master data record within the delay limit, the subform data need not be retrieved and displayed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Interneetii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151100				0	om	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070100.xhp\" name=\"Internet\"\>Interneetii\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154230				0	om	Use the \<emph\>Internet\</emph\> page of the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070000.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink dialog\"\>Hyperlink dialog\</link\> to edit hyperlinks with WWW or FTP addresses.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147291				0	om	Dirreewwan maqaa seeni, iggitaa fi maqadhablee fayyadamaa kan argamu teessoowwan FTP qofatti.				20200411 15:09:53
