helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170903.xhp	0	help	par_id3159224				0	om	Gatiiwwan dirreewwan gabateewwanii kamii fi gabateewwan tarree koronyatuu agarsiisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170903.xhp	0	help	par_id3150499				0	om	The value table is the table of the current form where the list field is inserted. The list table is the table whose data is to be shown in the list field. Both tables must be linked over a mutual data field. These links are to be entered on this page of the wizard. The field names must not necessarily be the same (this depends upon how the field names are defined in both tables), but both fields must have the same field type.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170903.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149180				0	om	Gatii gabatee dirree				20200411 15:09:53
