helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150084				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_ENABLED\"\>If a control field has the property "Enabled" (Yes), the form user will be able to use the control field.\</ahelp\> If the property is disabled, it will not be enabled (No) and will be displayed in a gray color.				20200411 15:09:53
