helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3152577	20			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_DROPDOWN\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sanduuqni makaan gadbuusaa (Eeyyee) ykn (miti) ta'uu isaa ifteessa.\</ahelp\>A control field with the dropdown property has an additional arrow button which opens the list of the existing form entries per mouse click. Under \<emph\>Line count\</emph\>, you can specify how many lines (or rows) should be displayed in the dropdown state. Combination fields can have the dropdown property.				20200411 15:09:53
