helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146950				0	om	Saxatoowwan				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154344	115			0	om	Qabduun calaqqee amala \<emph\>Saxatoowwanii \</emph\>qaba. \<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_IMAGE_URL\"\>Amalli\<emph\> Saxatoowwanii\</emph\> xurree saxatoowwanii fi maqaa faayilii qabduu irratti agarsiisu barbaadde ifteessa.\</ahelp\> Yoo faayilii saxatoo qabduu \<emph\>...\</emph\> wajjiin filte, xurree fi maqaa faayilii ofumaan sanduuqa barruu keessa gala.				20200411 15:09:53
