helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151340				0	om	Maqaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149819	10			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_NAME\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Fuula cancala \<emph\>Amalootaa\</emph\> irraa, filannoon kun maqaa dirree too'annootif  ifteessa. Fuula cancala \<emph\>Amaloota unkaa \</emph\>irraa, filannoon kun maqaa unkaaf ifteessa.\</ahelp\>Tokkoon tokkoon dirree too'annoo fi unkaa amala \<emph\>Maqaa \</emph\>ittiin addabaafamu qabu. Maqaan \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170600.xhp\" name=\"Form Navigator\"\>Unkaa Naannawaa\</link\> keessatti argamu akkasumas, maqaa fayyadamaa, dirree too'annoo maakiroo irraa agarsiisa. Qindoomina durtii duraanuu maqaa asxaa fi lakkoofsa dirreewwanitti fayyadamuun ijaarame ifteessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153025				0	om	Yoo maakroo wajjiin hojjatta ta'e, maqoonni too'annoowwanii adda ta'uu isaa mirkaneessi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146325				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>too'annoowwanii; gareedhaan\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>gareewwan;too'annoodhaa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>unkaawwan; too'annoowwan gareedhaan\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146325				0	om	Maqaanis too'annoowwan garagaraa kanneen hojiin isaanii walitti dhihaatu garee tokko jalatti fiduuf fayyada, kanneen akka qabduulee reediyoo. Kana hojjachuuf, miseensota garee maraaf maqaa tokko kenni:too'annoowwan maqoota walfakkaatan qaban garee uumu. Too'annoowwan gareeffaman \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\" name=\"Group Box\"\>Sanduuqa Garee\</link\>tti fayyadamuun dhugaan bakka bu'uu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149720				0	om	Kabal naannawiinsa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149918	198			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_NAVIGATIONBAR\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Kabala naannawiinsaa handaara gadaanaa too'annoowwan gabateerraa mul'isuu fi dhabuu isaa ifteessa.\</ahelp\>Kabala naannawiinsaa handaara gadaanaa too'annoowwan gabateerraa mul'isuu fi dhabuu isaa ifteessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3158426				0	om	Dubbisqofa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153215	43			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_READONLY\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Yoo too'annoon dubbisqofa (Eeyyee) ykn yoo gulaalamuu danda'e (Miti) tilmaama.\</ahelp\>Amalli\<emph\> Dubbisqofa \</emph\>too'annoowwan mara iddoo dhimmamaan barruu galchuu danda'u keessatti ramaduu danda'a. Yoo amala dubbisqofaa gara dirree calaqqee saxattoowwan kuusaa deetaarraa fayyadame ramadne, dhimmamaan saaxattoowwan haaraa gara kuusaa deetaa saaguu hin danda'u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148912				0	om	Handaara				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145637	140			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_BORDER\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Determines if the field's border should be displayed "Without frame", with a "3-D look" or "Flat".\</ahelp\>With control fields that have a frame, you can determine the border display on the form using the \<emph\>Border \</emph\>property. You can select among the "Without frame", "3-D look" or "Flat" options.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149266				0	om	Tartiiba cancalaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147483				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_TABINDEX\"\>The \<emph\>Tab order\</emph\> property determines the order in which the controls are focused in the form when you press the Tab key.\</ahelp\> In a form that contains more than one control, the focus moves to the next control when you press the Tab key. You can specify the order in which the focus changes with an index under \<emph\>Tab order\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3156207				0	om	The \<emph\>Tab order\</emph\> property is not available to \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170600.xhp\" name=\"Hidden Controls\"\>Hidden Controls\</link\>. If you want, you can also set this property for image buttons and image controls, so that you can select these controls with the Tab key.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150378				0	om	When creating a form, an index is automatically assigned to the control fields that are added to this form; every control field added is assigned an index increased by 1. If you change the index of a control, the indices of the other controls are updated automatically. Elements that cannot be focused (Tabstop = No) are also assigned a value. However, these controls are skipped when using the Tab key.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150640				0	om	You can also easily define the indices of the different controls in the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170300.xhp\" name=\"Tab Order\"\>\<emph\>Tab Order\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id0509200912114423				0	om	Hantuutee golollee marfataa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id0509200912114566				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Yeroo itti fayyadamaan hantuutee golollee maru gatiin jijjiiramuu isaa qindeessi. Tasumayyu: Gatiin hin jijjiiramu. Yeroo xiyyeeffannaa: (durtii) Yommuu too'annoon xiyyeeffannaa qabatuu fi gololleen too'annoo agarsiisuu fi marfamu gatiin ni jijjiirama. Yeroo Hundaa: yommuu gololleen gara too'annootti xiyyeeffatuu fi marfamu, wantootni too'annoon irratti xiyyeffatu tokkolee gatiin isaanii hin jijjiiramu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
