helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3156432	8			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_LABEL\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Amala asxaa dirree too'annoo asxaa unkaa irratti mul'ate qindeessa.\</ahelp\>Amala asxaa dirree too'annoo asxaa unkaa irratti mul'ate qindeessa. Amalli kun asxaa mul'ataa ykn irraantoo sarjaa dirree deetaa unkaalee too'annoo gabatee keessaa tilmaama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154568				0	om	Weyta too'annoo haaraa uumnu, ibsamni amala \<emph\>Maqaa\</emph\> keessatti duribsame akka durtii too'annoo sarxeessuf. Sarxaan maqaa dirree too'annoo qaba fi intijarii too'annoo lakkoofsisan (fakkeenyaa, QabduuAjajaa1). Amala \<emph\>Mataduree\</emph\> wajjiin, ibsama biroo gara too'annoo ramaduu danda'a kanaafuu sarxaan hojjaa too'annoo balaqqisiisa. Sarxaa ibsamaa too'annoo dhimmamaatti mul'atutti ramaduuf galfata kana jijjiiri.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	bm_id3163820				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>matadureewwan sar-baay'ee unkaalee keessaa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Maqoota; matadureewwan sar-baay'ee\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>too'annoowwan; matadureewwan sar-baay'ee\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3163820				0	om	To create a multi-line title, open the combo box using the arrow button. You can enter a line break by pressing Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159407				0	om	Amalli \<emph\>Matadure\</emph\> maalimaa unkaa sarxeessuu walqunnamaa dhimmamaa kessatti qofa fayyadu. Yoo maakiroon dalagde, If you work with macros, Yeroo ka'uumsatti yaadadhu, too'annoon yeroo mara kan iddeeffamu amala \<emph\>Maqaa\</emph\> keessa dabruun.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150293				0	om	URL				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154358	57			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_TARGET_URL\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Teessoo URL qabduu "Galmee banaa / fuula saphaphuu" yeroo cuqaasnu banu ifteessa.\</ahelp\>Teessoo URL gosa qabduu galmee banaaf ykn fuula saphaphuuf sanduuqa \<emph\>URL\</emph\> keessaa galcha. Weyta qabduu bannu teesson ni banama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146074				0	om	Yoo hantuutee qabduu haalata Dhimmamaa irra siiqsine, URL'n akka qaccee diriiratti argama, barruun Gargaarsa biraa hin galle jajjabeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147134				0	om	Mallattoo Maallaqaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145160	150			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_CURRENCYSYMBOL\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Arfii ykn diraa mallattoo maallaqaaf galchuu dandeenya.\</ahelp\>Dirree maallaqaa keessatti, arfii ykn diraa amaloota \<emph\>Mallattoo maallaqaa\</emph\> keessatti galchuun mallattoo maallaqaa duribsuu dandeenya.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144444				0	om	Gatii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3152417	155			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_HIDDEN_VALUE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deetaa too'annoo dhokataa irraa dhaalame galchuu dandeenya.\</ahelp\> \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170600.xhp\" name=\"hidden control\"\>Too'annoo dhokataa\</link\>keessatti, \<emph\>Gatii\</emph\>jalatti, Deetaa too'annoo dhokataa irraa dhaalame galchuu dandeenya. Deetaan kun weyta unkaa eginu ni darba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157315				0	om	Arfiilee ugguraa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155323	157			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_ECHO_CHAR\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Yoo sanduuqni barruu akka naqata ugguratti fayyade, Lakkaddaa ASKII arfii mul'ataa galchi. Arfiin kun bakka arfiilee ugguraa dhimmamaan barreeffamee bakka bu'u agarsiisa.\</ahelp\>Yoo dhimmamaan ugguraa galche, arfiilee bakka arfiilee dhimmamaan barreeffamee bakka bu'u agariisu tilmaamamuu dandeessa. \<emph\>Arfii ugguraa\</emph\>jalatti, lakkaddaa AKSII arfii barbaadme galcha. Gatii 0 hanga 25 fayyadamuu dandeenya.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3152493				0	om	Arfiilee fi lakkaddaawwan ASKII isaanii kan mul'atu qaaqa\<emph\>Arfiilee Addaa\</emph\> (Saagi - Arfii Addaa).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157884				0	om	Haguuggee laataraalii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3157557	160			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_LITERALMASK\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Haguuggee laataraalii ibsa. Haguuggen laataraalii gatiiwwan jalqabaa qaba akkasumas yeroo mara kan mul'atu erga unkaa naqannee booda.\</ahelp\>dirreewwan haguuggetiin haguuggee laataraalii ibsuu dandeenya. Haguuggeen laataraalii gatiiwwan jalqaba unkaa, Akkasumas yeroo mara kan mul'atu erga unkaa naqannee booda. Lakkada arfii haguuggee gulaallitti fayyadamnee, galfatawwan dhimmamaan dirree haguuggeetti barreesse tilmaamuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148513				0	om	Dheerinni haguuggee laataraalii yeroo hunda dheerina haguuggee gulaallitiin wal gitu qaba. Yoo kun dhimma hin taane, haguuggeen gulaallii takkaa ni murama ykn hanga dheerina haguuggee gulaallii  duwwaan guutama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146762				0	om	Bocquu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151037	6			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_FONT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Bocquu barruu dirree too'annoo keessa jiruuf fili.\</ahelp\>Dirreewwan too'annoo barruu ykn matadureewwan mul'ataa qabaniif, bocquu fayyadamuu barbaanne mul'isu fili. Qaaqa \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020100.xhp\" name=\"Font\"\>\<emph\>Bocquu\</emph\>\</link\> banuuf, qabduu \<emph\>...\</emph\> cuqaasi. Bocquun filatame maqaawwan dirreewwan too'annoo keessatti fi deetaa dirreewwan too'annoo gabatee keessaa mul'isuuf fayyada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156734				0	om	Hojjaa dalgee				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3160455	163			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_ROWHEIGHT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Tarree hojjaa dirree too'annoo gabatee ifteessa.\</ahelp\>Too'annoowwan gabatee keessatti, gatii tarree hojjatiif galchi. Yoo barbaadde, gatii yuniitii safara gatiinsaatiin duukame galchuuf nu dandeessisa, fakkeenyaaf, sm 2.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11FB6				0	om	Sararootni Barruu kan dhaabbatan				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11FBA				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Dirreewwan barruutif, dhuma lakkada sararaa weyta barruu sarjaa kuusaa deetaatti barreessinu fayyadamnu fili.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3160477				0	om	Dhangii yeroo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145187	169			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_TIMEFORMAT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Dhangii yeroo mul'isuuf barbaannu ibsuu dandeessa.\</ahelp\>Dhangii yeroo mul'isuuf barbaannu ibsuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3158195				0	om	Barruu gargaarsaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146823	171			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_TAG\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Odeeffannoo dabalataa ykn barruu iftaataa'aa dirree too'annoof ifteessa.\</ahelp\>Dirree too'annoo tokkoon tokkoo keessatti odeeffannoo dabalataa ykn barruu iftaa'aa dirree too'annoof ifteessitu dandeessisa. Amalli kun saganteessaa odeeffannoo dabalataa lakkada sagantaa keessatti fayyadamnu olkaa'uf gargaara. Dirreen kun kan fayyadu, fakkeenyaaf, jijjiiramaaf ykn ulagaalee madaalinsaa birootif.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157828				0	om	Dhangeessuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146843				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_FORMATKEY\"\>Dhangii lakkada too'annoof ifteessa. Dhangii lakkadaa filuuf qabduu\<emph\>...\</emph\> cuqaasi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN122C4				0	om	Safara				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN122C8				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_SCALEIMAGE\"\>Calaqqee hammamtaa too'annootti taasisuuf deebi'ii hammamteessi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1209F				0	om	Kuusaa irratti gocheessuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN120B1				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"37930\"\>Maalimoota gochaa too'annoo kabala naannawiinsaa filame mul'isuuf ykn dhoksuuf ifteessa.\</ahelp\> Maalimoonni gochaa kanneen asiin gadii kana: Kuusaa olkaa'i, Gaabbii, Kuusaa haaraa, Kuusaa haqi, Haaromsi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN120BE				0	om	Iddoo qabsiisuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN120D9				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"37928\"\>Maalimoota qubannoo too'annoo kabala naannawiinsaa filame mul'isuuf ykn dhoksuuf ifteessa.\</ahelp\> Maalimoonni qubannoo kanneen asiin gadii kana: Kuusaa sarxaa, Kuusaa qubannoo, Kuusaa sarxaa lakkaa'i, Kuusaa lakkaa'i.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN120D7				0	om	Naannawiinsa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN120DB				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"37929\"\>Maalimoota naannawiinsa too'annoo kabala naannawiinsaa filame mul'isuuf ykn dhoksuuf ifteessa.\</ahelp\> Maalimoonni naannawiinsaa kanneen asiin gadii kana: Kuusaa jalqaba/duraa, Kuusaa duraanii, Kuusaa ittaanaa, Kuusaa xumuraa/maayyii.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12156				0	om	Gingilchuu / Fooyuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1215A				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"37931\"\>Maalimoota gingilchiinsafi fooyinsaa too'annoo kabala naannawiinsa filamee mul'isuuf ykn dhoksuuf ifteessa.\</ahelp\> Maalimoonni gingilchiinsaa fi fooyinsaa kanneen asiin gadii kana: Olee fooyi, Fooyi, Gingilchaa ofumaanii, Gingilchaa durtii, Gingilchaa fayyadami, Gingilchaa/fooyi haqi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12175				0	om	Hammamtaa Sajoo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12179				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"37927\"\>Sajoowwan kabala naannawiinsaa keessatti filaman xiqqaa ykn guddaa ta'uu ifteessa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id0409200920593864				0	om	Mul'ataa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id0409200920593851				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Too'annoon akka haalata jiru keessatti mul'atu ibsi. Haalata saxaxa keessatti, too'annoon yeroo hundaa mul'ata.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id0409200921154683				0	om	Hubachiisa, yoo amali kun gara "Tole" (durtii)tti qindaa'e, kana jechuun too'annoon sirriimaan argii irratti uumama jechuu miti. Ittisamootni dabalataa yeroo mul'ita kan too'annoo sirriitti herregnu hojjoomu. Fakkeenyaaf, too'annoo kutaa dhokataa hanga kutaan xiqqaan ofiisaa mul'atuti kan Barreessaa keessaa hundi isaa tasumayyuu hin mul'atu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id0409200921154691				0	om	Yoo amali "No"tti qindaa'e, too'annoon yeroo hunda haalata jiru keessaa dhokata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id0409200921154614				0	om	Yemmuu galmeewwan warra akka itti fayyadamtu godhan dubbistuu, fooyya'aan OpenOffice.org inni moofaan hanga 3.1 amala kana ni tuffata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12314				0	om	Hammamtaa mul'ataa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12318				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Hammamtaa abgudduu kabala maraa "gatii yuniitota" keessaa ifteessa. Gatiin ("Gatii olaanaa maraa" Hir'isuu "Gatii gadaanaa maraa." ) / 2 bu'aan abgudduu keessaa walakkaa bal'ina duubbee kan qabatudha.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12375				0	om	Yoo gara 0 qindeessite, yabbinni abgudduuwwanii hojjan isaatin walqixa ta'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12332				0	om	Qajeelfama				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12336				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Qajeelfama surdala ykn sarjaa kabala maraa ykn qabduu qaanxii ifteessa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Tartiiba cancalaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146959				0	om	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170300.xhp\" name=\"Tab Order\"\>Tartiiba cancalaa\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150347	2			0	om	\<variable id=\"text\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TabDialog\"\>In the\<emph\> Tab Order \</emph\>dialog you can modify the order in which control fields get the focus when the user presses the tab key.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3109850				0	om	If form elements are inserted into a document, \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> automatically determines in which order to move from one control to the next when using the Tab key. Every new control added is automatically placed at the end of this series. In the \<emph\>Tab Order\</emph\> dialog, you can adapt the order of this series to your individual needs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	om	You can also define the index of a control through its specific properties by entering the desired value under \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Order\"\>\<emph\>Order\</emph\>\</link\> in the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> dialog of the control.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760				0	om	A radio button inside a group can only be accessed by the Tab key when one of the radio buttons is set to "selected". If you have designed a group of radio buttons where no button is set to "selected", then the user will not be able to access the group or any of the radio buttons by keyboard.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149140				0	om	Too'annoo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789	5			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TABORDER_CONTROLS\"\>Lists all controls in the form. These controls can be selected with the tab key in the given order from top to bottom.\</ahelp\> Select a control from the \<emph\>Controls \</emph\>list to assign the desired position in the tab order.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153750				0	om	Ol siiqsi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751	7			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_TAB_ORDER_PB_MOVE_UP\"\>Click the\<emph\> Move Up\</emph\> button to shift the selected control one position higher in the tab order.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155339				0	om	Move Down				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823	9			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_TAB_ORDER_PB_MOVE_DOWN\"\>Click the\<emph\> Move Down\</emph\> button to shift the selected control one position lower in the tab order.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154288				0	om	Ofumaan fooyi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153748	11			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_TAB_ORDER_PB_AUTO_ORDER\"\>Click the\<emph\> Automatic Sort\</emph\> button to automatically sort the controls according to their position in the document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
