helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147574				0	om	Saaxxiillaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153760				0	om	Wanti saxatoo saxxiillaa keessatti mul'ata. A color graphic object can become monochrome in grayscale. You can also use the color sliders to apply a uniform color to the monochrome graphic object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151246				0	om	Adii fi Gurraacha				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153062				0	om	Wanti saxatoo gurraacha fi adii keessatti mul'atu. Ifiinsi hundinuu kan gatiinsaa 50% gadii gurraacha ta'a, 50% olii hundinuu ammoo adii ta'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146795				0	om	Saaxatoo golgolaa'aa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	om	Saxatoo wanta ifiinsa keessaatti olka'e fi dimimmisa keessaatti gadbu'e durduubbee keessatti akka saxatoo golgolaa'atti fayyaduu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
