helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3154134				0	om	Yoo "Gabatee" \<emph\>Gosa qabeentoota tarree\</emph\> jalatti filatte, caasaa gabatee kasaa ifteeffamuu deemu ibsa. Fakkeenyaa: Yoo gabatee kuusaa deetaa \<emph\>Qabiyyee tarree\</emph\>jalatti filatamte, gabatee gadiif wabeessi:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3155379				0	om	Dirree marfame				20200411 15:09:53
