helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3154260				0	om	Sarjaan gabatee tokkoffaan gara dirree \<emph\>Dirree deetaa\</emph\>jalatti ibsametti koronyate.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3156448				0	om	1				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3154486				0	om	Sarjaan gabatee lammaffaan gara dirree \<emph\>Dirree deetaa\</emph\>jalatti ibsametti koronyate.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3149949				0	om	2				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3146767				0	om	Sarjaan gabatee sadaffaan gara dirree \<emph\>Dirree deetaa\</emph\>jalatti ibsametti koronyate..				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149772				0	om	Gosa tarree qabiyyeewwanii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3154419				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_LISTSOURCETYPE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deetaa tarreewwan tarree keessaa fi sanduuqota makaa guutuf tilmaama.\</ahelp\>Deetaa tarreewwan tarree keessaa fi sanduuqota makaa guutuf tilmaama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3153326				0	om	Filannoo "Tarreegatii" tiin, Galfatawwan mara dirree \<emph\>Galfatawwan tarree\</emph\> keessatti galfaman cancala \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"General\"\>\<emph\>Waliigala\</emph\>\</link\> too'annoo keessatti argamu. Unkaawwan kuusaa deetaa, Gatiiwwan wabii fayyadamuu danddeessa (kutaa \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170102.xhp\" name=\" References Using Value Lists\"\>\<emph\>Gatii tarreewwan wabiiletti fayyadamuu\</emph\>\</link\> ilaali).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3153067				0	om	Yoo qabiyyeen too'annoo kuusaa deetaarraa dubbifame, gosa madda deetaa filannoowwan birootirraa timaamuu dandeenya. Fakkeenyaaf, gabateewwan fi galfatawwan gidduu filuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153820				0	om	Tarree Qabiyyee				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3159171				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_LISTSOURCE\"\>Unkaawwan kuusaa deetaa, madda deetaa qabiyyee tarree maalimaa unkaa ifteessa. Dirreen kun gatii tarree galmeewwanii waliindha kuusaa deetaa ibsuuf fayyada.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3168456				0	om	Dhimma unkaawwan kuusaa deetaatiin, maddi deetaa galfatawwan tarree ykn sanduuqa makaa tilmaama. Gosa filamerratti hundaa'ee, filannoo maddoota deetaa garaagaraa \<emph\>Qabiyyee tarree\</emph\>jidduu qaba. wantootni kun kuusaa deetaa kee keessatti argamuu kan jajjabeessu dha. Gosni kuusdeetaa wantoota \<emph\>Gosa qabeentaa tarree\</emph\> jalatti filame asitti argama. Yoo "Gatii Tarree"gosa akka dirqaalaatti filatte, wabii kuusdeetaa akka dhangiitti fayyadamuu dandeessa. Yoo agarsiisni to'annoo ajaja SQL tiin to'atama ta'ee, himni SQL asitti saagama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3155870				0	om	Fakkeenyota himoota SQL:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3144504				0	om	Sanduuqota tarreetif, himni SQL unkaa asiin gadii qabaachuu danda'a:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3156188				0	om	dirree1, dirree2, gabatee IRRAA FILI				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3155266				0	om	"gabatee"n asii gabatee deetaan isaa too'annoo tarree keessatti mul'atu. "dirree1" dirree deetaa galfata mul'ataa unkaa keessaa ibsuuf; qabiyyeen isaa sanduuqa tarree keessatti mul'ata. "dirree2" dirree gabatee tarree gara gabatee unkaa(gatii gabatee) dirree \<emph\>Deetaa dirree\</emph\>jalatti ibsame keessa dabre yoo \<emph\>Dirree daangeffame\</emph\> = 1 filame.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3145074				0	om	Sanduuqota makaatiif, himni SQL unkaa asiin gadii qabaachuu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3150991				0	om	Dirree ADDAA gabatee IRRAA FILI,				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3154344				0	om	"dirree" asii dirree deetaa "gabatee" gabatee tarreerraa kan qabiyyeen isaa tarree sanduuqa makaa keessatti mul'atan.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3149328				0	om	\<emph\>Tarreewwan gatii galmeewwan HTML\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3156034				0	om	Unkaawwan HTML tiif, gatii tarree \<emph\>Qabiyyee tarree\</emph\>jalatti galchuu dandeenya. Filannoo "Gatiitarree" \<emph\>Gosa qabeentota tarree\</emph\>jalaa fili. Gatiiwwan asitti galchine unkaa keessatti hin mul'atan, akkasumas gatiiwwan gara galfatoota mul'atotti ramaduuf gargaara. Galfatni \<emph\>Qabiyyee tarree\</emph\> jalatti hojjataman iyyaatoo HTML walgitanii <OPTION VALUE=...>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3154855				0	om	Dabra deetaa galafata sanduuqa tarree ykn makaa irraa filame keessatti, gatiiwwan tarree unkaa keessatti mul'atan lachanuu, kan cancala \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"General\"\>\<emph\>Waliigala\</emph\>\</link\> \<emph\>Galfata tarree\</emph\>jalatti galan, akkasumas gatii tarree cancala\<emph\>Deetaa\</emph\>irratti \<emph\>Qabiyyee tarree\</emph\>jalatti galfaman, xiyyeeffannaa jala galchuu qaban: Yoo barruun qubannoo gatii tarree keessaa filaman (<OPTION VALUE=...>), daddabruu danda'a. Kanata'uu baannan, barruun too'annoo (<OPTION>) keessatti mul'atan ni ergamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3163377				0	om	Yoo gatiin tarree diraa duwwaa qabaatuf, gatii "$$$empty$$$" \<emph\>qabiyyee tarree\</emph\>jalatti iddoo qubannoo wal gitanitti (yaadannoo qubee guddaa/xiqqaa)galchi. $[officename] naqa kana akka diraa duwwatti akkasumas gara galfata tarree firooma qabanitti ramadi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3156309				0	om	Gabatee asiin gadii waliindha HTML, JaavaaIskiriptii fi dirree$[officename] \<emph\>Qabiyyee tarree\</emph\> gidduu jiru fakkeenya sanduuqa tarree moggaasni isaa "SanduuqaTarree1" mul'isa. Dhimma kana keessatti, "Maalimaa" galfata tarree unkaa keessatti mul'atan wixineessa.				20200411 15:09:53
