helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3158405	5			0	om	If you have numbered paragraphs and click the\<emph\> Move Down \</emph\>icon, the numbers will be adjusted to the current order. \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>The \<emph\>Move Down \</emph\>icon is only visible when the cursor is positioned in a bulleted or numbered list. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>The \<emph\>Move Down \</emph\>icon appears on the \<emph\>Text Formatting\</emph\> Bar when you use the outline view. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
