helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154873				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OFA_HYPERLINK_URL\"\>Takkaa URL barreesu fayyadamu dandeessa, ykn URL galmee irraa harkisii kaa'itti fayyadamii saagi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153894				0	om	URL iddoo qubannoo qaree ammee galmee ka'aa keessaatti sajoo \<emph\>Geessituu\</emph\> wajjiin gulaaluu fi saagu dandeessa. Sajoon \<emph\>Geessituu\</emph\> kan ta'u yoo dirreen \<emph\>Maqaa URL\</emph\> barruu qabaate qofa.				20200411 15:09:53
