helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363	2			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertMode\"\>Haalata ammee saagame mul'isa. INSRT = saagi and OVER = irraba jidduu ceesisuu dandeenya.\</ahelp\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>Dirreen kun ka'aa kan ta'u yoo qareen sarara naqaa kabala foormulaa ykn man'ee keessa ta'e qofa dha. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
