helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\19090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156183				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SourceView\"\>Madda barruu galmee HTML ammee mul'isa. Madda HTML galmee haaraa laaluuf, galmee haaraa akka galmee HTML tti jalqaba olkaa'uu qabda.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\19090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760				0	om	Madda haalata HTML keessatti, laaluu fi gulaaluu \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#tags\" name=\"tags\"\>iyyaatoo\</link\>\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#html\" name=\"HTML\"\>HTML\</link\>ni dandeessa. Galmee akka galmee barquutti olkaa'i. Galmee akka HTML tti agarsiisuf fuufaa .html ykn .htm ramadi.				20200411 15:09:53
