helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153662				0	om	If you call the context menu of a selected entry, the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\> offers the following functions:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153252				0	om	Haaraa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153561	8			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_NEW\"\>Adds new elements to the form. The\<emph\> Add \</emph\>function can only be called if a form is selected in the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149763				0	om	Form				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156117	10			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_NEW_FORM\"\>Creates a new form in the document. \</ahelp\> To create a \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"subform\"\>subform\</link\>, add the new form under the desired parent form.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155342				0	om	Too'annoo dhokataa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3158430				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_NEW_HIDDEN\"\>Creates a hidden control in the selected form that is not displayed on the screen. A hidden control serves to include data that is transmitted together with the form.\</ahelp\> It contains additional information or clarifying text that you can specify when creating the form through the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Special Properties\"\>Special Properties\</link\> of the control. Select the entry of the hidden control in the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\> and select the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> command.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3159147				0	om	Gabatee muraa kessaan (furtuu qaxxaamuraa \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+C garagalchuu fi \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+V saaguuf) galmee keessaatti too'annoowwan garagalchuu dandeessa. To'atamtoota dhokatan \<emph\>Naanna'aa Unkaa\</emph\> keessatti garagalchuu kan dandeessu furtuun \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> gadhiibamee osoo jiruu harkisii-kaa'ii fayyadamuudhaani.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3145068				0	om	Galmeewwan ykn galmee walfakkaataa gidduutti too'annoowwan garagalchaa harkisuudhaan haqi. Galmee unkaa banuudhaan too'annoo dhokate \<emph\>Naanna'aa Unkaa\</emph\> irraa gara galmee galtee \<emph\>Naanna'aa Unkaa\</emph\>tti harkisi. Too'annoo argamu kallattiidhaan galmee keessaa cuqaasi, hantuutee yeroo xiqqoof qindeessi isaa boodas galagalchi too'annoo gabatee muraa harkisii fi haqitti dabalamu, itti aansuun garagalcha gara galmee biraatti harkisi. Galmee walfakkaatu keessatti garagalchuu yoo barbaade, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>dhiibi garuu harkisi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152812				0	om	Haqi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154938				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_DELETE\"\>Deletes the selected entry.\</ahelp\> This allows you to delete individual form components as well as whole forms with one mouse click.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153799				0	om	Tartiiba cancalaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156282				0	om	Weyta unkaan filatame, qaaqa \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170300.xhp\" name=\"Tab Order\"\>\<emph\>Tartiiba Cancala\</emph\>\</link\> bana, where the indices for focusing the control elements on the Tab key are defined.				20200411 15:09:53
