helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419				0	om	Yeroo taatewwan argaman,Geessituun maacroo ni waamamu.Maacroo gara taatetti ramuduuf,qabduu \<emph\>....\</emph\> gad qabi. An \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05060700.xhp\" name=\"Assign Macro\"\>Maakroo ramadi\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>qaaqa\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> opens.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149732				0	om	Too'annoo irratti hundaa'ee,taatewwan gara garaa ni argamu. Taatewwan too'annoo filamee fi halqara fuula cancala \<emph\>Taatewwan\</emph\> irratti tarreeffaman qofa. Taatewwan asiin gadii ibsaman:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149191				0	om	Jalqabuun dura				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153717				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_APPROVEACTIONPERFORMED\"\>Taaten kun osoo gochi cuqaasa too'annootin kaka'in dura iddoo qabata.\</ahelp\> Fakkeenyaaf, qabduu "dabarsi" cuqaasun gocha ergiinsaa kakaasa; haa ta'uu malee, adeemsi "erguu" dhugaa kan eegalu weyta taateen\<emph\>Yeroo kaka'umsaa\</emph\> argame qofa. Taateen \<emph\>Eegaliinsa duraa\</emph\> adeemsa ajjeessuu ni hayyama. Yoo tooftaan koronyate SOBA duubatti erge, \<emph\>Weyta kaka'umsaa\</emph\> hin hojjatamu.				20200411 15:09:53
