helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D2E				0	om	Hamma tarkaanfii guddaa maraa kabala maraa ifteessa, fakkeenyaaf, weyta abgudduu kabala maraa fi xiyya kabala maraa jidduu cuqaastu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D35				0	om	Turiinsa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D3B				0	om	Mudatoota ceesistuu kabala marfataa gidduutti turiinsa miillii sekoondii keessaa ifteessa. Fakkeenyaaf, turiinsi yommuu qabduu xiyyaa kabala marfataa fi qabduu hantuutee gadi qabii irratti uumamu.				20200411 15:09:53
