helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148394				0	om	Yoo garee goodayyaa gara galmeetti saagde, \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01120000.xhp\" name=\"Group Element Wizard\"\>Masaka Garee Maalimaa\</link\> haala salphaan garee filannoo uumuu si dandeessisu ni jalqaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150567				0	om	\<emph\>Yaadannoo:\</emph\> yeroo sanduuqa garee too'annoowwan duraan argamanirra harkisuu barbaadde fi akkasumas too'annoo filachuu barbaadde,jalqaba baafata halqara sanduuqa garee banu qabda akkasumas \<emph\>Qindeessi - Duuba ergi\</emph\>jedhu filadhu. akkasumas yeroo \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> dhiibuudhaan toa'annoo fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145615				0	om	Sanduuqotni garee taatee arguu qofaaf fayyada. A functional grouping of option fields can be made through the name definition: under the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Name\"\>\<emph\>Name\</emph\>\</link\> properties of all option fields, enter the same name in order to group them.				20200411 15:09:53
