helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3109848	137			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoControlFocus\"\>Yoo\<emph\> Too'annoo xiyyeeffannoo ofumaanii \</emph\>ka'aa ta'e,Unkaan too'annoo jalqabaa yero galmee bante kan filamudha. Yoo qabduun ka'aa ta'uu baatte,barruun baniinsa booda filama. \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170300.xhp\" name=\"Tab Order\"\>Tarree cancalaa\</link\> that you have specified determines which is the first form control.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
