helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3147588				0	om	Baafata xiqqaa Kuusfaayaa keessatti bana iddoo ati itti \<emph\>Gargalchi\</emph\> fi \<emph\>Geessituu\</emph\> keessaa filattutti jechuu dha. Wanti kuusfaayaa filatame gara galmee ammeetti gargalchama yookaan geessituun ni uumama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3146130				0	om	Yoo galmee kee keessaa wanta filatteetta ta'e, saagamni haaraan wanta filatame bakka bu'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145829				0	om	Duubbee				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3149180				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_MN_BACKGROUND\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Fakkaattii filatame akka saxaatoo duubbeetti saaga.\</ahelp\> Akka saxaatoon fuula guutuu yookaan keewwata ammee qofa haguuguu qabu qindeessuuf, ajaja baafata xiqqaa \<emph\>Fuula\</emph\> ykn \<emph\>Keewwata\</emph\> fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153049				0	om	Garagalchi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_EXPLORERCONTENT_COPY\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Maalimaa filatame gara barruu xiqqaatti gargalchuuf.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148620				0	om	Haqi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3154317				0	om	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"SID_EXPLORERCONTENT_DESTROY\"\>Filannoo ammee haqa. Yoo wantootni hedduun filataman, hundi isaanii ni haqamu. Haaloota hedduu keessatti, \<link href=\"text/shared/01/03150100.xhp\" name=\"security query\"\>gaafata ittisaa\</link\> osoo wantooni hin haqamiin mul'ata.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3155941				0	om	Wanti baattuu deetaa irraa qaamaan haqameera yookaan halqara irratti hundaa'uun agarsiisni wantaa haqameera.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3150506				0	om	Kuusfaayaa keessa yeroo jirutti \<emph\>Haqi\</emph\> yoo filatte, galfatni kuusfaayaa keessaa haqama, garuu faayilichi mataansaa osoo hin tuqamiin tura.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150443				0	om	Bani				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3149149	137			0	om	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"SID_EXPLORERCONTENT_OPEN_OBJECT\"\> Wanta filatame hojii haaraa irratti banuuf\<emph\> Bani \</emph\>fayyadami.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149732				0	om	Maqaa jijjiiri				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3149797				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_EXPLORERCONTENT_RENAME\" visibility=\"visible\"\> Wanta filatame maqaa jijjiiruuf dandeessisi.\</ahelp\> Filannoon booda \<emph\>Maqaa Jijjiiri\</emph\> maqichii filame wanti haaraa kallchaan galfamuu danda'a. Qaree jalqaba ykn dhuma maqaa irratti qindeessuun haquuf yookaan gara qaama maqichaatti ida'uuf yookaan qaree bakka biraa qubachiisuuf furtuulee xiyyaa fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155434				0	om	Haaromsi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3154898				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_ACTUALIZE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Mul'annoo foddaa keessaa yookaan wanta filatame keessatti haroomsa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147573				0	om	Durargii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3155583				0	om	Maalimaan filatame Kuusfaayaa keessatti hammamtaa guddaadhaan mul'ifama. Gara mul'annoo kuusfaayaa baratameetti deebisuuf durargii lama cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157809				0	om	Geessituu Uumi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000010.xhp	0	help	par_id3153716				0	om	Yoo wanti filatame, ajajni kun kakaafamuu danda'a. Geessituun maqaansaa "Gara xxx tti geessi" (\<emph\>xxx\</emph\> maqaa wantaa bakka bu'a) akka wanta filatameetti galeeloo walfakkaatu keessatti uumama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Qabdoota-Irradaddebiin Fayyadaman				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152952				0	om	Qabdoota-Irradaddebiin itti fayyadaman				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147617				0	om	Dhiisi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155913				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>\<emph\>Dhiisi\</emph\> cuqaasuun jijjiirama wrramee tokkolee osso olhinkaaiin qaaqa cufa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id2341685				0	om	Xumuri				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id6909390				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Jijjiiramoota hunda fayyadami akkasumas masakiichaas cufa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147477				0	om	Toolbars				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149783				0	om	Xiyyicha soojoowwan tokko tokkoo cina jiran caqasuun kamshaa banta. Kamshichaa sosochoosuuf, kabala matadurichaa harkisi. Battaluma qabdu hantuutttee gadhiisteen, kamshaan iddoo haaraatti hafa. Kamshaa mataduree gara iddoo biraatti harkisi, ykn gara qarree foodichaa, bakka kamshichaatti itti hidhamutti harkisi.Cuftuu foodaa soojoo caqasuun kamshaa cufi. Kamshaa dabalataan akka mul`atu gochuuf \<emph\>Ilaali - Kamshaalee - (maqaa kamshaa)\</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152414				0	om	Qabduu qaamii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id1094088				0	om	Akka hunka to'annootti, qaanxiin qabduu amaaloota dirree lakkoofsa, dirree sharafa, dirree guyyaaa, ykn dirree sa'atiiti. Yoo amlichiif spin bootoon hojeete dirricha mallattoolee cimdii irran gadee ykn dagaleen akkatan mul'isa .				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id7493209				0	om	Bu’uura IDE keessatti, qabduun qanxii maqaa kan xiyya olee lama waliin lakkoofsa dirreef gargaaru dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155599				0	om	Dirree qabduu qaanxii itti aanu keessatti gatii lakkoofsaa barreessuu, ykn qabduu qaanxii irraa gatii mallattoolee xiyya - olii ykn xiyya - gadii waliin filachuu dandeessa. Gatiicha hir'suuf yookiin dabaluuf gabatee cuqoo irraa furtuulee xiyyaa alkaassaa fi gadbuusaa dhiibu dandeessa. Gatii olaanaa fi gadaanaa qindeessuuf furtuu Fuul Olee fi Fuul Gadee dhiibu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150264				0	om	Osoo dirreen qabduu qaanxii itti aanuu gatiiwwan lakkoofsa hiike, dabalataan \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000003.xhp#metrik\" name=\"measurement unit\"\>safartuu\</link\> hiikuu dandeessa, fakeenyaaf, 1 cm ykn 5 mm, 12 pt ykn 2".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154232				0	om	Jijjiiri				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3148983				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Qaaqa keessa gara fulduraatti yoo cuqaafte, qabduun kun \<emph\>itti aanee\</emph\> jedhama. Fuula jalqabaa irratti qabduun maqaa \<emph\>Jijjiiri\</emph\> qaba. Jijjiirraan qabduu cuqaasuun raawwatama.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145129				0	om	Baafata Halqaraa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3156553				0	om	\<variable id=\"context\"\>Baafata halqara wantaa kakaasuuf, jalqaba wanta fiachuuf\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>left\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>qabduu hantuutee waliin cuqaasi, itti aansuudhaan yeroo furtuu Ctrl ykn ajajaa fi furtuuwwan dirqalaa gad qabdu, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>qabduu hantuutee irra deebuun cuqaasi \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>qabduu hantuutee mirgaa cuqaasi\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>. Baafatni halqaraa gariin osoodhuma wanti hin filatamiin illee waamamuu danda'u. Baafatni halqaraa $[officename] keessatti iddoo maratti argama.\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149180				0	om	Haqi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153750				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Maalimaa ykn maalimoota filataman dhugoomsa booda haqa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147557				0	om	Haqi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Maalimaa ykn maalimoota filataman dhugoomsa osoo hin barbaadiin haqa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148620				0	om	Safartuuwwan				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	om	Gatiiwwan dirree naqaa keessa safartuu birootiin galchuu dandeessa. Safaruun durtii inchii dha. Haata'u malee, yoo iddoo 1cm ta'u barbaadde, "1cm" barreessi. Baafata irratti hundaa'uun safartootni kan biroos ni argamu, fakkeenyaaf, 12 pt bakka iddoo akeeki 12. Yoo gatiin safartuu haaraa beekamaa hin ta'iin, sagantichi gatii guddaa fi xiqqaa durumaan ibsaman fayyadama. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155535				0	om	Cufi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Qaaqa cufee jijjiiramoota mara ol kaa'a.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
