helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154331				0	om	Gaafatni dhugoomsuu hin mul'atu. Yoo qaaqa TOLE dhaan dhugoomsite qindaa'inootni hundi qaaqa kana keessa jiran ni haaroomu.				20200411 15:09:53
