helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000003.xhp	0	help	par_idN10715				0	om	Fakkeenyaaf, barruu galmee keessaa, \<emph\>Dhangii - Keewwata - Galumsoota & Addaan Fageenya\</emph\>bani. Keewwata ammee inchii tokkoon galchuuf, gara sanduuqa "Barruu Dura"\<item type=\"literal\"\>1 in\</item\> ykn \<item type=\"literal\"\>1"\</item\> galchi. Keewwata 1cm raan galchuuf, gara sanduuqa naqaatti \<item type=\"literal\"\>1 cm\</item\> galchi.   				20200411 15:09:53
