helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000206.xhp	0	help	par_id3150620				0	om	Dirqalee alaagi/alergiif qindeessa. Qaaqonni kun ofumaan mul'ifamu yoo akaakuun faayilii isa gituu filatame.				20200411 15:09:53
