helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000206.xhp	0	help	par_id3152942				0	om	Calaltuu ilaalchisee odeeffannoo baay'ee argachuuf, mataduree: \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000020.xhp\" name=\"Information about Import and Export Filters\"\>Odeeffannoo waa'ee Calaltiiwwan Alaagi fi Alergii\</link\> ilaali.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Export text files				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153116				0	om	Export text files				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3150379				0	om	The \<emph\>Export text files\</emph\> dialog allows you to define the export options for text files. The dialog will be displayed if you save spreadsheet data as file type "Text CSV", and if the \<emph\>Edit filter settings\</emph\> check box is marked in the \<emph\>Save As\</emph\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155577				0	om	Dirqalee dirree				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3152427				0	om	Adda baasaa dirree, adda baasaa barruu fi qindaa'ina kan alergii barruuf qindeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
