helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	hd_id783149793				0	om	Quote all text cells				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3152778363				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Exports all text cells with leading and trailing quote characters as set in the Text delimiter box. If not checked, only those text cells get quoted that contain the Field delimiter character.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	hd_id7145298				0	om	Qabeentoo seelii akka mul'atetti olkaa'i				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id5719779				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enabled by default, data will be saved as displayed, including applied number formats. If this checkbox is not marked, raw data content will be saved, as in older versions of the software.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3541062				0	om	Dhangii lakkoofsa irratti hundaa'uun, qabeentoota seelii gatiiwwan barreefama koo kan yeroo alaagi akka gatiiwwan lakkoofsatti hin hiikamne mul'atu olkaa'uu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149793				0	om	Dalgee tarjaa dhaabbataa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCDLG_IMPORTOPT_CB_FIXEDWIDTH\"\>Dirroota deetaa hunda dalgee dhaabbataa wajjin alerguu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3149283				0	om	Dalgeen dirree deetaa fayilee barruu alergee keessaa akka dalgee ammee tarjaa walitti dhufootti qindaa'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3154116				0	om	Gatiin dhangii keessatti alergame akka ammeetti seelii keessatti ilaalame.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3156414				0	om	Yoo gatiin dalgee tarjaa dhaabbataa irra dheerate, akka ### diraatti alergama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3150178				0	om	Yoo dirraan barruu dalgee tarjaa dhaabbataa irra dheerate, xumurarratti ni gabaabbata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3148548				0	om	Hiriirfama bitaa, Wiirta'aa, fi mirgaa fakkeeffama bakka duuwwaa saaguu dhaan.				20200411 15:09:53
