helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	ASCII Gingilcha Dirqalaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146856				0	om	ASCII Gingilcha Dirqalaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	par_id3153070				0	om	 Dirqala kam akka ta'e ibsuu dandeessa, kanneen akka bocquu bu'uuraa, afaan, qindaa'ina arfii, yookan qurxiinsa galmee barruu waliin alergamu yookan alaagamu. Qaaqni kan mul'atu yoo faayilii ASCII gingilcha waliin "Barruu Erguu" fe'amu yookan galmee yeroo duraatiif  yommuu olkeessu yookan yommu "akka olkaa'i" maqaa birootiin olkeessu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159217				0	om	Amaloota				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	par_id3155577				0	om	Qindaa'ina alergi yookan alaaguu faayilii keetii hiika. Yommuu alergitu, arfii qofatu qindaa'ee qurxiinsi keeyyataa qindaa'uu danda'a. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146959				0	om	Character set				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	par_id3143206				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_ASCII_FILTER:LB_CHARSET\"\>Qindaa'ina amala faayilii alergi yookan alaaguu ibsa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154926				0	om	Bocquuwwan durtii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	par_id3151262				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_ASCII_FILTER:LB_FONT\"\>Bocquu durtii qindeessuun, kan ati ifteessitu barruun mul'chuu kan qabu bocquu murtaa'e irratti qofa. Bocquun durtii filatamuu kan danda'uu yommuu alaaguu qofa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154894				0	om	Language				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	par_id3153323				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_ASCII_FILTER:LB_LANGUAGE\"\>Afaan barruu ibsuun, yoo kun duraan dursee ibsamuu baate. Qindaa'inni kun kan jiraatu yommuu alaaguu qofa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
