helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	par_id3143281				0	om	Akaakuu keeyyata qurxiinsa sarara barruuf qindeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150935				0	om	CR & LF				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	par_id3145829				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_ASCII_FILTER:RB_CRLF\"\>Akka qurxii keeyyataatti "Carriage Return" fi "Linefeed" oomisha. Dirqalli kun durtii dha.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
