helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000011.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Ajajoota Baafataa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000011.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156045				0	om	Ajajoota Baafataa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000011.xhp	0	help	par_id3150838				0	om	Foddaan galmee of keessatti qabate ati irratti hojjechuu barbaaddu akka ajajoota baafataa fayyadamuuf filatamuu qaba. Haaluma walfakkatuun, ajajoota baafataa wanta waliin firooman fayyadamuuf wanta galmee keessaa filachuu qabda.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000011.xhp	0	help	par_id3156027				0	om	Baafatawwan rifachisaa halqalaati. Kana jechuun maalimootni baafataa kun hojii amma hojjetamaa jiruuf faayidaa qabeessa ta'anii jiraatu. Yoo qareen barruu keessatti iddeeffame, maalimootni baafataa barruu gulaaluuf fayyadan hundi ni jiraatu. Yoo galmee keessaa saxaatoo filatteetta ta'e, maalimoota baafataa saxaatoo gulaaluuf fayyadan hunda agarta.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Jibsoo Waliigalaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154896				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>jechoota waliinii;jibsoowwan\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>jibsoowwan;jechoota waliinii\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>jecha;jibsoo waliigalaa\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154896				0	om	\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp\" name=\"General Glossary\"\>Jibsoo Waliigalaa\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3154788				0	om	Jibsoon kun ibsoota jechoota baay'ee barbaachisoo $[officename] keessatti si mudatan qabata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3154873				0	om	Jechoota hin beekne $[officename] kamiyyuu keessatti agartu barbaaduuf jibsoo fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156192				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>ASCII; hiika\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156192				0	om	ASCII				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3155922				0	om	Gabaabbataa Lakkaddaa Durtii Ameerikaatiif Waljijjiirraa Odeeffannoof. ASCIIn tuuta arfii bocquulee koompiitara matayyaa irratti agarsiisuuf fayyada. Qubeewwan, lakkoosoota, ittisoo fi mallattoowwan dabalatee arfiilee 128 ofkeessatti qaba. Tuutni arfii dheertoo ASCII arfiilee 256 of keessatti qaba. Arfiin tokkoon tokkoo isaa lakkoofsa addaaf ramadama, lakkaddaa ASCII jedhamuun waamama. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3150823				0	om	Fuuloota HTML keessatti, arfiileen tuuta arfii biitii ASCII 7 irraa qofti mul'atu. Arfiileen biroon, kan akka qubeewwan Jarmanii, lakkaddaa fo'ameetin adda baafatamu. Dheertoo arfiilee lakkaddaa ASCII naquu dandeessa: gingilchaan alergii $[officename] jijjiirraa barbaachisu raawwata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151245				0	om	Wanta Bézier				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3154924				0	om	Herregduun Freench Pierre Bézier dhaan dagaagfame, qonyoon Bézier fayyadama saxaatoo gar lameen qonyoo herreegaan qindeeffame dha. Qonyoon kun qabxiiwwan afuuriin qindeeffama: qubannoo duraa fi qubannoo xumuraa, fi qabxiiwwan fo'aman lama. Wantootni Bézier qabxiiwwan kana hantuuteedhaan siiqsuun fooyyeeffamuu danda'u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146907				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>CTL;hiika\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>teessuma barruu xaxaa;hiika\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>tessuma barruu xaaxa, CTL ilaali\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146907				0	om	Teesumaa Barruu Xaxaa (CTL)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3156081				0	om	Afaanootni teessuma barruu xaxaa waliin garii yookaan hunda amaloota kana gadii qabaachuu danda'u:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3145116				0	om	Afaanichi arfiileen barreeffame yookaan glyphs kutaawwan hedduu kan of keessatti qaban				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3154630				0	om	Qixni barruu mirga irraa gara bitaatti dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3148677				0	om	Amma, $[officename]iin Hindi, Thai, Hebrew, fi Arabiffaa akka afaanoota CTLtti deeggara.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3151176				0	om	Enable CTL support using \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Languages\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_idN108F1				0	om	Baafata Halqaraa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147084				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>DDE; hiika\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147084				0	om	DDE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3145154				0	om	DDEn "Dynamic Data Exchange" dhaaf dhaabbata, innis dursee OLEti, "Object Linking and Embedding". DDE waliin, wantootni wabii faayilii keessan qornyatu, garuu hin ida'aman.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3154820				0	om	Geessituu DDE uumuuf adeemsa armaan gadii fayyadamuu dandeessa: wardii Calc irraa man'eewwan filadhu, gara gabatee muraatti gargalchi itti aansuudhaan gara wardii biraatti ce'uun qaaqa \<emph\>Gulaali - Bayeessa Maxxansi\</emph\> filadhu.Akka walqabsiistu DDEtti qabeentota saaguuf filannoo \<emph\>Walqabsiistu\</emph\> fili. Yommuu walqabsiistuu kakaastu, ma`een bal`inaa saagame faayilii maddaa  isaa irraa dubbisama. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150439				0	om	Takkaan fi Akkaataan Dhangeessuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3159254				0	om	Galmee haalataalee malee yoo dhangeessite, dhangeessuu "takkaan" jedhama. Barruu yookaan wantoota kan biroo, kan akka godayyaawwanii ykn gabateewwanii, amaloota adda addaa kallattiin takkaan fayyadamuun foyyeessuu jechuu dha. Dhangiin kun naannoo filatame qofaaf fayyada fi jijjiiramootni hundi qofaatti uumamuu qabu. Karaa biraatin, Haalataaleen barruu irratti kallachaan hin fayyadan, garuu foddaa Haalataalee fi Dhangeessuu irratti qindaa'un hojiirra oolu. Yeroo haalataa jijjirtutti bu'aa argattu keessaa tokko, kutaawwan galmee kan haalataan irratti ramadamu hundi al tokkoon fooyya'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3147287				0	om	Dhangeessuu kallachaa galmee kee keessaa furtuuwwan qaxxaamuraati \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+A itti aansitee \<emph\>Dhangii - Dhangeessuu Durtii\</emph\> filachuun haquu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155132				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>foddaa; hidhuu hiika\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hidhuu; hiika\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155132				0	om	Hidhuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638				0	om	\<variable id=\"andock1\"\>Some windows in $[officename], for example the Styles and Formatting window and the Navigator, are "dockable" windows. You can move these windows, re-size them or dock them to an edge. On each edge you can dock several windows on top of, or alongside each other; then, by moving the border lines, you can change the relative proportions of the windows.\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3147233				0	om	\<variable id=\"andock2\"\>To undock and re-dock, holding down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key, double-click a vacant area in the window. In the Styles and Formatting window, you can also double-click a gray part of the window next to the icons, while you hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key.\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155306				0	om	Hidhuu (OfDhoksi)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3155854				0	om	Qarqara foddaa kamirrattuu bakka foddaan biroo irratti hidhame jiru irratti akka foddaa agarsiiftu yookaan dhoksitu qabduu si gargaaru agarta.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3143274				0	om	Foddaa agarsiisuuf yoo qabduu qarqara foddaa jiru cuqaafte, hanga ati irra deebitee hujeekaan dhoksitutti fodichi kan mul'atu ta'ee tura (qabduu walfakkaataan).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3153093				0	om	Handaara foddichaa cuqaasuun yoo foddaa mul'ifte, qabduu osoo hin ta'iin, dalagaa \<emph\>OfDhooksi\</emph\> kakaaste jechuu dha. Dalagaan OfDhooksiin handaara foddaa cuqaasuun akka foddaa dhokate mul'istuuf si gargaara. Yeroo galmee keessa cuqaaftu, foddaan hidhame irra deebi'ee dhokata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	bm_id3163710				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>dhangeessuu; hiika\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163710				0	om	Dhangeessuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3163821				0	om	Dhangeessuun teessuma argaa barruu hujeessa jechaa yookaan sagantaa DTP ilaallata. Kun immoo dhangii waraqaa, handaarawwan waraqaa, bocquulee fi galtee bocquu, akkasumas galuumsaa fi iddoo of keessatti qabata. Barruu \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#Section7\"\>kallachaan yookaan Haalataalee\</link\> $[officename]iin kennaman waliin dhangeessuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156006				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>IME; hiika\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156006				0	om	IME				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3157874				0	om	IMEiin bakka Gulaalaa Mala Naqaa bakka bu'a. Sagantaa fayyadamaan arfii waaltawaa hin taane gabatee cuqoo durtii fayyadamuun arfiiwwan xaxaa akka galchuu fayyadaan.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151172				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>JDBC; hiika\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151172				0	om	JDBC				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3148386				0	om	API walidhinsa kuusdeetaa Jaavaa (JDBC) gara kuus deetaa %PRODUCTNAME fayyadamuu dandeessa. Ooftootni JDBC afaan saganteessa Jaavaatin barreeffamu fi hujeeffannoo irratti kan hin hundoofne dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151282				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>rukkina; hiika\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151282				0	om	Rukkina				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3146321				0	om	Rukkina jechuun mul'annoo walii galaa barruu foyyeessuuf hamma iddoo qubeewwan lama gidduu jiru dabaluu fi hir'isuu jechuu dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3146078				0	om	Gabateewwan rukkinaa odeeffannoo qubootni lama bakka dabalataa barbaadan of keessatti qabata. Gabateewwan kunniin waliigalatti qaama bocquu ti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150592				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>geessitoota; hiika\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150592				0	om	Geessituu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3150092				0	om	Ajajni \<emph\>Geessitootaa\</emph\> baafata\<emph\>Gulaaluu\</emph\> keessatti argama. Ajajni kun kan kaka'u yoo xiqqaate geessituun tokko galmee ammee keessatti haammatameera ta'e qofa. Yeroo fakkaattii saagdu, fakkeenyaaf, fakkaatti kallachaan yookaan akka geessituutti galmee keessa saaguu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3145730				0	om	Yeroo wanti kallachaan galmee keessatti saagamu, hammamtaan galmichaa (yoo xiqqaate) hamma baayitoota wantaan dabala. Galmicha ol kaa'uu akkasumas kompitara biroo irratti banuu dandeessa, fi wanti saagame galmee keessatti qubannoo duraanii irra tura.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3144765				0	om	Yoo wanta akka geessituutti saagde, wabiin maqaa faayilii qofti saagama. Hammamtaan galmee kan dabalu danda'u xurree fi faayilii wabiitin qofa. Haata'u malee, yoo galmee kee kompitara biroo irratti bante, faayiliin qornyate qubannoo walfakkaatu irratti akkaataa wabiin kennametti wanta galmee keessatti ilaaluuf fayyada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3153334				0	om	Faayilii isa kamtu akka geessituutti saagame baruuf \<emph\>Gulaali - Geessitoota\</emph\> fayyadami. Yoo barbaachisaa ta'e geessitootni kun haqamuu danda'u. Kuni geessituu kuta akkasumas wanta kallachaan saaga.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154512				0	om	Sirna Lakkoofsootaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3157846				0	om	Sirni lakkoofsootaa baay'ina arfiilee lakkoofsa bakka buusuuf jiran irratti hundaa'a. Lakkoofsi kurnyee, fakkeenyaaf lakkoofsoota kudhan irratti hundaa'a (0..9), sirni lamee ammoo lakkofsoota lama irratti hundaa'a 0 fi 1, Kudha ja'een arfiilee 16 irratti hundaa'a (0...9 fi A...F).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156358				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>wantoota; hiika\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156358				0	om	Wanta				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3144748				0	om	Wanti maalimaa argii deetaa of keessatti qabate dha. Deetaa fayyadamaa kan akka barruu yookaan saxaatoo ilaalachuu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3153839				0	om	Wantootni of danda'oo dha akkasumas tokko tokkorratti dhiibbaa hin geesisan. Wanti kamiyyuu deetaa of keessatti qabu ajajoota gariiniif ramadamuu danda'u. Fakkeenyaaf, wanti saxaatoo ajajoota calaqqee gulaaluu fi ajajoota herreegaa wardii of keessaa qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152827				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>ODBC; hiika\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152827				0	om	ODBC				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3153530				0	om	Walqabinsi kuusdeetaa banaa (ODBC) aaloo fayyadamootni sirnoota kuusdeetaa bira gahaniif gargaaru dha. Afaan gaaffii fayyadu Afaan Gaaffii Caasawaa (SQL)ti. $[officename] keessatti, tokko tokkoo kuusdeetaawwaniif akka ajajoota SQLii kaasuu barbaaddu adda baasi. Filannoon biraa ammoo, gaaffii kee cuqaasa hantuuteedhaan qindeessuuf akkasumas gara SQL tti $[officename] ofumaan hiikame qabu fayyadamuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3153956				0	om	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\>Faankishinootni ODBC biitii 32 asitti barbaadaman gargaarsa sagantaa qindaa'inaa kuus deetaa keetin kenname waliin sirna kee irratti yeroo barbaadametti ijaaramuu danda'u. Amaloota karaa qaama to'annaatin foyyeessuu dandeessa. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154479				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>OLE; hiika\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154479				0	om	OLE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3157840				0	om	Wanta Geessuu fi Idaatuu (OLE) wantootni gara galmee galteetti ykn galfamuu danda'u. Idaatiin gargalcha wantaa fi bal'ina sagantaa hundee galtee galmee keessa saaga. Yoo wanta gulaaluu barbaadde, wanta irratti lama cuqaasuun sagantaa hundee kaasuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154507				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>BaniGL; hiika\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154507				0	om	OopinGL				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3146879				0	om	OpiinGLiin afaan saxaatoo 3-D bakka bu'a, kan jaqaba SGI (Silicon Graphics Inc) dhaan dagaagfame. Loqodootni afaan kanaa lama beekamoo dha: Maaykiroosooft opiinGL, kan fayyadama foddaawwan NT dhaaf dagaage, fi Koosmoo OpiinGL kan SGI dhaan uumame. Inni lammataa afaan saxaatoo of danda'aa hujeeffannoo hundaaf fi gosa kompitaraa hundaaf, maashinoota saxaatoo jajjabee 3-D hin qabne irrattis kan fayyadu, bakka bu'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155764				0	om	PNG				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3148993				0	om	Cimdaa Saxaatoo Harkee (PNG) dhangii faayilii saxaatooti. Faayilootni baay'ataa cafaqaa filatamaa ta'een cafaqamu, akkasumas, faallaa dhangii JPG dhaan, yeroo hunda faayilootni PNG osoo odeeffannoon hin hir'atiin cafaqamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3083286				0	om	Furtuu dursaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3150323				0	om	Furtuun dursaa akka adda baasaa addaa iddoowwan kuusdeetaatti tajaajila. Adda bahuun addaa iddoowwan kuus deetaa \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#relational\"\>kuusdeetaa firoomaa\</link\> keessatti, gabateewwan biroo keessatti deetaa bira gahuuf fayyada. Gabatee biraa irraa furtuu dursaaf wabiin uumame, furtuu alaa jedhamuun waamama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3148916				0	om	Yoo $[officename] keessatti, ajaja barbaachisaa irraantoo tarree baaafata halqaraa  keessaa filachuun iddoo filatameef, argii saxaxaa gabatee keessatti furtuu dursaa qindeessita.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147359				0	om	KuusDeetaa Firoomaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3147585	101			0	om	Kuus deetaan firoomaa walitti qabama deetoota karaa seera qabeessaan gabatee keessatti qindaa'anii kan deetaan irraatii bira gahamuu danda'u ykn osoo gabateewwan kuus deetaa irraa fudhatamu hin gaafatiin karaa adda addaa walitti qabamuu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3154255				0	om	Sirni bulchiinsa kuusdeetaa firoomaa (RDBMS) sagantaa akka ati kuusdeetaa firoomaa kee uumtu, haaroomsitu, fi bulchitu si dandeessisa. RDBMSiin himoota Afaan Gaaffii Caaseeffame (SQL) kan fayyadamaadhaan galfaman fudhata yookaan kan fayyadama sagantaa fi uumamtoota, hareeffamtoota, yookaan akka gara kuusdeetaa bira gaessu si dandeessisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3147535				0	om	Fakkeenyi gaarii kuusdeetaa firoomaa kuusdeetaa Maamila, Bittaa, fi gabateewwan kaffaltii waliin kennamuu danda'a. Gabatee kaffaltii keessatti, maamilli yookiin deetaa bittaa dhugaa ta'e hin jiru; garuu, gabatichi wabbiiwwan karaa geessaa firoomii yookaan firoomaa, gara maamila barbaachisutii fi gabateewwan bittaa (fakkeenyaaf, dirree ID maamilaa gabatee maamilaa irraa) of keessatti qabata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147315				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>fayyadamaa-galmaa'e; hiika\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147315				0	om	Galmeessa-dhugaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3154223				0	om	Galmeessi-dhugaa jechuun jecha topogiraafii yommuu ta'u kan maxxansaaf fayyaduudha. Jechi kun kan ibsu rogitaa sarara maxxansaa akaakuu bali'ina kan gara fuulduraa fi duuba moggaa fuula kitaabaa, fuula gaazexaa fi fuula barruuleeti. Galmeessi-dhugaa fuula kana haala salphaan akka dubbifamu amala dabalataa qaba innis fajajaa gaaddidduu akka hin balaqeessifne gidduu sarara barruu ittisa. Kana malees,galmeessi dhugaa barruu sararoota wal-cinaa tarjaa kan dheerina walqixa qaban agarsiisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3145230				0	om	Yommuu keeyyata qindeessitu, Akkataa Keeyyataa yookan akkaata fuula akka galmeessa dhugaatti, bu'uurri sararaa arfii miidhamee tarsaa fuula sarjaatti hiriirsii akka hamamtaa bocquuti yookan jirachuu saxaatooti. Yoo babaadde, qindaa'ina tarsaa kanaaf ibsuu dandeessa akkataa amala fuula ti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156710				0	om	RTF				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3151186				0	om	Dhangii Barruu Badhaadhaa (RTF) dhangii faayilii jijjiirraa faayilii barrutiif gaamarameedha. Amalli adda isaa dhangiin kallatiidhaan gara barruu odeeffannoo dubbifamuutti jijjiirama. Akka tasaa ta'ee, dhangii cafaqoo faayilii birooti, kun yoo walbira qabame faayilii guddaa uuma.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156372				0	om	Olkaa'insa Sadhatawaa fi Ofdanda'aa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3146919				0	om	Qaaqa hedduu keessatti (fakkeenyaaf, \<emph\>Gulaalli - BarruuUfmaa\</emph\>) filachuu dandeessa yoo faayilii sadhatawaan yookan ofdana'aan olkaa'uu barbaadde.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3152946				0	om	Yoo sadhatawaan olkaa'uu barbaadde, wabiin saaxatootti ida'amaa yookan wanta biraa galmee kee keessatti sadhatawa sirna argamsa faayiliitiin olkaa'ama. Haala kanaan, iddoo wabiin caasaa galeeloo itti kuufamu rakkoo hin qabu. Faayiliin akkataa iddootiin argama, haaluma wabiin ofaa yookan qabee tokko keessatti hafu. Kun barbaachisaa dha yoo galmee komputara birootiif jiraachifte kan walumaagalatti caasaa galeeloo garaagaraa irratti ofaa yookan maqaa qabee ta'eedha. Karaa birootiin kan gorfamu immoo olkaa'ina sadhatawaa yoo caasaa galeeloo Interneetii kaadhima irratti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3148927				0	om	Yoo olkaa'a ofdanda'a filatte, ooftuu dhuufaa, qabeentaa ykn galeeloo hundee irratti hundaa'uun wabiiwwan faayiloota biroo hundi akka of danda'aatti qindeeffamu. Bu'aan kanaa galmeen wabiiwwan of keessatti qabate gara galeeloowwan yookaan ukaankaalee siqfamuu danda'a akkasumas faayidaa qabeessa ta'ee tura.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149922				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>SQL; hiika\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149922				0	om	SQL				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3152863				0	om	Afaan Gaaffii Caaseffame (SQL) afaan gaafatawwan kuusdeetaa fayyadu dha. $[officename] keessatti SQL yookaan hantuutee fayyadamuun gaafatawwan foormueessuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147552				0	om	Kuusdeetaa SQL / Kaadimaa SQL				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3159239				0	om	Kuusdeetaan SQL sirna kuusdeetaa walqunama \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#sql\"\>SQL\</link\> filatu dha. Kuusdeetootni SQLii cimdaa maamila/kaadimaa kan maamiltootni hedduu kaadimaa gidduu bira gahan keessatti tajaajilu (fakkeenyaaf, kaadimaa SQL), kuusdeetoota kaadimaa SQL jedhamuun waamamu, yookaan gabaabaatti kaadimoota SQL jedhamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3159118				0	om	$[officename] keessatti, kuusdeetoota SQL alaantoo walitti fidu dandeessa. Kun ammoo tari baxxee jabaa qe'ee akkasumas cimdaa irratti iddeeffamuu danda'a. Bira gahuun karaa \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#odbc\"\>ODBC\</link\>, yookaan ooftuu qee'e gara $[officename]tti dabalameen milkaa'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166423				0	om	Hiikamtootaa fi Darbamtoota				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3149448				0	om	Hiikamtootaa fi Darbamtootni jechoota bocquu seenaati, isaanis waggoota hedduuf hojiirra olaa turani. Hiikamaan sarara gabaabaa dhuma keewwataa irra jiru ibsa, kunis yeroo maxxanfamu, gubbaa fuula itti aanu irratti mul'ata. Darbamaan, faallaa isaatin, sarara jalqabaa keewwataa miljala fuula darbee irratti qofaan maxxanu dha. Galmee barruu $[officename] keessatti wanti akkasii haalataa keewwataa barbaadame irratti akka hin mul'anne ofumaan dhorka. Yeroo kana dalagu, hamma sararoota gadee fuulicha irratti qabataman murteessuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Dhangiiwwan Faayilii XML				20200411 15:09:53
