helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id0514200811525591				0	om	In current versions, you can select to save your documents using ODF 1.2 (default) or ODF 1.0/1.1 (for backward compatibility). Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Options - Load/Save - General\</item\> and select the ODF format version.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E9				0	om	Yoo galmeewwan itti fayyadamtoota waliin hanga gargaaramuu OpenOffice.org 1 or StarOffice 7 waljijjiiruu barbaade, galmee maqaa gingilchaa duraa duubaan sanduuqa tarree \<emph\>Akaakuu faayilii\</emph\> keessa olkaa`i.s				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3146907				0	om	If you want to define another file format as the default, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010200.xhp\" name=\"Load/Save - General\"\>Load/Save - General\</link\>\</emph\> to find alternative file formats for each $[officename] document type.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150398				0	om	Caasaa faayilii XML				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3149649				0	om	Galmeewwan dhangii faayilii GalmeeBani keessatti akka furtuu wallitti qabamee faayilii XML ofkeessatti qabatuu olkaa`amu. Faayiloota XML kana ilaaluuf, faayilii GalmeeBani sagantaa hin qolofamneen banuu dandeessa. Faayilootnii fi galeelota kanneen armaan gadii Faayiloota GalmeeBani kassatti qabamu:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3153178				0	om	Qabeentoon barruu galmee \<emph\>content.xml\</emph\> keessatti argama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3154068				0	om	By default, \<emph\>content.xml\</emph\> is stored without formatting elements like indentation or line breaks to minimize the time for saving and opening the document. On the \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Load/Save - General\</emph\> tab page you can activate the use of indentations and line breaks by clearing the check box \<emph\>Size optimization for ODF format\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3145152				0	om	Faayileen \<emph\>meta.xml\</emph\> galmee odeeffannoo meetaa qabaatu, Kan \<emph\>Faayilii - Amaloota\</emph\> jalatti saaguu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3150740	33			0	om	Yoo galmee iggita wajjin olkeesse, \<emph\>meta.xml\</emph\> hin hicciteeffamne.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3150391				0	om	Faayiliin \<emph\>settings.xml\</emph\>odeeffannoo baay'ee waa'ee qindaa'inaa galmeef qabaata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447	35			0	om	\<emph\>styles.xml,\</emph\> keessatti akkaataawwan galmee kan foddaa akkaataawwanii fi dhangeessisuu ilaalamuu danda'an fayyadu argachuu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3153353	36			0	om	Faayiliin \<emph\>meta-inf/manifest.xml\</emph\> caasaa faayilii XML ibsa. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3153368				0	om	Faayiloonni fi ukaankonni dabalataa dhangii faayilii qarqaba keeessatti qabamuu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154299				0	om	Qindaa'ina dhangiiwwan XML				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AAD				0	om	Squariin dhangilee GalmeeBanuu iddoo saphaphuu \<link href=\"http://www.oasis-open.org\"\>www.oasis-open.org\</link\> irratti argamuu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3149561				0	om	Faayiloonni Ibsa Akaakuu Galmee (DTP) dhangilee duraanitiif ukaankaa ijaarsaa keessatti argamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3152596				0	om	Yaadachiisa dhangileen hayyamoota murtaa'eef dhimma. Yaadannoo hayyamoota jalqaba faayiloota DTD irratti argachuu dandeessa. Odeeffannoo baay'ee gadfageenyan iddoo saphaphuu \<link href=\"https://www.openoffice.org\" name=\"Apache OpenOffice\"\> \</link\>irratti argamuu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
