helpcontent2	source\text\shared\07\09000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143284				0	om	Meeshaan warrii fuuloota saphaphuu haaraa uumanii, haalata teessuma saphaphuu isa ati \<emph\>Mul'annoo - Teessuma Saphaphuu\</emph\> waliin dandeessisteedha.				20200411 15:09:53
