helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150275				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_PUBLISHING:PAGE2_CHG_DEFAULT\"\>Darbiinsi islaayidii yeroo tokko tokkoo islaayidiif dhiheessa keessatti qindeessite irratti hundaa'a. Yoo darbiinsa fuula hujeekaa qindeessite, dhiheessi HTML fuula haaraa furtuu kamuu saddeeqa qubee kee irraa dhiibuun beeksisa.\</ahelp\> 				20200411 15:09:53
