helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150486				0	om	Odeeffannoo dabalataa Alergii Tamsa'inasaphaphuu irraatti				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152578				0	om	Teeknoolojii Tamsa'inasaphaphuu fayyadamuun dhiheessa $[officename] Impireessi: Active Server Pages (ASP) fi Peerlii alerguuf filannoo lamatu danda'ama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153364				0	om	Kamiiyyuu keessatti, Tamsa'innisaphaphuu parlii ykn ASPii akka barruutti dhibaasuuf kaadima HTTP barbaada. Kanaafuu, filannoon alerguu kaadima HTTP fayyade irratti hundaa'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151112				0	om	Tamsa'inasaphaphuu ASP keessaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159197				0	om	Alerguu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	om	ASPiitti alerguuf, galmeen $[officename] Impireessi keessatti \<emph\>Faayelii - Alergii\</emph\>filata. Qaaqa \<emph\>Alergii\</emph\>laali kan \<emph\>galmee HTML\</emph\> akka akaakuu faayeliitti filatte. Yeroo tokko galeeloo erga filattee fi maqaa faayelii galchite, \<emph\>Kaa'uu\</emph\> cuqaasi. ALerguuf akka ASPtti, maqaa faayelii "secret" faayelii HTMLiif filamef yaada kennina(odeeffannoo dabalataaf kan kanaa gadii ilaali). Achiin qaaqa \<emph\>Alerguu HTML\</emph\> ilaali. Faayeloonni baay'een galeeloof barreeffaman kan duraan filattee dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149410				0	om	Islaayidii dhaggeeffatootaan mul'atan gidduu jijjiiruuf dhiheessaan maqaa faayelii gale fayyadama. Faayelii tamsa'inasaphaphuu qe'ee olkaa'uu dandeessa ykn kallattin kaadima HTTPirra olkaa'i. Booda faayelii qe'ee olkaa'ame gara kaadima HTTP tti FTP'n dabarsuu dandeessa. Beekuu kan qabdu Tamsa`iniSaphaphuu kan hojiirra oolu faayilootni HTTP severii irraa barbaachisani qofa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3157974				0	om	Alergoota HTMLii adda addaa lamaaf galeeloo walfakkaataa hin fayyadamini.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153157				0	om	\<emph\>Tamsa'inaSaphaphu\</emph\> fili akka akaakuu maxxansa fuula lammaffaa Masaka Alergii HTML irrattii.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154790				0	om	Naannoo filannoo tamsa'inasaphaphuu keessatti, filannoo\<emph\>Fuulota Kaadima Ka'aa(FKK)\</emph\>fili. Qindaa'inoota biroo itti fuftee qindeessuu dandeessa ykn alergii qabduu \<emph\>Create\</emph\>cuqaasuun jalqabi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153281				0	om	Tamsa'inasaphaphuu ASP fayyadamuun				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149910				0	om	Akkuma faayeloonni alergeen kaadima HTTP irraa gaheen Tamsa'inasaphaphuu fayyadamuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154503				0	om	\<emph\>Fakkeenya\</emph\>:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152375				0	om	Kompitara kee irratti kaadima odeeffannoo intarneetii maykirosoftii ijaarte jennee haayaadnu. Galeeloo "c:\\Inet\\wwwroot\\presentation" akka galeeloo bahaa HTMLiitti galchite yeroo qindeessa IIS. URL kompitara kee akka "http://myserver.com"tti yaadame.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150715				0	om	Faayelii yeroo demicha alergii uumame galeeloo c:\\Inet\\wwwroot\\presentation\\ keessa olkeessa. Galeeloo kana keessatti, alergiin faayelii HTML moggaafame uuma, fakkeenyaaf akka "secret.htm". Maqaa kana qaaqa olkaa'ame keessa galchite(armaan olii laali). Dhiheessaa faayelii alergii HTMLtiif http://myserver.com/presentation/secret.htm URL galchuudhaan gargaarsa JavaScript iyyaafataa HTTP qabu kamuu keessatti sakatta'uu danda'a. Dheheessaan amma too'annaa tokko tokkoon fayyadamuun fuula haaromsuu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3159110				0	om	Dhaggeeffattoonni islaayidii dhiheessaan filatame URL http://myserver.com/presentation/webcast.asp. keessan ilaalu. Hanga maqaan faayelii hin beekamnetti, islaayidii URLitti argamutti siquu hin danda'an. Mee kaadimni HTTP caqasa galeeloo akka hin mul'isne dhugoomsi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153732				0	om	Parlii garmale Tamsa'inaSaphaphu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152999				0	om	Alerguu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3146972				0	om	Aleguuf, galmee $[officename] Impireessi keessatti \<emph\>Faayelii- Alergii\</emph\> fili. Kun qaaqa \<emph\>Alergii\</emph\> bana, kan \<emph\>Galmee HTML\</emph\> akka akaakuu faayeliitti filatte. Erga ukaankaa filattee fi maqaa faayelii galchitee booda, \<emph\>Olkaa'i\</emph\> cuqaasi. Kun \<emph\>Masakaa Alergii HTML\</emph\> bana. Kun faayeloota tokko tokkoo ukaankaa filattetti barreessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156362				0	om	Dhiheessaan islaayidii keessa geeddaruuf maqaan faayelii galee fayyadama. Mee galeeloo duwwaa filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148432				0	om	Alergii HTMLii fuula lammaffaa keessatti, \<emph\>Tamsa'inasaphaphuu\</emph\> akka akaakuu maxxansaatti fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149018				0	om	Bakka dirqalaa keessatti LabsiiSaphaphuuf, \<emph\>Peerlii\</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154509				0	om	Saanduqa barruu \<emph\>URLii dhaggeeffatootaaf\</emph\> keessatti, maqaa faayelii galmee HTML kan dhaggeeffattootaan fayyadame galchi. \<emph\>URLii dhiheessaf\</emph\>keessatti, URLi galiiloo kan dhiheessaf fayyade galchi, \<emph\>URLi barruuwwaniif\</emph\>keessatti, galeeloo barruu CGIf galchi. Qindaa'ota fuulota armaan gadii masakichaa irratti dabaltee qindeessuu dandeessa ykn adeemsa alergii qabdoo \<emph\>Uumi\</emph\> cuqaasudhaan jalqabi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148996				0	om	Tamsa'inasaphaphuu parlii fayyadamuun				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3159268				0	om	Faayeloonni yeroo alergii uumaman dirqama amma parlii kaadima HTTP qindeessise keessatti qindaa'a. Kun ofumaan hin hojjatu sababiin isaa kaadimoonni HTTP adda addaa gargaarsa parlii akaakuu garaagara waan qabaniif. Dhawaatiin hordofamuu qabu kanatti aanee ibsama. Mee hujeeka kaadimaa kee ilaali ykn bulchaa saphqunnamtii kee gaafadhu akkamitti dhawaata kana kaadima kee irratti dalageessitu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147340				0	om	Jalqaba faayeloota yeroo alergii uumaman gara galeeloo sirrii kaadima HTTPirraatti siksuu qabda.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155936				0	om	Faayelii dheertowwan htm,jpg fi gif qaban hunda galeeloo kaadima HTTP kee kan saanduqa barruu \<emph\>URLii dhiheessaf\</emph\> keessatti ilaalametti siksi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151014				0	om	Faayeloonni hunduu p1 fi dheertowwan txt gara galeelootti siqe kaadima HTTP kee irratti qaban kan saanduqa barruu \<emph\>URLii barroota parliif\</emph\> keessatti ilaalamedha. Galeeloon kun haala barruu parlii achitti qabateen qindeeffameen itti dabalees fedha HTTPiidhaan ka'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151250				0	om	Sirna hiyyama UNIX irratti faayeliin dheerattoo P1 wajjin kaadima HTTP dhaan mirga rawwachuu qaba. Akka baratametti, kun ajaja chimoodii wajjin hojjata. Faayeliin currpic.txt dirqama akka kaadima HTTP dhaan barreeffamuu danda'utti qindeeffama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153534				0	om	Amma Tamsa'inaSaphaphuu fayyadamuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156711	66			0	om	\<emph\>Fakkeenya\</emph\>:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147313				0	om	Fakkeenya kana keessatti, kompitara linuuksii kaadima HTTP wajjin qabda. URLiin Kaadimaan HTML kee http://myserver.com fi galeeloo bahaan galmee HTMLi kee galeeloo //user/local/http/dha. Barruuwwan parlii kee galeeloo //user/local/http/cgi-bin/ keessatti qabamu. secret.htm akka maqaa faayelii alerguutti fi presentation.htm akka \<emph\>URLii dhaggeeffatootaaf\</emph\> galchi. Saanduqa barruu \<emph\>URLii dhiheessaf\</emph\> keessatti http://myserver.com/presentation/ galch. \<emph\>URLii barruuwwan parliif\</emph\> tiif http://myserver.com/cgi-bin/.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145792				0	om	Amma, faayeloota *.htm, *.jpg fi *.gif hunda galeeloota irraa kan yeroo alergii galeeloo//user/local/http/presentation/ kaadima HTTP kee irraa keessatti ifteeffame fi faayeloota dheertoo *.pl fi *.txt galeeloo //user/local/http/cgi-bin/ keessatti garagalcha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153920				0	om	Akka hundeetti kaadima kee irra seeni. Galeeloo //user/local/http/cgi-bin/ tti geeddaruudhaan ajaja chimoodii fayyadamuun walgita sirrii qindeessuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148479				0	om	Yeroo tokko faayeloota parlii ijaaruu yoo xumurte, dhiheessaan dheheessa kennuu danda'a. Dhaggeeffattoonni dhiheessa kan URL http://myserver.com/presentation/presentation.htm.jalatti laaluu danda'u.				20200411 15:09:53
