helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id2577593				0	om	Fayyadamaa A'n galmicha waan baneef galmichi fayyadamaa kan birootiin foyyefamee ol hin kaa'amne.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id5883968				0	om	Galmichi ol kaa'ameera.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id9049653				0	om	Fayyadamaa A'n galmicha waan baneef galmichi fayyadamaa kan birootiin foyyefamee ol kaa'ameera.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id1976683				0	om	Yoo jijjiiramoonni waldhabuu baatan, galmichi ol kaa'ama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id43946				0	om	Yoo jijjiiramoonni waldhaban, qaaqichi waldhabinsoota furu ni agarsiifama. Fayyadamaa A'n waldhabootaaf fooyya'aa isa kam "Kan koo Kaa'i" yookiin " Kan biroo Kaa'i" kaa'uu akka qabu murteessuu qaba. Yommuu waldhabinsootni hundi furaman, galmichi ol kaa'ama. Yommuu fayyadamaa A'n waldhabinsoota furu, galmicha hirmaannaa fayyadamaa biroon ol kaa'uu hin danda'u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id6449171				0	om	Fayyadamaa kan biroon galmicha hirmaannaa ol kaa'uuf yaala yeroo kana keessa waldhabinsoota fura.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id7101046				0	om	Fayyadamaa A'n dhaamsa kan keessa-makissi guddina keessa jira jedhu arga. Fayyadamaa A'n ammaaf ajajicha olkaa'uu dhiisuuf filachuu danda'a, yookiin yeroo muraasa booda olkaa'insa lamyaala.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id7186498				0	om	Yommuu fayyadamaan wardii hirmaannaa fiixa bahinsaan olkaa'u, ajaja olkaa'uu booda galmichi lamfe'amee, wardiichi jijjiiramoota hundaa dhiyoo fooyya'an kanneen fayyadamtoota hundaan ol kaa'aman agarsiisa. Yommuu fayyadamaa biroon qabiyyeewwan muraasa jijjiiru dhaamsi "jijjiiramtoonni alagaa ida'amaniiru" sana agarsiisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	hd_id2871791				0	om	Gamtoomina Barreessaa, Toleessaa, fi Fakkaasaa keessaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id2675862				0	om	Muraalee hundaaf Barreessaa, Toleessaa, Fakkaasaa fi Calc tiif yommuu hirmaannaan galmee hin dandeessifamne tahe, saamsuun faayilii ni danda'ama. Saamsuun faayilii kuni yommuu galmeema walfakkaatu opireetingi siistemii adda addaa irraa gaheenya taasisnu illee ni jira:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id7333597				0	om	Fayyadamaa A'n galmee bane. Haalotni armaan gadii hojiirra ooluu ni danda'u:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id9976195				0	om	Galmichi fayyadamaa biroo kaminiyyuu hin saamsamne.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id2507400				0	om	Fayyadamaa A tiin galmeen kun gahinsa dubbisuu fi barreessuuf ni banama. Hamma fayyadamaa A'n galmicha cufutti galmichi fayyadamtoota biroof ni saamsama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id216681				0	om	Galmichi sirna faayiliitiin akka "dubbisuu-qofa" tti milkataa'eera.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id7709585				0	om	Galmichi kuni haalata dubbisuu-qofa tiin ni banama. Gulaaluun hin eeyyamamu. Fayyadamaa A'n maqaa galmee biroo yookiin xurree biroo fayyadamuudhaan galmicha ol kaa'uu ni danda'a. Fayyadamaa A'n garagalcha kana gulaaluu ni danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id4309518				0	om	Galmichi fayyadamaa biroo tiin saamsameera.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id206610				0	om	Fayyadamaa A'n qaaqa galmichi saamsamuu isaa fayyadamichatti himu arga. Qaaqichi galmichi haalata dubbisuu-qofaan akka banamu, yookiin garagalcha gulaaluuf banuu, yookiin ajajicha banuu dhiisuuf kenna.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	hd_id29349651				0	om	User access permissions and sharing documents				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id11746571				0	om	Some conditions must be met on operating systems with a user permission management.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id25775931				0	om	The shared file needs to reside in a location which is accessible by all collaborators.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id90496531				0	om	The file permissions for both the document and the corresponding lock file need to be set so that all collaborators can create, delete, and change the files.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id71864981				0	om	Write access also enables other users to (accidentally or deliberately) delete or change a file.				20200411 15:09:53
