helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3153031				0	om	Fakkaattiin suurxiqqoo Barreessaa $[officename], Calc $[officename], Fakkaasaa $[officename] fi galmeewwan Toleessaa $[officename] keessa saagamuu ni danda'u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209				0	om	\<emph\>Saagi - Fakkii - Faayilii Irraa\</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3149236				0	om	Faayilicha fili. Sanduuqa \<emph\>Gosa faayilii\</emph\> keessa filannoo gara gosoota faayilii murtaa'aniitti daangessuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3153126				0	om	Yoo geessituu gara faayilii xabboo barbaadde \<emph\>Geessituu\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3154306				0	om	Yoo sanduuqni  \<emph\>Geessituu\</emph\> mallattaa'eera tahe, yeroo halle galmeen haaromsamu fi fe'amu fakkaattiin suurxiqqoo irra deebi'ee fe'ama. Ejjatoowwan gulaaluu kanneen ati garagalcha qe'ee fakkii galmicha keessatti adeemsifte irra deebiitiin fayyadamanii fakkaattichi ni agarsiifama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3147336				0	om	Yoo sanduuqni \<emph\>Geessituu\</emph\> hin mallatteeffamne tahe, ati yeroo hundumaa garagalcha yommuu saxaatoon yeroo jalqabaaf saagame uumameetiin hojjetta.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3153824				0	om	To embed graphics that were first inserted as links, go to \<emph\>Edit - Links\</emph\> and click the \<emph\>Break Link\</emph\> button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3151384				0	om	Fakkatticha saaguuf\<emph\>Bani\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147303				0	om	Suurxiqqoo Gulaaluu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	hd_id187078				0	om	Sajoowwan kabala Fakkii irraa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3148552				0	om	Yommuu fakkaattii suurxiqqoo filattu, kaballi \<emph\>Fakkii\</emph\> meeshaalee fakkaatticha gulaaluuf siif kenna. Yoo ati fakkaattii akka geessituutti saagdeyyuu, garagalchii qe'ee galmee keessaa qofti gulaalama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413				0	om	Kaballi \<emph\>Fakkii\</emph\> mojuulii ati fayyadamtu irratti hundaa'uun  garaagarummaa xiqqoo fakkaachuu ni danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3154124	13			0	om	Gingilchaan hedduun kamshaa \<link href=\"text/shared/02/24010000.xhp\" name=\"Graphic Filter\"\>Saxaatoo \<emph\>Gingilchaa\</emph\>\</link\> irratti argamu, kan ati sajoo kabala \<emph\>Fakkii\</emph\> irraatiin banuu dandeessu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id7055574				0	om	Faayiliin fakkii xabboo gingilchaatiin jijjiiramuu dhiisuu ni danda'a. Gingilchaan fakkii galmee keessaa qofaatiif fayyadu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3145273				0	om	Gingilchaan muraasni qaaqa, kan ati, fakkeenyaaf, jabina gingilchaa filachuuf itti fayyadamuu dandeessu, banu. Gingilchaa irra jireessi yeroo baay'ee galtee gingilchaa dabaluuf fayyadamuu ni danda'u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3150105				0	om	Fakkaasaa $[officename] fi Toleessaa $[officename] keessatti, barruu fi saxaatoo ida'uu , wantoota kana suurxiqqoo waliin filachuu, fi filannoo akka fakkaattii suurxiqqoo haaraatti alerguu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	hd_id2572405				0	om	Qaaqa Fakkii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id6457411				0	om	Fakkicha mirga cuqaasiiti qaaqa amalootaa banuuf baafata xiqqaa irraa \<emph\>Fakkii\</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id7991882				0	om	Amaloota fakkii filatamee jijjiiriitii, TOLE cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153574				0	om	Suurxiqqoo Olkaa'uu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576				0	om	Yoo dhangii kanneen akka GIF, JPEG yookiin TIFF tiin olkaa'uu barbaadde, fakkaattii suurxiqqoo filattee alerguu malta. Kuni Fakkaasaa fi Toleessaa keessatti qofa danda'ama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id0801200803544667				0	om	Draw ykn Impress keessatti suurxiqqoo alerguu:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3155414				0	om	Fakkaatti suurxiqqoo filadhu. Wantoota dabalataa kanneen akka barruu, fakkaatticha waliin alergaman osoo filachaa jirtuu yookiin goodayyaa filannoo naannoo wantoota hundaa banuutiin furtuu shift dhiibuudhaan filachuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3148618				0	om	\<emph\>Faayilii - Alergi\</emph\> fili. Qaaqni \<emph\>Alergi\</emph\> ni banama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3157139				0	om	Ajajni \<emph\>Alerguu\</emph\> fakkicha galteewwan gingilchaa fayyadaman hundaa waliin gara faayiliitti barreessa. Ajajni \<emph\>Fakkii Akka Olkaa'i\</emph\> baafata harqalaa keessaa galteewwan gingilchaa kamiyyuu malee fakkicha olkaa'a, yoo fakkichi akka fakkii geessituutti saagame. Fakkiin idaatii yeroo hundumaa gingilchaatti fayyadamee olkaa'ama yookiin alergama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3083443				0	om	Dirree \<emph\>Dhangii faayilii\</emph\> keessaa, dhangii faayilii barbaaddu filadhu, fakkeenyaaf GIF yookiin JPEG.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3152462				0	om	Yoo wantoota filataman qofa alerguu barbaadda tahe, sanduuqa \<emph\>Filannoo\</emph\> mallatteessi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3150874				0	om	Yoo \<emph\>Filannoo\</emph\> hin mallatteefne tahe, fuulli waamara galmichaa alergama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id3149417				0	om	Faayilichaaf maqaa galchiiti \<emph\>Alergi\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\insert_bitmap.xhp	0	help	par_id0801200803525078				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Suurxiqqoo Barreessaa irratti alerguuf: Suurxiqqoo Mirga-cuqaasi, Saxatoo Olkaawwii filadhu. Qaaqa Saxatoo alergii argita. Maqaa faayilii galchii akaakuu faayilii filadhu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
