helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152801				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>kamshaawwan;hidhuu/hiikuu\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>kamshaawwan;ilaaluu/cufuu\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cufuu;kamshaawwan\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hidhuu;kamshaawwan\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>kamshaawwan suphuu\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>kamshaawwan gadhisisuu\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>kamshaawwan teessisuu\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>qubachiisuu;kamshaawwan\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>siiqsuu;kamshaawwan\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>kamshaawwan milteessuu\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>kamshaawwan bololi'u\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>foddaawwan;hidhuu\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>ilaaluu;kamshaawwan\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>agarsiisuu;kamshaawwan\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>kabalawwan sajoo, kamshaawwan ilaali\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>kabalawwan qabduu, kamshaawwan ilaali\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152801				0	om	\<variable id=\"floating_toolbar\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/floating_toolbar.xhp\" name=\"Using Toolbars\"\>Kamshaawwan Fayyadamuu\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	om	Sajoowwan kamshaa muraasni, fakkeenyaaf sajoo \<emph\>Halluu Bocquu\</emph\>, kamshaa biroo banuu ni danda'a. Kamshaa sajoowwan dabalataa qabate banuuf xiyya sajoochatti aanee jiru cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id3155450	8			0	om	Amma filannoo qabda: sajoo kakaasuu barbaaddu cuqaasi, yookiin qabduu hantuutee gad qabdee osoo jirtuu kamshaa kabalaa matadureesaatiin qabiiti isa harkisi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	hd_id733970				0	om	Halqara Kamshaawwanii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id341196				0	om	Kamshaawwan muraasni halqara irratti hirkachuun ofumaa banamu. Fakkeenyaaf, yommuu keessa gabatee galmee barruu keessaa cuqaastu, kamshaan gabatee ni banama. Yommuu keessa keewwata lakkoofsamee cuqaastu kamshaan Rasaasaalee fi Lakkaawwii ni banama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	hd_id4224372				0	om	Kamshaa Yeroodhaaf Cufuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id295724				0	om	Sajoo kabala mataduree kamshaa cuqaasi, yookiin baafata halqaraa irraa \<emph\>Kamshaa Cufi\</emph\> fili. Yommuu halqarichi deebi'ee ka'u kamshaan ofumaan deebi'ee agarsiifama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	hd_id1905575				0	om	Kamshaa Turaalessaan Cufuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id9776909				0	om	While the toolbar is visible, choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars\</emph\> and click the name of the toolbar to remove the check mark.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077E				0	om	Kamshaa Cufame Agarsiisuuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_idN10785				0	om	\<emph\>Mul'annoo - Kamshaawwan\</emph\> filiitii maqaa kamshichaa cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id7296975				0	om	Kamshaawwan gara amala suukanaa halqaraa durtii isaanitti haaromsuuf \<emph\>Mul'annoo - Kamshaawwan - Haaromsuu\</emph\> fili. Amma kamshaawwan muraasni halqara irratti hirkatan ofumaan agarsiifamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E9				0	om	Kamshaa Kamshaa Bololi'aa Gochuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EF				0	om	Qabannoo bakka jalqaba kamshichaa cuqaasiiti, kamshicha garakeessa galmichaatti harkisi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F2				0	om	Kamshaa Bololi'aa Deebisanii qabsiisuuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F7				0	om	Kabala mataduree kamshaa gara qarqara foddaa galmeetti harkisi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id6154362				0	om	Foddaa bololi'aa deebistee qabsiisuuf, kabala mataduree foddichaa gara qarqara foddaa galmeetti harkisiiti kaa'i. Yommuu qabduu hantuutee gadlakkiftu akeektuun hantuutee qarqara foddaa galmeetti baay'isee dhiyaachuu qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id1510055				0	om	Qindaa'inoota taaligaa foddaa sirnaakee irratti hirkachuun, furtuu \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> gad qabdee osoo jirtuu bakka duwwaa kamshaa yookiin foddaa irraa lama cuqaasuu ni dandeessa. Yookiin kabala mataduree kamshaa bololi'aa yookiin foddaa lama cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_idN107AC				0	om	Kamshaawwanii fi foddaawwan harkisanii kaa'uudhaan hidhuun qindaa'inoota taaligaa foddaa sirnaakee irratti hirkatu. Yommuu foddaa siiqsitu qabiyyeewwan foddaa guutummaatti agarsiisuuf sirnaakee dandeessisuu qabda, goodayyaa aloo qofa agarsiisuurra.				20200411 15:09:53
