helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	om	Adeemsa armaan gadii fayyadamuun galmee dhangii kan birootiin olkaa'ame banuu ni dandeessa:				20200411 15:09:53
