helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id3159399				0	om	If you always want the file dialogs to show another format by default, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Load/Save - General\</emph\> and select that format as \<emph\>Default file format\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154898				0	om	Galmeewwan ukaankaa hunda jijjiiruu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id3147336				0	om	Masaka, kan karaa dalagaa galmeewwan hunda Maykirosoft Woordii,ekseelii Maykirosoft yookiin Maykirosoft paawor poo'eentii irraa garakeessa galmeewwan dhangii faayilii GalmeeBanaatti garagalchuu fi jijjiiru si qajeelchu, bani. Galeeloo maddaa fi galtee filachuu, galmeewwan fi/yookiin qajoojilee jijjiiruufi jijjiiruu dhiisuu, fi kan caalaa dabalataan ifteessuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
