helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\standard_template.xhp	0	help	par_id3154365				0	om	Jalqaba, qajojii $[officename] kan duraan ture baniiti fooyyessi, ykn qajojii barbaadamu uumuuf galmee haaraa baniiti akka barbaachisummaa isaatti gulaali.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\standard_template.xhp	0	help	par_id3159152				0	om	Haalta $[officename] tokkoon tokkoof qajojii galmee qindeessuu ni dandeessa. Kan kanatti aanee jiru galmeewwan barruuf akkamitti akka hojjetamu ibsa.				20200411 15:09:53
