helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\standard_template.xhp	0	help	par_id3156276				0	om	Qajojii barruu fooyyessame gara qajojii durtii xabbootti haaromsuuf:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\standard_template.xhp	0	help	par_id3146792				0	om	\<emph\>Faayilii - Qajojiilee - Qindeessi\</emph\> filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\standard_template.xhp	0	help	par_id3153714				0	om	Baafata halqaraa baniiti, \<emph\>Qajojiilee durtii haaromsi\</emph\> filadhu. Baafata xiqqaa keessaa, akkaakuu galmee qindaa'inni durtii isaa haaromsuu barbaaddu fili. Sanaa booda, yoo galmee barruu duwwaa bantu, qajojii durtii $[officename] kan galmeewwan barruu waliin walgita.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\standard_template.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153764				0	om	Qajojiilee Maamiloo Fayyadamuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\standard_template.xhp	0	help	par_id3150386	14			0	om	Qajojiilee maamiloo kan mataakee fayyadamuun hojiike kan sii salphisan toftaaleen hedduun jiru. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\standard_template.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149109				0	om	Qajojiilee Ukaankaa Qajojii keessaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\standard_template.xhp	0	help	par_id3146918				0	om	You can save a new template with \<emph\>File - Templates - Save\</emph\> or by selecting "Template" file type in any Save dialog. Save the template in the user directory specified under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Paths\</emph\> to be able to access the template from within the \<emph\>File - New - From Templates and Documents\</emph\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\standard_template.xhp	0	help	par_id3155960				0	om	Mul'annoo qajojiilee kan qaaqa keessaa haromsuun si barbaachisuu danda'a, qajojii haaraa uumame utuu hin argiin dura. Yeeroo kana, qabduu \<emph\>Faayilii - Qajojiilee - Qindeessi\</emph\> filadhuti baafata xiqqaa qabduu \<emph\>Ajajawwan\</emph\> keessaa, \<emph\>Haaromsi\</emph\> filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\standard_template.xhp	0	help	par_id3147343				0	om	Qajojii gulaaluudhaaf banuuf, \<emph\>Faayilii - Qajojiilee - Gulaali\</emph\> fildhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\standard_template.xhp	0	help	par_id3147315				0	om	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01110000.xhp\" name=\"Templates\"\>Qajojiilee\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
