helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147399				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>gahenya; $[officename] deggarsaa teknoolojii\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>deggarsaa teknoolojii kessaa $[officename]\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>dubbistuu argii\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>guddeessaa argii\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>guddessaa\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147399				0	om	\<variable id=\"assistive\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/assistive.xhp\" name=\"Assistive Tools in $[officename]\"\>Meeshaalee deggarsaa keessaa  $[officename]\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	om	$[officename] meeshaalee gargaarsaa teeknooloojii kanneen mosajjii guddiftuu, dubbiftoota argii fi furtuuwwan gabatee irraa-argii fakkaatan deeggaru. Harki caalaan meeshaalee kanaa $[officename] waliin mala mosajjii riqicha gahinsa  Java(TM) isa gaheenya Java API fayyadamuun, kutaa qeeyyaa Java yeroo ka'uumsatiin walquunnamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id8847010				0	om	Gargaarsi meeshaa gargaaraa tarree ammee OpenOffice.org Wiki at \<link href=\"https://wiki.openoffice.org/wiki/Accessibility\"\>Apache OpenOffice Wiki\</link\> irratti argama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145345				0	om	$[officename] keessaatti meeshaalee gargaarsaa fayyadamuuf kan barbaachisan				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209				0	om	Qeeyyaa Jaavaa Yeroo ka'uumsaa(JRE) fooyya'aa 1.4.1_01 fi isaa ol , yookiin fooyya'aa 1.4.0_02 gitoo biyyaa "en_us" waliin kurfaa'e.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797				0	om	Meeshaa gargaarsakeef mosajjii baay'ee reefu fooyya'e				20200411 15:09:53
