helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id3149762				0	om	Sirna UNIX(R)irratti, qeeyyaa minjaalaa  GNOME 2 mosajjii Riqicha Gahinsa Jaavaa waliin  GNOME tiif				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149795				0	om	Meeshaalee Gargaarsaa Deeggaraman				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419				0	om	Sirna Foddaawwanii irratti, $[officename] mosajjii gabatee furtuu irra-argii harka caalaan sududaan deeggara. Deeggarsi dabalataa meeshaalee gargaarsaaf mosajjii Riqicha Gahinsa Jaavaa tiin laatama. Kan armaan gadii tarree meeshaalee gargaarsaa $[officename]tiin deetaa jijjiirraaf kanneen mosajjii Riqicha Gahinsa Jaavaa fayyadaminidha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id3156329				0	om	Guddeessaa Argii GuddisBarruu ( fooyyee 7.11 yookiin isaa ol) (Foddaawwan)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id3155628				0	om	Dubbistuu Argii fi Guddeessaa Gnopernicus, walquunnama laattuu tajaajila teeknoolojii gargaarsaa(at-spi) fayyadamuu fi moosajjii API Gaheenyaa Jaavaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id3148474				0	om	GNOME Gabatee Furtuu Argii irraa (GOK), GNOME at-spi fayyadamuunii fi moosajjii API Gaheenyaa Jaavaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153061				0	om	Mi'oota Naqaa Deeggaraman				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id3156024				0	om	$[officename] gahinsa  hojiiwwanii $[officename] hundaaf  mi'aawwan naqaa filmaataa dandeettii fayyadamuu laata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id3149045				0	om	Mosajjiin guddeessaa argii fayyadamtoota argoo xiqqaa $[officename]keessatti arfii hoxxee fi faana dhahuu xiyyeefannootiin akka hojjetaniif heyyama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id3152811				0	om	Gabateewwan furtuu irra-argii fayyadamtoonni gara caalaa  naqa deetaa hunda fi ajajoota hantuuteetiin akka hojjetan dandeessisa. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id3153379				0	om	Dubbistoonni argii fayyadamtoonni agartuu miidhamoo barruu gara haasaa fi agarsiisota barruu jaamaa akka $[officename] gahinsa godhan heyyama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\assistive.xhp	0	help	par_id3149808				0	om	Yommuu deeggarsi gaheenyaa $[officename] keessaa dandeessifamu, qeeyyaan Jaavaa Runtime ni fe'ama, fi yeroo itti jalqabaa $[officename]tiif ni dabala.				20200411 15:09:53
