helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Saxaxa Gabatee				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155448				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>kuusaawwan deetaa gabateewwan keessaa; mul'annoo saxaxatiin uumuu\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>saxaxuu; gabateewwan kuusdeetaa\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>amaloota ;dirreewwan kuusaawwan deetaa keessaa\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>dirreewwan;gabateewwan kuusdeetaa\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>GateessaaUfnaa (Bu'uura)\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>furtuu dursaa;saxaxa mul'anno\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149798				0	om	\<variable id=\"data_tabledefine\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/data_tabledefine.xhp\" name=\"Table Design\"\>Saxaxa Gabatee\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535				0	om	Kutaan kun odeeffannoo waa'ee akkaataa itti gabatee kuusdeetaa haaraa \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/05010000.xhp\" name=\"design view\"\>mul'annoo saxaxaa\</link\> keessatti uumuu of keessaa qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3154288				0	om	Faayilicha kuusdeetaa kan kuusdeetaa bakkatti gabatee haaraa barbaaddu bani. Sajoo\<emph\>Gabatee\</emph\> cuqaasi. Gabatee haaraa uumuuf \<emph\>Mul'annoo Saxaxaa keessatti Gabatee Uumi\</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3146798				0	om	Mul'annoo Saxaxaa keessatti, gabatee keef amma dirreewwan uumuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3153349				0	om	Gubbaarraa gara gadiitti tarreewwaniin dirreewwan haaraa galchi. Man'ee\<emph\>Maqaa Dirree\</emph\> cuqaasiiti tokkoon tokkoo dirree deetaaf maqaa dirree galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id1595507				0	om	Dirree deetaa "furtuu dursaa" itti dabali. Qabiyyeewwan gabatee gulaaluu danda'uuf Bu'uurri furtuu dursaa fedha. Furtuun dursaa tokko tokkoo kuusaa deetaaf qabiyyeewwan addata qaba. Fakkeenyaaf, dirree lakkoofsaa saagi, tarjicha jalqabaa mirga-cuqaasiiti, baafata halqaraa irraa \<emph\>Furtuu Dursaa\</emph\> fili.\<emph\>GateessaaUfnaa\</emph\> gara "Eeyyee" tti qindeessi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3150084				0	om	Man'ee itti aanu gara mirgaa keessaa, \<emph\>Gosa Dirree\</emph\> hiiki. Yommuu man'ee keessa cuqaastu, gosa dirree sanduuqa makaa keessaa filachuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3154760				0	om	Tokkoo tokkon man'ee deetaa gosa dirree iftaa'etti walitti dhufoo tahe qofa fudhachuu danda'a. Fakkeenyaaf, dirree lakkofsaa keessa barruu galchuun hin danda'amu. Dirreewwan yaadannoo dhangii dBASE III keessaa faayiloota barruu keessaan-taaligaa'an kanneen barruu hanga 64KB baachuu danda'aniif wabiidha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3149456				0	om	Tokko tokkoo dirreef dirqala\<emph\>Ibsa\</emph\> galchuu ni dandeessa. Barruun ibsaa matadureewwan tarjaa mul'annoo gabatee keessaa irratti akka qacceetti mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153379				0	om	Amaloota Dirree				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3148798				0	om	Tokko tokkoo dirree deetaa filatameef amaloota galchi. Gosa kuusdeetaa irratti hundaa'uun, mijeessotni naqaa muraasni jiraachuu dhiisuu ni danda'u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3144762				0	om	Sanduuqa \<emph\>Gatii durtii\</emph\> keessaa, kuusaa haaraa halleef qabiyyeewwan durtii galchi. Qabiyyeewwan kun booda gulaalamuu ni danda'u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3150869				0	om	Sanduuqa \<emph\>Galfata barbaachisuu\</emph\> keessaa, dirreen duwwaa turuu fi turuu baachuu isaa ifteessi.				20200411 15:09:53
