helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_dbase2office.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145313				0	om	Deetaa garakeessa $[officename] Alaaguu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_dbase2office.xhp	0	help	par_id3147275				0	om	Dhangii barruutiin deetaa jijjiirraaf gingilchaa $[officename] Calc alaaguu/alerguu fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_dbase2office.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	om	Deetaa barbaadamu kuusdeetaa madda irraa dhangii barruutiin alergi. Dhangiin barruu CSV ni deeggarama. Dhangiin kun dirreewwan deetaa daangessitoota kanneen akka qoodduu yookiin qoodduu jabaa fayyadamuudhaan adda baasa, fi kuusaawwan cita sararaa saaguutiin adda baasa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_dbase2office.xhp	0	help	par_id3153821				0	om	\<emph\>Faayilii - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01020000.xhp\" name=\"Open\"\>\<emph\>Bani\</emph\>\</link\> filitii, alaaguuf faayilicha cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_dbase2office.xhp	0	help	par_id1977904				0	om	Sanduuqa makaa irraa \<emph\>Gosa faayilii\</emph\> "Text CSV" fili. \<emph\>Bani\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_dbase2office.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	om	Qaaqni \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000208.xhp\" name=\"Text Import\"\>\<emph\>Alaaguu Barruu\</emph\>\</link\> ni mul'ata. Galmee barruu irraa deetaa isa kam dabaluu akka qabdu murteessi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_dbase2office.xhp	0	help	par_id3150986				0	om	Deetaan wardii $[officename] Calc keessa erga jira ta'ee, akka barbaadametti gulaaluu ni dandeessa. Deetaa akka madda deetaa $[officename]tti ol kaa'uu:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_dbase2office.xhp	0	help	par_id3149762				0	om	Wardii $[officename] Calc ammaa dhangii dBASE tiin ukaankicha kuusdeetaa dBASE keessa ol kaa'i. Kana gochuuf, \<emph\>Faayilii - Akkasitti Olkaa'i\</emph\> filiitii, achii \<emph\>Gosa Faayilii\</emph\> "dBASE" fi ukaankicha kuusdeetaa dBASE filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_dbase2office.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150400				0	om	Dhangii Barruu CSV tiin Alerguu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_dbase2office.xhp	0	help	par_id3154140				0	om	Wardii $[officename] ammaa dhangii barruutiin kan fayyadamoota biroo hedduutiin dubbifamuu danda'u alerguu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_dbase2office.xhp	0	help	par_id3152933				0	om	\<emph\>Faayilii - Akka Olkaa'i\</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_dbase2office.xhp	0	help	par_id3154216				0	om	\<emph\>Gosa faayilii\</emph\> keessaa gilgilchaa "Barruu CSV" filadhu. Maqaa faayilii galchii tii \<emph\>Olkaa'i\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_dbase2office.xhp	0	help	par_id3154908				0	om	Kuni qaaqicha \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000207.xhp\" name=\"dBase Export\"\>\<emph\>Alerga faayiloota barruu.\</emph\>\</link\> bana, kan keessatti gurmuu arfii, daangessituu dirree fi daangessituu barruu filattu.\<emph\>TOLE\</emph\>cuqaasi. Ofeeggannoon wardii ka'aa qofti ol kaa'amuu isaa sitti hima.				20200411 15:09:53
