helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008	31			0	om	Yommuu iddoo jechoota lama gidduutti barreessitu sarara dhumaa irratti jechoota lama gargarbahuu irraa ittisuuf, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja furtuu \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Furtuu Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
