helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146957				0	om	Mursaa hincinnee				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3148538				0	om	Fakkeenyi mursaa hincinnee maqaa kuubbaaniyaa kan akka A-Z dha. Akkuma beekamu A- akka sarara dhumaaratti fi sarari Z jalqabaa itti aanu irratti akka argamu hin barbaadu. Rakkina kana furuuf, mallattoo hir`isuu Shift+Ctrl+ dhiibi. Jecha biraan, furtuulee Shift fi Ctrl gadi qabuudhaan furtuu hir`isuu dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163802				0	om	Murfoo, mursaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749	66			0	om	Mursaawwan dheeraa saaguuf, \<emph\>Meeshaalee - Dirqaleewwan OfiinSirreessaa\</emph\>\<emph\>- Dirqaleewwan\</emph\> the \<emph\>Mursaawwan bakka buusi\</emph\> filannoo (only on Windows systems) jalaa barbaaduu dandeessa. Filannoon kun haalota murtaa`aa en-dash ykn em-dash ykn (ilaali \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040100.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] Help\"\>gargaarsa $[officename] \</link\>) waliin mallattoo hir`isuu tokko ykn lama bakka buusa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3153561	67			0	om	Dabalataan bakka buusuuf gabatee bakka buusaa \<emph\>Meshaalee - OfiinSirreessaa\</emph\>\<emph\>- \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040200.xhp\" name=\"Replace\"\>\<emph\>Bakka Buusi\</emph\>\</link\> jalaa ilaali. Kanneen biraa keessaa, qaxxaamura ofummaan, bocquu biroo keessatti mataasaa, mursaa gargaaramuun bakka buussuu damdeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153825				0	om	Foo'aa Beekamaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3154306	60			0	om	Footuu jidduu jechaa ofumaan galchuun murfinsa ofumaa gargaaruuf, furtuulee\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+mallattoo hir'isuu fayyadami. Yoo dhuma sararaa irra ta'e , keewwata kanaaf murfiinsi ofumaa cufamu illee jechi bakka kanatti fo'ama.				20200411 15:09:53
