helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3156113				0	om	Sajoo \<emph\>Ol kaa'i\</emph\> cuqaasi yookiin furtuuwwan qaxxaamuraa \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+S dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3155450				0	om	\<image id=\"img_id3152349\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_save.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152349\"\>Sajoon kuni saganticha irra caalaa fulla'insaan akkamitti fayyadamuu akka dandeenyu qajeelfamatiifi.\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3148685				0	om	Galmichi karaa fi maqaa isaa, gidduugaleessa deetaa qeeyyee ammaa irratti yookiin ooftuu cimdaa yookiin intarneetii irratti,faayilii kamiyyuu maqaan walfakkaatu irraba gochuun, jalatti ol kaa'ameera.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3150984				0	om	Yommuu faayilii haaraa yeroo jalqabaaf ol keessu, qaaqni \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01070000.xhp\" name=\"Save As\"\>Akka Olkaa'i\</link\> kan keessatti maqaa, ukaankaa fi ooftuu yookiin faayiliif qabee galchuu dandeessu ni banama.Qaaqa kana banuuf, \<emph\>Faayilii - Akka Olkaa'i\</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3152472				0	om	You can set the automatic creation of a backup copy under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010200.xhp\" name=\"Load/Save - General\"\>Load/Save - General\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	hd_id7146824				0	om	Dheertoo ofumaa gara maqaa faayiliitti				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id9359111				0	om	Yommuu faayilii ol keessu, %PRODUCTNAME yeroo hundumaa maqaa faayiliitti dheertoo milteessa, yommuu maqaan faayilii durumaan dheertoo gosa faayiliitiin walsimu qabateerraan ala. Tarree \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000021.xhp\"\>Dheertoowwan ODF\</link\> ilaali.				20200411 15:09:53
