helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3144436				0	om	Barruu kee keessatti kofa maamilaa, yabbina, halluu, fi amaloota kabiroo waliin sararoota hirmachisuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	om	Amaloota sararaa fi kallattii qindeessuuf, wanta fakkasaa \<emph\>Sarara\</emph\> akka gadiitti fayyadami:				20200411 15:09:53
