helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3152780				0	om	\<image id=\"img_id3154285\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_line.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154285\"\>Sajoo\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3153254				0	om	1.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3159400	41			0	om	Kabala waaltaawaa irratti, sajoo \<emph\>Faankshinoota fakkasaa agarsii \</emph\> cuqaaasi kamshaa \<emph\>fakkasaa \</emph\>banuu, fi sajoo\<emph\>Sarara\</emph\>cuqaasi. Hantuuttee agarsiistuun gara mallattoo qaxxaamur-refeensaa tti jijjiirama sarara cinaa jiru wajjin.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3156117				0	om	2.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3152472				0	om	Galmee kee keessatti, iddoo sararri jalqabutti cuqaasi. Qabduu hantuuttee gadi qabuu fi tuqaatti harkisi iddoo sarara itti xumuruu barbaaddu. Dabalees yoo furtuu Shift gadi qabde, sararoonni surdala, dhaabboo, fi shaffaxa fakkasuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3149294				0	om	\<image id=\"img_id3159413\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_drawselect.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3159413\"\>Sajoo\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3151056				0	om	3.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3153361	43			0	om	Yoo sararri kallatti fi dheerina sirrii qabaate qabduu hantuuttee gaddhiisi. Achiin sararoota baay'ee fakkasuu dandeessa. Faankshinii kana kabala\<emph\>Fakkasaa \</emph\> irraa furtuu Esc dhiibuun ykn sajoo \<emph\>Filuu\</emph\> cuqaasuun xumiri.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	om	4.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3159149				0	om	Sajoo \<emph\>Select\</emph\> cuqaasteen booda, tokkoo tokkoo sarara yeroo furtuu Shift gadi qabdu cuqaasudhaan sararoota hunda yeroo walfakkaataatti filachuu dandeessa. Baay'inni filannoo kun haalluu wajjummaa, dalgee ykn amaloota biroo ramaduuf si dandeessisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3153049				0	om	Akkaataa keewwata \<emph\>Sarara Surdala\</emph\> durqindaa'aan fayyadamuun sarara surdala uumi. Keewwata duuwwaa keessatti cuqaasi, akkaataa \<emph\>Sarara Surdala\</emph\> foddaa \<emph\>Akkaataa fi Dhangeessuu\</emph\> keessatti dachaa-cuqaasi. Yoo galfanni sarara surdalaa tarree akkaataa keewwataa keessatti hin mul'anne, "All Styles" saanduqa gadaanu keessaa fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3153748				0	om	Sarara olaanu, cinaa ykn gadi keewwata galmee barruu barreessaa keessaa \<emph\>Dhangii - Keewwata - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030500.xhp\" name=\"Borders\"\>\<emph\>Borders\</emph\>\</link\> filachuudhaan fakkasuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_idN107C6				0	om	Sararoota ofumaa Barreessaa keessaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_idN107CC				0	om	Yoo sarara haaraa galmee barruu Kitaabessaa keessaa arfiilee murfoo sadii ol barreessitee fi furtuu Saagi dhiibdu, arfiileen haqamuudhan dubbisni duraa sarara akka handaara jalaatti argata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id8849452				0	om	Sarara baaqee tokko uumuuf, murfiwwan (-) ykn murgadii ( _ ) sadii ykn sadii caaluu barreessi, kana booda Galchii dhiibi. Sarara dachaa uumuudhaaf ammoo, mallattoo qixxee (=), urjoowwan (*), dalduufaawwan (~), ykn malattoo haashii (#) sadii ykn sadii caaluu barreessi, kana booda Galchii dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D0				0	om	Handaara ofumaan fakkafamee haquuf, \<emph\>Dhangi'i - Keewwata - Handaaraalee\</emph\> filadhuutii, handaara malee fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D8				0	om	Handaara ofumaan bakkabu'ame altokko gaabbuuf, \<emph\>Gulaali - Gaabbi\</emph\> filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E0				0	om	Handaarawwan ofumaa dhaamsuuf, \<emph\>Meeshaalee - OfiinSirreessaa - Dirqaleewwan\</emph\> filadhuutii, \<emph\>Handaara fayyadami\</emph\> qulqulleessi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3145787				0	om	Sararootaa fi wantoota fakkasaa kabiroo barruu kee keessatti saagdee\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#html\" name=\"HTML\"\>HTML\</link\> keessatti hinqindaa'uu, kanaafuu kalatiin dhangii HTML keessatti alergamuu hindanda'u. Qooda isaa, akka saxaatooleetti alergamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id641804				0	om	Yabbina sararaa tokko yammuu galchituu, safartuu tokko miiltessuu nidandeessa. Yabbini sararaa zeeroon sarara rifeensaa keessaa yabbina kan pikselii tokkoo kan giddugaleessa bahaa ta'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3154188				0	om	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030500.xhp\" name=\"Format - Paragraph - Borders\"\>Dhangi'i - Keewwata - Handaarota\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
