helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	om	Yommuu barruu galchitu, $[officename]iin tarii jechicha \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#url\" name=\"URL\"\>URL\</link\>ofumaan hubachuu fi jechicha geessituutiin bakka buusa. $[officename] amaloowwan (halluu fi jala harriquu) bocquu sirriitiin geessituu kanneen amaloonni isaanii akaataalee arfii muraasa irraa argaman dhangeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3153561				0	om	Yommuu ati barreessaa jirtuu $[officename] ofumaan URLs akka beeku yoo hin barbaanne tahe, amaloota kana dhaamsuuf karaan hedduun jira.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154306				0	om	Gaabbi Beekommii URL				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3149233				0	om	Yommuu barreessituu fi barruun ofumaa gara geessituutti jijjiiramuu isaa hubattu, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Z dhangeessa kana gaabbi dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3149235				0	om	Jijjiiraa kana hamma eegereetti hubaachuu yoo baatte, geessituucha  filitii ajaja baafataa filadhu\<emph\>Dhangii - Dhangeessaa Durtii\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
