helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	om	Kan kanaan gadii ilaalcha gubbaa toftaa addaa addaa qabeentoota kan \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> keessaa akka hin jijjiiramne, hin haqamne ykn ilaalamne eeganidha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146957				0	om	Galmeewwan hundaa yoo olkaa'aman eeguu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3150775				0	om	Galmeewwan hundi \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000021.xhp\" name=\"OpenDocument format\"\>Dhangii OpenDokumentii\</link\>dhaan olkaa'aman ittigaan olkaa'amuu ni danda'u. Galmeewwan ittigaan olkaa'aman ittigaa malee banamuu hin danda'an. Qabiyyichi hayyisameera akka gulaalaa alaantoon akka hin dubbifamneef. Kuni qabiyyeef, saxaatoo fi wantoota OLEf fayyada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	om	Turning on protection				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3145121				0	om	\<emph\>Faayilii - Akka Olkaa'i\</emph\> filiiti, Saanduqa filannoo \<emph\>Ittigaan wajjin olkaa'i\</emph\> mallattoo kaa'i. Galmee olkaa'i.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3154286				0	om	Hayyisa dhaamsuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3148492				0	om	Galmee bani, iggita sirrii saagi. \<emph\>Faayilii - Akka Olkaa'i\</emph\>filitti saanduqa filannoo \<emph\>Iggita wajji olkaa'i\</emph\> haqi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3145068				0	om	Odeeffannoon \<emph\>Faayilii - Amaloota\</emph\> keessatti sagame hin icciteeffamne. Kun maqaa barreessaa, guyyaa kalaqaa, jecha fi arfii lakkaa'u qabata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149294				0	om	Irra-deebi'ama Mallattoo itti godhame Eeguu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3161646				0	om	Calc \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> fi Writer \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> keeessatti jijjiirama yeroo hunda hojjatameen, faaankshiniin keeddeebii eenyu akka jijjire kuusa. Faankishiniin kun hayyisa wajjin kafame, kanaaf yoo igginni sirri itti gale qofa dhaamuu danda.a. Hanga sanatti, jijjiiramonni hundi kuufamuu itti fufu. Jijjiramni fudhatamaa fi gatiinsaa hin danda'amu.				20200411 15:09:53
