helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autohide.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149796				0	om	Foddaawwan Hidhaman Agarsiisuu fi Dhoksuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autohide.xhp	0	help	par_id3149045				0	om	\<image id=\"img_id3149655\" src=\"res/helpimg/ein.png\" width=\"0.1043inch\" height=\"0.4272inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149655\"\>Sajoo\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autohide.xhp	0	help	par_id3152921	64			0	om	Foddaa hidhame agarsiisuuf yookiin dhoksuuf qabduu qarqara foddicha hidhamee irra jiru cuqaasi. Faankishiniin OfumaaDhoksaa foddaa dhokate qarqara isaa irratti cuqaasuudhaan yeroodhaaf agarsiisuuf sii eeyyama. Yommuu galmicha keessa cuqaastu, foddichi hidhame ammas ni dhokata.				20200411 15:09:53
