helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3159876				0	om	%PRODUCTNAME uses the installed fonts of your system. In a text document you can select from all printable fonts. In an HTML document or in Web layout, only fonts that are visible on screen are offered. In spreadsheets and drawings you can select from all installed fonts.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233				0	om	Under UNIX based platforms, the printer administration program \<emph\>spadmin\</emph\> is provided to help you set up printers and faxes for use with the $[officename] software.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	om	Sagantaa bulchiinsa maxxansaa \<emph\>spadmin\</emph\>akka armaan gadiitti waami:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3147242				0	om	Gara {install_path}/galeeloo sagantaatti jijjiri.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209				0	om	Galchi: ./spadmin				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3152349				0	om	Erga eegaleen booda, foddaan sagantaa bulchiinsa maxxansaa \<emph\>spadmin\</emph\> ni mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3149580				0	om	Ijaarsa kadiimaatti aanuun, bulchaan sirnaa akka kunuunsa hundeetti seena, akkasumas sagantaa bulchiinsa maxxansaa eegalsiisa\<emph\>spadmin\</emph\>. Bulchaan itti aansuudhaan qindaayina maxxansaa maraa {install_path}/share/psprint/psprint.conf fayyadamtoota maraaf uuma. Jijjiiramootni hundi fayyadamtoota hundaaf yeroodhuma sana mul'atu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159177				0	om	Maxxansittota Qindeessuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3159157				0	om	Hujjeeffannoo UNIX irratti hunda'e jalatti, soraajiin $[officename] gargaarsa kalachaa maxxansitoota teekinooloojii PostScript qofaa fudhata. Maxxansitootni kan biroo akka kutaa eerameetti\<emph\>Ooftoota maxxansaa  $[officename] Soraajii\</emph\> qindaa'uu qabu. Sooftiweeriin $[officename] ofmaa maxxansaa ooftuu durtii sirna hiriira tokkoo tokkootiif kenna. Maxxansalee dabalataa akka barbaachiseen ida'uu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148564				0	om	Maxxansaa Ida'uu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3147559				0	om	Gara {install_path}/galeeloo sagantaatti jijjiri.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3152360				0	om	Galchi: ./spadmin				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3153360				0	om	Qabdoo \<emph\>Maxxansaa haaraa\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3151210				0	om	Dirqaalee\<emph\>Maxxansaa Uumi\</emph\>filadhu itti aansuun \<emph\>itti aanee\</emph\>cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	om	Maxxansaakeef ooftuu mijatu filadhu. Maxxansaa PostScript fayyadamaa yoo hin jiraanne ykn ilaallatni kee yoo hin tarreeffamiin, ooftuu\<emph\>Maxxansaa Gitaa\</emph\>fayyadami ykn  ejjettoowwan armaan gadii hordofi. Ooftuuwwan haaraa  \<emph\>Alaagi\</emph\>qabduu fayyadamuun ida'uu ykn ooftuwwan hin barbaachifne qabduu \<emph\>Haqi\</emph\>haquu dandeessa. \<emph\>Itti aanee\</emph\>cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3125863				0	om	Sarara ajajaa maxxansaa keerratti maxxansuu dandeessa(fakkeenyaaf, lp -d my_queue). \<emph\>itti aanee\</emph\>cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3150767				0	om	Maqaa maxxansaa kenni itti aansuun akka maxxansaa durtii ta'e murteessi. \<emph\>Xumuri\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3155429				0	om	Fuula yaalii maxxansuuf, \<emph\>Fuula Yaalii\</emph\> irratti cuqaasi. Yoo fuulli yaali maxxanfamuu dide ykn dogogorraan yoo maxxane, qindaa'inoota mara\<emph\>Qinda'ina Maxxansaa Jijjiiruu\</emph\> akka ibsamaniti mirkaneessi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146147				0	om	Mosaajii$[officename] ooftuu maxxansaa keessaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3147428				0	om	Yeroo maxxansaa PostScript hin ta'in ijaartu, akka PostScript afaan maxxansichaatti jijiramu sirna kee qindeessuu qabda. Soofti weerii jijjiirraa PostScript ammee kan akka Ghostscript (http://www.cs.wisc.edu/~ghost/) fayyadamuun yaada kennuu dandeenya.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3154639				0	om	Golga kompitarichaa keessatti\<emph\>Maxxansaa Gitaa\</emph\>qindeessuu qabda. Dabalataanis mudanaaleen fuulaa akka sirriitti qindaa'an mirkaneessi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3159153				0	om	Yoo maxxansaa teekinooloojii PostScript dhaan fayyadamaa jirta ta'e, faayilii ibsaa maxxansaa keef ijaaruu qabda (PostScript Printer Definition - PPD) amala maxxansaa filatte kan akka filannoo harkata waraqaa, dalaga garlamee maxxansaa fi kaadima waljaartuu hundaa akka fayyadamtu si dandeessisa. Sababa deetaa barbachisaa ta'e of keessatti qabuufi maxxansitoota hedduuf mijataa waan ta'eef maxxansaa gitaa illee fayyadamuu dandeessa. Kana keessatti, filannoo harkata waraqaa malee dalaguu dandeessa akkasumas mudanoota fuulaa sirriitti qindeessuu qabda.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3146976	128			0	om	Faayilootni PPD gariin akka faayiloota durtiitti ijaaramu. Maxxansaa keetiif faayiliin PPD wal fakkatu hin jiru ta'e, faayiloota PPD adda addaa http://www.adobe.com/products/printerdrivers/ irratti argatta. Oomishaa maxxansaa kee faayiloota PPD dhaaf gaafachuu dandeessa. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147435				0	om	Yeroo Maxxansaan Uumamu Ooftuu Alaaguu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3149484				0	om	Qaaqa filannoo ooftuu keessaa\<emph\>Alaagi\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3149260	347			0	om	Bakka faayiloota PPD hin xaxamiin galeeloo filachuuf \<emph\>Iyya'i\</emph\>cuqaasi. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3147443				0	om	Tarree sanduuqaa\<emph\>Filannoo ooftuuwwanii\</emph\>keessaa, ooftuu maxxansaa ijaaruu barbaaddu fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3145364				0	om	Click OK.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152885				0	om	Yerootti maxxansaa haaraa uuman ooftuu haquu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3154729				0	om	Ooftuu maxxansaa filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3155417				0	om	\<emph\>Haquu\</emph\>Cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3149909				0	om	Ooftuu maxxansaa gitaa haquu dhiisuu kee mirkaneessi, akkasumas ooftuuwwan ijaarsa kaadima irraa haqaman fayyadamtoota biroo ijaarsa kaadima wal fakkaturrati fayyadaman biratti akka hin mul'atne mirkanessi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3148456				0	om	Yoo maxxansaan kaadimaalee bratamoo PostScript caalaatti waljaartuu kadiimaalee qabaate, kaadimaalee dabalataa kanaa faayilii AFM fe'uu qabda. Faayilii AFM {install_path}/share/psprint/galeeloo fontmetric ykn gara {install_path}/user/psprint/ fontmetric directory irratti garagalchi . Faayiloota AFM ,fakkeenyaaf, ftp://ftp.adobe.com/pub/adobe/type/win/all/afmfiles/ irraa barbaaduu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148388				0	om	Qindaa'ina maxxansaa jijjiruu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3156284				0	om	Sagantaa bulchiinsa maxxansaa keessaa \<emph\>spadmin\</emph\>, maxxansaa sanduuqa tarree \<emph\>Maxxansitoota ijaaraman\</emph\>irraa filadhu itti aansuudhaan \<emph\>Amaloota\</emph\>cuqaasi. Qaaqni\<emph\>Amaloota\</emph\>mul'ate fuuloota caancalaa hedduu of keessaa qaba. Kun iddoo ati qideessaa kee akkaataa faayilii PPD maxxansaa filatameedhaan itti uumtu dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3148833				0	om	Caancalaa fuulaa irraa ajaja\<emph\>Ajaja\</emph\>filadhu. Ajajoota superfluous\<emph\>Haquu\</emph\>fayyadamuun haquu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3154270				0	om	Fuula caancalaa \<emph\>Waraqaa\</emph\> irraatti, dhangii fi harkata waraqichaa qindeessuun akka qindaa'ina durtiitti fayyadamuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3145649				0	om	Fuula qaaqaa\<emph\>Mi'a\</emph\>irratti, filannoowwan baay'ee mijatoo ta'an maxxansaa keetiif filuu dandeessa. Yoo maxxansaan kee adii fi gurraachaan qofa maxxansa ta'e,\<emph\>Halluu\</emph\>jalatti "grayscale" filadhu, kanarraan kan hafe"color" filadhu. Yoo gara saxxiilaatti darbuun bu'aa hin barbaachifne argamsiise,\<emph\>Color\</emph\>jalatti "color" filadhu itti aansuun haala akkeessaan maxxansaa ykn PostScript itti fayyadamu ilaali. Dabalataanis, fuula qaaqaa kana irratti sirrummaa halluu sadarkaa PostSscript dhaan qindeessuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3150752				0	om	Fuulli qaaqa\<emph\>Bakka bu'aa Kaadimaa\</emph\> akka ati gosa kaadimaa maxxansicha keessa gosa kaadimaa koompitaricha keessa jiru keessaa akka filattu si tajaajila. Haala kanaan hamma deetaa maxxansatti eergamu hir'isuu dandeessa. Bakka buusuun kaadimaa maxxansitoota hundaaf qeenxeetti banamuu fi cufamuu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3153924				0	om	Akkasumas yeroo ooftuu maxxansaa gitaa fayyadamtu akka maxxanee bahaan kee hin soofamneef qabduu\<emph\>Qindoominoota Dabalataa\</emph\>irratti murdana fuulootaa sirriitti qindeessuu qabda. Dirree yaada irratti ibsa galchuu dandeessa, kun qaaqa\<emph\>Maxxansi\</emph\> irrattis ni mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3155443				0	om	Gariin qindoominootaa maxxanfamee bahaa ammeetiifis qaaqa\<emph\>Maxxansi\</emph\> keessatti qindaa'u danda'u yookaan qaaqni\<emph\>Qindoominoota maxxansaa\</emph\> soraajii $[officename] qabduu\<emph\>Amalootaa\</emph\>waliin.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150042				0	om	Maxxansitoota Maqaa jijjiiruu ykn Haquu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3147338				0	om	Tarree sanduuqaa keessaa\<emph\>Maxxansittota Ijaaraman\</emph\>maxxansaa fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3149258				0	om	Maxxansuu filatame maqaa jijjiiruuf, \<emph\>Maqaa jijjiiruu\</emph\>cuqaasi. Qaaqa mul'ate keessa maqaa mijataa galchii itti aansuun TOLEE cuqaasi. Maqichi addata akkasumas akka ati maxxansaa fi fayyadamaa baruu dandeessutti ta'u qaba. Maqaan maxxansitootaa fayyadamtoota hundaaf maqaa wal fakkaatuun mogga'uu qaba.Sababa galmeewwan wal jijjiiraniif, yoo fudhaataan maqaa wal fakktuun qabaate maxxansaan filatame akkuma jirutti ta'a				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3153963				0	om	Maxxansaa filatame haquuf, \<emph\>Haqi\</emph\>cuqaasi. Maxxansaan durtii ykn maxxansaan sirna bulchaatin kaadima ijaarame keessatti uumame qaaqa kanaan hin haqamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147346				0	om	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>Maxxansaa Durtii Filachuu \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3145769				0	om	Sanduuqa tarree keessaa maxxansaa filame \<emph\>Maxxansitoota Ijaaraman\</emph\>akka maxxansaa durtiitti tolchuuf, maqaasaa lama cuqaasi ykn qabduu \<emph\>Durtii\</emph\>cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154204				0	om	Rogeeffamuu Faaksii Fayyadamuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3148463				0	om	Yoo qarqaba faaksii kan akka Efax or HylaFax koompitara kee irratti ijaarte, Soraajii $[officename] fayyadamuun faaksii eerguu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3154575				0	om	Gara {install_path}/galeeloo sagantaatti jijjiiri.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3151277				0	om	Galchi: ./spadmin				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3146808				0	om	\<emph\>Maxxansaa Haaraa\</emph\>cuqaasi. Kun qaaqee \<emph\>maxxansaa ida'i\</emph\>bana.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3151070				0	om	\<emph\>Mi'a faaksii walindhi\</emph\>filadhu. \<emph\>Itti aanee\</emph\>cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3150787				0	om	Ooftuu durtii akka fayyadamtu fili yookaan ooftuu maxxansaa biraa fili. Ooftuu durtii yoo fayyadamaa hin jirtu ta'e, ooftuu mijataa filadhu. \<emph\>Itti aanee\</emph\>filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3155111				0	om	Qaaqa itti aanu keessatti sarara ajajaa faaksii ittiin qunnamuu barbaaddu galchi. Sarara ajajaa faaksiiwwan eergaman tokko tokkoof "(TMP)" iin faayilii ammaafiitin bakka bu'ama akkasumas "(PHONE)" iin laakkoofsa bilbilaa maashinii faaksii fudhataatin bakka bu'ama. Yoo "(TMP)" iin sarara ajajaa irratti mul'ate, lakkadaan PostScript faayilii keessatti tamsa'a, kan kanarraan hafe ujummoo keessaan akka galfata durtiitti ta'a. \<emph\>Itti aanee\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3146135				0	om	Faaksii maxxansaa keetiif maqaa moggaasi, itti aansuudhaan akka lakkoofsootni bilbilaa (gadi ilaali) barruu  maxxanee bahu irraa haqamuu fi haqamuu dhiisuusaa adda baasi. \<emph\>Xumuri\</emph\>cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3147506				0	om	Amma faaksii maxxansaa irraa gara maxxansaa uumameetti erguu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3148419				0	om	Lakkoofsa faaksii akka barruutti galmee keessa saagi. Akkasumas dirree lakoofsa faaksii kuusaa deetaa kaka'aa keessaa fudhatu galchuu dandeessa. Sababa kamiifuu, lakkoofsi faaksii arfiilee @@# dhaan eegalee @@ xumurama. Galfatni gataa'aa unka @@#1234567@@ qabaata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3150826				0	om	Yoo arfiileen lakkofsoota bilbilaa dabalatee hin maxxanfamiin, \<emph\> Maxxanfamee bahaa lakkoofsi faaksii irraa haqame\</emph\> Dirqaalee jalatti \<emph\>Amaloota\</emph\> fuula caancalaa \<emph\>Ajajaa\</emph\> irratti kakaasi. Yoo lakkoofsi bilbilaa galmee keessa hin galfamne ta'e, maxxansa booda qaaqni yaadachiisaa ni mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3154196				0	om	In $[officename] you can also activate an icon for sending faxes to a default fax. To do this, choose \<emph\>Tools - Customize - Toolbars\</emph\>, click \<emph\>Add Commands\</emph\> and add from "Documents" the \<emph\>Send Default Fax\</emph\> icon. You can set which fax is used when this button is pressed under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Print\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3150517				0	om	Hojii maxxansaa addaa faaksiwwan hundaaf uumuu kee yaadadhu, yoo kun ta'uu baate, fudhataan jalqabaa faaksiiwwan hunda fudha. Qaaqa \<emph\>Meeshaalee - Makiinsa Ergannoo\</emph\> keessaa dirqaalee\<emph\>Maxxansaa\</emph\>filadhu itti aansuudhaan sanduuqa filannoo\<emph\>hujiiwwan maxxansa qeenxee\</emph\>filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146929				0	om	Barruudirbaasi irraa gara PDF itti walindhuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3154989				0	om	Yoo jijjiiraan PostScript gara PDF kan akka Ghostscript ykn Adobe Acrobat Distiller koompitara kee irratti ijaarame, soraajii $[officename] keessatti galmee PDF safiisaan uumuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3150524				0	om	Spadmin keessaa,\<emph\>Maxxansaa Haaraa\</emph\>cuqaasi. Kun qaaqa\<emph\>Maxxansaa ida'i\</emph\> bana.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3145268				0	om	\<emph\>Jijiiraa PDF walindhi\</emph\>filadhu. \<emph\>Itti aanu\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3156445				0	om	Ooftuu durtii akka fayyadamuu dandeessu filadhu, ooftuu Acrobat Distiller yookaan ooftuu adda biraa. Ooftuun "Generic Printer (T42 enabled)" kaadimaalee gosa 3 irra gosa 42 filata; ooftuun kun bahaatiif hiikaan soraajii PostScript filannoo gaarii dha. \<emph\>Itti aanee\</emph\>cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3155128				0	om	Qaaqa itti aanu keessaa, sarara ajajaa jijjiiraa PostScript->PDF tiif galchi. Bakka faayilootni PDF kuusamuu qabanitti galeeloo galchi. Yoo galiiloo hin kenniin, galiiloon manata fayyadamtootaa ni tajaajila. Sarara ajajaa irratti "(TMP)" iin faayilii ammaatiin akkasumas "(OUTFILE)" iin ammoo faayilii galteetin bakka bu'amu, maqaa galmee irraa uumame. Yoo "(TMP)" sarara ajajaa irratti dhufe, lakaddaan Postscript faayilii keessa fuulduratti darba, akka naqa durtiitti ujummoo ajajaa keessaan galfama. Ghostscript or Adobe Acrobat Distilleriin xurree bardaadaa keessa ta'e, ajajoota durmurtaawaa keessaa tokko fayyadamuu dandeessa. \<emph\>Itti aanee\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3152889				0	om	Jijjiraa PDF keetii haaraaf ramadi. \<emph\>Xumuri\</emph\>Cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3153064				0	om	Amma jijjiiraa jalqaba uumame irratti maxxansuun galmee PDF uumuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
