helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_search2.xhp	0	help	par_id3149182				0	om	Galmee unkaa kan dirreewwan kuusdeetaa qabate bani.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_search2.xhp	0	help	par_id3159157				0	om	Akka fakkeenyaatti, galmee barruu duwwaa baniiti F4 dhiibi. Mul'annoo madda deetaa keessaa gabatee kuusdeetaa borquusaa \<emph\>biblio\</emph\> bani. Yommuu Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> dhiibdu, irraantoowwan tarjaa muraasa garakeessa galmichatti akka dirreewwan unkaa uumamanitti harkisi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_search2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150984	19			0	om	Kamshaa \<emph\>To'annoowwan Unkaa\</emph\> irraa, haalata saxaxaa kaasuuf sajoo \<emph\>Haalata Saxaxaa Kaasuu/Dhaamsuu\</emph\> cuqaasi \<image id=\"img_id3147618\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_switchcontroldesignmode.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147618\"\>Sajoo\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_search2.xhp	0	help	par_id3148672	6			0	om	Kamshaa \<emph\>Naannessaa Unkaa\</emph\> irraa ,sajoo\<emph\>Gingilchaawwan Unka- Hundaa'e\</emph\> cuqaasi \<image id=\"img_id3149807\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formfilter.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149807\"\>Sajoo\</alt\>\</image\> cuqaasi. Galmeen ammaa to'annoowwan unkaa isaa waliin akka haguuggee gulaali duwwaatti agarsiifama. Kamshaan \<emph\>Gingilchaa Unkaa \</emph\> ni mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_search2.xhp	0	help	par_id3149666				0	om	Haalota gingilchaa garakeessa dirreewwan hedduu yookiin tokkootti galchi. Hubadhu: Yoo garakeessa dirreewwan hedduutti haalota  gingilchaa galchite, haalotni galan hundi walsimuu qabu (Buuliyaanii AND).				20200411 15:09:53
