helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\aaa_start.xhp	0	help	par_id3144436				0	om	\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> galmeewwan fakkeenyaa baay'ee fi qajojiilee fayyadamuuf qophaa'an ofitti qabata. \<emph\>Faayilii - Haaraa - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01010100.xhp\" name=\"Templates and Documents\"\>\<emph\>Qajojilee fi Galmeewwan\</emph\>\</link\> filachuun yookiin, Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+N dhiibuun gahinsa gochuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
