helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3152473				0	om	Gara galmeetti jijjiiruuf,\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F6 dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3152360				0	om	Gara kabala baafataa fi duubatti deebi'uuf F10 dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153896				0	om	Escapen, baafata xiqqaa baname, kamshaa, ykn foddaa bilisa ammaa cufa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3161656				0	om	Ajaja baafataa tokko waamuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3151056				0	om	Baafata jalqabaa filachuuf \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Dirqala\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> yookan F6 ykn F10 dhiibi (baafata \<emph\>Faayilii\</emph\>). Xiyya mirgaan, baafatni itti aanu kan mirgaa ni filama; xiyya bitaan, baafatni durii ni filama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153381				0	om	Xiyyi gadee baafata filame bana. Xiyyi dabalataa gadee fi olee, filannoo ajajoota baafataa keessatti siqsa. Xiyya mirgaatiin ammoo, baafatoota xiqqaa jiran mara banuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148798				0	om	Ajaja baafataa filame raawwachuuf Enter dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147086				0	om	Ajaja sajoo tokkoo raawwachuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148922				0	om	Hanga sajoon jalqabaa kamshaa irra jiru filamutti F6 irra deddeebi'ii dhiibi. Kamshaa surdalaa irratti sajoo filachuuf xiyya mirgaa fi bitaa fayyadami. Haaluma walfakkaatuun, kamshaa sarjaa irrati sajoo filachuuf xiyya olee fi gadee fayyadami. Furtuun Home, kamshaa tokko irraa sajoo jalqabaa, furtuun End ammoo kamshaa isa dhumaa filu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3144433				0	om	Sajoo filame raawwachuuf Enter dhiibi. Yoo sajoon filataman haala baratamoon gocha hantuutee irraa duuban barbaadu ta'ee, kan akka reektaangilii galchuu, san booda furtuu Enter qofa dhiibuun ga'aa miti: iddoo kanatti \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153968				0	om	Wanta fakkasaa uumuuf sajoo \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter irratti cuqaasuu. Wanti fakkaasaan gidduu mul'annootti hammamtaa dura ibsame waliin bakka qabata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150449				0	om	Galmee keessaa wanta fakkaasaa jalqabaa filachuuf, meeshaa filannoo irraa \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter dhiibi. Yoo wanta fakkaasaa filaman gulaaluu, hammamteessuu, ykn siqsuu barbaadde, xiyyeefannoo galmee keessatti sirreessuuf jalqaba C\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F6 fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041				0	om	Yoo kamshaan argii irratti mul'achuu kan danda'u caala ta'e, sajoo gara handaara mirgaa ykn jalaatti agarsiisa. Sajoo hafan agrsiisuuf kamsha filachuun PageUp ykn PageDown dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150440				0	om	Kamshaaleef qabachiisa addayaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149983				0	om	Kamshaa filame banuuf xiyya gadee fi mirgaa dhiibi. Innis cuqaasa hantuutee waliin waltiqixa. Kamshaa keessatti furtuuwwan xiyya mirgaa fi bitaa fayyadami. Furtuuwwan Home fi End kamshaa keessaa sajoo jalqabaa fi dhumaa walduraa duubaan filu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145365				0	om	Esc dhaan kamshaa cufi. Hantuuteen alatti kamshaa siqsuun hin danda'amu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151119				0	om	Saanduqa makaa tokko irraa filannoo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3146986				0	om	\<image id=\"img_id3148645\" src=\"res/helpimg/zellvor.png\" width=\"1.528in\" height=\"0.292in\" localize=\"true\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148645\"\>Saanduqa makaa\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149666				0	om	Saanduqa makaa fili. Enter dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155366				0	om	Galfattoota saanduqa makaa gadee maruuf, xiyya gadee ykn furtuu Page Down, ykn olee maruuf ammoo xiyya olee ykn furtuu Page Up fayyadami. Furtuun Home gara galfata jalqabaatti fi furtuun End gara galfata dhumaatti si geessu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145749				0	om	Galfata filame raawwachuuf Enter dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150685				0	om	Filannoo Gabateewwan keessaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154320				0	om	Foddaawwan, Qaaqawwanii, fi dirree to'annoo gabatee hedduu keessaa, deetaa filachuuf gabateewwan ni jiru, fakkeenyaaf, gara mirgaa \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/database_main.xhp\" name=\"Data Source View\"\>Mul'annoo Madda Deetaa\</link\> keessatti. Furtuuwwan armaan gadii gabatee kanneen keessaa filachuuf fayyadu:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154014				0	om	Kabala iddoo: tarree ammeef filannoo jijjiiruu fi filannoo hunda dhiisa, garuu yoo maadheen ammaa haalata gulaalli keessa jiraate hin ta'u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3147396				0	om	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Kabala iddoo: filannoo tarree ammee fi dhiisuu filannoo kana jijjiira.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149488				0	om	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+Kabala iddoo: filannoo tarjaa ammaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3156286				0	om	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Xiyya Olee yookan \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Dirqala\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Xiyyaa Gadee gargareessaa gabatee fi unka gidduu siqsa, fakkeenyaaf barroo tarroo kuusdeetaa keessaa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145251				0	om	To'annoo gabatee yookiin mul'annoo madda deetaa keessatti, furtuun Tab tarjaa itti aanutti siqsa. To'annoo itti aanuu siqsuuf, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab dhiibuu dandeessa. Too'annoo duraa siqsuuf, Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150592				0	om	Hammamtaa fi qubannoo Foddaawwanii fi Qaaqawwanii 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153221				0	om	Jalqaba \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Dirqalee\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+spacebar dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148456				0	om	Sirni baafataa ajajoota kan akka \<emph\>Siqsi\</emph\>, \<emph\>Hagamtaa Jijjiiri\</emph\> fi \<emph\>Cufi\</emph\> ni bana.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149400				0	om	Ajaja (xiyya gadee, itti aansee Enter) filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155083				0	om	Qaaqaa ykn foddaa, siqsuuf ykn hagamtaa jijjiiruuf amma furtuuwwan xiyyaa fayyadamuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3147497				0	om	Jijjiirama fudhachuuf Enter dhiibi. Jijjiirama dhiisuuf Escape dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146988				0	om	Foddaalee fi Kamshaalee Hidhuu fi Kaafachuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3147176				0	om	Hanga foddaan ykn kamshaan filamutti F6 dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153707				0	om	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+F10 dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154479				0	om	Wantoota filachuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148993				0	om	Press Shift+F4 to select the first object in the current document. When an object is selected, press Tab to select the next object, or press Esc to go back to the text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152962				0	om	Wantoota Gulaali				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3156379				0	om	Wanti OLE filame kan kaka'u furtuu Galchi jedhuuni.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155766				0	om	Qubannoo fi Hammamtaa wantootaa gulaali				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148405				0	om	Safartuu tarsaa qulqullinaa tokkoon wantoota filaman siqsuuf, furtuulee xiyyaatti fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145619				0	om	Set the grid resolution unit with \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Grid\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Resolution\</emph\> area. If you enter a number greater than 1 in the \<emph\>Subdivision\</emph\> area, you must press the arrow key as often as the number states to move the selected object by one grid resolution unit.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3166450				0	om	Wanta filatame piikseelii tokkoon siksuuf \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> fi furtoota xiyyaa fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3147345				0	om	Qabannoo haalataa gulaali galchuuf, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab fayyadami. Qabannoon bitaa innii gara gubbaa qabannoo si'aadha, liphsachuu eegala. Qabannoo itti aanuu filachuuf, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab fayyadami. Qabannoo haalataa gulaaluu keessaa bahuuf, Escape fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149565				0	om	Qabannoo haalataa gulaali keessatti, furtootni xiyyaa qabannoo filataman isa hamamtaa wantichaa jijjiiru siksa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147361				0	om	Korkoddiiwwan Wantaa Gulaali				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148534				0	om	Korkoddii kan wanta tokko furtoota xiyyaa waliin siqsuu nidandeessa. Jalqaba qabannoo haalataa gulaali galchitii, korkoddii filadhu. Akaakuu korkoddii irratti hundaa'uun, korkoddiicha gara adda addaatti siqsuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3163808				0	om	Wanticha filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150646				0	om	Qabannoo haalataa gulaali, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab waliin galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150940				0	om	The upper left handle starts blinking. Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab several times, until no handle blinks. This signals that now the anchor of the object is activated. \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>In text documents you can press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+A to activate the anchor directly.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153919				0	om	Korkoddiicha siqsuuf furtoota xiyyaa fayyadami. Wantaan akka barbaachisumaasaatiitti korkoddiicha dukaa bu'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3152582				0	om	Korkoddii wanta filatamee, fakkeenyaaf baafata halqaraa wantoota keessatti jijjiiruu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148393				0	om	Yoo wantichii \<emph\>Gara Keewwatatti\</emph\> korkoddaa'ee, furtuun xiyyichaa, wanticha gara keewwata duraaniitti ykn gara keewwata itti aanuutti siqsa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145615	69			0	om	Yoo wantichii\<emph\> Gara Fuulaatti\</emph\> korkoddaa'ee, Furtooti PageUp yk PageDowniin gara duraaniitti ykn gara itti aanuutti siqsa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145135				0	om	Yoo wantichii \<emph\>Gara Arfiitti\</emph\> korkoddaa'ee, furtootni Xiyyaa, keewwata ammee keessa siqsu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145256	71			0	om	Yoo wantichii\<emph\> Akka Arfiitti\</emph\> korkoddaa'ee, sajoon korkoddii kamiyuu hinargamu. Wanticha siqsuu hindandeessu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149527				0	om	Yoo wantichii \<emph\>Gara Goodayyaatti\</emph\> korkoddaa'ee, furtootni Xiyyaa, qixa irraa duubaatiin goodayyaa itti aanuutti siqsa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153270				0	om	Hirtuu Sararootaa Too'aachuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3158413	134			0	om	Mul`atoota gargarreesamaa keessaatti galmeewwan Calc \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>, Fakkasaa \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>,fi Toleessaa \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> sardalanii fi tarjaan addabaasuu dandeessa. Tokko tokkoon mul`ata gosa galmeewwan biraa agarsiisu. Hantuutee gargaaramuudhaan, sarara hiraman kabala maraa irraa gara galmeetti harkisuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149814				0	om	Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F6:: hirtuu sararoota bakka qubannoo durtii fi xiyyeeffannoo sarara tokkoo mul'isa.				20200411 15:09:53
