helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3154150				0	om	Qaaqa \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030300.xhp\" name=\"Paragraph\"\>\<emph\>Keewwata\</emph\>\</link\> banuuf safartuu lama cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3154145				0	om	Caancala tokko qindeessuuf, bakka adii safartuu lama cuqaasi. Qaaqaan \<emph\>Keewwata\</emph\>, fuula caancala \<emph\>Caancaloota\</emph\> baname waliin mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145748				0	om	Caancaloota Safartuu irra Siiqsuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3145264				0	om	Hantuutee fayyadamuun dhaabataalee caancalaa kophaa safartuu irra siiqsi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3159156				0	om	Dhaabataalee caancalaa safartuu irra siiqsuuf, caancala cuqaasuuke dura furtuu Shift dhiibi. Caancala sana fi caancaloota hunda gara harga mirgaa isaatti argaman siiqauuf, furtuu Shift utuu dhiibaa jirtuu caancala tokko harkisi. Addaan fageenyi caancaloota kana gidduu jiru kan duraa irraa hin jijjiiramu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3147349	23			0	om	Caancala sana fi caancaloota hunda gara harga mirgaa isaatti argaman siiqauuf yoo caancala safartuu irra harkistu, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> dhiibi. Kuni addaan fageenya caancaloota gidduu jiru fageenya muudana irraa gitaa'aa akka jijjiiramu godha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146146				0	om	Amaloota Caancaloota Jijjiiruu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3145646				0	om	Akaakuu caancalaa jijjiiruuf, safartuu irraa caancala jijjiiruu barbaaddu cuqaasi, sanaa booda baafata halqara banuu barbaaddu mirga cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154729				0	om	Caancaloota Haquu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3148879				0	om	Caancala haquuf, qabduu hantuutee gad qabiiti utuu hin gadhiisiin caancalicha safartuu alaan harkisi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151074				0	om	Durtiiwwan Jijjiiruu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3151059				0	om	If you want to change the settings of your default tab stops, you will find further information under \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040900.xhp\" name=\"Text Document - General\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - General\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060300.xhp\" name=\"Spreadsheet - General\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Calc - General\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01070500.xhp\" name=\"Drawing - General\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Draw - General\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01070500.xhp\" name=\"Presentation - General\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Impress - General\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>(module name) - General\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> in the Options dialog box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3146972				0	om	\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000001.xhp#kontextmenue\" name=\"context menu\"\>baafata halqara\</link\>n sarartuu akka Safartuu. Jijjiirraan kuni kan gataa'aan hanga ati $[officename] baatuutti qofaa dha.fi sarartuu kan ati baafata halqaraa jijjiirra itti goote qofaaf hojii irra oola tti qofaa dha.Yuunitii safara safartuu dhaabbataatiin jijjiiruu yoo barbaadde \<emph\>Meeshaalee - Dirqalee - [Gosa Galmee] - Mul'annoo\</emph\> filiiti yuunitii safaraa achii jijjiiri.				20200411 15:09:53
