helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN109A9				0	om	Yeeroo gingilchaa XML %PRODUCTNAME uumtu, \<emph\>Wardii akkaataa XSLT\</emph\> kan gara dhangii faayilii XML Open Dokumentiitti fi open Dokumentii irraa jijjiiru saxaxuu qabda.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN109B0				0	om	Odeeffannoo dabalataa wa'ee dhangii XML Open Dokumentii yoo barbaadde, gara \<link href=\"https://xml.openoffice.org/\"\>https://xml.openoffice.org/\</link\>. deemi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN109C5				0	om	Akkaataa %PRODUCTNAME galmee XML alaagde irratti fayyadamuuf yoo barbaadde, gingilchhaake waliin \<emph\>Qajojii\</emph\> dabaluu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN109CC				0	om	Akasumas dhangii XML alaantoof \<emph\>Hiika Akaakuu Galmee\</emph\> (DTD) dabaltee, achumaanis dhangii XML gataa'essuu ni dandeessa, fakeenyaaf yeeroo gingilchaa yaaltu.				20200411 15:09:53
