helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN109E0				0	om	Geeddarama XSLT \<emph\>wardii akkaataa\</emph\> kan maalimaawwan dhangii XML alaantoo irraa gara maalimaawwan dhangii faayilii XML Open Dokumentiitti barruyyeesse duubatti deebisu uumi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN109E8				0	om	Yeeroo faayilii dhangii kanaa gara %PRODUCTNAME alaagdu, qajojii kan akkaataalee %PRODUCTNAME maalimaawwan ykn miseensota dhangii XML alaantoo keessatti ramadu uumi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN109EC				0	om	Barreessaa %PRODUCTNAME keessatti, galmee barruu uumiti \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Meeshaalee - Qindaa'inoota Gingilchaa XML\</item\> filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
