helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A03				0	om	Sanduuqa \<emph\>Maqaa Gingilchaa\</emph\> keessatti, maqaa ginglilchaa XML galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
