helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A09				0	om	Saanduqa \<emph\>Fayyadama\</emph\> keessatti, fayyadama %PRODUCTNAME gingilchaan kuni isaaf ta'e galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A0F				0	om	Sanduuqa \<emph\>Maqaa Akkaakuu Faayilii\</emph\> keessatti, akkaakuu faayilii gingilchaan kuni isaaf ta'e galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10CC6				0	om	Maaqaan kuni tarree akkaakuuwwan faayilii keessatti qaaqawwan \<emph\>Bani\</emph\>, \<emph\>Alergii\</emph\>, fi \<emph\>Akka olkaa'i\</emph\> keessatti agarsiisama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A15				0	om	Saanduqa \<emph\>Dheertoo Faayilii\</emph\> keessatti, dheertoo faayilii alergamanii galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A1B				0	om	Faayilii kana faayilii XML kan biroo irraa adda baasuuf, dheertoo tokko *.xml irraa kan hafe galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
