helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A32				0	om	Saanduqa \<emph\>XSLT Alergiif\</emph\> keessatti, xurree fi maqaa faayilii wardii akkaataa XSLT isa geedarama dhangii galmee bani irraa gara dhangii alaantoo qindeessu galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A38				0	om	Saanduqa \<emph\>XSLT Alaagiif\</emph\> keessatti, xurree fi maqaa faayilii gara wardii akkaataa XSLT, isa geeddarama dhangii alaantoo irraa gara dhangii galmee banitti qindeessu galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A3E				0	om	(Dirqalee) Sanduuqa \<emph\>Qajojii Alaagiif\</emph\> keessatti, xurree fi maqaa qojojii akkaataalee %PRODUCTNAME kan qindeessu, kan faayilii alaagame keessatti fayyadaman, galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
