helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3149807	18			0	om	Amma booda, galmee yoo olkeesse, \<emph\>Akaakuu faayilii \</emph\> akka filannooketti qindaa'a. Yoo barbaadde ammallee akaakuu faayilii gara biraa kan qaaqa faayilii olkaa'i keessaa filachuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
