helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3146986				0	om	\<emph\>Masaka Jijjiiraa Galmee\</emph\>n faayiloota Maykiroosoftii Ofiisii hundaa kan ukaankaa sana keessa jiran gara galmeewwan $[officename] dhangii faayilii OpenDokumentiitti galagalchee jijjiira. Ukaankaa dubbisuu barbaaddu fi ukaankaa bakka faayiloonni jijjiiraman itti olkaa'aman ifteessuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3150486				0	om	Maskicha eegalsiisuuf \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01130000.xhp\" name=\"File - AutoPilot - Document Converter\"\>\<emph\>Faayilii - Masakoota - Jijjiiraa Galmee\</emph\>\</link\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154319				0	om	Maakroota Maykiroosoftii Ofiisii fi $[officename] keessaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3154921				0	om	Quxaala xiqqoo wajjin, Maykiroosoftii Ofiisii fi $[officename] lakkaddaa maakroo tokko ta'e hin kaasani. Maykiroosoftii Ofiisiin lakkaddaa VBA (Visuuwaal Beesikii Fayyadamootaaf) fayyadama, $[officename]  immoo lakkaddaa Beesikii qeeyyaa $[officename] API (Apilikeeshinii Proograamii Interfeesii) fayyadama. Afaan sagantaa lamaan isaanii fayyadaman tokko ta'u illee, wantoota fi toftaalee isaan fayyadaman garaa gari.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id0804200804173539				0	om	The most recent versions of %PRODUCTNAME can run some Excel Visual Basic scripts if you enable this feature at \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Load/Save - VBA Properties\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3152577				0	om	Maakroota fayyadama tokkoof erga fayyadamte booda isuma deebistee fayyadama biraaf fayyadamuu yoo barbaadde, maakroota sana gulaaluu qabda. $[officename]n maakroota faayiloonni Maykiroosoftii Ofiisii ofkeessatti qabatu fe'uu fi lakkaddaa maakroota kan gulaalaa $[officename] \<link href=\"text/shared/main0600.xhp\" name=\"Basic IDE\"\>Bu'uura IDE\</link\> keessa jiran gulaaluu ni danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152596				0	om	Maakroota VBA akka jiranitti dhiisuu ykn haquu ni dandeessa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3153144				0	om	Galmee Maykiroosoftii Ofiisii kan lakkaddaa maakroota VBA ofkeessatti qabatu bani. Qabeentoota baratamoo(barruu, man'eewwan, Saxaatoo) qofa jijjiiri, maakroota hin gulaaliin. Galmicha akka akaakuu faayiloota Maaykiroosoftii Ofiisiitti olkaa'i. Faayilii Maaykiroosoftii Ofiisii keessatti baniitii, maakroonni VBA akkuma duraaniitti ka'u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3150011				0	om	Maakroota VBA yeeroo fe'amu ykn olkaa'amu faayilii Maykiroosoftii Ofiisii irraa haquu danda'ama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3155366				0	om	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01130100.xhp\" name=\"Load/Save - VBA Properties\"\>Load/Save - VBA Properties\</link\>\</emph\> to set the VBA macro handling of $[officename].				20200411 15:09:53
