helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\breaking_lines.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E0				0	om	Man'ee wardii keessa cita sararaa saaguuf, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\breaking_lines.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E3				0	om	Sararicha naqaatti osoo hin taane, kun kan hojjetu qaree gulaalli barruu man'eecha keessaa waliin qofa. Kanaaf jalqaba man'ichaa lama cuqaasi, achii qubannoo barruu'ichaa bakka cita sararaa barbaaddutti takkaa cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\breaking_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id0509200914160968				0	om	Arfii sarara haaraatiif qaaqa Barbaadii fi Bakkabuusii barbaaduu ni dandeessa\\n akka himannoo idileetti. Barruu faankishinii CHAR(10) gara arfii sarara haraatti saaguuf foormulaa barruu fayyadamuu dandeessa. 				20200411 15:09:53
