helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id1631824				0	om	Faankishiniin keeddeebii %PRODUCTNAME keessatti galmeewwan barruu fi galmeewwan wardiif argama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	om	Jijjiirama galmee keessatti yeroo gulaali uumame eeguuf, \<emph\>Gulaali - jijjiiri - Kuusaawwan Eegi\</emph\> fili. Faankishinii dhaamsuuf ykn jijjiirama fudhachuuf ykn gatuuf iggitaa sirrii dursanii saaguun barbaachisaa dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088				0	om	\<emph\>Kuusaawwan Eegi\</emph\> fili. Kunis qaaqa \<link href=\"text/shared/01/password_dlg.xhp\" name=\"Password\"\>\<emph\>Iggitaa\</emph\>\</link\> bana.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	om	Iggitaa yoo xiqqaate arfiilee 5 irraa ijaarame saagi itti aansuun iggitaa kee dhugoomsi. \<emph\>TOLE\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copytable2application.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Deetaa Wardiiwwan Irraa Saaguu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copytable2application.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154186				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>taattoowwan; geessituu waliin hammanga man'ee maddaatti garagalchuu\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>saaguu ; hammangoota man'ee wardiiwwan irraa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>maxxansuu;hammangoota man'ee wardiiwwan irraa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>dhiyeessota;man'eewwan wardii saaguu\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>galmeewwan barruu;man'eewwan wardii saaguu\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>gabateewwan wardii keessaa ;deetaa faayyadamoota birootti garagalchuu\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copytable2application.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154186				0	om	\<variable id=\"copytable2application\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/copytable2application.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Data From Spreadsheets\"\>Wardiiwwan Irraa Deetaa Saaguu\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copytable2application.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088				0	om	Qabiyyeewwan man'ee qeenxee garagalchuuf gabaticha muraa fayyadami.Foormulaas man'ee irraa garakeessa gabaticha muraatti garagalchuu ni dandeessa ( fakkeenyaaf , sararicha naqaa kabalicha foormulaa irraa) sana booda foormulichi garakeessa barruutti saagamuu ni danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copytable2application.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	om	Hammanga man'ee garakeessa galmee barruutti garagachuuf,hammangaa man'ee wardii keessaa filiitii achii man'eewwaan garakeessa galmicha barruutti saaguuf gabaticha muraa yookiin harkisii ka'I fayyadami.Achii wanta OLE kan irra caalaa gulaaluu dandeessu galmicha barruu keessatti argatta.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copytable2application.xhp	0	help	par_id3146957				0	om	If you drag cells to the normal view of a presentation document, the cells will be inserted there as an OLE object. If you drag cells into the outline view, each cell will form a line of the outline view.				20200411 15:09:53
