helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id1331217				0	om	Foddicha Bu'uuraa keessaa, alerguuf maqaa gabatichaa mirga-cuqaasi.Baafaticha halqara irraa \<emph\>Garagalchi\</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id3806878				0	om	Foddicha Calc haaraa keessaa man'ee A1 cuqaasi, achii \<emph\>Gulaali - Maxxansi\</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id130619				0	om	Amma deeticha gara gosoota faayilii hedduutti ol kaa'uu yookiin alerguu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	hd_id9999694				0	om	Deetaa Bu'uura irraa alaaguu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id8494521				0	om	Faayiloota barruu, faayiloota wardii fi yaadannoo teessoo sirnaakee haalata dubbisuu-qofa qofaan alaaguu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id9579760				0	om	Yommuu faayilii barruu yookiin wardii irraa alaagdu, faayilichi odeeffannoo irraantoo dalagata jalqabaa qabaachuu qaba. Dalaganni lammaffaa faayilichaa dalagata deetaa gataa'aa jalqabaati. Dhangiin dirree dalagata lammaffaa keessaa kamiyyuu dhangii tarjaa waamaraaf murteessa. Yommuu gara Bu'uuraa tti alaagdu odeeffannoon dhangii faayilii wardii irraa kamiyyuu ni bada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id325632				0	om	Fakkeenyaaf, tarjaan jalqabaa dhangii barruu qabaachuu isaa mirkaneessuuf, dirreen jalqabaa dalagata deetaa gataa'aa jalqabaa barruu of keessaa qabaachuu isaa mirkaneeffachuu qabda. Yoo dirreen dalagaticha deetaa gataa'aa jalqabaa lakkoofsa of keessaa qabaa tahe, tarjichi guutuun dhangii lakkoofsaatti qindaa'a, fi barruu osoo hin taane, lakkoofsotni qofa tarjaa sana keessatti agarsiifamu. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id2216559				0	om	Faayilii Bu'uuraa gosa kuusaa deetaa barbaadde sanaa bani.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id7869502				0	om	Faayilii Bu'uuraa haaraa  \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/dabawiz00.xhp\"\>Masaka Kuusdeetaa\</link\> fayyadamuun uumi , yookiin faayilii Bu'uuraa jiraataa kan dubbisuu-qofa hin taane bani.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id9852900				0	om	Faayilii Calc kan deetaa gara Bu'uuraatti alaagamu of keessaa qabate bani. Faayilii *.dbf dBASE yookiin gosoota faayilii hedduu kan biroo  banuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id3791924				0	om	Deeticha gara Bu'uuraatti garagalchamu filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id6173894				0	om	Yoo marfata taasisuu hin barbaadne tahe, Sanduuqa Maqaa keessa wabii hangii kan akka A1:X500 galchuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id533768				0	om	Yoo wardii dBASE garagalchite, dalagata gubbaa kan deetaa irraantoo of keessaa qabu dabali.				20200411 15:09:53
