helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN10681				0	om	Barruu amaloowwan waliin kanneen sududaan dhaangessuun yookiin akkaataaleetiin faayidaa irra oolan barbaaduu ni dandeessa. Fakkeenyaaf, yoo amala \<emph\>Bocquu\</emph\> barbaadde, miseensotni barruu hundi kanneen bocquu durtii hin fayyadamne ni argamu. Barruun hundi kan amala bocquu sududaan lakkaddaa'e qabu, fi barruun hundi bakkatti akkaataan amala bocquu biliqu, ni argamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN10688				0	om	Yoo maqaatiin bocquu kamiyyuu argachuu barbaadde, qabduu \<emph\>Dhangii\</emph\> qaaqa Barreessaa %PRODUCTNAME \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02100000.xhp\"\>Argadhuuti Bakka buusi\</link\> keessaa cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN1069D				0	om	Amaloowwan kanneen barbaaduu barbaaddu erga filattee booda, sanduuqicha\<emph\>Akkaataalee Barbaaduu\</emph\> qaaqa \<emph\>Argadhuuti Bakka buusi \</emph\> naannoo \<emph\>Dirqalee \</emph\> barreessaa %PRODUCTNAME keessaa gara \<emph\>Akkaataalee Dabaluu\</emph\> tti jijjiira.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B0				0	om	Yoo barruu kan keessatti amalootni sududaan dhaangessamanii fi akkaataalee fayyadamuun qindaa'an barbaaduu yoo barbaadde, sanduuqicha \<emph\>Akkaataalee Dabaluu \</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
