helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	par_id3146798	70			0	om	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01010300.xhp\" name=\"File - New - Business Cards\"\>\<emph\>Faayelii - Kaardota bunaqaa -Haaraa\</emph\>\</link\> banuuf\<emph\> kaardota bunaqa qaaqaa \</emph\>fili, kaardonni bunaqaa kee kun maal akka fakkatu filuuf sii hayyama.				20200411 15:09:53
