helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10774				0	om	Wardii keessa jirta yoo ta'ee fi qabeentoonni gabatee muraa man'eewwan wardii yoo ta'an, qaaqni garabiraa \<emph\>Maxxansa Addaa\</emph\> mul'ata. Dirqaleewwan bu'uuraa ykn ol'aanaa fayyadamtee man'eewwan galagalchuuf qaaqa \<emph\>Paste Special\</emph\> fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
