helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN1063C				0	om	Ragaa Argachuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN10640				0	om	You can get a certificate from a certification authority, which may be a private company or a governmental institution. Some certification authorities want money for their service, for example when they certify your identity. Other certificates are free of costs, for example those offered by some e-mail providers, which certify your e-mail address. A few of the companies that offer certificates to private persons are listed in the following, in alphabetical order: \<link href=\"http://www.globalsign.net\"\>GlobalSign\</link\>, \<link href=\"http://www.verisign.com\"\>Verisign\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F6				0	om	Ragaalee ke Taaliguu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070A				0	om	Yoo foddaawwan maayikiroosooftii fayyadamaa jirta tahe, ragaalee kee fuula caancaalaa "Qabiyyeewwan" irraa "Dirqalee Intarneetii " gargar xiqqaa moggargii to'annaa irraa taaliguu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_id8311410				0	om	Ragaa hundee haaraa ke garakeessa tarree Abboomtota Raggaasisuu Hundee Amanamoo tti alaagi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN1071D				0	om	Yoo Soolaarisii yookiin Liinuksii fayyadamaa jirta tahe, faayiloota sirnaa muraasa kanneen icciteessaaf barbaadaman fe'uuf fooyya'aa dhiyoo mosaajjii Thunderbird, Mozilla Suite, yookiin Firefox fe'uu qabda.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN10720				0	om	Yoo danoota adda addaa Thunderbird, Mozilla, yookiin Firefox keessatti uumaa jirta tahe fi ragaaleef danaa murtaa'e tokko fayyadamuuf %PRODUCTNAME barbaaddee,achii ukaankaa danaa murtaa'e sanatti agarsiisuuf jijjiiramaa qeeyyaa MOZILLA_CERTIFICATE_FOLDER qindeessuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_id944242				0	om	Qaaqa fedhiilee iyyaafataa saphaphuu kee baniitii, fuula caancalaa Maatengaa fi Ittisaa filii, Ragaalee irratti cuqaasi - Ragaalee Taaliigi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_id6452223				0	om	Ragaa hundee haaraa ke alaagitii, achii ragicha filiitii gulaali. Yoo xiqqaate gahinsa saphaphuu fi ergaa akka amanamu ragaa hundee dandeessisi. Kuni ragichi galmeewwan ke mallateessuu akka danda'an mirkaneessa.Karaa walfakkatuun ragaa gidduugaleessa kamiyyuu gulaaluu ni dandeessa, garuu galmeewwan galmeessuuf barbaachisaa miti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_id6486098				0	om	Yommuu ragaalee haaraa gulaalaa jirtu, %PRODUCTNAME irra deebii jalqabsiisi.				20200411 15:09:53
