helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN10698				0	om	Erga olkeessee booda, qaaqa \<link href=\"text/shared/01/digitalsignatures.xhp\"\>Mallattoowwan Lakqurxaawaa\</link\> ni argita. Galmichatti furtuu uummataa ida'uuf \<emph\>Ida'i\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AE				0	om	Qaaqicha \<link href=\"text/shared/01/selectcertificate.xhp\"\>Select Certificate\</link\> keessaa, galmeeke filadhuuti TOLE cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C0				0	om	Qaaqa Mallattoowwan Lakqurxaawaan bakka itti ragaalee dabalataa yoo barbaadde ida'uu dandeessu amma ni argita. Faayilicha olkaa'ametti furtuu uummataa ida'uuf TOLE cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C3				0	om	Galmeen mallattaa'e sajoo \<image id=\"img_id262764\" src=\"xmlsecurity/res/certificate_16.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id262764\"\>sajoo\</alt\>\</image\> kabala haalojii keessaa agarsiisa. Ragicha ilaaluuf sajoo kabala haalojii keessaa lama cuqaasuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_id2008200911381426				0	om	Bu'aan mallattoo mirkaneessaa kabala haalojii fi qaaqa mallattoo lakqurxaawaa keessatti mul'ata. Galmee fi mallattoon maayikiroo baay'een galmee ODF keessatti argamuu danda'u. Yoo mallatticha waliin rakkoon jiraate, mirkaneessi bu'aa mallattoo sana mallattoo hundaaf tilmaamama. Innis, yoo mallattoo gataa'aa kudhan fi mallattoo fashalaa tokko ta'an, kabala haalojii fi kabala dirree qaaqa keessatti alabaa dhaabii akka fashalaa'u godha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E0				0	om	Maakroota galmee keessaa mallatteessuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E4				0	om	Barsiisaan, maakrootni kutaa galmeeti. Yoo galmee mallatteesite,maakrootni galmee keessaa ofumaan mallatteeffamu. Yoo galmicha osoo hin tahiin maakroota qofa mallatteessuu barbaadde,akka armaan gadiitti darbi:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EA				0	om	\<emph\>Meeshaalee - Maakroota - Mallattoo Lakqurxaawaa\</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F2				0	om	Akka olitti galmeewwaniif ibsametti mallatticha fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F5				0	om	Yommuu IDE Bu'uuraa kan maakiroota mallattaa'an qabate bantu, kabala haalojii keessaa sajoo \<image id=\"img_id9252296\" src=\"xmlsecurity/res/certificate_16.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id9252296\"\>Sajoo\</alt\>\</image\> ni argita. Raqicha ilaaluuf sajoo kabala haalojii keessaa lama cuqaasuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
