helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id9173253				0	om	Many questions and answers are the same for %PRODUCTNAME software and for the commercial office software.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150667				0	om	Iddoola saphaphuu %PRODUCTNAME irra, \<link href=\"https://support.openoffice.org\"\>support.openoffice.org\</link\> gargaarsa argachuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154230				0	om	Goolaba tajaajilawwan gargaarsa ammeetiif, faayilii \<emph\>Nadubisii\</emph\>, ukaankaa \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> keessaa daawadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id26327				0	om	Fuuloota gargaarsaa afaan naannoo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id1318380				0	om	Piroojektootii biyyoomsuu %PRODUCTNAME, fuuloota gargaarsaa afaan naannootiin laatu. Piroojektoota afaan dhalootaa mul'annoo \<link href=\"https://projects.openoffice.org/native-lang.html\"\>projects.openoffice.org/native-lang.html\</link\> irra barbaadi. Gargarsafi deeggarsa iddoola saphaphuu %PRODUCTNAME \<link href=\"https://support.openoffice.org\"\>support.openoffice.org\</link\>.irraa afaan Ingiliziitiin argachuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id2611386				0	om	Tarreewwan ergannoo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3166335				0	om	Waa'ee %PRODUCTNAME gaafadhutii, ofiin duuloo irraa gargaarsa barbaadi, tarreewwan ergannoo matadureewwan gargaarsaa irratti marii godhu. Iddoola saphaphuu %PRODUCTNAME \<link href=\"https://www.openoffice.org/mail_list.html\"\>www.openoffice.org/mail_list.html\</link\> irratti tarreewwan ergannoo waliigala fi addaa argachuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id0915200811081722				0	om	Walga'ii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0915200811081778				0	om	You can access web forums to ask and answer questions about %PRODUCTNAME.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id0804200803314150				0	om	Ittisa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0804200803314235				0	om	Yeroo ati waa'ee ittisaa mosaajjii kana fayyadamuun waliin hojjettutti, dagaagsitoota tarree ergaa ummataa  \<link href=\"https://www.openoffice.org/security/index.html\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Security\</link\> tin qunnamuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
