helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3497211				0	om	Galmeessa akka faayilii PDF 'tti , how-tos, akkasumas qajeelchoota iddoola saphaphuu %PRODUCTNAME  \<link href=\"https://documentation.openoffice.org\"\>documentation.openoffice.org\</link\>irraa naqachuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id0120200910361765				0	om	Hirmaadhuu fi deebisii kenni				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0120200910361848				0	om	Ummata addunyaa waliin %PRODUCTNAME keessatti hirmaannaa si'ataa qabaachuu yoo barbaadde, dubdeebii kennuuf, amaloota mari'achuuf, wanta dabaltaa gaarii kennuuf, FAQ keessatti barruu mataa kee barreessuuf, akkamitti, hujeekaan, irrabahii viidiyoo uumuuf anaa dhufu jedhamta.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0120200910361874				0	om	Daawwadhu \<link href=\"https://documentation.openoffice.org/\"\>Iddoola saphaphuu galmeessa\</link\> ykn \<link href=\"https://wiki.openoffice.org/wiki/Documentation\"\> Fuula jalqabaa wiikii\</link\> fi hirmaattootaaf geessitoota duukaa bu'i.				20200411 15:09:53
