helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156062				0	om	Toorbarruuwwan hiika fayyadamaa of keessatti qaba. Toorbarruuwwan gulaaluu yookaan haquu dandeessa, yookaan gara fuuloota walgitaniitti ce'uuf irratti cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150699				0	om	The Help references the default settings of the program on a system that is set to defaults. Descriptions of colors, mouse actions, or other configurable items can be different for your program and system.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150618				0	om	\<emph\>$[officename] Sirni gargaartuu\</emph\> karaa salphaa odeeffannoo fi gargaarsa itti argannu nuuf kenna. Naannoo gargaartuu keessatti\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000110.xhp\" name=\"Help environment\"\>wanta ilaaluu barbaadnu arguuf karaalee hedduutu jira \</link\>: Jecha ijoo tokko barbaaduu dandeessa\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000130.xhp\" name=\"Index\"\>Kasaa\</link\>, barbaada barruu guutuu raawwachuuf \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000140.xhp\" name=\"Find\"\>Find\</link\>, yookaan tarree sadarkaalee keessa ilaali \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000160.xhp\" name=\"Topics\"\>Matadureewwan\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
