helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3152552				0	om	Fankiishiniin barbaada guutuu barruu $[officename] Gargaartuu keessaa makii jechoota  barbaadi kamiyyuu galmeewwan Gargaartuu barbaaduudhaaf si dandeessa.Kana gochuuf, \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> keessatti jecha tokko ykn tokkoo ol katabi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	om	Dirreen barruu\<emph\>Jecha barbaadi\</emph\>jechoota jalqaba galchite kuusa. Barbaada duraa irra deebi'uuf, sarjoo xiyyaa cuqaasuun jechicha tarree keessaa filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3155941				0	om	Erga barbaadi raawwateen booda, matadureewwan galmee tarree keessatti mul'atu. Galfata lama cuqaasi yookaan galmee gargaartuu walfakaataa fe'uuf filadhu \<emph\>Agarsiisi\</emph\>cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958				0	om	Barbaadni akka matadureewwan galmee irratti qofa ta'uuf\<emph\>Matadureewwan keessaa qofa\</emph\>sanduuqa filannoo fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3147210				0	om	Sanduuqni filannoo\<emph\>Jechoota guutuu qofa\</emph\> barbaada sirrii akka gootu si dandeessisa. Yoo saanduqni kum mallattefame, jechootni haanquun hin argataman. Yoo jechi barbaadi kee akka qaama jecha dheeraatti argama taanaan sanduuqicha hin mallateessiin.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3146798				0	om	Makaa jechoota barbaadde galchuu dandeessa, iddooleetin kan adda bahan. Barbaadni qub-sukanaawaa miti.				20200411 15:09:53
