helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153825	2			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS\"\>Tarreewwan fayyadamaan qindaa'an marti gongee dhaamsaa\<emph\> Tarreewwan tarreen kaawuu \</emph\>keessatti mul'ata. Tarree mataa keetiis qindeessuu fi gulaaluu dandeessa. Barruu qofatu akka tarreewwan tarreen kaawuu gargaara, lakkoofsi hin ta'u.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
