helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3158409				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS:BTN_COPY\"\>Qabiyyeewwan maadheelee sanduuqa \<emph\>Tarree kanarraa garagalchi\</emph\> keessaa garagalcha. Yoo wabiilee tarreewwanii fi sarjaalee firoomanitti filatte, gongeen dhaamsaa \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060401.xhp\" name=\"Copy List\"\>\<emph\>Tarree Garagalchaa\</emph\>\</link\> erga qabduu cuqaastee booda mul'ata. Gongee dhaamsaa kanatti fayyadamuudhaan akka wabiin gara tarreewwan tartiibaa tarreen yookiin sarjaan jijjiiraman qindeessuu dandeessa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
