helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156343				0	om	Qubeelee maxxansamuu hin dandeenye kamtu argii irratti akka mul'atan qindeessa. Saajoo \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03100000.xhp\" name=\"Non-printing Characters On/Off\"\>\<emph\>Qubeelee maxxansamuu hin dandeenye \</emph\>\</link\> kabala \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> kakaasi. Qubeeleen fuula caancala  \<emph\>Gargaarsa tottolchaa\</emph\> irraa filatte hundi ni mul'atu.				20200411 15:09:53
