helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3147230	32			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTSHDWCRSR_CB_SHYPH\"\>Akka daangessitoonni fayyadamaan qindaa'an mul'atan ifteessa. Kunneen daangessitoota dhokatoo kan jecha keessatti  \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+Hyphen(-) \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl+Hyphen(-) tuquudhaan galchitu dha.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> Jechootni fayyadamaan daangessaman dhuma sararaa iddoo itti daangaan fakkadamaan saagame qofaatti addaan ba'a, murfootni ufmaan kaka'anis dhiisanis hin ilaallatu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
