helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149020				0	om	Dirqaalaalee saagaa qaree kallattiif qindeessa.Yoo qubannoo kamiyyuu galmee kee keessaa cuqaaste,keeyyatni haaraa qubannoo kana irratti barreeffama yookiin saagama.Amalootni keeyyata kanaa dirqaala filatame irratti hundaa'a. Dirqaalaalee armaan gadii keessaa filachuu dandeessa:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148995				0	om	Keeyyata walqixxeessuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156384	10			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_OPTSHDWCRSR:RB_SHDWCRSFILLMARGIN\"\>Yeroo qareen kallachaa fayyadu walqixxeessa keeyyataa qindeessa. Akka antuutteen cuqaasame irraatti hundaa'uudhaan,keeyyatni bitaan,jidduun yookiin mirgaan walqixxaatee tottolfama. Qareen cuqaasa antuuttee duraa, rogsadeedhaan, walqixxeessa kamtu akka qindeeffame agrsiisa. \</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150387				0	om	Marfata keeyyata bitaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3151188	12			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_OPTSHDWCRSR:RB_SHDWCRSFILLINDENT\"\>Yeroo qareen kallachaa fayyadu, galumsi keeyyata bitaan iddoo ati qaree kallachaa cuqaastetti dalga qindaa'a.Keeyyatni bitaan walqixxaata. \</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
