helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01041000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10849				0	om	If the option is off, table cells will be formatted as in Writer versions prior to StarOffice 8 or OpenOffice.org 2.0. If the option is on, an alternative method of formatting table cells will be applied. The option is on by default for new documents created with %PRODUCTNAME %PRODUCTVERSION and for documents imported from Microsoft Word format.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01041000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1084C				0	om	Qubannoo waanta %WRITERCOMPATIBILITYVERSIONOOO11 fayyadami				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01041000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10864				0	om	Akkaataa qubannoo waantota bololi'anii kan qubeetti yookiin keeyyatatti kallattii jalaa fi gubbaa iddoo keeyyataatti hidhaman ifteessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01041000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10867				0	om	If the option is on, the floating objects are positioned as in Writer versions prior to StarOffice 8 or OpenOffice.org 2.0. If the option is off, the floating objects are positioned using an alternative method that is similar to the method used by Microsoft Word. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01041000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1086A				0	om	Dirqaalli galmeelee haaraaf gara cufaatti jijjiirama. Galmeelee Barreessaa fooyya'a %PRODUCTNAME %PRODUCTVERSION dura uumameef dirqaalli banaa dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01041000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10821				0	om	Marsaa barruu naannawa waantotaa %WRITERCOMPATIBILITYVERSIONOOO11 fayyadami				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01041000.xhp	0	help	par_id4016541				0	om	MS Word fi Barreessaan marsaa barruu naannawa argiirra waantotaa bololi'an adeemsa garaa garaa qabu. Waanti argii irra bololi'u MS word keessatti goodayyaa barreessaa fi waantota fakkisaa, akkasumas 'sanduuqa barruu' waantotaa, 'saxaatoo', 'goodayyaa', 'fakkii' kkf.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01041000.xhp	0	help	par_id7280190				0	om	MS Word fi Barreessaa fooyya'aa ammeef keessatti, qabiyyeen mataduree/jalee fuulaa fi qabiyyeen miiljalee/ibsa dabalataa naannawa waantota argii bololi'an irratti hin maramu. Qabiyyeen ijoo barruu naannawa waantota argii bololi'anii irratti marama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01041000.xhp	0	help	par_id2782982				0	om	Fooyyaa'aa Barreessaa isa StarOffice 8 ykn OpenOffice.org 2.0 duraa keessatti, faallaan dhugaadha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01041000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10892				0	om	Yoo dirqaalli cufaa ta'e, kan qindaa'ina durtii ta'e, marsaa barruu haaraatu raawwata. Yoo dirqaalli banaa ta'e, marsaa barruu duraaniitu raawwata.				20200411 15:09:53
