helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159399	6			0	om	\<variable id=\"codetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR:CHECKBOX:RID_OFAPAGE_MSFILTEROPT:CB_WBAS_CODE\"\>Lakaddaa bu'uuraa galmee Microsoft irraa muraa bu'uura addaa $[officename] galmee wajjiniitti olkaa'uu fi fe'a. Lakaddaan bu'uuraa Microsoft dandeessifama alata ta'e IDE bu'uuraa  $[officename] keessatti \<emph\>Sub\</emph\> and \<emph\>End Sub\</emph\> jidduutti mul'ata.\</ahelp\> Lakaddicha gulaaluu dandeessa. Yeroo galmee gita $[officename] tiin olkeessu, lakkaddaan Bu'uuraas akkanuma olkaa'ama. Yeroo gita biraan olkeessu, lakaddaan bu'uuraa IDE bu'uuraa $[officename] irraa hin olkaa'amu. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153824				0	om	Lakaddaa Bu'uuraa jalqabaa olkaa'i				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150084				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR:CHECKBOX:RID_OFAPAGE_MSFILTEROPT:CB_WBAS_STG\"\>Specifies that the original Microsoft Basic code contained in the document is held in a special internal memory for as long as the document remains loaded in $[officename]. When saving the document in Microsoft format the Microsoft Basic is saved again with the code in an unchanged form.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153088				0	om	Yeroo gita Microsoft ala gita biraan olkeessu,lakaddaan bu'uuraa Microsoft hin olkaa'amu.Fakkeenyaaf,yoo galmeen lakaddaa bu'uuraa Microsoft qabaatee fi gita $[officename] tiin olkeesse,akka lakkaddaan Microsoft bu'uuraa ol hin kaa'amne of eeggachiisa agarta.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151246				0	om	Sanduuqni dhugoomsaa \<emph\>Ammas lakaddaa bu'uuraa jalqabaa olkaa'i\</emph\> dursa sanduuqa dhugoomsaa \<emph\>Lakaddaa bu'uuraa gulaaluuf fe'i\</emph\> irraa fudhata. Yoo sanduuqni lachuu mallattaa'anii fi lakaddaan bu'uuraa IDE bu'uuraa $[officename] keessaa hin dandeessifamne gulaalte, lakaddaan bu'uuraa Maayikiroosooftii yeroo gita Maayikiroosooftii tiin olkeessu olkaa'ama. Kana sitti himuuf ergaan ni mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148946	19			0	om	Vaayirasoota macro bu'uuraa Maayikiroosooftii danda'aman kamiyyuu balleessuuf, sanduuqa dhugoomsaa \<emph\>Lakaddaa Bu'uuraa jalqabaa olkaa'i\</emph\> mallattaa'uu dhorkiitii galmee gita Maayikiroosooftii tiin olkaa'i. Galmeen lakaddaa bu'uuraa Maayikiroosooftii malee olkaa'ame.				20200411 15:09:53
