helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150400	11			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCPAGE_LAYOUT_CB_FORMAT\"\>Akka amaloota tottolchaa maadhee filatamee madheelee cinaatti irrattis ufmaan raawwatan ifteessa.\</ahelp\> Yoo, fakkeenyaaf, qabiyyeewwan madhee filatamee amala yabbuu qabaate, amalli yabbuun kun maadheelee cinaatiifis ni raawwata. Maadheeleen duraanuu gita addaa qaban dalagaa kanaan hin fooyya'an. Daangee gaafatame \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> tuquudhaan + qaxxaamura * (mallattoo baay'isuu). Gitni kun gatiilee haaraa daangaa kana keessatti saagaman hundaafis ni raawwata. Qindaa'inoonni durtii baratamoon maadhee daangaa kana alaatiif raawwatu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148451				0	om	Yeroo sarjaalee/tarreewwan haaraan saagaman wabiilee babal'isi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCPAGE_LAYOUT_CB_EXPREF\"\>Akka wabiileen yeroo sarjaaleen yookiin tarreewwan cina daangaa wabiitti saagaman babal'atan ifteessa. Kun kan danda'amu yoo daangaan wabii, iddoo sarjaan yookiin tarreen saagame, jalqabaan yoo xiqqaate kan maadheelee lama kallattii barbaadameen haguuge dha.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153194				0	om	\<emph\>Fakkeenya:\</emph\> Yoo daangaan A1:B1 foormulaa keessatti wabeeffame fi sarjaa B booda sarjaa haaraa saagde, wabiin gara A1:C1 babal'ata. Yoo daangaan A1:B1 wabeeffamee fi tarreen haaraan tarree 1 jalatti saagame, wabiin hin babal'atu, haajaa maadheen tokko qofti kallattii gadiin jiruufuu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150449				0	om	Yoo tarreewwanii yookiin sarjaalee walakkaa bal'ina wabiilee keessatti saagde, wabiin yeroo hundaa ni babal'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
