helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154918				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SVXPAGE_INET_SEARCH:ED_CASE\"\>Barbaacha raawwachuuf walsima qubee murteessa.\</ahelp\> Tarreen galfatoota armaan gadii qabata: \<emph\>Homaa\</emph\>, \<emph\>Guddaa\</emph\> and \<emph\>Xiqqaa\</emph\>. Jechootni barbaachaa barreeffaman haala filannoo keetiin jijjiiramu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149262				0	om	Mala barbaadotni gaafata haala caasaa isaaniitiin adda simatu.Fakkeenyaaf,kaan walsima qubee fedhu kaan immoo hin fedhan.Sababa kanaaf,\<emph\>Homaa\</emph\>akka dirqaala walsima qubeetti filachuun baay'ee gaariidha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156283				0	om	Haaraa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149413				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_INET_SEARCH:PB_NEW\"\>Mala barbaadaa haaraa dabaluuf qabduu kana fayyadami.\</ahelp\>\<emph\>Haaraa\</emph\> galfatoota barbaachisoo hunda kan akka "Maqaa" fi "Dursoo" balleessa. Mala barbaadaa haaraa odeeffannoo barbaachisoo hunda wajjin galchi. Galfatoota kee akkuma \<emph\>Dabali\</emph\> dhaan simatteen, mala barbaadaan haaraa tarree mala barbaadaa \<emph\>Keessaa barbaadi\</emph\> jalatti mul'ata. Gongee dhaamsaa qabduu \<emph\>Eeyyee\</emph\> dhaan cufi.				20200411 15:09:53
