helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144761				0	om	Jalqaba sararaarra miti:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156214				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_EDIT_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_ED_START\"\>Qubeelee kan jalqaba sararaa irratti qofaa isaanii argamuu hin dandeenye ifteessa.\</ahelp\> Yoo qubeen asitti barreeffame addaan baasaa sararaa booda jalqaba sararaa irratti qubachiifame, ufmaan gara sarara duraaniitti deema. Fakkeenyaaf, raajeffannoon dhuma himaa yoo qaama tarree \<emph\>Jalqaba sararaarra miti\</emph\> ta'e tasumaa jalqaba sararaa irratti hin mul'atu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154908				0	om	Dhuma sararaarra miti:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153367	26			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_EDIT_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_ED_END\"\>Qubeelee kan dhuma sararaa irratti qofaa isaanii argamuu hin dandeenye ifteessa.\</ahelp\> Yoo qubeen asitti barreeffame addaan baasaa sararaan dhuma sararaa irratti qubachiifame, ufmaan gara jalqaba sarara itti aanuutti deema. Fakkeenyaaf, mallattoon maallaqaa kan fuuldura hangaatti argamu yoo qaama tarree\<emph\> Dhuma sararaarra miti\</emph\> ta'e dhuma sararaa irratti hin mul'atu.				20200411 15:09:53
