helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3156444				0	om	Iftoominni kallachaan maxxansaatti bahuu hin danda'u. Bal'inni galmee kan iftoomni keessatti mul'atu kanaafuu hogayyuu akka bitmaps shallagamee gara maxxansaa ergama. Hanga bitmaps fi rukkina maxxansaa irratti hundaa'uudhaan deetaan guddaa argamuu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
