helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	hd_id6065248				0	om	Lakkoofsotaaf gitoo biyyaa 'English (USA)' fayyadami				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	par_id8023926				0	om	When importing numbers from an HTML page, the decimal separator and the thousands separator characters differ according to the locale of the HTML page. The clipboard however contains no information about the locale. For example, the characters "1.000" copied from a German Web page most possibly mean "one thousand" because the period is the thousands separator in a German locale. If copied from an English Web page, the same characters stand for the number 1 as in "one dot zero zero zero".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	par_id7658314				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>If not checked, numbers will be interpreted according to the setting in \<emph\>Language Settings - Language of - Locale setting\</emph\> in the Options dialog box. If checked, numbers will be interpreted as 'English (USA)' locale.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145068				0	om	Iyyaatoota HTML hin beekamne akka badheeleetti alaa galchi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149295				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR:CHECKBOX:RID_OFAPAGE_HTMLOPT:CB_UNKNOWN_TAGS\"\>Yoo \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#tags\" name=\"tags\"\>tags\</link\> kan $[officename] dhaan hin beekamne akka alaa akka badheeleetti galan barbaadde sanduuqa kana mallatteessi.\</ahelp\> Iyyaatoo banaaf, badheen HTML_ON gatii maqaa iyyaatootiin uumama. Iyyaatoo cuftuuf, HTML_OFF uumama. Badheeleen kun ala baha HTML keessatti gara iyyaatootti jijjiiramu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148797				0	om	Qindaa'inoota bocquu dhiisi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149202	44			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR:CHECKBOX:RID_OFAPAGE_HTMLOPT:CB_IGNORE_FONTNAMES\"\>Yeroo keessatti galchitu qindaa'inoota bocquu hunda dhiisuuf sanduuqa dhugoomsaa kana mallatteessi. Bocquuwwan haalata fuula HTML keessatti qindaa'an bocquuwwan fayyadan ta'u. \</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151177				0	om	Alatti baasi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150449				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR:LISTBOX:RID_OFAPAGE_HTMLOPT:LB_EXPORT\"\>Qindaa'inoota galmeelee HTML alatti baasuuf ta'an qindeessa.\</ahelp\> Gita HTML dhaan alatti baasuuf faayilii gosa \<emph\>Galmee HTML \</emph\> gongee dhaamsaa \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01070000.xhp\" name=\"Save As\"\>\<emph\>Save As\</emph\>\</link\> filadhu. Qajeelfamoota dabalataa \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000020.xhp\" name=\"Import and export filters\"\>Calaloota Alatti baasuu fi keessatti galchuu\</link\> keessaa argachuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145606				0	om	Alatti baasa HTML guutolchuuf, sadarkaa iyyaaftaa yookiin HTML sanduuqa alatti baasuu keessaa filadhu. Yoo "$[officename] Writer" filatame, qajeelfamootni murtaa'aa $[officename] Writer alatti ba'u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155132				0	om	Bu'uura $[officename]				20200411 15:09:53
