helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150872				0	om	Dirqaala kana barreeffama bu'uuraa $[officename] osoo hin uumin dura kakaasuu qabda, kana malee $[officename] waan saagamuu baatufi.Barreeffamoonni bu'uuraa $[officename] mata duree galmee HTML keessatti argamuu qabu.				20200411 15:09:53
