helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3155307				0	om	Yeroo galnmee HTML alaagdu, iyyatawwan META ofumaan gara dirreewwan$[officename] jijjiirama: <META HTTP-EQUIV="REFRESH"...> and <META NAME="..." ...> yemmuu NAMEn walqixa AUTHOR, CREATED, CHANGED, CHANGEDBY, DESCRIPTION, KEYWORDS ykn CLASSIFICATION ta'e.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3146146				0	om	Barruulee,yaadawwaniifi iyyatawwan SARARA UUMAME kallattiin fuuldura GABATEE iyyataa fuulduratti qubatan jalqaba man'ee gabatee keessatti salgamniini				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3155366				0	om	Barruuleenii fi iyyata SARARA UUMAMEE irrantoo galmee jalqaba galmee keessatti alaagamuun korkodaa'eera.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3152885				0	om	To set the options for importing HTML tags, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Load/Save - HTML Compatibility\</emph\>. A known META tag contains either "HTTP-EQUIV" or "NAME", and are imported as $[officename] comments. The only exception is <META NAME="GENERATOR"...>, which is ignored.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163717				0	om	Qacceewwan Aleergi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3159180				0	om	Yaadannowwanii fi barruun ka'uumsa jalqaba keewwata galmee keessaa gara irrantoo galmee HTMLtti aleergamu. Yoo galmeen gabateedhan jal qabe, keewwanni jalqaba man'ee duraa gabatee gara irrantoo galmee HTMLtti aleergamu.				20200411 15:09:53
