helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Bib/autoFilter\"\>Dirree deetaa jecha sanduuqa \<emph\>Furtuu Barabaachaa\</emph\> keessatti galchitee fayyadamuu barbaaduu feetee filuuf dheeraa cuqaasi. Dirree deetaa tokko qofa barbaaduu dandeessa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
