helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id9824518.00000001				0	om	Arfiilee kenname bakka bu'a ta'uu baannan ifteefameera.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3152427				0	om	.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149031				0	om	Arfii baaqqee kamuu cita sararaattii ala ykn cita keewwataa bakka bu'a. Fakkenyaaf jecha "sh.rt" lamaanuu deebisa "qomee fi gabaabaa"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154682				0	om	^				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155351				0	om	Jecha barbaadii qofa barbaada. Yoo jechi jalqabaa keewwataa wantoota addayaa kanneen akka dirreewwan duwwa ykn arfii-goodayyaawwan korkodaaye jalqabbiin keewwataa tuffatamaniini. Fakkenyaaf: "^peter".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3159194				0	om	$				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3152542				0	om	Jecha barbaadii qofa barbaada. Yoo jechi xumura keewwataatti mul'ata. Wantoonni addayaa kanneen akka dirreewwan duwwaa ykn arfii keewwataa tuffatamaniiru Fakkenyaaf: "pete$".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3156414				0	om	*				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	om	Arfilee zeeroo ykn isaa ol fuuldura "*". Fakkenyaf, "Ab*c"barbaada"Ac","Abc", "Abbc", "Abbbc", fi kan kaanneen fakkaatu barbaada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147399				0	om	+				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958				0	om	Arifiilee tokko ykn isaa ol fuulduura"+". Fakkenyaaf, "Ax+41" barbaada "Ax*41", garuu "Ax*4" miti barbaada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145313				0	om	Diraa baay'ee dheeraa barbaacha kana kan miilu haala keewwata keessaa yeroo hundaa argama. Keewwanni yoo diraa "Ax4ax4" karaan hundi shoolame.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	om	?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153684				0	om	Arfiilee zeeroo ykn tokkoo fuula dura "?" barbaada. Fakkenyaf, "Barruulee" barbaa "Barruu" fi "Baruulee" fi "x(ab|c)?y" barbaada "xy", "xaby" ykn "xcy".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	om	\\				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209				0	om	Arfii addayaa hiikuu kan "\\" akka arfii bartamootti hordofuu fi akka himannoo idileetti miti (waliin makiisaan ala \\n, \\t, \\>, fi \\<). fakkeenyaaf, "tree\\." "tree.", not "treed" ykn "trees" barbaada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3152945				0	om	\\n				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153700				0	om	Sarara citaa walmakiinsa furtuu Shift + Enter walin sagamee ture bakka bu'a. Sarara citaa keewwata citaa keessatti jijjiiruuf \<emph\>\\n\</emph\> \<emph\>Barbaachaa\</emph\> keessatti galchiiti sanduuqawwan \<emph\>Bakkabuusi\</emph\> ittaansuudhaan barbaaduufi bakka buusuu hojadhuu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id9262672				0	om	\\n \<emph\>Barbaacha\</emph\> keessatti, sanduuqni barruu cita sarara wal makiinsa furtuu Shift+Enter waliin sagamee tuureef dhaabbata. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id2366100				0	om	\\n\<emph\>Bakka buusii\</emph\>  waliin saagamuu danda'u bakka bu'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153258				0	om	\\t				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3157809				0	om	Caancala bakka bu'a. Dabalataaniis himannoo kana sanduuqa \<emph\>Bakka buusiin\</emph\> waliin fayyadamuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150670				0	om	\\<				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153666				0	om	Match a word boundary. For example, "\\bbook" finds "bookmark" but not "checkbook" whereas "book\\b" finds "checkbook" but not "bookmark". The discrete word "book" is found by both search terms.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149576				0	om	^$				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3151245				0	om	Keewwata duwwaa barbaada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550				0	om	^.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413				0	om	Arfii ka'uumsa keewwataa barbaada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147282				0	om	& ykn $0				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153961				0	om	Diraa ulaagaa barbaaduuttin argame sanduuqa \<emph\>Barbaachaf\</emph\> keessaa argame gara jecha sanduuqaa \<emph\>Barbaacha waliin\</emph\> keessaatti yeroo bakka bu'iinsa taasiftu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149650				0	om	Fakkeenyaaf, Sanduuqa \<emph\>Barbaacha\</emph\> keessatti yoo galchitu fi "&goodayyaa" sanduuqa \<emph\>Bakkabuusuu waliin\</emph\> keessatti jechi "foddaan" foddaa goodayyaadhaan bakka bu'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150543				0	om	Dabalataanis, "&" sanduuqa \<emph\>Bakka buusaa\</emph\> keessatti galchuu dandeessa \<emph\>Amaloota\</emph\> ykn \<emph\>Dhangii\</emph\> diraa ulaagaa barbaachaatiin argamu fooyyessuuf.				20200411 15:09:53
