helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149167				0	om	Represents any of the characters that are between a and e, including both start and end characters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id100520090232005				0	om	The characters are ordered by their code numbers.				20200411 15:09:53
