helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3148676				0	om	Arfiilee kamuu kan a-e gidduu fi h-x bakka bu'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145318				0	om	[^a-s]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153351				0	om	Represents everything that is not between a and s.				20200411 15:09:53
