helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	om	Arfii addayaa lakkaddaa kudhijabee lakkqurxa-afur ofii isaa irratti hundaa'e bakka bu'a. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3159252				0	om	Lakkaddayyi arfii addayyaa bocaquu fayyadu irratti hundaa'a. \<emph\>Saaguu-Arfii Addaayaa\</emph\> filuudhaan lakkaddaawwan mul'isuun ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153951				0	om	|				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154985				0	om	Finds the terms that occur before the "|" and also finds the terms that occur after the "|". For example, "this|that" finds "this" and "that".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147376				0	om	{2}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150103				0	om	Defines the number of times that the character in front of the opening bracket occurs. For example, "tre{2}" finds and selects "tree".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3151289				0	om	{1,2}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147317				0	om	Defines the minimum and maximum number of times that the character in front of the opening bracket can occur. For example, "tre{1,2}" finds and selects "tre" and "tree".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id4870754				0	om	{1,}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id843836				0	om	Lakkoofas sa'aatiiwwan kan arfii fuuldura sadallaa banuutti uumamuu danda'u hiika. Fakkeenyaaf ,"tre{2,}" "mucha" "treee fi" "treeeee" hiika.				20200411 15:09:53
