helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153573				0	om	Arfiileen golbee lakkuu keessa akka wabii,ittaansuun gara wabii jalqabaa himannoo waliini ammee keessaa wabeffachuu dandeessa "\\1", waabii lammaffa "\\2" fi kkf.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3156061				0	om	Fakkeenyaaf, yoo barruun kee lakkofsa 13487889 qabatee fi himannoo idilee fayyadamuu dhaan (8)7\\1\\1,"8788" barbaaduu ni argama.				20200411 15:09:53
