helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3152876				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OFAPAGE_AUTOCORR_EXCEPT\"\>Gabaajeewwanii fi walmakinsa qubee $[officename] hin barbaadne ofumaan sirreessuuf murteessi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154926				0	om	Quxaaleen hiiktu qindaa'ina afaan ammee irratti hundaa'a. Yoo barbaadde, qindaa'ina afaan fi jijjiiruu ni dandeessa, afaan garagara \<emph\>Bakka bu'iinsaa\</emph\> fi quxaalee keessaa sanduuqa afaanif.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149205				0	om	Bakka bu'iinsaa fi quxaalee keessaa sanduuqa afaanif:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3156027				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AUTOCORR_LANGUAGE\"\>Afaan kan seeroota bakka bu'insaa uumuu ykn gulaaluu barbaade fili.\</ahelp\> $[officename] jalqaba quxaaleef kan afaaniif qubannoo qarree ammeef galmee keessatti hikaman barbaada, ittaansuudhaan afaanota hafan barbaada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153681				0	om	Gabaajeewwan (no subsequent capital)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR:EDIT:RID_OFAPAGE_AUTOCORR_EXCEPT:ED_ABBREV\"\>Gabaajee tuqaadhaan hordofamu barreessi, ittaansuudhaan \<emph\>Haaraa\</emph\> cuqaasi. Kunis $[officename] ofumaan qubee jalqabaa jecha tuqaan booda dhuma gabaa jetti dhufu akka qubee guuddaa hin taanee dhoowwaa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149751				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR:LISTBOX:RID_OFAPAGE_AUTOCORR_EXCEPT:LB_ABBREV\"\>Gabaajeewwan ofumaan hisirroofne tarreessa.\</ahelp\> Maalima fili ittiansuudhaan \<emph\>Haqi\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151110				0	om	Jechoota Qubee guguddaa Qubdura Lama waliin				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR:EDIT:RID_OFAPAGE_AUTOCORR_EXCEPT:ED_DOUBLE_CAPS\"\>Jecha ykn gabaajee qubee gurgurddattin jalqabu kan $[officename] qubdura qubee guguddaa tokkootti jijjiiruu hin barbaadne barreessa. Fakkenyaaf, $[officename] kompitara Matayyaa dhaagara kompitara matayyaatti akka hin jijjiramne ittisuuf PC galchi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3143271				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR:LISTBOX:RID_OFAPAGE_AUTOCORR_EXCEPT:LB_DOUBLE_CAPS\"\>Jechoota ykn gabaajeewwan qabdura lamaan jalqabanii qubee guguddaa ofiin hin sirroofne tarreessa. Jechoonni marri kan qubeewwan guguddaadhaan jalqaban dirree keessatti tarreeffamaniiru.\</ahelp\> Maalima tarree irraa haquuf, maalima fili, ittaansuudhaan \<emph\>Haqi\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
