helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01100600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C9				0	om	To protect the recording state with a password, click \<emph\>Protect\</emph\> and enter a password. Other users of this document can apply their changes, but they cannot disable change recording without knowing the password.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01100600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D0				0	om	Protect / Unprotect				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01100600.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D4				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"703992336\"\>Protects the change recording state with a password. If change recording is protected for the current document, the button is named \<emph\>Unprotect\</emph\>. Click \<emph\>Unprotect\</emph\> and type the correct password to disable the protection.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
