helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150866	99			0	om	Dhangiin lakkaddaa mahaallaqootaa whaala [$xxx-nnn] fayyadama, haallaqaa xxx lakkadda biyyaati. Mallaattowwan addayaa hojiin mahaallaqaa, kanneen EUR (for Euro) hin barbaadu. Dhangiin mahaallaqaa afaan irratti hin hundaa'u kan ati sanduuqa \<emph\>Afaanii\</emph\> keessaa filtu. 				20200411 15:09:53
