helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id3994567				0	om	Qindaa'inni danda'amaan fuula caancala \<emph\>Deetaa\</emph\> too'annoo kan hundaa'u too'annoo duraa duubanii. Dirqaalee too'annoo ammee fi halqaraaf jireessa ta'an qofa ilaaluu dandeessa. Dirreewwan armaan gadii jireessa:				20200411 15:09:53
