helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id1481063				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Maqaa jildeessaa galchi ykn fili. Maqaa jildeessa jiraataa filuun jildeessa too'annoo unkaa waliin walitti firoomsa. Maqaa haaraa galchuun jildeessa haaraa uuma; too'annoo unkaa waliin waliti firoomsa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
