helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_CTL_ORGANIZER_RIGHT\"\>Akaakuuwwan qajojii jireessaa ykn $[officename]faayiloota baname agarsiisa. \<emph\>Qajojiiwwan\</emph\> ykn \<emph\>Galmeewwan\</emph\> sanduuqa gadii keessaa fili.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	om	To change the default template path, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010300.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] - Paths\"\>$[officename] - Paths\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154810				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:LISTBOX:DLG_ORGANIZE:LB_RIGHT_TYP\"\> \<emph\>Qajojiiwwan\</emph\> ykn \<emph\>Galmeewwan\</emph\> qabeentota tarree olii irraa keessatti agrsiifame jijjiiruuf fili.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149191				0	om	Akaakuuwwan qajojii sajoowwan ukaankaatiin bakka bu'u. Faayiloota qajojii akaakuutti mul'isuudhaaf, ukaanka lama-cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159166				0	om	Haalata faayilii keessatti fayyadan mul'suuf, maqaa faayilii lama-cuqaasi, ittaansuudhaan \<emph\>Haalata\</emph\> sajoo lama-cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155504				0	om	Haalata Garagalchuuf, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> gadi qabuudhaan, haalata faayilii tokko irraa gara faayilii biraatti harkisi. Haalata siiqsuuf, haalata faayilii tokko irraa gara faayilii biraatti harkisi.				20200411 15:09:53
