helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id6401257				0	om	When you click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Check for Updates\</item\> button or choose the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Update\</item\> command, the Extension Update dialog is displayed and the check for availability of updates starts immediately.				20200411 15:09:53
