helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id1830500				0	om	In Writer, the command \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Comment\</item\> or the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl+Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+C key combination inserts a comment anchor at the current cursor position. A comment box is shown at the page margin, where you can enter the text of your comment. A line connects anchor and comment box.				20200411 15:09:53
