helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id6718649				0	om	The comments by different authors get different colors. Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - User Data\</item\> to enter your name so that it can show up as the comment author.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id2929166				0	om	Yaadoota saaguu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id5201879				0	om	Fayyadamaan kamiyyuu hayyama barreessuu galmee barrutti yaadannoowwan barreessota maraa gulaaluu fi haquu ni danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id2571794				0	om	Sanduuqni yaadannoo sajoo xiyya gadee waliin hammata. Yaadannoowwan haquuf baafata ajajawwan muraasa waliin banuun sajoo cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
