helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id0522200809383428				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Galmicha ammaa keessaa yaadoota mara haqi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id1857051				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Yaadannoo ammee, ykn yaadannoowwan mara barreessaa tokko irraa akka yaadannoo ammeetti ykn yaadannoowwan mara galmee keessaa haquuf ajaja fili.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id0305200911090684				0	om	Yaadni barruu galmee keessaa yoo barreessaa birootin barreeffameera ta'e, baafata halqaraa keessatti ajajni deebisi jedhu jira. \<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Ajajni kun yaada haaraa hiixuu yaada ati itti deebisuu barbaaddetti saaga.\</ahelp\> Yaadni korkoddii yaadoota lamaaniif wal fakkaataa dha. Barruu deebisaa kee yaada haaraa irratti barreessi. Galmee kee gara barreessitoota birootti ol kaa'i akkasumas ergi, kana booda barreessitootni kun deebisa ida'uu danda'u, baay'eetti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id0804200803435883				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Mul'isuuf \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Mul'annoo - Yaadoota\</item\> fayyadami yookaan yaadoota mara dhoksi (Calc keessa hin jiru).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id0302200901430918				0	om	Qaaqa Barbaadi & Bakka buusi galmeewwan barruu keessatti, barbaada kee keessatti barruuwwan yaadootaa dabaluuf filachuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3445539				0	om	Barruu galmeewwanii keessatti yaada irraa gara yaadaatti naana'uu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id4271370				0	om	When the cursor is inside a comment, you can press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl+Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Page Down to jump to the next comment, or press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl+Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Page Up to jump to the previous comment.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id2116153				0	om	Qareen yoo barruu baratamoo keessa jiraate, gara yaada korkoddii itti aanutti yookaan darbeetti ce'uuf furtuuwwan gubbaatti eeraman dhiibi. Akkasumas yaada korkoddii tokko irraa gara yaada korkoddii itti aanuutti ce'uuf, fooddaa naana'insaa xiqqoo sarjaa kabala maraa jala jiru fayyadamuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id5381328				0	om	Tarree galmee mara ilaaluuf dabalataan Naanna`aa banuu ni dandeessa. Yaadannoo Naanna`aa keessaa gulaaluuf ykn haquuf maqaa yaadannoo mirga-cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id5664235				0	om	Yaadoota maxxanssuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id2254402				0	om	To change the printing option for comments for all your text documents, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Print\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0915200910571612				0	om	Yaadoota wardiilee keessaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166460				0	om	Yeroo yaadannoo man'eetti qabsiiftuu balbaloon bakka barruu kee galchuu dandeessuutti mal'ata. Arfakuu xiqqaan xiyyoo mirga guubaa keessa mallattoo man'ee qubannoo yaadannootti. Yaaydannicha dhaabbiidhaan agarsiisuuf, man'ee mirga cuqaasuun \<emph\>Yaadannoo Mul`isi\</emph\>fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id8336741				0	om	Amaloota wanta yaadannichaa jijjiiruuf, fakkenyaaf, halluu duubbee Mul'isa, \<emph\>Yaada Agarsiisi\</emph\> akka guubbaattii fili, ittaansudhaan yaadannicha mirga-cuqasi (barruu lama hin cuqaasiin).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155390				0	om	Yaadannoo mul'ate guulaaluuf, barruu yaadannoo lama-cuqaasi.Yaadannoo yeroo hunda hin mul'annee gulaaluuf, man'ee keessaa kan yaadannoo ofkeessaa qabu cuqaasi, ittaansudhaan \<emph\>Saagi - yaadannoo\</emph\> fili. Dhangeessuu yaadannoo barruu ifteessuuf, haalata gulaalaa keessaa yaadannoo barruu mirga-cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A1				0	om	To change the position or size of a comment, drag a border or corner of the comment.				20200411 15:09:53
