helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06050600.xhp	0	help	par_id3158397				0	om	Galumsa addaan fageenyaa fi dirqaalee hiriifamaa lakkoofsa ykn tarree rasaasa'eef qindeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06050600.xhp	0	help	par_id5004119				0	om	Fuulli caancala Qubannoo galmeewwan qubannoo haarawaa faayyadamanitii fi amaloota addaan fageenyaa OpenOffice.org 3.0 waliin, ykn galmeewwan ammaloota moofaa fooyya'insa 3.0 oduraa irraa fayyadaman akka waan biroo (addaattii) ilaalamu. Fooyya'insi haaraan too'annoowwan caancala fuula "lakkaawwiin kan deemu", "Hiriirfama lakkaawwii", "irratti Hiriirfame" fi "irratti Galumsa" agarsisaa. Fooya'insi moofaan too`annoowwan caancala fuula  too'annoo moofaaa lakkaawwamee ykn tarree rasaassa`ee "Galumsa", "Bal'ina lakkofsa kennuu", "iddoo xiqqoo lakkoofsa kennuu <-> barruu" fi "Hiriirfama Lakkoofsa kennuu" agarsiisa.				20200411 15:09:53
