helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3148397				0	om	Man'ee keessatti bara galchuuf, dhangii dhaha Gregorian fayyadami. Fakkeenyaaf, naannoo Ingliffaa keessatti 1/2/2001 Am dhaaf 2,2002 galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3153274				0	om	All date formats are dependent on the locale that is set in \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language settings - Languages\</emph\>. For example, if your locale is set to 'Japanese', then the Gengou calendar is used. The default date format in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> uses the Gregorian Calendar.				20200411 15:09:53
