helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156156				0	om	Yeroo faayilii kornyoowwan qabate bantu, kornyoowwan haaromsuuf kakaata. Bakka faayiloon kornyatan itti kuufaman irratti hundaa'udhaan dalagni haaromsuu xumuuruudhaaf daqiiqaawwan hedduu itti fudhachuu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143270				0	om	Faayilii kornyoowwan DDEqabate yoo feetu akka kornyoowwan haaromsituu si'i kakaasa. Yoo waliindhaa DDE kaadhimaa hundeessuu hin barbaadnee haaromsa.				20200411 15:09:53
