helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05350200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150008				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXFLOAT_3D:BTN_GEO\"\>Boca wanta 3D filatame sirreessa. Bocicha wanta 3D kan wanta 2D jijjiiruudhaan uumamee ture qofa foyyeessuu dandeessa. Wanta 2D gara 3Dtti jijjiiruuf, wanticha fili, mirga cuqaasi, itti aansuudhaan \<emph\>Jijjiirii - Gara 3Dttii\</emph\> fili, ykn \<emph\>Jijjiirii - Wanta Gara 3Dtti Marsu \</emph\> fili.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
