helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153882				0	om	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06010000.xhp\" name=\"Spellcheck\"\>Too'ata fi qubeeffannoo\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154682				0	om	\<variable id=\"recht\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Spelling\"\>Galmicha ykn filnnoo ammee dogoggora qubeeffannoodhaaf mirkaneessa. Too'ata qubeeffannoo keessatti irrantoo, jalaantoo, galfata kasaa fi miljaleewwan qabata.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064B				0	om	Too'ata  qubeeffannoo qubannoo qaree ammee irra jalqabee hanga dhuma galmichaa ykn filannotti guddata. Yeroo sana too'ata  qubeeffannoo ka'uumsa galmicha irraa fufsiisuu dhaaf filuu ni dandeesa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166445				0	om	\<emph\>Too'atni qubeeffannoo\</emph\> jechoota dogoggoraan barreeffaman ilaaluun galmee fayyadamaatti jecha hin beekamne dabaluuf dirqali si'iif kenna.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id1022200801300654				0	om	Yoo mirkaneessituun caasluga fufaa ijaarame ta'e, qaaqni kun \<emph\>Qubeeffannoo fi Caasluga\</emph\>jedhama. Dogoggorri qubeeffannoo diimaan jala sararama, dogoggorri caaslugaa immoo cuquliisani. Jalqabarratti qaaqni dogoggora qubeeffannoo dhiheessa, itti aansee dogoggora caaslugaa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id1022200801354366				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Dogoggora qubee mirkaneessii hunda irratti hojjechuuf \<emph\>Caasluga mirkaneessi\</emph\> kakaasi, itti aansee dogoggora caaslugaa hunda irratti.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149511				0	om	Galmee jechootaa keessaa miti.				20200411 15:09:53
