helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id5016327				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Gara dhangii PDF/A-1a tti jijjiira. Kun akka dhangii faayilii galmee elektiroonikiitti yeroo dheeraaf akka kaa'amuu danda'utti qindeessama. Bocquuwwan hundi galmee maddaa keessatti fayyadan gara faayilii PDF uumameetti idaatamu. Iyyaatootni PDF ni barreefamu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
