helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AD				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"42769\"\>Saanduqa tarree Taliiga Dheertoo kana keessatti, bakka dheertoo haaraa ida'uu barbaaddeetti cuqaasi, ykn dheertoowwan haquu, dandeessisu, dadhabsiisuu ykn aleerguu barbaaddu fili. Dheertoowwan hedduu filuuf, furtuu Ctrl dhiibi yeroo cuqaastu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
