helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02200200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154230				0	om	Ajaja baafata kun baafata xiqqaa \<emph\>Wantoota - Gulaali\</emph\> keessatti saagamee fayyadama wantadha. Kornyeetan uumame fayydama irratti hundaa'uudhaan ajaja"Bani" wanta OLE maqaa gara garaa qabaachuu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
