helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156372				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_QRYDGN_ROW_FIELD\"\>Maqaa dirree deetaa gara gaafatatti ibsite galchi. Ijaarsi gara jala tarreetti argaman hundi dirree ibsu.\</ahelp\> Yoo man'ee kakaaste hantuutee cuqaasuun If you activate a cell with a mouse click you'll see an xiyya qabduu agarta, innis dirree filachuuf si gargaara. Filannoon "Table name.*" jedhu dirreewwan deetaa filuu fi ulaagaan kunis dirreewwan gabatee hundaaf gargaara.				20200411 15:09:53
