helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151120				0	om	Fakkeenya itti aanutti, gaafatni gabateewwan lama keessaan kaa'a: "Meeshaa" dirree gabatee "Item_No" waliinii fi dirree gabatee "Dhiyeessitootaa" waliin. Dabalataan,gabateewwan lamanuu maqaa dirree waliinii "Supplier_No" qabu.				20200411 15:09:53
