helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145772				0	om	Gaafattoota ulaagaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157312				0	om	Gaafata ulaagaalee jijjiiramoo waliin uumuuf jijjiiramaa golbee arfakkuu (=[x]) gidduutti uumu qabda.Akka filannootti, mallatoo walqixaa tuqxolamee hordofame (=:x) fayyadamuu dandeessa. Yoo gaafatni raawwatu, sagantaan qaaqa jijjiiramaa x nkamitti akka moggaafame agarsiisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150818				0	om	Yeroo tokkotti ulaagaalee heddu yoo gaafatte, tarree dirree qaaqa ulaagaalee hundaa fi naqa sararaa qabu tokkon tokko waliin agarta.Gatii galchi,akka fedhiitti gubbaa irraa gara gadiitti, fi tokkoon okkoo sararaaf  furtuu Enter jedhu dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157855				0	om	Gaafattoota ulaagaa iddoogoota(*,_) of keessaa qabaniif ykn arfiilee addaa (fakkeenyaaf,?) hin danda'amani.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157537				0	om	Ulaagaa gaafataa yoo uumte fi jijjiiramaa waliin yoo olkeesse,hima ati barbaaddeen jijjiramaan akka bakka siif bu'uuf gaafata booda uumuu dandeessa. $[officename] akkuma gaafata banteen jijjiiramaa kana qaaqa keessaa gaafata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151035				0	om	Naqa Ulaagaa 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153596				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_QRYDGN_ROW_FUNCTION\"\>Qaaqni \<emph\>Naqaa Ulaagaa\</emph\> jedhu gaafata keessatti jijjiiramaa kam akka gaafatte si gaafata. Gaafata jijjiiramaa maraa gatii fi isa \<emph\>TOLE\</emph\> jedhu cuqaasuun mirkanneessi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150585				0	om	Gaafattoonni ulaagaa dabalataan \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"subforms\"\>subforms\</link\>, since they work exclusively with queries for which the values to be invoked are read internally from a variable.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153645				0	om	Ulaagaan gaafataa unka armaan gadii hima SQL keessatti qabaachuu danda'a:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156731				0	om	 Isa * 'addresses' irraa fili'name' = :placeholder				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145181				0	om	Haalata SQL				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147013				0	om	SQL kan bakka bu'u "Structured Query Language" fi ajajoonni akka of haaromsan ibsuu fi quunnamiilee kuusdeetaa bulchuu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152570	136			0	om	$[officename] keessaatti waa'ee SQL beekuun gaafata hedduuf si hin barbaachiisu, lakkadda SQL galchuun waan sirra hin jirreef. Saxaaxa gaafataa keessatti yoo gaafata uumte, $[officename]n yeruma sana ajajoota gara caasima SQL tti jijjiira. Yoo, gargaarsa  qabduu \<emph\>Jijjiirraa Saxaaxa Mul'annoo Bani/Cufi\</emph\>n, gara mul'annoo SQL tti jijjiirta, gaafata dura uumameef ajaja SQL arguu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152412				0	om	Lakkaddaa SQL keessatti kallattiin gaafata kee uummachuu dandeessa. Hubadhu, garuu, caasimni addaa sirna kuusdeetaa ati itti fayyadamtu irratti hundaa'a. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146842				0	om	Yoo lakkadda SQL hujeekaan galchite, gaafattoota addaa SQL kan walquummana giraaficaala \<emph\>Saxaaxa gaafata\</emph\> dhan hin deeggaramne uumuu dandeessa.Gaafattoonni kun raawwaatamuu kan qaban haalaa SQL beekamaniin ta'uu qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149632				0	om	Sajoo mul'annoo SQL keessaa cuqaasuun \<link href=\"text/shared/02/14030000.xhp\" name=\"Run SQL command directly\"\>\<emph\>Ajaja SQL kallattiin kaasi\</emph\>\</link\>, gaafata $[officename]n hin hojjetamne uumuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
