helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\querywizard07.xhp	0	help	par_idN10553				0	om	Maqbiroowwan gara maqaalee dirreetti moggaasa. Maqbiroowwan filannoo dha, fi maqaalee beekkamoo hedduu kennuu, kan iddoo dirree bakka bu'anii argamuu danda'an. Fakkeenyaaf, maqbiroon dirreen gabateewwan adda addaa maqaa walfakkatu qabaataniif fayyada.				20200411 15:09:53
