helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3150247	2			0	om	Yoo gaafatni gabateewwanii ykn dirreewwanii baname jiraachuu baate,qaaqni \<emph\> Wahiyyoo Hanqatan \</emph\> ni mul'ata.Qaaqni kun gabateewwan hanqatan ykn dirree hin hikamne moggaasuu fi adeemsa kee akkamitti itti fufuu akka dandeessuu si gargara. 				20200411 15:09:53
