helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146957				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>quunnamtii kuusdeetaawwanii (Base)\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146957	2			0	om	Ajajni kun foddaa \<emph\>Saxaaxa Quunnamtii \</emph\>banuu, walitti dhufeenya gabateewwan kuusdeetaa hedduu moggaasuuf gargaara.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_CTL_RELATIONTAB\"\>Asitti dirreewwan deetaa wal fakkataaniin gabateewwan adda addaa gara kuusdeetaa ammaan walitti hidhuu dandeessa.\</ahelp\> Sajoo \<emph\>Walquunnamtii Haaraa\</emph\>jedhu cuqaasii walitti dhufeenya uumuuf, ykn salphumati harkisii-fi-dhiisi hantuutee fayyadamuun.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145316				0	om	Faankishiniin kun kan argamu yoo ati walitti kuusdeetaa walitti dhufeenyaa walin hojjatta ta'ee dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149235				0	om	Yoo \<emph\>Meeshalee - Walitti dhufeenya\</emph\> jedhu bante, gabateewwan kuusdeetaa ammaa gidduu walitti dhufeenya jiru hundaa kan agarssisu foddaan ni banama. Yoo walitti dhufeenyi adda bahuu baate, ykn gabateewwan kuusdeetaa walitti fiduu barbaade, sajoo \<emph\>Gabateewwan Dabali\</emph\> jedhu cuqaasi. Qaaqni \<link href=\"text/shared/02/14020100.xhp\" name=\"Add Tables\"\>Gabateewwan Dabali\</link\> jedhu ni banama innis iddoo ati gabateewwan barbaadde itti filattuu dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152812				0	om	Yoo foddaan\<emph\>Saxaaxa Quunnamtii\</emph\> baname,gabateewwan filaman haaromuu hin danda'ani.Kunis yeroo quunnamtiileen uumaman gabateewwan akka hin jijjiiramnee dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150541				0	om	Gabateewwan filaman gara gubbaa saxaaxa mul'annootti argamu. Foddaa gabatee gara halqara baafataan ykn furtuu Haqi jedhuun cufuu dandeenya.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148922				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>furtuwwan dursaa;galchuu (Base)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>furtuwwan;furtuwwan dursaa (Base)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>furtuwwan alaantoo (Base)\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148922				0	om	Furtuu dursaa fi furtuu kan biraa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149168				0	om	Gabateewwan adda addaa gidduutti quunnamtii uumuu yoo barbaadde, isa \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#primaerschluessel\" name=\"primary key\"\>furtuu dursaa\</link\> kan ifaan dirree deetaa adda baasuuf gargaara. Deetaa gabatee kanaa argachuuf furtuu dursaa gabatee biraa irraa ilaaluu dandeessa. Dirreewwan deetaa hundi furtuuwwan dursaa kana agarsiisan akka furtuu alaantootti ilaalamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147085				0	om	Dirreewwan deetaa hundi furtuu dursaa irratti irkatan foddaa gabatee keessatti kan adda bahan furtuu mallattoo xiqqoo dhaani.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153193				0	om	Walquunnamtii moggaasi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155430				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>quunnamtiilee; uumuu fi haquu (Base)\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155430				0	om	Quunnamtiileen hundi dura turan foddaa quunnamtii keessatti sarara dirree  furtuu dursaa fi kan biraa walqabsiisan irratti mul'atu. Quunnamtii dabaluuf harkisii-fi-dhiibi fayyadamuun dirree gabatee tokko keessaa gara dirree gabatee biratti dhiisuuf ta'a. Quunnamtiin ni haqama ammas filachuudhaan furtuu Haqi jedhu dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149984				0	om	Akka filmaataatti, sajoo \<emph\>Quunnamtii Haaraa\</emph\> jedhu cuqaasuun gara gubbaa dirree quunnamtii jiruu fi walquunnamtii gabateewwan lama gidduu qaaqa \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/05020100.xhp\" name=\"Relations\"\>\<emph\>Quunnamtiilee\</emph\>\</link\> jiru ibsa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153093				0	om	Yoo $[officename] akka fuuldura-dhuma quunnamtii kuusdeetaa, uumamnii fi haquun waalquunamtiilee  kuufannoo hatattamaa $[officename] keessatti hin kaa'amu, garuu kallattiin gara kuusdeetaa alaantootti dabarsa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155856	15			0	om	Sarara walqabsiistuu lama cuqaasuun, quunnamtiitti amaloota murtaa'an moggasuu dandeessa. Qaaqni \<emph\>Quunnamtiilee\</emph\> jedhu ni banama.				20200411 15:09:53
