helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3479720				0	om	The Adabas D software package can be downloaded and installed separately (see www.adabas.com).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152997				0	om	Waa'ee Adabas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151111				0	om	The free available Adabas database is restricted to a size of 100 MB, and a maximum of three users on a network. See the "License.txt" file in the Adabas directory for more details. The Adabas database must be installed in a separate directory from $[officename].				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	om	Maqaan faayilii Adabas arfiilee 8 caaluu hin danda'u. Xurreen faayilii Adabas maqaa faayilii dabalatee, arfiilee 30 caaluu hin danda'u, akkasumas lakkadda ASCII isa 7-biitii waliin komii qabaachuu hin qabu. Lachan xurree fi maqaan faayilichaa iddoowwan duuwwaa qabaachuu hin qaban.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153254				0	om	Foddaalee jalatti, fayyadamni qindaa'ina Adabas kuusdeetaadhaaf jijjiirama naannoo DBROOT warra odeeffannoo xurree of keessaa qaban ida'a. Yoo fayyadamni qindaa'inaa jijjiirama kana argatee, kuusdeetaa hin ijaaru.				20200411 15:09:53
