helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id5248573				0	om	Ijaartuun Gabaasaa meeshaa gabaasawwan kuusdeetaa mataa keetii uumuuf si tajaajila. \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01100000.xhp\"\>Masaka Gabaasaa\</link\> malee Ijaartuu Gabaasaa fayyadamuun gara barbaaddeen gabaasa saxaaxuu dandeessa. Gabaasni uumame galmee Barreesituu kan ati gulaaluu dandeessuu dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id7128818				0	om	Ijaartuu Gabaasaa fayyadamuuf, fufaatiin Ijaarsa Gabaasaa ijaaramuu qaba. Dabalataan, sooftiweeriin Java Runtime Environment (JRE) ijaaramuu qaba fi sooftiweeriin kun %PRODUCTNAME filamuu qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	hd_id3753776				0	om	Fuufaatii Ijaartuu Gabaasaa Ijaaruuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id5284279				0	om	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/packagemanager.xhp\"\>Taliiga Fufaatii\</link\> banuuf Meeshaalee - Taliiga Fufaatii filadhu</link.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id4494766				0	om	If you see the Report Builder in the Extension Manager list, then you do not need to install the extension. Else click the link "Get more extensions here". This opens your web browser at the address \<link href=\"http://extensions.openoffice.org\"\>http://extensions.openoffice.org\</link\> and shows a list of available extensions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id7858516				0	om	Find the Report Builder extension. Click at the icon or the "click here" text link. This opens the download page for the extension.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id973540				0	om	Click the "Get it!" icon. The extension file will be downloaded to your computer.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id4680928				0	om	Sakkattii saphaaphuu kee irraa gara foddaa %PRODUCTNAME tti deebi'a. Ammayyuu taliigaa dheertoon ni mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
