helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id4515823				0	om	Ijaartuun Gabaasaa Java Runtime Environment (JRE) barbaada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id4044312				0	om	Choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/java.xhp\"\>Java\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id1369060				0	om	Hanga daqiiqaa tokkoo eegi, %PRODUCTNAME sirna kee irratti waan sooftiweerii Java ijaaruuf.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id860927				0	om	Yoo sirna kee irratti JRE inni ammaa kan fooyya'e jiraate, tarree keessatti galtee agarta.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id8581804				0	om	Qabduu kana fuuldura galfataa biratti cuqaasi fooyya'aa JRE %PRODUCTNAME fayyadamuuf.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id7730033				0	om	\<emph\>Use a Java runtime environment\</emph\> is enabled.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id6317636				0	om	If no JRE version is found on your system, open your web browser and download the JRE software from \<link href=\"http://www.java.com\"\>http://www.java.com\</link\>. Install the JRE software. Then restart %PRODUCTNAME and open \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Java again.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	hd_id9759514				0	om	Ijaartuu Gabaasaa banuuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id9076509				0	om	Faayila Base tokko bani ykn kuusdeetaa haaraa tokko uumi. Kuusdeetaan kunis yoo xiqqaate gabatee tokko innis yoo xiqqaate dirree deetaa fi dirree furtuu durtii tokko waliin qabaachuu qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id7050691				0	om	Sajoo Gabaasaa foddaa Base keessaa cuqaasi, kana booda Mul'annoo Saxaaxaa keessaa Gabaasa Uumi jedhu filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id7118747				0	om	Foddaan Ijaartuu Gabaasaa ni banama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id8283639				0	om	Ijaartuun Gabaasaa bakka saditti hirama. Gara gubbaatti baafata, gara gadiitti ammoo kamshaalee agarta.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id2291024				0	om	Gara mirgaatti foddaa Amalootaa, gatiiwwan amalaa warra wanta ammee filamanii waliin agarta.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id2100589				0	om	Foddaan Ijaartuu Gabaasaa inni gara bitaa mul'annoo Ijaartuu Gabaasaa agarsiisa. Mul'annoon Ijaartuu Gabaasaa jalqabarratti gubbaadhaa gara jalaatti iddoo saditti hirama:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id5022125				0	om	               \<emph\>Irraantoo Fuulaa\</emph\> - naannoo Irraantoo Fuulaa keessatti dirreewwan to'annoo barruu dhaabbii waliin harkisa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id6844386				0	om	               \<emph\>Bal'inaan\</emph\> - naannoo Bal'inaa keessatti dirreewwan kuusdeetaa harkisee kaa'a				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id7018646				0	om	               \<emph\>Jalaantoo Fuulaa\</emph\> - naannoo Jalaantoo Fuulaa keessatti dirreewwan to'annoo barruu dhaabbii waliin harkisa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id5857112				0	om	Naannawaa dabalataa \<emph\>Irraantoo Gabaasaa\</emph\> fi \<emph\>Jalaantoo Gabaasaa\</emph\> galchuuf, \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Gulaali - Irraantoo/Jalaantoo Gabaasaa Galchi\</item\>filadhu. Naannoon kun barruu warra jalqabaa fi dhuma gabaasaa guutuu irratti mul'atan of keessaa qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id6042664				0	om	Sajoo "-" fuuldura maqaa naannoo irratti cuqaasi, innis naannoo san  mul'annoo Ijaartuu Gabaasaa keessatti qoncoorsuuf. Sajoon "-" gara "+" jijjiirama, atis naannoo bal'isuuf cuqaasuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id1589098				0	om	Naannawaa Bal'ina keessatti dirreeewwan kuusdeetaa harkistee dhiisuun galchita. Kutaa "Gabaasatti dirree galchuuf" jedhu kan gadii ilaali.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id1278420				0	om	Dabalataan, Asxaa Dirree ykn Saanduqa Barruu kamshaalee keessaa cuqaasi, san booda Irraantoo ykn Jalaantoo Fuulaa keessaa reektaangilii harkisi, barruu hunda fuula tokkoorra jiru ibsa. Asxaa saanduqa foddaa Amalootaa waalgitan barruu isaanii galchi. Sajoo Saxaatoo fayyadamuun saxaatoo ida'uu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
