helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id5927304				0	om	Dirree gabaasa keessatti galchuuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id4503921				0	om	Foddaan Dirree Ida'i gabaasa keessatti galfata gabatee galchuuf si gargaara. Sajoo Dirree Ida'i jedhu kaamshaa keessaa foddaa Dirree Ida'i jedhu banuuf cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id4051026				0	om	Naannoo Bal'ina gabaasa keessatti foddaa Dirree Ida'i irraa maqaalee dirree tokko tokkoon harkisii kaa'i. Dirree akka barbaaddetti sirreessi iddoo qabsiisi.Dirree hiriirsuuf sajoo kamshaalee keessaa fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id3397320				0	om	Dirreewwan walirra gochuun hin danda'amu. Yoo gabatee dirree naannoo Bal'inaa irra kaa'atte, sana booda asxaa fi saanduuqni barruu ni galu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id3059785				0	om	You can also insert text that should be the same on every page of the report. Click the Label Field icon\<image id=\"img_id5605334\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_label.png\" width=\"0.566cm\" height=\"0.566cm\" localize=\"true\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id5605334\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>, then drag a rectangle in the Page Header or Page Footer area. Edit the Label property to show the text you want.				20200411 15:09:53
