helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_sort.xhp	0	help	par_id3409527				0	om	Dirree gosa Barruuf, Arfiilee Huddeelsoo filattee saanduqa barruu isaanii gadii keessatti arfiilee lakkoofsan n ta'an galchuu dandeessa. Galmeewwan arfiilee n isaan tokkooffaa walfakkaatan iddoo tokkotti gurmaa'u.				20200411 15:09:53
