helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	om	Kamsha To'annoo Unkaa bani. Kamshi to'annoo unkaa  \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\" name=\"functions\"\>faankishinii\</link\> unka gulaaluuf fayyadu of keessatti qaba. Faankishinii hedduun kabala  \<emph\>Saxaaxa Unkaa\</emph\> fi \<emph\>To'annoo Dabalataa\</emph\> keessatti argamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153146				0	om	Saxaaxa unkaa keessatti \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\" name=\"include controls\"\>to'annoon ni jira\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170100.xhp\" name=\"apply properties\"\>amaloota fayyadama\</link\> isaaniif, hiiki \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170200.xhp\" name=\"Form properties\"\>Amaloota unkaa\</link\>, fi \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"define subforms\"\>unkaxiqqaa hiiki\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154924	9			0	om	Sajoon \<emph\> Unka Naanna'aa\</emph\> \<image id=\"img_id3156002\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_showfmexplorer.png\" width=\"4.23mm\" height=\"4.23mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156002\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> Unka Saxaaxa kabalaa irra jiru \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170600.xhp\" name=\"Form Navigator\"\>\<emph\>Unka Naanna'aa\</emph\>\</link\> jedhu banu.				20200411 15:09:53
