helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\align.xhp	0	help	par_id3150249				0	om	Kana fiixan baasuf, garee duwwaa fi diraa arfii ibsuu (hiiku) qabda. Iddoo homaa hin barbaadan, garuu hojii hiriirsu keessatti odeefannoo baachun gargaaru.				20200411 15:09:53
