helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156000				0	om	\<emph\>ll\</emph\> ykn \<emph\><<\</emph\> foddaa \<emph\>Ajajoota\</emph\> keessatti Hariiroo \<emph\>daran irra xiqqaa\</emph\> foormulaa keessatti saaguuf barreessi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153749				0	om	Hariiroon \<emph\>akkasitti hiikama\</emph\> iddooqa lamaa waliin \<emph\><?>def<?>\</emph\>barreessuni saagamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154068				0	om	Arfii walgittaa \<emph\>tiin fakkii\</emph\> iddooqa lamaa waliin \<emph\><?> transl <?>\</emph\> foddaa \<emph\>Ajajoota\</emph\> keessatti barreessuun saagi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149592				0	om	Ajajni \<emph\><?>transr<?>\</emph\> kun arfii wagittaa \<emph\>xabboo...dhaan\</emph\> iddooqa lamaa waliin saaga.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154735				0	om	Yeroo foddaa \<emph\>Ajaja\</emph\> tiin odeefannoo hujeekaan galchiinu, caasaa sirri lakkoofsa ogeejjii iddoo barbaachisuu yaadadha. Kun keessumattu kan dhugoomu yoo atii iddooqarra gatiitti hojjeecha jiraatte dha. Fakkeenyaaf, hariiroo "tilmaaman irra caala" , \<emph\>10 gg 1\</emph\> ykn \<emph\>a gg b\</emph\>barreessi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Faaran Xinneessi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147338				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>mul'annoo; faaran xinneessaan jira $[officename] Math\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hamamta agarsiisa foormulaa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>foormulaa; faaran xinneessaan jira\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>agarsiisa foormulaa irratti faaran xinneessaan jira\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147338				0	om	\<link href=\"text/smath/01/03050000.xhp\" name=\"Zoom Out\"\>Faaran Xinneessi\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150249				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Decreases the display scale of formulas by 25%.\</ahelp\> The current zoom factor is displayed on the status bar. A selection of available zoom options is accessible through the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000001.xhp#kontextmenue\" name=\"context menu\"\>context menu\</link\>. The context menu in the work area also contains zoom commands.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03040000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Faaran Guddisi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03040000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153770				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>agarsiisa foormulaa irraa faaran guddisaan jira\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>foormulaa; hamamtaa agarsiisa irra dabalaan jira\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153770				0	om	\<link href=\"text/smath/01/03040000.xhp\" name=\"Zoom In\"\>Faaran Guddisi\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154490				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Increases the display scale of the formula by 25%.\</ahelp\> The current zoom factor is displayed on the status bar. A selection of available zoom options is accessible through the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000001.xhp#kontextmenue\" name=\"context menu\"\>context menu\</link\>. The context menu in the work area also contains zoom commands.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Sadallaa fi Gurmeessu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147341				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>sadallaa fi gurmeessu $[officename] Math keessa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>gurmeessu fi sadallaa $[officename] Math keessas\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147341				0	om	\<link href=\"text/smath/01/03091100.xhp\" name=\"Brackets and Grouping\"\>Sadallaa fi Gurmeessu\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150342				0	om	Yaadadha: mallattoon waraabbii fakkeenyoota keessa barruu ibsuuf fayyadu akkasumas qabiyyee foormulaa fi ajajootatti hin qoodaman. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146962				0	om	Yemmu foddaa \<emph\>Ajaja\</emph\> keessatti foormulaa fakkeenya barreessinu, caasa sirridhaaf iddoon akka barbaachisu yaadadha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149054				0	om	Sadalgoon "{}" himannoo walitti gurmeessuun himannoo haara tokko unkeessuuf fayyada. Fakkeenyaaf, "sqrt {x * y}" iskuweer ruuttii baayyisu hundaa x*y ti, garuu "sqrt x * y" iskuweer ruuttii x y'n baayyisa. Sadalgoon iddoo dabalata hin barbaadani.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151392				0	om	Set brackets were previously inserted in the Elements window or directly in the Commands window as "left lbrace <?> right rbrace". Now, a left and a right set bracket can also be inserted using "lbrace" and "rbrace", with or without wildcards.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147403				0	om	Dimshaashumatti sadallaa gosa garagaraa sadeettu(8) argama. Sadallaan "ceil" fi "floor" yeroo hundaa qajeelfama asii olii fi gadi intiijerii ittaanutti: "lceil -3.7 rceil = -3" or "lfloor -3.7 rfloor = -4" naanneessuuf fayyada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146320				0	om	Sadallaa ogeejjii (sadallaa kofa sarara sarjaa gidduu isaani waliin), sirnasxaa fiiziksii keessatti baratamoo dha: "langle a mline b rangle" ykn "langle a mline b mline c irra d mline e rangle." Hojjaa fi qubachiisa sararoota sarjaa yeroo mara sadallaa marfameen sirritti walitti dhufa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157870				0	om	Sadallaan hundi tarii cimdii qofaan fayyadamu. Sadallaan amala baramoo tokko tokko qabu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155761				0	om	Sadallaan gosa hundinuu dalagaa gurmeessuu walfakkaata akka sadallaa "{}" tiif ibsameetti qabu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145590				0	om	Sadallaa gosa hundaa, kanneen mul'atan dabalate, gurmuu duwwaa hiiku hayyamu.Himannoo marfamee egaa duwwaa ta'u danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154562				0	om	Sadallaan himannoo itti marfamaniin hamamta isaani hin mijeessani. Fakkeenyaaf, yoo "( a irra b )" sadallaa waliin hamamta a fi b mijeefamu barbaadde "bitaa" fi "mirga" saagu qabda. "Bitaa(a irra b mirgaa)" galchuun hamamta mija'aa nuu uuma. Yoo, garuu, sadallaan ofumasaniiti qaama himannoo ta'ani, hamamtaan hundi ni jijjiirama, jijjiirama hamamta of keessatti ni haammatu: "hamamta 3(a irra b)" fi "hamamta 12(a irra b)". Reeshoon himannoo sadallaa-gara-sadallaa hamamteessu yoomiyyu hin jijjiramu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153002				0	om	Hanga "biitaa" fi "mirgi" ramaddi sadallaa adda mirkaneessanitti, sadallaan qeenxe marri akka yaada walii galaa ajajoota lamaniitti fayyadamu ni dandeessa, isumayyuu sadallaa mirga gara bitaa, ykn sadalla bita gara mirga qubachiisa. Bakka sadallaa guutaa "homaa" fayyadamu ni dandeessa, kana jechuun sadallaan mula'atu hin jiru akkasumas iddoon sadallaadhaaf olkaawame hin jiru. Kana fayyadamuun himannoo armaan gadii uumu ni dandeessa:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150014				0	om	bitaa lbrace x mirgaa homaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149877				0	om	bitaa [ x right )				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145241				0	om	bitaas ] x right [				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156060				0	om	bita rangle x mirga lfloor				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150935				0	om	Seerotuma walfakkaatatu "bitaa" fi "mirgaa" tti fayyadama akka sadallaa kabirootti: akka gurmuu ijaaruttis ni hojjetu akkasumas tari himannoo duwwaas ni marsu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149030				0	om	Makaan sadallaa wal hin simiin, sadallaa qeenxe fi sadallaa lamatta bitaa fi mirgaa qubachiifamaan yeroo mara foormuloota herrega keessatti uumamu. Kan armaan gadii foormula yeroo barreessinu dogongora uuma:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155989				0	om	[2, 3) - addaan fageenya bana mirga				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147169				0	om	"Bitaa" fi "mirga" fayyadamuun himannoo armaan olii $[officename] Math keessatti gataa'aa godha: "bitaa [2, 3 mirga )". Haata'u malee, sadallaan kun hamamta dhaabata kamiyyuu hin qabu sababni isa hima wali galaatti mijeefama. Sadallaa qeenxe qindeessun laklamee cumbersome. Kanaafu, "\\" (haxaarroo) fuuldura sadallaa baratamoo qubachiisuun sadallaa qeenxe hamamtaa dhaabataa waliin agarsiisu ni dandeessa. Sadallaan kun egaa akka mallattoo kabiroo kamitti boqotu akkasumas dalagaa sadallaa adda ta'e kana booda hin qabatani; kanaafis akka gurmuu ijaarutti hin hojjetanu akkasumas qaabachiisi isaani mallattoole kabirootti  walitti dhufa. "Hamamta *2 \\langle x \\rangle" fi "hamamta *2 langle x rangle" ilaali.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153720				0	om	Millu irrakeessa guutu akka armaan gaditti				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149715				0	om	\\{ or \\lbrace, \\} or \\rbrace				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150756				0	om	\\(, \\)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145207				0	om	\\[, \\]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153153				0	om	\\langle, \\rangle				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150263				0	om	\\lceil, \\rceil				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147252				0	om	\\lfloor, \\rfloor				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154690				0	om	\\lline, \\rline				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145414				0	om	\\ldline, \\rdline				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147514				0	om	Rakkoo kamiiniyyu ala kara kanaan addaan fageenya akka armaan oliitti \<emph\>$[officename] Math\</emph\> keessatti ijaaru ni dandeessa: \\[2", "3\\) ykn "\\]2", "3\\[ (Hubadhu: Mallattoon waraabbii qaamq galfata ti.)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153532				0	om	Maalo malattoo waraabbii galuu akka qabu yaadadha akkasumas \<emph\>jijjirra+2\</emph\> fayyadamuun argama akkasumas mallattoo waraabbii typographical waliin ala. Walumagalatti, mallattoo buufattoo (haala ammatiin akka qoodduu) akka barrutti qindeessa. Akka "\\[2,~3\\)" barreessuun yoo danda'ames akki armaan olii filatamadha. Fakkeenya darbe keessatti, hamamtaan sadallaa hamamta bocquu fayyadamne irratti hirkachuun isaa "hamamta dhaabata" yeroo hunda ibsa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153674				0	om	Gareele walitti taasisuun hamma ta'e rakkoorra bilisa. Foormulaa hat "{a + b}" keessatti "hat" salphanumatti wiirtu "{a + b}" irratti agarsiifama. Akkasumas, "halluu diima lceil a rceil" fi "grave hat langle x * y rangle" akka tilmaamanitti hojjetu. Bu'aan qubee kana "grave {hat langle x * y rangle}" waliin wal madaalu dandeessa. Amalootni kun hin dorgomanu, garuu walitti makamu danda'u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147526				0	om	This differs slightly for competing or mutually influencing attributes. Kun yeroo hunda haala amaloota bocquu waliin. Fakkeenyaaf, halluu kam b "halluu keelloo halluu diima (a + halluu magariisa b)" keessa qaba, ykn hamamta kam "hamamta *4 (a + hamamta /2 b) keessa qaba"? hamamta bu'uura 12 kenname, hamamta 48 qabaa, 6 ykn isayyu 24 (akka makatti ilaalamu danda'amu)? Kanneen armaan gadii seerota qulqullina buu'ura ti, gara fuulduratti haalan duuka bu'amu. Walumagalatti, seerotni kun gurmu dalagaale hundaattti fayyadami. Kun dhiibba mul'atu amaloota bocquu kan akka "bold", "ital", "phantom", "size", "color" fi "font" irratti qaba:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152952				0	om	Dalagaalee garee tarree keessa akka dalagaan qeenxe hundi sadalgoodhaan marsameetti ilaalama. They are nested, and sadarkaa hunduma keessatti dalagaa tokkoo oli caala hin jiru. As biratti fakkeenya foormulaa dalagaale garee heeddu waliin: "hamamta 12 bocquu halluu diima hamamta sans -5 (a + hamamta 8 b)" aka "{size 12{color red{font sans{size -5 (a + {size 8 b})}}}}".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3158441				0	om	Fakkeenyi foormulaa kun egaa bitaa gara mirgaatti hiikama. Dalagaaleen kun garee ykn himannoo isaanin walitti dhufoo ta'ani qofa irratti dhiibba fidu. Dalagaaleen mirgaarra fagaatani jiranuu warreen dursanii waliin ofiisaniin "bakka wal buusu" ykn "wal maku".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150994				0	om	Dalagaan garee miidha kamiiniyyu dalagalee sadarkaa olaana hin qabu garuu garee fi himannoo sadarkaa gadaana qofa irratti miidha fida, sadallaa fi irrarfii/jalarfii dabalate. Fakkeenyaaf, "a + hamamta *2 (b * hamamta -8 c_1)^2"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154196				0	om	Dalagaalee gosa walfakkaata dursan kamiyyu  "halluu ..." fi "bocquu ..." akkasumas "hamamta n" (n'n kurnyee) bakka bu'a				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154136				0	om	Dhiibbaan dalagaalee "hamamta +n", "hamamta -n", "hamamta *n", fi "hamamta /n" walmaka,				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146934				0	om	"hamamta *2 hamamta -5 a" hamamta jalqabaa dachaa godhe 5 hir'isa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149297				0	om	"bocquu sans ( a + font serif b)"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155174				0	om	"size *2 ( a + size /2 b )"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154906				0	om	Hamamta foormula jijjiiruf, "size +" or -,*,/ fayyadama. "Hamamta n" hin fayyadamina. Kun salphaanumatti halqara kamiiniyyuu keessatti ni fayyadamta. Kun akka atii gara naannoo birootti garagalcha fi maxaansi fayyadamte garagalchitu sii dandeessisa. Bu'aan isaa walfakkaatadha. Itti dabalataan, himannoon akkasii yemmu "hamamta n" fayyadamnu caala hamamta bu'uura baafata keessa jijjiiruf jiraatu. Yoo atii "hamamta *" fi "hamamta /" (fakkeenyaaf, "hamamta *1.24 a ykn hamamta /0.86 a") qofa fayyadamte gitaawummaan isaani hin badu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147587				0	om	Fakkeenyoota (hamamta bu'uura 12 waliini fi 50% kasaalef):				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148734				0	om	Sirritti "hamamta 18 a_n" fi "hamamta *1.5 a_n" kana waliin gitaawa dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152766				0	om	Haallee garagaraa keessatti garagara: "x^{size 18 a_n}" fi "x^{size *1.5 a_n}"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157986				0	om	Hamamta +n waliin fakkeenyoota wal madaalu. Walfakkaata fakkaatu:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3158001				0	om	a_{size 8 n}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147332				0	om	a_{size +2 n}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155143				0	om	a_{size *1.333 n}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147129				0	om	Fakkeenyootni armaan gadii garuu wsl hin fakkaatani:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147073				0	om	x^{a_{size 8 n}}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147086				0	om	x^{a_{size +2 n}}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154386				0	om	x^{a_{size *1.333 n}}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153354				0	om	n marti as biratti hamamtaale garagara qabu. Hamamtaan 1.333, 8/6 irra argama, hamamtaan yaadame hamamtaa kasaa durtii 6 hirama. (hamamta kasaa 50% hamamta bu'uura 12 waliin)				20200411 15:09:53
