helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151129				0	om	Walitti Fidi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156102	39			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_XCIRCY\"\>Iddooqa lamaa waliin \<emph\>agarsistuu walitti fiddu\</emph\> saaga. \</ahelp\> Fodda \<emph\>Ajaja\</emph\> kessattis \<emph\>circ\</emph\> barreessu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150464				0	om	You can also insert user-defined unary operators by typing \<emph\>uoper\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window, followed by the syntax for the character. This function is useful for incorporating special characters into a formula. For example, the command \<emph\>uoper %theta x\</emph\> produces a small Greek letter theta (a component of the \<emph\>$[officename] Math\</emph\> character set). You can also insert characters not in the $[officename] character set by choosing \<emph\>Tools - Catalog - Edit\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154725				0	om	 You can also insert user-defined binary commands by typing \<emph\>boper\</emph\> into the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window. For example, the command \<emph\>y boper %theta x\</emph\> produces the small Greek letter theta preceded by a \<emph\>y\</emph\> and followed by an \<emph\>x\</emph\>. You can also insert characters not in the $[officename] character set by choosing \<emph\>Tools - Catalog - Edit\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150906				0	om	Ajaja \<emph\><?>oplus<?>\</emph\> kana foddaa \<emph\>Ajaja\</emph\> keessatti barreessuun, galmeekee keessa \<emph\>ogeejjii idaatii geenga'e\</emph\> saagda.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151197				0	om	\<emph\><?>ominus<?>\</emph\> foddaa \<emph\>Ajajoota\</emph\> keessatti \<emph\>Ogeejjii hir'isuu geenga'e\</emph\> saaguuf barreessi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155082				0	om	\<emph\><?>odot<?>\</emph\> foddaa \<emph\>Ajajoota\</emph\> keessatti \<emph\>Ogeejjii tuqaa geenga'e\</emph\> saaguuf barreessi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154331				0	om	\<emph\><?>odivide<?>\</emph\> foddaa \<emph\>Ajajoota\</emph\> keessatti \<emph\>Ogeejjii qooddii geenga'e\</emph\> saaguuf barreessi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150089				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_XWIDESLASHY\"\>Arfii lama haxaaroon giddusaani jiruu omishachuudhaaf \<emph\>haxaaroo bal'aa b\</emph\> foddaa \<emph\>Ajajoota\</emph\> keessatti (gara bita gadaana gara mirgaa olaanatti) barreessi.\</ahelp\> Wanti hundi gara bita haxaaroo jiranii olii, wannti hundi gara bita haxaaroo jirani gadii jechudhaaf arfiin kun kan qinda'amani. Ajajni kun baafata halqara foddaa \<emph\>Ajajoota\</emph\> keessa ni jira.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150024				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_XWIDEBSLASHY\"\>Arfii lama haxaaroon giddusaani jiruu omishachuudhaaf \<emph\>haxaaroo bal'aa b\</emph\> foddaa \<emph\>Ajajoota\</emph\> keessatti (gara bita olaana gara mirgaa gadaanatti) barreessi.\</ahelp\> Wanti hundi gara bita haxaaroo jiranii gadii, wannti hundi gara bita haxaaroo jirani olii jechudhaaf arfiin kun kan qinda'amani. Ajajni kun baafata halqara foddaa \<emph\>Ajajoota\</emph\> keessallee ni jira.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149376				0	om	Arfii foormulaa kee keessa jiranitti kasaale fi paawurii ida'uuf foddaa ajaja keessatti \<emph\>sub\</emph\> yookaan \<emph\>sup\</emph\> barreessi. fakkeenyaf, a sub 2.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155383				0	om	If you want to use a colon ':' as division sign, choose \<emph\>Tools - Catalog\</emph\> or click the \<emph\>Catalog\</emph\> icon on the Tools bar. Click the \<emph\>Edit\</emph\> button in the dialog that appears, then select the \<emph\>Special\</emph\> symbol set. Enter a meaningful name next to \<emph\>Symbol\</emph\>, for example, "divide" and then click the colon in the set of symbols. Click \<emph\>Add\</emph\> and then \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to close the \<emph\>Symbols\</emph\> dialog,too. Now you can use the new symbol, in this case the colon, by entering its name in the Commands window, for example, \<emph\>a %divide b = c\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147398				0	om	Odeeffannoo yeroo foddaa Ajaja keessa hujeekan galchiinu, caasaa sirrii lakkoofsa ogeejjii iddoo miseensota giddu barbaachisuu maalo yaadadha. Kun kan dhugoomu keessattu yoo iddooqa irraa gatii ogeejjii kee keessatti fayyadama jirattee dha.fakkeenyaaf, hiruu ijaaruufs 4 div 3 yookaan a div b.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090903.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Mallattoole Kasaale waliin				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090903.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155959				0	om	\<link href=\"text/smath/01/03090903.xhp\" name=\"Symbols with Indices\"\>Mallattoole Kasaale waliin\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090903.xhp	0	help	par_id3150300				0	om	Fakkeenyi sadaffaan akkaata mallattooleen kasaale wajjiin uumuf \<emph\>$[officename] Math\</emph\> fayyadamtu armaan gaditti argama. Fakkeenya kan gabatee muraa keessatti garagalchuun foormulaa kee keessatti foddaa \<emph\>Ajaja\</emph\> keessatti fayyadamu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
