helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145115				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH:METRICFIELD:RID_FONTSIZEDIALOG:1\"\>Miseensonni foormulaa hundi  hamamta bu'uuratti gitaan safaramaniiru. Hamamta bu'uura jijjiiruf, hamamta tuqaa yaadame keessatti fili ykn barreessa. Safartuu safaraa kabiroos fayyadamu dandeessa ykn \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000001.xhp#metrik\" name=\"metrics\"\>safartuu\</link\> kabiroo, achumaan ofumaan gara tuqaatti geedaramu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
