helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147546				0	om	Kasaa ykn eksiponeentiis faankishiniitti ramaduu ni dandeessa. Fakkeenyaaf, \<emph\>sin^2x\</emph\> barreessuun faankishinii " saayinii paawurii 2x" buufanna.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154752				0	om	Yemmuu faankishinii hujeekaan foddaa ajaja keessatti barreesinuu, iddoo faankishinii tokko tokkoo barbaadani yaadadha (fakkeenyaafs, abs 5=5 ; abs -3=3).				20200411 15:09:53
