helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147173				0	om	Odeeffannoo dabalata waa'ee madaalu \<emph\>\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Math\</emph\> bal'inaan akkasumas fakkeenyootni tokko tokkos asitti argamu ni danda'u. (Mallattoon waraabbii barruu kana keessatti agarsiisu (ibsuuf) qofaaf tajaajila akkasumas qaama fakkeenyoota miti.)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156316				0	om	Faakitooriyaalin hin safaramu (fakkeenya: "fact stack{a#b}" fi "fact {a over b}") garuu sarjala ykn wiirtuu yaada walii galaa fayyadamuun hubatamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150756				0	om	Sadallaan yeroo hunda hamamta dhaabbataas qabu. Kun kan fayyadamnu mallattoolee hunda akka sadallaatti fayyadaman hundaafi.  "(((a)))", "( hiriira{a#b#c})", "(a irra b)" madaali.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147570				0	om	Sadallaan "bitaa" ykn "mirgaan" durfamu, haata'u malee, yaada walii galaatti qixeefamu. "bita(bita(bita(a mirga)mirga)mirga)", "bita(hiriira{a#b#c}mirga)", "bita( mirga a irra b )" ilaali.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145206				0	om	 \<link href=\"text/smath/01/03091300.xhp\" name=\"Attributes\"\>Amalootni\</link\> tokko tokko hamamta dhaabbata qabu; yoo mallattoo dheera gubba qubachiifamani jiraatan hin jijjirin.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154694				0	om	Caasa sirridhaaf addaan fageenyi fakkeenyoota giddu jiru ni barbaachisa. Yemmu foddaa Ajajaa keessatti galcha galchinuu hin haqin.				20200411 15:09:53
