helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153250				0	om	Faankishinii gasa tokko baafata xixxiqqa keessa jiraan kara baafata halqara foddaa  \<emph\>Ajajaa\</emph\> ga'uu dandessu.				20200411 15:09:53
