helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149208				0	om	Sadallaan ofumaan kan hamamtaa'u yeroo atii \<emph\>bitaa\</emph\> fi \<emph\>mirga\</emph\> ajaja sadallaa fuulduratti barreessitudha, fakkeenyaaf, \<emph\>bitaa(a'n b irra mirgaa)\</emph\>. Hamamtaa fi addaan fageenya sadallaas \<emph\>Dhangii - Addaan Fageenya - Akaakuu - Sadallaa\</emph\> filachuun qindeessu ni dandeessa. Akkasumas dhibbeentaa yaadamen qindeessuuni. \<emph\>Safaraa sadallaa maraa\</emph\> mallatteessii sanduuqaitti jijjirama fayyadamtuu mara foormulaa sadallaa keessa mirkaneessis.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150857				0	om	Sadallaa altokkees gargaaramu ni dandeessa. Kana gochuuf, ajaja fuulduratti haxaarroo \<emph\>\\\</emph\> barreessi. Fakkeenyaaf, yeroo atii \<emph\>\\[\</emph\>, barreessituu golboon arfakkuu bitaa gara faallatiin alaatu mul'ata. Kun kan gargaaru sadallaa faalla uumuf ykn gidduutti ijaaruuf. Sadallaa safarjijjirama hin ta'in qofatuu qofatti gargaaramuu akka dandeessu yaadadha. Hamamtaa jijjiruuf, ajaja \<emph\>hagamta\</emph\> gararami.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_idN113E5				0	om	Fakkeenyoota sadallaa altokkee				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_idN113E8				0	om	Sadallaa hin safaramiin:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_idN113EB				0	om	a = \\{ \\( \\[ b sarara haara				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_idN113EE				0	om	{} + c \\] \\) \\ }				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_idN113F3				0	om	Sadallaa safarameef \<emph\>none\</emph\> akka maqaa sadallatti gargaarami.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_idN113FA				0	om	a = bitaa ( a'n b irra mirgaa none sarara haara				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_idN113FF				0	om	bitaa none phantom {a over b} + c mirgaa )				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_idN11404				0	om	Himni \<emph\>phantom\</emph\> kun sadallaan inni dhumaa hamamta sirri akka ta'e mirkanneessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145107				0	om	Yeroo foddaa ajajatiin kallattiin galchinuu iddoolee (addaan fageenya) miseensota gidduu keessu mirkaneefadhu. Kun caasaa sirri akka baramee nuu mirkaneessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153198				0	om	Odeefannoon faayida qabeessa waa'ee \<link href=\"text/smath/01/03091200.xhp\" name=\"indexes and exponents\"\>kasaalee fi eksiponeentii\</link\> akkasumaas \<link href=\"text/smath/01/03091400.xhp\" name=\"scaling\"\>safaruu\</link\> haalan akka atii foormulaa kee caasessittuu si gargaara. Odeefannoo dabalataa waa'ee sadallaa, \<link href=\"text/smath/01/03091100.xhp\" name=\"Brackets and Groups\"\>Sadallaa fi Gurmeessu\</link\> ilaali.				20200411 15:09:53
