helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147524				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_BRACKET_EXCHEIGHT2\"\>Dhibbeenta hamamta irra hafaa mijeessi.\</ahelp\> Dhibbeenta 0 tti sadallaan yaada waliigalaatti hojja walqixa ta'etti qindeefamutti mijeefamu. Hamma gatiin galchamu dabalaa deeme, addaan fageenyi sarjaa qabiyyee sadallaa fi daanga sadallaa gara alaa gidduu jiruu guddacha adeema. Dirreen kun \<emph\>Sadallaa hunda safara\</emph\> waliin walitti maku qofaan fayyadamu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
