helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150746				0	om	\<link href=\"text/smath/01/03091200.xhp\" name=\"Indexes and Exponents\"\>Kasaalee fi Eksiponeenti\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153730				0	om	As biratti, odeefannoo bu'uura kasaale fi eksiponeentoota \<emph\>$[officename] Math\</emph\> keessa argattu. Fakkeenyoota asitti ibsamaan gadfageenyaan hubaachuuf yaalu ni dandeessa. (Mallattoon waraabbii barruu kana keessa ibsuu qofaaf yaadameti akkasumas qaama fakkeenyoota miti.)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149884				0	om	Arfiidhaaf kasaale fi eksiponeentootni gubbaa waliisan irratti agarsiifamu, arfii bu'uura gara bitatti qixeessa. Fakkeenyaaf, \<emph\>a_2^3\</emph\> ykn \<emph\>a^3_2\</emph\> barreessa. Kara tartiiba kamiyyu ni dandeessa. Qooda \<emph\>'_'\</emph\> fi \<emph\>'^'\</emph\>, you can use \<emph\>'sub'\</emph\> fi \<emph\>'sup'\</emph\> fayyadamu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148387				0	om	Haata'u malee, kana caala sarxaa kana gadii fayyadamuun hin danda'amu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149029				0	om	sa_2_3				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155985				0	om	a^2^3				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153923				0	om	a_2^3_4				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153724				0	om	Qubannoo jalarfii/irrarfii arfii bu'uura kamiyyu si'a tokko qafa fayyadamu dandeessa. Bu'a tilmaame agarsiisuuf sadallaa fayyadamu qabda. Fakkeenyotni armaan gadii kana agarsiisu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151185				0	om	a_{2_3}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151272				0	om	a^{2^3}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156316				0	om	a_2^{3_4}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145207				0	om	a_{2^3}^{4_5}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151173	13			0	om	Akka gulaaltoota foormulaa kabiroo "\<emph\>_\</emph\>" fi " \<emph\>^\</emph\> " arfii ittaanu mul'isa ("a_24" "2" qofa mul'isa), $[officename] Math lakkoofsa/maqoota/barruu mara mul'isa. Yoo irrarfii fi jalarfii tarree keessa galchuu barbaadde, himannoon isaa akka armaan gadiiti: a_2{}^3 or a^3{}_2				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154260				0	om	Hubannoo karqabee waliigala barreessuuf, \<emph\>$[officename] Math\</emph\> dirqala heedduu dhiheessa. Sirnasxaatti dabalata "R_i{}^{jk}{}_l", fayyadama kabiroo keessatti baratamoo dha, Sirnasxaa dabalataas fayyadamu ni dandeessa, maqaa dhahuuf "R_i{}^jk{}_l" and "{{R_i}^jk}_l."				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147516				0	om	Arfii bu'uuratti gara mirgaa irrarfii fi jalarfiittis mirgatti qixeessu ni dandeessa. Kana gochuuf, ajajni haaran "lsub" fi "lsup" fayyadamta. Ajajootni lamaan dhiibba walfakkaata akka "sub" fi "sup" qaba, arfii bu'uura gara bitaa ta'uun gargar ta'u. Kanas "a lsub 2 lsup 3." ilaali				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154276				0	om	Seeroti waan ifaa ta'ee fi barbachisumma sadallatti fayyadamu ta'an kan bulchu ammas walfakkaata. Akka kaayootti, kun \<emph\>{}_2^3 a\</emph\> waliin fiixan ba'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152961				0	om	Ajajni "sub" fi "sup" akka "rsub" fi "rsup" ttis ni argamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3158437				0	om	Ajaja "csub" fi "csup" fayyadamuun, arfii kallattiin gubba ykn jelatti irrarfii fi jalarfii barreessu ni dandeessa. Fakkeenya "a csub y csup x". Kasaale fi eksiponeentoota wlitti makuunis ni danda'ama: "abc_1^2 lsub 3 lsup 4 csub 55555 csup 66666."				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154570				0	om	Irrarfii fi jalarfiin ogeejjii tokkee fi lamee baay'etti maxxanuu danda'u. Fakkeenyota lama: "a div_2 b a<csub n b +_2 h" fi "a toward csub f b x toward csup f y."				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155904				0	om	Foddaa \<emph\>Ajaja\</emph\> keessatti fakkeenyoota kana yemmu galchituu addaan fageenya arfii gidduu galchuus sirritti yaadadha.				20200411 15:09:53
