helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154513				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_MODALDIALOG_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG\"\>Tuuta mallattooletti mallattoo dabaluuf qaaqa kana fayyadami, tuuta mallatoo gulaaluf, ykn sirnasxaa mallattoo fooyyessuf.\</ahelp\> Tuuta mallattoo haaras ibsuus ni dandeessa, mallattootti maqaa ramadi, ykn tuuta mallattoo amma jiraan fooyyessuuf.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146066				0	om	Mallattoole moofaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153965				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_COMBOBOX_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_1\"\>Maqaa mallattoo ammaa filadhu.\</ahelp\> Mallattoo, maqaa mallattoo, fi  tuutni mallattoon itti hammatamu bitaa hirdaatii duraargii jalaa saanduqa qaaqatti agarsiifamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154020				0	om	Tuuta Mallattoo Moofaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150209				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_COMBOBOX_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_2\"\>Saanduqi tarree kuni maqaa tuuta mallattoo ammee of keessatti qabateera. Yoo barbaadde, tuuta mallattoo adda addaas filachuu ni dandeessa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145386				0	om	Mallattoo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148870				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_COMBOBOX_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_4\"\>Maqoota mallattoo tuuta mallatto amma keessa tarreessi. Tarree keessa maqaa filadhu ykn maqaa mallatto haara dabalame barreessi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150215				0	om	Mallattoo haara dabalaa jira				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3143233				0	om	Tuuta mallattootti mallattoo dabaluuf, saanduqa Bocquu keessa \<emph\>Font\</emph\> bocquu fili, achumaan mallattoo hirdaatii mallattoo keesssa cuqaasi. Saanduqa \<emph\>Mallattoo\</emph\> keessatti, maqaa mallattoodhaaf barreessi. Saanduqa tarree \<emph\>Tuuta Mallattoo\</emph\> keessa, tuuta mallattoo fili, ykn maqaa haara tuuta mallattoo uumuf barreessi. Hirdaatii duraargii mirgaa mallattoo ati filatte agarsiisa. \<emph\>Dabala\</emph\> cuqaasi ittaansun \<emph\>TOLE\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151389				0	om	Maqaa mallattoo fooyyessaa jira				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147296				0	om	Maqaa mallattoo jijjiruuf, saanduqa tarree \<emph\>Mallattoo moofa\</emph\> keessa maqaa mallattoo moofa fili. Ittaansuun maqaa haara saanduqa \<emph\>Mallattoo\</emph\> keessa galcha. Arfiin yaadame foddaa duraargii keessa jiraatu dhiisu utuu qabduu \<emph\>Fooyyessi\</emph\> hin cuqaasin mirkaneefadhu. Click \<emph\>TOLE\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157870				0	om	Tuuta Mallattoo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145825				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_COMBOBOX_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_5\"\>Sanduuqni tarree  \<emph\>mallattoo man`ee \</emph\> maqoota tuuta mallattoo hunda jiran qabata. Tuuta mallattoo tokkoo fooyyessuu ykn haaraa uumuu ni dandeessa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154554				0	om	Tuuta Mallattoo Haara uuma jira				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145594				0	om	Tuuta mallattoo haara uumuf, Saanduqa tarree \<emph\>tuuta Mallattoo\</emph\> keessatti maqaa isaa barreessi akkasumaas yoo xinnaate mallattoo tokkoo dabali. Qaaqa kana cufuuf \<emph\>TOLE\</emph\> cuqaasi. Tuutni mallattoo haaran maqaa haara jalatti ni argama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153736				0	om	Bocquu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147374				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_LISTBOX_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_1\"\>Maqaa bocquu ammaa agarsiisa akkasumaas akka atii bocquu garagara filattu sii dandeessisa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150564				0	om	Cita tuuta				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145295				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_LISTBOX_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_LB_FONTS_SUBSET\"\>Too bocquu mallattoo alaa saanduqa \<emph\>Bocquu\</emph\> keessa filattee, cita tuuta yuniikoodii bakka mallattoo haara ykn gulaalame keewwatu filachu dandeessa. Yemmuu citi tuuta filamuu, mallattoolen hundi kan cita tuutaa tuuta mallattoo amma ta'an tarreele mallattoo armaan olii keessatti ni agarsiifamu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148386				0	om	Barfuula				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155366				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_COMBOBOX_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_3\"\>Barfuula ammaatu agarsiifama. Saanduqa tarree keessa tokko filuun barfuula jijjiiru ni dandeessa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156262				0	om	Ida'i				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153922				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_1\"\>Mallattoo foddaa durargii mirgatti mul'atan gara tuuta mallattoo ammaatti dabaluuf qaaqa kana cuqaasa.\</ahelp\> Maqaa saanduqa tarree \<emph\>Mallattoo\</emph\> keessatti agarsiifame jalatti olka'ama. Maqaa qabduu kana itti fayyadamuuf \<emph\>Mallattoo\</emph\> ykn \<emph\>Tuuta Mallattoo\</emph\> jalatti ifteessu qabda. Maqootni si'a tokko caala itti fayyadamuun hin danda'amu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150756				0	om	Fooyyessi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147570				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_2\"\>Maqaa mallattoo foddaa durargii bitaa keessatti mula'ate (maqaan inni moofan saanduqa tarree \<emph\>mallattoo moofa\</emph\> keessatti agarsiifama) maqaa haara saanduqa \<emph\>Mallattoo\</emph\> keessatti galchiteen bakka buusuuf qabduu kana cuqaasi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154640				0	om	Mallattoo gara tuuta mallattoo kabirootti siqsiisa jira				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151174				0	om	Akka fakkeenyatti, ALPHA guddaa "Giriiki" irra dabarsuuf tuuta "Addayaa" tti qindeessi, tuuta moofa (Giriiki ) fili ittaansun mallattoo ALPHA Saanduqoota tarree gubba lama fayyadami. Mallattoon foddaa durargii bitaa keessatti mula'atu. Saanduqa tarree \<emph\>tuuta Mallattoo\</emph\> keessatti, tuuta "Addayaa" fili. \<emph\>Fooyyessi\</emph\> cuqaasi achumaan \<emph\>TOLE\</emph\>. Mallattoon ALPHA amma tuuta mallattoo "Addayaa" keessa qofatti jira.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145414				0	om	Haqi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154258				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_3\"\>Mallattoo foddaa durargii bitaa keessatti mila'ate tuuta mallattoo ammaa keessa haquuf cuqaasi.\</ahelp\> Gaafatni ittisa hin jiru. Mallattoo dumaa qobaa hafee tuuta mallattoo keessa haquunis tuuta mallatto haqa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153527				0	om	Yeroo kamittu \<emph\>Dhiisi\</emph\> cuqaasuun jijjirra kee utuu ol hin ka'iin qaaqa cufu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
