helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_LISTBOX_RID_SYMBOLDIALOG_1\"\>Mallattoolen hundi tuuta mallattoo keessatti ijaaramaniiru. Tarre saanduqa keessa tuuta mallatto yaadame fili. Dirree armaan gadiitti gareen mallattoo gita'antu mula'atu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153917				0	om	Yemmu mallattoon filatame, tarree mallatto jalatti maqaan ajaja isaa ni dhufa akkasumaas fooyya'iinsi guddaatanis gara mirgaa sanduuqa keessatti dhufa. Akka as biratti agarsiisametti foddaa \<emph\>Ajaja\</emph\> keessatti barreefamu qabu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149126	3			0	om	Mallattoo saaguf, tarree keessa filii achumaan \<emph\>Saagu\</emph\> cuqaasi. Foddaa \<emph\>Ajaja\</emph\> keessatti maqaan ajaja gita'a ta'e ni dhufa. 				20200411 15:09:53
