helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	hd_id8036133				0	om	Ajaja "matrix" fayyadamuun hiriirsuuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_idN10F70				0	om	Gara bitatti hiriirsu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149645				0	om	Yoo sararri ykn himannoon barruun eegale, durtiin bitaarra hiriifamu. Kana ajaja \<emph\>hiriirsu\</emph\> kamiiniyyu jijjiru ni dandeessa. Fakkeenya \<emph\>stack{a+b-c*d#alignr "text"}\</emph\>, yeroo "barruu"n gara mirgaatti hiriirfame mul'atu. Yeroo hunda barruun mallattoo waraabbiitiin marfamu akka qaban yaadadha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149966				0	om	Baafata \<emph\>Dhangii - Hiriira\</emph\> utuu hin fayyadamiin foormulootni sadarkaa wiirta'an gara bitaatti hiriirfamu ni danda'u. Kana gochuuf, arfii diraa duwwaa kutaa foormulaa hiriirsu barbaadde dura qubachiisi, kunis, qoodduun galagalaan barruu kamiiniyyu marsa "", . Fakkeenyaf, \<emph\>"" a+b sarara haara "" c+d\</emph\> barreessun qixxaatoo lamaan keessatti qooda wiirtu bitaatti hiririisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3145654				0	om	Yemmuu foddaa Ajaja keessatti odeefannoo barreessinuu, Dhangiin tokko tokkoo caasa sirrii iddoo akka barbaadan yaadadhu. Kun keessumayyuu kan dhugoomu yemmuu bakka iddooqa gatii (fakkeenyaaf, a lsup{3}) galchituu dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3148708				0	om	\<link href=\"text/smath/01/03091100.xhp\" name=\"Brackets and Grouping\"\>Brackets and Grouping\</link\> odeefannoo dabalataa waa'ee dhangeessuu \<emph\>$[officename] Math\</emph\> keessattiif cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3155340				0	om	Odeeffannoo faayidaqabeessa ta'anii waa'een \<link href=\"text/smath/01/03091200.xhp\" name=\"Indexes and Exponents\"\>Kasaalee fi Eksiponeentii\</link\> and \<link href=\"text/smath/01/03091400.xhp\" name=\"Scaling\"\>Safaruu\</link\>, galmee kee kara gaari salphaa ta'een akka ati qindeessitu si gargaara.				20200411 15:09:53
