helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156261				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>bocquu; $[officename] Math keessa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>foormula bocquu; hiika jira\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hiika jira; foormula bocquu\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156261				0	om	Bocquu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153716				0	om	\<variable id=\"schriftartentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FONT\"\>Bocquu miseensa foormulatti fayyadamtuu ibsa.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154639				0	om	Bocquulee Foormulaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151187				0	om	Bocquulee jijjiiramtoota, lakkoofsoota fi barruu saagamn kanneen miseensa foormulaa kee uuman ibsuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156318				0	om	Saanduqni tarree qaaqa \<emph\>Bocquu\</emph\> keessa bocquu durtii miseensota hundaaf agarsiisa. Bocquu garagaratti jijjiruuf, \<emph\>Fooyyessi\</emph\> cuqaasi, ittaansun gosa miseensa filadhu. Saanduqni qaaqa haara ni dhufa. Bocquu yaadame filadhu akkasumas amaloota yaadamani kamiyyu mirkanneessa, ittaansuun \<emph\>Tole\</emph\> cuqaasi. Akka bocquu durtiitti jijjirra amma qindeessuuf, qabduu \<emph\>Durtii\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148831				0	om	Yoo tokkoon tokkoon keeyyata barruu bocquu kabiroo atii barruu hundaaf fayyadamte alatti mallattoo itti godhu yoo barbaadde, achii ajaja \<link href=\"text/smath/01/05010000.xhp\" name=\"FONT\"\>Bocquu\</link\> foddaa \<emph\>Ajaja\</emph\> keessatti galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154262				0	om	Jijjiiramoota				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147516				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_LISTBOX_RID_FONTTYPEDIALOG_1\"\>Bocquulee jijjiiramtoota foormulaa kee keessatiif filachu ni dandeessa.\</ahelp\> Fakkeenyaaf, foormulaa x=SIN(y) kana keessatti, x fi y jijjiiramtoota, bocquu itti ramadame calaqqisiisu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150708				0	om	Fankishinoota				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152950				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH:LISTBOX:RID_FONTTYPEDIALOG:2\"\>Maqaa fi amaloota faankishiniitif bocquu fili.\</ahelp\> Fakkeenyaaf, faankishinii foormulaa x=SIN(y) are =SIN( ) keessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149805				0	om	Lakkoofsoota				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154610				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH:LISTBOX:RID_FONTTYPEDIALOG:3\"\>Lakkoofsota foormulaa kee keessa jiraniif bocquu filachuu ni dandeessa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153529				0	om	Barruu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153780				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH:LISTBOX:RID_FONTTYPEDIALOG:4\"\>Barruu foormulaa kee keessa jiraniif bocquu ibsa (hiika).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152963				0	om	Bocquulee Mammiloo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154566				0	om	Qaaqa \<emph\>Bocquu\</emph\> kutaa kana keessatti bocquu ibsuu dandeessa, qaamoota barruu kabiroo foormulaa keessa wajjiin dhangeessuu ni dandeessa. Bocquulee bu'uura sadeen \<emph\>Serif, Sans\</emph\> fi \<emph\>Dhaabbata\</emph\> ni argamu. Bocquu kabiroo kamiyyu bocquu bu'uura ulaaga addunyaa guutun ijaaramanitti dabaluu ni dandeessa. Bocquu hundi system kee irratti ijaarame itti fayyadamuuf ni jira. Qabduu \<emph\>Fooyyessi\</emph\> jedhu filadhu filannoo tarree saanduqa keessa bal'isuu deegara.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151315	17			0	om	Yoo bocquulee garagara foddaa \<emph\>Ajaja\</emph\> keessatti ajaja BOCQUU wajjiin qindeessite bocquulee maamiloo kun fayyadu. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153670				0	om	Serif				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151108				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH:LISTBOX:RID_FONTTYPEDIALOG:5\"\>Bocquu fayyadamuuf jirtuu dhangii \<emph\>bocquu serif\</emph\> ifteessu ni dandeessa.\</ahelp\> Serifs "qajeelcha" xiqqoo mullachuu danda'anii dha, fakkeenyaaf, jala qubee guguddaa A yeroo bocquu bay'isu serif fayyadamne. Serifs fayyadamuun baay'e faayidaqabeessa sababni isaa agartuu dubbistoota sarara qajeela irra qajeelcha akkasumas dubbisu si'ayesiisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150836				0	om	Sans				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155900				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH:LISTBOX:RID_FONTTYPEDIALOG:6\"\>Dhangeessuu bocquu \<emph\>sans\</emph\> tiif bocquu ifteessu ni dandeessa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
