helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159194				0	om	Fooyyessi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146932				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH:MENUBUTTON:RID_FONTTYPEDIALOG:1\"\>Baafata ol bahuu kana keessa qaaqa \<link href=\"text/smath/01/05010100.xhp\" name=\"Fonts\"\>Bocquu\</link\> gahuuf filannoo tokkoo cuqaasi, bocquu fi amaloota foormulaa gita'etiif ibsuu ni dandeessa akkasumaas bocquu maamilootiif.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149304				0	om	Durtii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155186				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH:PUSHBUTTON:RID_FONTTYPEDIALOG:2\"\>Jijjiira kee akka durtii foormulaa haara hundaaf olka'uuf qabduu kana cuqaasi.\</ahelp\> Jijjirroota erga mirkaneesite booda, qabduu \<emph\>yaa\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
