helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148839				0	om	\<link href=\"text/smath/01/03091300.xhp\" name=\"Attributes\"\>Amaloota\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150051				0	om	Odeefannoon dabalataa waa'ee amaloota \<emph\>$[officename] Math\</emph\> keessa asitti argama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091300.xhp	0	help	par_id3146966				0	om	Amalootni \<emph\>acute\</emph\>, \<emph\>bar\</emph\>, \<emph\>breve\</emph\>, \<emph\>check\</emph\>, \<emph\>circle\</emph\>, \<emph\>dot\</emph\>, \<emph\>ddot\</emph\>, \<emph\>dddot\</emph\>, \<emph\>grave\</emph\>, \<emph\>hat\</emph\>, \<emph\>tilde\</emph\> fi \<emph\>vec\</emph\> yeroo hunda hamamta dhaabbata qabu akkasumas yoo mallattoo dheera gubbaa ta'anis hin dheeratan ykn hun bal'atan. Durtiidhaan, amalootni wiirta'aniiru.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154557				0	om	Amalootni dheerina mallattoo waliin guddatu \<emph\>overline\</emph\>, \<emph\>underline\</emph\> fi \<emph\>overstrike\</emph\> qofa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091300.xhp	0	help	par_id3151180				0	om	Diraa arfii tokko tokkoo, sararri \<emph\>jalmura\</emph\> waliin saagame arfiitti baay'ee dhihaachu ni danda'a. Haala kanaan, gurmuun duwwaa rakkoo kana furuu ni danda'a: \<emph\>jalmura Q sub {}\</emph\> qooda \<emph\>jalmura Q\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
