helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3145618				0	om	Hamamtaa jijjiiri				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153125				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_SIZEXY\"\>Hamamtaa bocquu fooyyessuuf ajaja iddooqa lamaan saagi. Iddooqi inni jalqabaa hamamtaa bocquu agarsiisa (fakkeenyaaf, 12) fi inni lammata barreefama qabateera.\</ahelp\> Caasaa sirridhaaf, gatiilee gidduu iddoo saagi. Dabalataan \<emph\>size <?> <?>\</emph\> kallattiin foddaa \<emph\>Ajajoota\</emph\> keessatti galchuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_idN10595				0	om	\<image id=\"img_id3148804\" src=\"starmath/res/at21720.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148804\"\>Sajoo\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154359				0	om	Bocquu jijjiri				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154371				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_FONTXY\"\>Gosa bocquu jijjiruuf ajaja iddooqa lamaan saagi. Iddooqa isa jalqabaa maqaa tokkoo \<link href=\"text/smath/01/05010000.xhp\" name=\"custom fonts\"\>bocquu maamiloo\</link\> keessa, \<emph\>Serif, Sans\</emph\> ykn \<emph\>Fixed\</emph\> bakka buusi. Iddooqa isa lamaffaa barreefamaan bakka buusi.\</ahelp\> Dabalataan \<emph\>font <?> <?>\</emph\> kallattiin foddaa \<emph\>Ajajoota\</emph\> keessatti barreessuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149626				0	om	 Halluu foormulaa keetii jijjiruuf ajaja \<emph\>halluu\</emph\> fayyadami. \<emph\>halluu\</emph\> barreessi, ittaansuun maqaa halluu (halluuleen jiran adii, gurraacha, hallataa, maagneetaa, diima, cuquliisa, magariisa and keelloos) barreessi, ittaansuun foormulaa, arfii ykn tarree arfii barreessi. Naqaan \<emph\>halluu magariisa hagamta 20 a\</emph\> qubee "a" magariisa bocquu hagamta 20 buusissas.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149627				0	om	Available color names are 16 HTML color names (white, silver, gray, black, red, maroon, yellow, olive, lime, green, aqua, teal, blue, navy, fuchsia and purple) and the names cyan and magenta. Cyan is rendered as aqua, magenta is rendered as fuchsia.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3146071				0	om	Ajajni \<emph\>nbold\</emph\> fi \<emph\>nitalic\</emph\> bocquu yabbuu ykn bocquu durtii mirgadaa qaamota foormula haqa. Fakkeenyaaf, foormulaa 5 x + 3=28 keessaa mirgada x irraa haquuf fuuldura x tti \<emph\>nitalic\</emph\> barreessi akka \<emph\>5 nitalic x + 3=28\</emph\> keessatti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150612				0	om	\<link href=\"text/smath/01/03091300.xhp\" name=\"attributes\"\>amalootni\</link\> kun "acute", "bar", "breve", "check", "circle", "dot", "ddot", "dddot", "grave", "hat", "tilde" fi "vec" hagamta dhaabataa qabu. Yemmu mallattoo dheera gubba qubachiisamani yabbinni fi dheerinni isaani hin mijeefamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155621	52			0	om	Jijjirraa hamamtaaf \<emph\>size n\</emph\>,\<emph\> +n\</emph\>,\<emph\> -n\</emph\>,\<emph\> *n\</emph\> fi\<emph\> /n \</emph\> fayyadamu ni dandeessa, \<emph\>n\</emph\> iddooqa dha. Tooftaan kun kan fayyaduu yemmuu hamamtaan buu'ura foormulaa jijjirratti saaxilamu dha. Ajajni \<emph\>size +n\</emph\> fi \<emph\>size -n\</emph\> hamamtaa tiqaa jijjira,  \<emph\>size *n\</emph\> fi \<emph\>size /n\</emph\> immoo hamamtaa dhibbeentaan jijjira. Fakkeenyaaf, ajajni \<emph\>size *1.17\</emph\> hamamtaa arfii sirrumaan 17% dabala.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3148695				0	om	Caasaa sirriif galiinsi tokko tokkoo iddoo barbaadu. Kun keessumayyuu kan dhugoomu yoo atii amaloota iddooqarra gatii dhaabbataatiin ifteessiteedha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3145230	50			0	om	Odeefannoo dabalataa waa'ee dhangeessuu \<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME\</emph\>          \<emph\>Math\</emph\> keessa, \<link href=\"text/smath/01/03091100.xhp\" name=\"Brackets and Grouping\"\>Sadallaa fi Gurmeessu\</link\> ilaali.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154221				0	om	Odeefannoon \<link href=\"text/smath/01/03091300.xhp\" name=\"attributes\"\>amaloota\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/smath/01/03091200.xhp\" name=\"indexes and exponents\"\>kaasalee fi eksiponeentii\</link\>, fi \<link href=\"text/smath/01/03091400.xhp\" name=\"scaling\"\>madaaluu\</link\> irraa shaffisaan galmee kee caasessuuf sii gargaara.				20200411 15:09:53
