helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id8962370				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sarara adeemsaa qixxaatoo issa sarara adeemsaa ti annee jiru.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id6889858				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Firoomina fuldurra sarara adeemsaa itti annee jiru agarsiisa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id8398998				0	om	Sarara adeemsa yoo taattoo issa akaakuu adda addaa fayyadamuti saagt'ee, Fakkatii \<emph\>Sarara \</emph\>ykn \<emph\>tarjaa, \</emph\>itti fufee lakkoofsa 1, 2, 3, \<emph\>…\</emph\> hudii kun akka gatii-x ti sarara adeemsa irrati heeregama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id5676747				0	om	Sarara adeemsa walfaannee deetaa hundaa ti saaguf, haalata gulaali galchuuf taattoo lama cuqaasi . Fili \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Saagi - Sarara Adeemsa\</item\>, itti fufuun sarara adeemsa hooma keessa ti fili, Sorooroo, Logaarizimii, Exponeentialii, ykn humna sarara adeemsa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id4349192				0	om	Sarara adeemsa walfaanneee deetaa tokkee ti saaguf, walfaannee deeataa taattoo keessati fili, baafata halqara banuuf mirga cuqaasi, itti fufuun fili \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Saagi - Sarara Adeemsa\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id9337443				0	om	Sarara adeemsa altokkee haqufi ykn gatii sarara miinii, Sarara irra cuqaasi,itti fufuun Furtuu Haqxuu dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id4529251				0	om	Sarara adeemsa hundaa haquuf, fili \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Saagi - Sarara Adeemsa\</item\>, itti fufuun fili \<emph\>Hooma\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id296334				0	om	Sararan adeemsa waayoo ofumaa keessati mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id4072084				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Sararan gatii miinii sarara adeemsa addaa issa gatii miini mul'sudha. Fayyadamii \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Saagi - Sarara gatii miinii\</item\> Sarara gatii miinii walfaannee deetaa hundaa ti saaguf.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id9569689				0	om	Sararan adeemsa walfaannee deetaa wajjiin halluu wal fakkataa qaba. Amala sarara jijjiiruuf, Sarara adeemsa fili itti fufuun fili \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Dhangii - Amala Wanta - Sarara\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id846888				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Sarara adeemsa qixxaatoo mul'suu fi, sarara adeemsa taattoo keessati fili, Baafata halqara banuuf mirgaa cuqaasi, itti fufuun fili \<emph\>Sarara Adeemsa Qixxaatoo Saagi\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id8962065				0	om	Yeroo taattoon haalata gulaali keessa jiru, %PRODUCTNAME sarara adeemsa qixxaatoo fi fuldurre firoomina R² siif kenna. Odeeffannoo kabala haalojii irra ilaaluf sarara adeemsa irratti cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id1328470				0	om	For a category chart (for example a line chart), the trend line information is calculated using numbers 1, 2, 3, … as x-values. This is also true if your data series uses other numbers as names for the x-values. For such charts the XY chart type might be more suitable.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id8092593				0	om	To show the equation and the coefficient of determination, select the trend line and choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Format Selection - Equation\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id7971434				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enable Show equation to see the equation of the trend line.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id558793				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enable Show Coefficient of Determination to see the determination coefficient of the trend line.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
