helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	hd_id7874080				0	om	Sorooroo dadhabbii expoonentialii qixxaatoo 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id4679097				0	om	 For exponential trend lines a transformation to a linear model takes place. The optimal curve fitting is related to the linear model and the results are interpreted accordingly. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id9112216				0	om	Dadhabbiin exponeenshaalii qixxaatoo hordoofee gala \<item type=\"literal\"\>y=b*exp(a*x)\</item\> ykn \<item type=\"literal\"\>y=b*m^x\</item\>, garra muuxata kan ti \<item type=\"literal\"\>ln(y)=ln(b)+a*x\</item\> ykn \<item type=\"literal\"\>ln(y)=ln(b)+ln(m)*x\</item\> tartiiban.				20200411 15:09:53
