helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	hd_id7907040				0	om	Sorooroo dadhabbiin polonoomialii qixxaatoo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id8918729				0	om	A \<emph\>dadhabbii polonoomialii\</emph\> qonyoon ofumman ida'uun hin danda'amu. Qonyoo kana dirqaaman hujeekan herregu. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id33875				0	om	Gabatee tarjaa waliin uummi x, x², x³, … , xⁿ, y hangaa digirii n barbachiisa ta'e ti. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id8720053				0	om	Foormulaa kana fayyadamii \<item type=\"literal\"\>=LINEST(Data_Y,Data_X)\</item\> hangii guutuun x garra xⁿ (Mataduree ottu hin qabattiin) akka Deetaa_X. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id5068514				0	om	Tarree issa tokkoffaa LIINESTII bahaan kan inni qabbattu fuldurre dadhabbii polonoomialii, fuldurre dhan xⁿ garra qubannoo bitaa ti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id8202154				0	om	Maalimaa tokkoffaa issa tarree saddaffa LINESTII gatiin issa kan bahaa r². Ilaali \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060107.xhp#Section8\"\>LINESTII\</link\> dalaga bal'inan iddo barbachiisa ti ulaaga fi hiikaa bahaa kan biroo waliin fayyadamu.				20200411 15:09:53
