helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id9842219				0	om	Kabaloota moggaa moggaadhaan agarsiisi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id9800103				0	om	Yoo siiqqonni taattoo keessatti agarsiifaman fi walfaanneen deetaa siiqqonnitti tokkoffatti miilta'e, karaa biroon immoo walfakkannen deetaa siiqqoo lammaffaatti milta'u, walfakkaanneen deetaa lamaanuu gargar agarsiifamamii tokkoon tokkoo isaaniis wal'irra ta'u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id2144535				0	om	Akka bu'aatti, kabalaan siilloo y ti miilta'e walakkaan isaa ykn gutummaan guututti kabala siilloo y isa lammaffaadhaan dhokata. Kana dhorkuuf, moggaa moggadhaan filannoon akka mul'atu taasisi. \<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Yoo siilloon tokko qofa irraatti miilta'e kabalaan walfaanee garaagaraa ni agarsiifamu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id24414				0	om	Faallee sa'aatii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id2527237				0	om	Taattoo deeloo fi donutii tiif ni jira. \<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Kallattiin durtii biilee taattoo deeloo itti qindaa'e kallattii sa'aatitiini  \<emph\>Faallee sa'aatii \</emph\> haalojii dandeesisi kallattii biilee faallaan kaasuuf.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id401013				0	om	Kofa jalqabaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id761131				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Tuqaa xiqqaa karaa geengootiin harkisi yookan geengoo irratti qabannoo kamiiyyuu cuqaasi kofa jalqabaa kan deeloo yookan donutii taattoo qindeessuuf. Kofni jalqabaa qabannoo kofa herreeguu ti kan biileen irraa kaafamu. Gatiin diigrii 90 qabannoo sa'aatii 12 citaa tokkoffaa kaasa. Gatiin diigrii qabduu sa'aa 3 irraa eegala.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id553910				0	om	Taattoo deeloo fi donuutii 3D keessatti kan mosajjii fooyyeen isaa duraanii ta'een uumama. Kofni jalqabaa diigrii 0 bakka diigrii 90. Taattoo haraa fi duraanii kan 2D durtii kofni diigrii jalqabaa 90.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id1414838				0	om	Yommuu kofa jalqabaa yookan kallattii jijjiirtu, mosajjii fooyyee ammaa gatii jijjiirama qofa agarsiiisa. Fooyyeen mosajjii duraanii galmee walfakkaatu gatii durtii fayyadamuun agarsiisa. Yeroo hunda kallattiin sa'aatii fi gatii jalqabaa diigrii (taattoo deeloo 2D) yookan diigrii 0(taattoo deeloo 3D) dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3179723				0	om	Diigrii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id2164067				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Kofa jalqabaa diigrii 0 fi 359 gidduu jiru galchi. Gatii agarsiifame jijjiiruuf xiyya cuqaasuu dandeessa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0305200910524613				0	om	Gatiiwwan hin jirre hojjadhu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id0305200910524650				0	om	Walfaannee deetaa taattoo keessatti mul'ifamu keessaa takka takka gatiiwwan deetaa baduu danda'u. Gatiiwwan hin jirre kana akkatti hojjettu baruuf dirqaalee hedduu keessaa filachuu dandeessa. Gosawwan taattoo qofaaf dirqaaleen kun ni jiraatu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0305200910524823				0	om	Addaan fageenya hambisi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id0305200910524811				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Gatii hinjirreef, deetaan homtuu hin agarsiifamu. Kun durtii gosawwan taattooti Tarjaa, Kabala, Sarara, Culqee.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0305200910524811				0	om	Zeeroo fudhu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id030520091052489				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Gatii hin jirreef, gatiin-y akka zeerootti agarsiifama. Kun naannoo gosa taattoof durtii dha.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0305200910524837				0	om	Sarara itti fufi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id0305200910524938				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Gatii hin jirreef, tilmaamni gatiiwwan bukkee irraa ni argama. Gosa taattoo XY tiif kun durtii dha.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0305200910524937				0	om	Gatiiwwan mandheewwan dhokatan irraa dabali				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id030520091052494				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Gatiiwwan maandheewwan ammee hangii mandhee maddaa keessa dhokatanii jiran agarsiisuuf mirkaneessi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Akaakuu Taattoo fi Kabala				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	bm_id5976744				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>column and line charts\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>chart types;column and line\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>combination charts\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	hd_id8596453				0	om	\<variable id=\"type_column_line\"\>\<link href=\"text/schart/01/type_column_line.xhp\"\>Akaakuu Taattoo fi Kabala\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id4818567				0	om	Fuula jalqabaa irratti\<link href=\"text/schart/01/wiz_chart_type.xhp\"\>Gargaartuu Taattoo\</link\> akaakuu taattoo filadhu. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	hd_id2451551				0	om	Tarjaa fi Sarara				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3101901				0	om	Tarjaa fi sararri taattoo makaa \<link href=\"text/schart/01/type_column_bar.xhp\"\>Taattoo tarjaa\</link\> waliin \<link href=\"text/schart/01/type_line.xhp\"\>sarara taattoo\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id7910397				0	om	Addaba'oo ta'e tokko filadhu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id5244300				0	om	Tarjaa fi Sararoota. Sarjaan reektangilii walfakkannee deetaa moggaa moggaadhaan kaafaman kanaaf gatii isaanii haala salphaan dorgomsiisi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id7163609				0	om	Tarjaa walirra tuullee fi Sararoota. Reektaangiliin sarjaa walfakkannee deetaa walii olitti kuufama kanaaf, dheerinni tarjaa ida'ama gatii deetaa mul'isa. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id1842097				0	om	Siilloo y suuquu dandeessa \<link href=\"text/schart/01/04040000.xhp\"\>Siiqqota-Suuqaa\</link\> erga masaka xumurteen booda.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	hd_id8297677				0	om	Hanga deetaa ifteessuuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id8871120				0	om	Sarjaan gara bitaa (yookan tarree gubbaa) hangi deetaa filamee deetaa akka wanta tarjaatti kenna. Sarjaan biroo yookan tarreen hanga deeataa sarara wantaatiif kenna. Mogaasa qaaqaa kana jijjiiruu \<emph\>Walfakkannee deetaa\</emph\> dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id2952055				0	om	Hanga deetaa filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id594500				0	om	Filannoo kenname walfaannee deetaa tarreen yookan tarjaan cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id1944944				0	om	Hangi deetaa tarree tokkoffaa irra yookan tarjaa tokkoffaa irratti waammee yookan lamaanirraa yoo qabaate mirkaneessi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	hd_id6667683				0	om	Walfaannee deetaa qindeessuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id7616809				0	om	Walfaannee deetaa sanduuqa tarree keessaa, tarree deetaa hunda taattoo ammee keessaatti argita.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id9770195				0	om	Sarjaan walfaannee deetaa qabannoo tarree gubbaa irratti fi sararri walfaannee deeataa gara jala tarreetti argama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id1446272				0	om	Walfaannee deetaaa qindeessuuf, tarree keessaatti galfata filadhu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3779717				0	om	Galfata filamee gadittii walfaannee deetaa biroo ida'uuf Ida'aa cuqaasi. Walfaanneen deetaa haraan akaakuu galfata filame waliin gosa tokko.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id5056611				0	om	Tarree walfaannee deetaa kessaa galfata filame haquuf Haqaa cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id7786492				0	om	Xiyya qabduu Olii fi Gadi fayyadami galfata filame tarree keessatti olii fi gadi siqsi. Haala kanaan walfakkaannee sarjaa deetaa gara walfakkaanne tarree deetaatti geedartee duubaatti deebisuu dandeessa. Kun tartiiba gabatee madda deetaa hin jijjiiru garuu qindaa'ina taattoo irrattii qofa jijjiira.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	hd_id265816				0	om	Walfakkannee deetaa gulaaluu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id6768700				0	om	Tarree keessatti amala galfata ilaaluuf ykn gulaaluuf galfata cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id1924497				0	om	Hanga deetaa sanduuqa tarree keessatti qooda maqaa fi hangii man'ee qaamota walfaannee deetaa ilaalta.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id5081942				0	om	Galfata cuqaasi, itti aansuun qabeentoota sanduuqa barruu keessaa gadii gulaali.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id2958464				0	om	moggasni Sanduuqa barruutti aanu fakkeenya ammeen filame ibsa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id883816				0	om	qaaqa gadeessuu fi hangii hantuutee waliin filuuf hammangaa saagi ykn \<emph\>hammanga deetaa fili\</emph\> cuuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id5091708				0	om	Hammangan ga`ee deetaaf, kan akka gatiiwwan-y, dirqama man`ee moggaasa ofkeessatti hin qabatan.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	hd_id974456				0	om	Gulaalaa akaakuuwwanii ykn moggaasa deetaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id2767113				0	om	Hammanga man`ee akaakuuwwaniif ykn moggaasa deetaaf akka barruutti gargaaru saagi ykn fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id301828				0	om	Gatiiwwan hammanga akaakuuwwan keessaa siiqqee x irratti akka moggaasaatti agarsiisamu.				20200411 15:09:53
