helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_line.xhp	0	help	par_id7889950				0	om	Moggaasa deetaa adda addaa tokko tokkoo deetaaa walfaanneef qindeessuuf, amaloota qaaqa deetaa walfaannee gargaarami.				20200411 15:09:53
