helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152577				0	om	Qaaqaan kun qaphxii deetaa filamee akka jijjiiramu eeyyama. Qaaqaan kun kan mul'atu gosni deetaa tokkoo qofti yoo filatamee yommuu ati \<emph\>Dhangii - Filannoo Dhangii\</emph\> filattu. Baafanni tokko tokko galfataa taatoo 2D yookan 3D dhaan qofa argama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149121				0	om	Jijjiiramni uumamae kamiyyuu qaphxii deetaa tokkoo qofa miidha. Fakkeenyaaf, yoo halluu kabala gulaalte halluu kabalaa qofatu adda ta'a.				20200411 15:09:53
