helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id6998809				0	om	Fuula jalqabaa irratti \<link href=\"text/schart/01/wiz_chart_type.xhp\"\>Masaka Toottoo\</link\> Taattoo baafata dubbii hallee keessatti akaakuu taattoo filachuu dandeessa. \<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Torree ilaalcha fuulsadee, kabala, deloo, fi bali'ina taattoo. Sarara fi XY(faca'iinsa) taattoo sarara 3D ilaaluu dandeessa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id6942045				0	om	Durargii taattoo qindaa'ina isa haraa qaaqaa kessatti galchitee gabaasa. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id3806878				0	om	Yoo qaaqa TOLE jette kessaa baate qindaa'inni yeroo hundaaf fayyada. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id130619				0	om	Yoo qaaqa dhiistee yookan irra utaalte kessaa baate, taattoon haalatti deebi'a yoo ati qaaqa bantu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id8081911				0	om	Taattoo 3D dhaaf \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Dhangii - Ilaaloo 3D \</item\> filachuun kaadhima, argamsaa fi calaqqee qindeessuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	hd_id2924283				0	om	Tilmaamuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id5781731				0	om	Gatii marsaa taattootiif siiqqoo sadee irratti fi tilmaama mil'annoo galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id9999694				0	om	Kofa hunda 0 tti taattoo mul'anno fuldurattif qindeessi.Taattoo deloo fi taattoo donuutii akka geengootti agarsiifamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id2861720				0	om	Siiqqota gara mirgaa waliin hojjeta, qabiyyee taattoo kallattii X fi Y kessatti marsuu dandeessa, innis daangaa taattootiin walmaddii dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id2216559				0	om	Gatiin x inni 90 y fi z waliin 0 tti qindaa'uun, mul'ata gubba gara jala taattootti agarsiisa. Gara jala taattoo x waliin -90 qindaa'e argita.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id7869502				0	om	Marsaan tartiiba dura x, itti aanee y, dhuma irratti z fayyadama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id9852900				0	om	Yoo gadideessuun hojate fi taattoo marsite fi yoo ifni taattootti murataa'e ifni ni marsama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id2578203				0	om	Siiqqonni marsaa yeroo hunda fuula walitti foraa'a, taattoo siiqqotaati miti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id4923245				0	om	Tilmaama haalhojii tattoo filadhu tilmaama keessaa akka doo'atuuf fakkaftuu mul'istu fayyadami iddoo karoortii walmaddii fayyadamuun.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id3416547				0	om	Dheerina xiyyeffanna qabduu qaanxii waliin qindeessi. 100% tilmaama mul'ataa kenna yommuu afoon fagoo guddinni taattoo tilmaaman walakka afoo cinaa fakkaatu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id3791924				0	om	Fooyyeen durattii %PRODUCTNAME kan agarsiisa paarsantii tilmaamaa foyyee ammee waliin tokko ta'e.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id7623828				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Yoo kofni mirgaa dalage,qabiyyee taattoo kallattii X fi Y qofatti marsuu dandeessa. Innis,walmaddii daangaa taattootti. Siiqqoon kofa sirrii durtiin taattoo haraa 3D dhaan uumame dandeesifama . Deloo fi Donuutiin siiqqota kofa sirrii hin deegarani.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id4721823				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Marsaa taattoo siilloo x irratti qindeessi. Durargiin qindaa'ina haraaf gabaasa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
