helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id6070436				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sanduuqa itti aanee dhufu doo'innee fakkaftuu keessatti mul'isuuf mallattoo itti godhi. Paarsanteejii qindeessuuf qaanxii qabduu fayyadamai. Paarsanteejii baay'een wanti dhiyoo jiru wanta fagoo jiru irra guddaa fakkaata.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
