helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id7432477				0	om	Gurmoo filachuun, sanduuqa filannoo fi maddi ifaa haalaa galuumsaan qindaa'u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id7141026				0	om	Yoo makaa sanduuqa filannoo mallatteesite yookan mallatttessu baatte, gurmoo qabataman yookan gurmoo salphaan hin kennamu, gurmoo baratamaa uumta.				20200411 15:09:53
