helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id6531266				0	om	Qabduu saddeettan keessaa ifa kallattii banuu yookan cufuu irraatti biliqsuuf cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id6173894				0	om	Durtiin maddi ifaa inni lammaffan ni biliqa. Innis tokkoffaa torban "normal" keessa madda ifaa walfakkaataniti.Maddi ifaa lakkofsa waajama tokkoo balqeessisuu ifaa shoola waliin ta'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id2761314				0	om	Madda ifaa filameef, halluu filuu fi hamma saduuqa tarree keessatti qabduu saddetanii gadi ta'a. Gatiin balaqeessa'uu ifa hundaa ni ida'ama. Kanaafuu yoo ifa karaa baay'een dandeesiftu halluu dukkana'aa fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id3912778				0	om	Durargii xiqqaan sarjaa fi surdala qabannoo qindeessuuf madda ifa filamee fuula caancalee keessatti islaayiderii lama qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	par_id3163853				0	om	Qabannoon xiyyoo durargii xiqqaa keessaa calaqqee gara keessaa halata mulullee fi kiyuubii gidduu agarsiisa.				20200411 15:09:53
