helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149666				0	om	\<variable id=\"statistik\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Qaaqa\<emph\> Kabala dogongoraa Y \</emph\>kana fayyadami kabala dogongoraa taattoo 2Df  agarsiisuf.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3401287				0	om	Kabali dogongoraa kan sarara waa himaa hangii y - Hi'eertaGatiiDogongoraa gara y + Eeda'aaGatiiDogngoraa ti ga'udha. Jecha kana irrati, y ni gatii tuqaalee deetaa ti. yoomuu "standard deviation" filaatamuu, y ni gatii meanii walfaannee deetaati. Hi'eertaGatiiDogongoraa fi Eeda'aaGatiiDogongoraa herregduun hamma kan ta'u dalaga kabala dogongoraan ykn qulqulliinan kennamma.				20200411 15:09:53
