helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3236182				0	om	The data series are organized in columns. The role of the left most column is set to categories or data labels respectively. The contents of the left most column are always formatted as text. You can insert more text columns to be used as hierarchical labels.				20200411 15:09:53
