helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_bubble.xhp	0	help	par_id40589				0	om	Fuula jalqabaa \<link href=\"text/schart/01/wiz_chart_type.xhp\"\>Masaka Taattoo\</link\> irratti gosa taattoo filachuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_bubble.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200904491284				0	om	Hoomacha				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_bubble.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200904491222				0	om	Taattoon homachaa walitti dhufeenya jijjiramoota sadii agarsiisa. Qubachiisa siiqqee-X fi siiqqee-Y jijjiiramoota lamaan fayyadama, jijjiiramaan sadaffaa akka hammamtaa firoomaa hoomichaawwan tokko tokkootti agarsiifama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_bubble.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200906040162				0	om	Taattoo homachaaf qaaqni adeemsa deetaa galfata hamamtaa hoomachaaf hangii deetaa qindeessuu qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
