helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148407				0	om	If you want the dimension line to be the same length as the side of a nearby object, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key while dragging. To constrain the dimension line to 45 degrees, hold down the Shift key while dragging.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148986				0	om	Fakkaasaa %PRODUCTNAME keessatti dheerinni fi bal'inni sararaa yeroo hundaa qajeelcha irratti \<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/layer_tipps.xhp\" name=\"layer\"\>baqqaanni\</link\> saagame \<emph\>Dheerinaa fi Bal'ina\</emph\> sararawwanii jedhama. Baqqaana sana akka hin mul'annetti yoo keessa kaafama keetirratti dheerinaa fi bal'ina arguu hindeessuu.				20200411 15:09:53
