helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157874				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Mirror\"\>Wanta(oota)filatamanii maddii sarara meelchuu ati islaayidiirratti iddoo barbaaddeetti harkistu meelcha. Qabannoo wanta(toota) gamaa gamana sarara meelchu harkisuuf. Qaabachisa sarara meelchuu jijjiiruuf, tokko isaa qabxii isadhumaa gara argama haaraatti harkisi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
