helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145169				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ConvertInto3DLathe\"\>Wanta(oota)G-2 filatame gara wanta G-3tti kan jijjiiruu maddii sarara walqixaan marsuu dhaanii.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150332	36			0	om	Boca wanta jijjiiramee jijjiiruuf, sarara walqixa gara argama haaraatti harkisi. Yaadachiisa sarara walqixaa jijjiiruuf dhuma qabxii tokko isaatti harkisi. Gara G-3 tti jijjiiruuf wanta cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
