helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\layers.xhp	0	help	par_id3146313	3			0	om	Baqqaanootni Fakkasaa $[officename] keessaatti malee Impress $[officename] keessatti hin aragamuu. Baqqaanootni fuula walfakaatan irratti maalimoota akka gurmeessitu hayyama. Baqqaannoota, mul'annoo, maxxansuu, ykn cufuu irraa akka iddoo hojii dhuunfaatti dhooksu dandeessu yaadi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\layers.xhp	0	help	par_id7036957				0	om	Baqqaanootni, baqqaana Too'atamtootaa \<emph\>Too'annoo\</emph\>baqqaanoota birroo fuldurartti argamanif yoo ta'e male tatiba sadarkaa wantoota fuularratti hin ibsu. 				20200411 15:09:53
