helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\select_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3159238				0	om	Wanta wanta birootin haguugame filachuuf, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Dirqala\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> gaqabi tii hanga wanta sararame bira geessitti gara wantaatin cuqaasi. Tartiiba gara wantaatin marsuuf, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Dirqala\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift gaqabi yommuu cuqaastu.				20200411 15:09:53
