helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_draw.xhp	0	help	par_id3148868	4			0	om	Sajoon \<emph\>Qanyoo\</emph\> \<image id=\"img_id3150205\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_linetoolbox.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150205\"\>Sajoo\</alt\>\</image\>kamshaa \<emph\>Fakkasaa\</emph\> irraa kamshaa qonyoota Bézier fakkasuuf oolu bana. Qonyootii Bézier qaphxiilee jalqabaa fi dhumaa jedhamaniin hikama. Qonyoowwaan Qonyoo Bézier qaphxiilee too'annoo ("qabannoota") jedhamaniin hiikama. Qaphxiilee too'annoo sochasuun boca qonyoo Bézier jijjiira.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_draw.xhp	0	help	par_id8532364				0	om	Qaphxiileee too'annoo halata "Qaphxiile Gulaali" qofaan mul'atu. Qaphxiilee too'annoogengoodhaan bakka bu'ama. Qaphxiileen anchor immoo iskweeriidhaan bakka bu'ama. qaphxii jalqabaa xiqqoo qaphxiilee anchor irraa guddata				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_draw.xhp	0	help	par_id3150210				0	om	Segmantoota qonyoo Bézier fi sarara qajeelaa walitti makamuun qonyoota Bézier baay'ee xaxamaa ta'aan uumu. Ce'uumsootni garagaraa sadi ta'an gara sagmentoota cinnaatti argamanitti makkamuuf fayyaduu danda'u:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_draw.xhp	0	help	par_id3154766				0	om	Qaphxiin hituu \<emph\>walfakkaatoo\</emph\> mogaa lamaan keessaa gama tokkon dacha'aa sararaa walfakkaatoo fi sararoota too'annoo akka sarara qajeelaatti waliin socho'an lama of keessaa qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
