helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id2629474				0	om	Yoo”qonyoo”, “rogaddee” ykn “sarara unka akka feetee filatte, qaaqni ni cufama. Yoo fakkasaan dhume fi haqamu baate, xurreen uumamee galmicha keessaa haqameetii akka xurree sochiitti saagama.				20200411 15:09:53
