helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3155959				0	om	Qaphxilee deetaa fi qaphiilee too'annoo sarara fi qonyoowwaa ilaaluuf, sarara fili, kana booda sajoo \<emph\>Qaphxiilee\</emph\> kabala Fakkasaa irra jiru cuqaasi. Qaphxilee deetaa yemmuu skuweerdhaan bakka bu'aman qaphxiilee too'annoo ammoo gengoodhaan akka buttamu qaphxii too'annoo qaphxii deetaa irratti dacha'ee taa'u danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
