helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3156064				0	om	\<emph\>Dhangiin - Fuula\</emph\> fili, kana booda calcala \<emph\>duubbeerratti\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3145356	59			0	om	Iddo \<emph\>Guutiinsa\</emph\> keessatti, \<emph\>suurxiqqoo\</emph\> fili, kana booda tarree keessaa calaqqee cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3150757	60			0	om	Yoo calaqqee maamiloo duubbee isalaayidiitiif fayyadamu barbaaddee, \<emph\>Qaaqa Qindaa'ina Fuulaa\</emph\> cufi, kana booda \<emph\>Dhangii – Bal'ina\</emph\> fili. Caancala \<emph\>Suurxiqqoowwan\</emph\> cuqaasi, kana booda \<emph\>Alaaguu\</emph\> cuqaasi. Calaqqee alaaguu barbaadduu mul'isitti \<emph\>Bani\</emph\> cuqaasii. Yemmuu gara caancala \<emph\>Duubbee\</emph\>tti deebitu, calaqqeen alaagdee tarree \<emph\>Suurxiqqoo\</emph\> keessatti taa'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3153151				0	om	Kanneen itti aanana keessaa tokko hojadhu:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3150263	62			0	om	Calaqqee mara akka duubbeetti mul'isuuf, \<emph\>Iddoo\</emph\> bal'inaa keessaa saanduqa filannoo \<emph\>Daltuuli\</emph\> haqi, kana booda \<emph\>TaasisaaOfmaa\</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3149756				0	om	Calaqqee duubbeerratti dultuuluuf \<emph\>Daltuuli\</emph\> filitii, dirqalaalee \<emph\>Hammamtaa\</emph\>, \<emph\>Iddoo\</emph\>, fi \<emph\>Iddoodaa\</emph\> qindeessi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3154934				0	om	\<emph\>Tole\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3158403				0	om	Fooyyeffamni kuni galme pirezanteshiinii ammaa qoofaaf fayyada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_idN10820				0	om	Kuusaa islaayidii haaraa akka fajojiitti jlkaa'uuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_idN10827				0	om	Gara kuusaa islaayidiitti jijjiiruuf, \<emph\>Mul'annoo - Hundataa\</emph\> kuusaa islaayidiitti filu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_idN1082F				0	om	Dubbee islaayidii ykn \<emph\>Dhangii - Fuula\</emph\> fili ykn ajajoota dhangeessuu biro filadhu. Wantootni asitti ideessan islaayidoota kuusaa islaayidii irratti hundaa'an hundarratti mul'atu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_idN10837				0	om	Mul'annoo hundataa cufuuf, \<emph\>Mula'nnoo Baratamoo\</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_idN1083F				0	om	Galmee akka qajojiitti olkaa'uuf \<emph\>Faayilii – Qajoojiilee – Olkaa'i\</emph\> filii.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_idN10847				0	om	Qajoojichaaf maqaa galchi. Akkaakuu kana "Qajoojiilee kiyya" kan jedhuurraa hin jijjiirin. Tole cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_idN1084A				0	om	Qajojii haaraa irratti hundaa'uun piresanteeshini haaraa banuuf, masaka pirezenteeshinii fayyadamu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Qaphxii Cuftii Fayyadamuun				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	bm_id0919200803534995				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>qaphxiiwwan cuftii;fayyadamuu\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_idN1065F				0	om	\<variable id=\"gluepoints\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/gluepoints.xhp\"\>Qaphxii Cuftii Fayyadamuun\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803040964				0	om	Toleessa fi fakkaasa, bocawwan lamaanii walqabsiisuu sarara waliin \<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10100000.xhp\"\>kornyoo\</link\>. Yommuu kornyoo gidduu fakkaastu, kornyoon tokkoon tokko bocaa irratti qabphxii cuftiitti maxxanfama. Tokkoon tokkoo bocaa durtii qaphxii cuftii of keessaa qabatee, fi qabannoon durtii qaphxii cuftii bifa murataawaa qaba. Maamiloo qaphxii cuftii mataa keetii bifattii fi kornyootti gara maamila qaphxii cuftiitti maxxansuun ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803041099				0	om	Qaphxii cuftii ida'uu fi gulaaluuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id091920080304108				0	om	Kanneen armaan gadii kessaa tokkoo hojjedhu:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803041082				0	om	\<emph\>Qaphxii Cuftii\</emph\> sajoo masaka Fakkaasaa irratti cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803041186				0	om	\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Gulaaluu - Qaphxiiwwan Cuftii\</item\> filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803041160				0	om	\<emph\>Qaphxii Cuftii Saagi\</emph\> sajoo masaka fakkaasaa irratti cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803041115				0	om	Keesssa bocaa qaphxii cuftii haaraa ida'uu yoo barbaadde cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803041133				0	om	Bocni yoo guute, keessa boca iddoo kamiyyuu cuqaasuu dandeessa. Yoo bocni guutuu baate, qaphxii cuftii saaguuf handaara cuqaasuu dandeessa. Yoo al tokko saagame, qaphxii cuftii qabannoo birootti harkisuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803041250				0	om	Sajoo afran \<emph\>Gulaaluu Qaphxiiwwan Cuftii\</emph\> ti aanaee jiru sajoo, kallattii kornyoof kan eeyyamamu qaphxii cuftii irratti failchuu dandeessa. Kallattii tokkoo fi isaa ol qaphxii cuftii murtaa'ee filuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803041298				0	om	Yoo \<emph\>Qaphxii Cuftii Firoomaa\</emph\> sajoon ka'aa ta'e, qaphxiin ni siqa yoo hagamtaa wantaa jijjiirtu firummaa handaara wantootatin qabannoo eeguuf.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803041223				0	om	Yoo \<emph\>Qaphxii Cuftii Firoomaa\</emph\> sajoon ka'aa yoo ta'uu baate, sajoon itti aanee jiru baay'ee fajajaa miti. Sajoo kanaan qaphxiin cuftii eessa akka taa'u yommuu hamamtaan wantaa jijjiiramu murteessu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
