helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id4846339				0	om	Yoo sirniichii foddaan toorgiiwwan jiran irratti akka babala'atuu haayyamee, "Toorgiiwwan hunda" filachuu dandeessa. Haala kanaan pirezanteeshiini toorgiiwwan jiran hunda irratti babala'atta.				20200411 15:09:53
