helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974	2			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Combine\"\>Wantoota filataman tokkoo fi tokkoo olii gara boca tokkottii maka.\</ahelp\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05290000.xhp\" name=\"grouping\"\>Tuutessu\</link\> irraa bifaadda ta`een, wantootnii makamman amaloota wantoota tartiiba sadarka wantoota kessaa issa gaddii irraa jiran qabaatu. Wantoota makaman \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/13150000.xhp\" name=\"split\"\>adda baasu\</link\> dandessa, garu ammalootnii jalqaba wantootaa ni bada.				20200411 15:09:53
