helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146978				0	om	Qabiyee man'ee filattamee haquuf, haqii dhiibi. Kunnis kan banuu \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02150000.xhp\" name=\"Delete Contents\"\>Qabiyyee haqi\</link\> qaaqa, kananiis man'ee qabiyyee filitte haquu dandessa. Qabiyyee man'ee filattamee qaaqala alla haquuf, Furtuu DUUBXOOLA dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
