helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	par_id3145232	19			0	om	Sadarkaa 2 "Dalagaa  %PRODUCTNAME Basic fayyadamuun qindeessuu" keessatti, qaaqa \<emph\>Macro\</emph\> keessatti \<emph\>Gulaali \</emph\> cuqaaste. Akka durtiitti, dirree \<emph\>Macro irraa\</emph\> keessatti muraan \<emph\>Macros koo - Durtii - Muraa1\</emph\> ni filatama. Galmee\<emph\>Durtii\</emph\> galeeloo fayyadamaa keessa jira..				20200411 15:09:53
