helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3149402				0	om	Faayilootni gatiiwwan qoodduun addan bahan(CSV)faayiloota barruu kan qabiyyeewwan man'ee wardii baaqqee qabatu dha. Qoodduuwwan, buufatoonni xiqqaa, ykn arfiileen biroo akka daangessaa dirree jidduu man'eeleetti fayyaduu danda'u. Diraawwan barruu mallattoo waraabbii keessa taa'u, lakkoofsonni mallattoo waraabbii malee barreeffamu. 				20200411 15:09:53
