helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3147340	13			0	om	Ajajni yoo wardiin dhorki barreessuu banaa ta'uun yoo banamee ture hin mul'atu.Haala kanaan,sajoo \<emph\>Faayilii gulaali \</emph\> kabala \<emph\>Durtii\</emph\>irraa cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
