helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3156424				0	om	Foormulaa garagalchuuf karaa adda addaatu jira. Malli dhiyeeffame tokko:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3150439				0	om	Maadhee foormulaa qabate filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319				0	om	\<emph\>Gulaali - Garagalchi\</emph\> filadhu, ykn garagalchuuf \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+C dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3159155				0	om	Maadhee foormulaan itti akka garagalchamu barbaadde filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3153728				0	om	\<emph\>Gulaali - Maxxansi\</emph\> filadhu, ykn garagalchuuf \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+ C tuqi. Foormulaan man'ee haaraa keessa qubachiifama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3149961				0	om	Yoo foormulaa maadhee baay'eetti garagalchuu barbaadde, gara bal'inoota cinaatti garagalchuuf karaa saffisaa fi salphaatu jira:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3149400				0	om	Maadhee foormulaa qabatee jiru filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3154018				0	om	Hantuutee jala mirgaa xiyyoo shoolamaa maadhee irra qubachiisiitii, qabduu hantuutee gad qabuu hanga qareen mallattoo qaxxaamura-mataatti jijjiiramtuutti itti fufi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	om	Akka qabduun hantuutee gad qabameen, gadi ykn gara mirgaa maadheelee foormulaa itti garagalchitu gubbaan harkisi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3153714				0	om	Yeroo qabduu hantuutee gad dhiistu, foormulaan gara maadheeleetti garagaleetu ufmaan sirreeffama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3156385				0	om	Yoo gatiiwwanii fi barruuwwan akka ufmaan hin sirroofne barbaadde, furtuu \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> yeroo harkistu gad qabi. Foormulaawwan, garuu, hogayyuu haalaan sirreeffamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Gingilcha Ufmaa raawwachuu				20200411 15:09:53
