helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	hd_id5621509				0	om	Gatiiwwan Hangii Man'eewwaniitti Hujeekaan Galchuuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id8200018				0	om	Yeroo garee deetaa harkaan galchitu amaloota si gargaaran lamatu jiru.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	hd_id1867427				0	om	Tarreewwan Haaraaf Bal'ina Baruu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id7908871				0	om	Tarree jala tarree irraantoo keessatti, man'ee tokkoo gara itti aanutti socho'uuf  furtuu Tab fayyadamuu dandeessa. Erga gatii man'ee dhumaatti tarree ammee keessatti galchitee booda, Enter dhiibi. Calc qaree jala man'ee jalqabaa kan garee ammee keessa qubachiisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id6196783				0	om	\<image id=\"img_id6473586\" src=\"res/helpimg/area1.png\" width=\"4.8335in\" height=\"1.5937in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id6473586\"\>bal'ina baruu\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id8118839				0	om	Tarree 3 keessatti, man'ee B3 gara C3,D3, fi E3 socho'uuf, Tab tuqi. Achiin gara B4 socho'uuf Enter dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3583788				0	om	Filannoo Bal'inaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id2011780				0	om	Bal'ina bakka gatiiwwan naquuf barbaaddufilachuuf harkisii-kaayi fayyadami. Garuu harkisuu man'ee bal'inaa isa dhumaa irraa jalqabiitii qabduu hantuutee yeroo man'ee isa jalqabaa filatte gad dhiisi. Amma gatiiwwan galchuu jalqabuu dandeessa. Gara man'ee ittaanuu deemuuf hoggayyuu furtuu Tab tuqi. Bal'ina filatame keessaa hin baatu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id7044282				0	om	\<image id=\"img_id2811365\" src=\"res/helpimg/area2.png\" width=\"4.8335in\" height=\"1.5937in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id2811365\"\>filannoo bal'inaa\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3232520				0	om	Bal'ina E7 hanga B3 filadhu.Amma B3 n naqa kee eeggata.Bal'ina filatame keessatti gara man'ee itti aanuutti socho'uuf Tab dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	hd_id8950163				0	om	Gatiiwwan Hangii Man'eeleetti Hujeekaan Galchuuf				20200411 15:09:53
