helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_view.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	om	To hide column and line headers in a table:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_view.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	om	Under the menu item \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc,\</emph\> go to the \<emph\>View\</emph\> tab page. Unmark\<emph\> Column/row headers\</emph\>. Confirm with \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_view.xhp	0	help	par_id3147436				0	om	Sararoota tarsaa dhoksuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_view.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726				0	om	Under the menu item \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc\</emph\>\<emph\>,\</emph\> go to the \<emph\>View\</emph\> tab page. Unmark \<emph\>Grid lines\</emph\>. Confirm with \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
