helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id3808404				0	om	Yemmuu \<emph\>Barbaadi\</emph\> cuqaastu, Calc man'ee ittaanu kan barruu kee qabatu filata. Barruu ilaaluu fi gulaaluu dandeessa, gara man'ee ittaanee argamuutti deemuuf achiin \<emph\>Barbaadi\</emph\> ammas cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id2394482				0	om	Yoo qaaqa cuftee jiraatte, man'ee ittaanu osoo qaaqa hin banin argachuuf makaa furtuu(\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+F) tuquu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id631733				0	om	Durtiin, Calc wardii ammee barbaada. \<emph\>Dirqaalaalee Dabalataa\</emph\> cuqaasi, achiin wardiilee galmee hunda keessa barbaaduuf \<emph\>Wardiilee hunda keessa barbaadi\</emph\> dandeessisi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id7811822				0	om	Yeroo \<emph\>Hunda Barbaadi\</emph\> cuqaastu, Calc man'eelee hunda kan galfata kee qabatu filata. Amma fakkeenyaaf man'eelee argaman hunda yabbuu gochuu dandeessa, ykn haalata man'ee hundaaf altokko raawwachuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
