helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_protect.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C7				0	om	Caasaa galmee dhorkuuf,fakkeenyaaf lakkaawwii,\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/rename_table.xhp\"\>names\</link\>,fi tartiiba wardiilee,akka hin jijjiiramne,\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Miyoota - Galmee Dhorki - Galmee\</item\>filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
