helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\line_fix.xhp	0	help	par_id3148576				0	om	If you have long rows or columns of data that extend beyond the viewable area of the sheet, you can freeze some rows or columns, which allows you to see the frozen columns or rows as you scroll through the rest of the data.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\line_fix.xhp	0	help	par_id3156441				0	om	Tarree jalaa, ykn sarjaa mirga tarree ykn sarjaa bal'ina dhaabbii keessa akka ta'u barbaaddu filadhu. Tarreewwan gubbaa hundi, ykn sarjaaleen bitaa filannoo jiran hundi ni dhaabbatu.				20200411 15:09:53
