helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3156442				0	om	Durtiidhaan, $[officename] ufmaan dogoggora barreessuu baratamoo sirreessuudhaan yeroo barreessitu dhangeessuu raawwata. Jijjiirraa ufmaa kamiyyuu \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Z fayyadamuun battalumatti gaabbuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
