helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3154730				0	om	Yeroo galfata man'ee keessatti galchitu,$[officename] Calc ufmaan naqa gitu kan sarjaa sana keessaa argame yaada dhiyeessa. Fankishiniin kun \<emph\>OfmaaNaqaa\</emph\> jedhama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3153878				0	om	Naqa ufmaa banuuf/cufuuf, mallattoo filannoo \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/06130000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Cell Contents - AutoInput\"\>\<emph\>Miyoota - Qabiyyeewwan man'ee - Naqa ufmaa\</emph\>\</link\> fuuldura jiru qindeessi yookiin balleessi.				20200411 15:09:53
