helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3153707				0	om	$[officename] Calc galfatoota muraasa ufmaan gara dhangii guyyaatti jijjiira. Fakkeenyaaf, galfatni \<emph\>1.1\</emph\> bara ammee keessatti akka amajjii 1 tti, akkaataa qindaa'inoota gitoo biyyaa sirna dalagaa keetti hiikamuu danda'a, achumaan akkaataa dhangii baraa maadhee irratti raawwateetti mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
