helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id1955626				0	om	Fakkkeenyaaf, yoo fuula Interneetii odeeffannoo jijjiirraa gabaa ammee man'eelee wardii keessatti qabatu argatte, fuula kana $[officename] Calc keessatti mala armaan gadiitti fayyadamuudhaan fe'uu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3152993				0	om	Galmee $[officename] Calc keessatt,qaree man'ee itti deetaa alaa saaguu barbaaddu keessatti qubachiisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384				0	om	\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Saagi - Geessituu Deetaa Alaa\</item\> fili. Qaaqni \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"External Data\"\>\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Deetaa Alaa\</item\>\</link\> ni mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3152892				0	om	URL kan galmee ykn fuula Saaphaphuu qaaqa keessatti galchi. URL dhangii: http://www.my-bank.com/table.html ta'uu qaba. URL qe'ee ykn faayiloota netwoorkii bal'ina qe'ee xurree qaaqa \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Faayilii - Bani\</item\> keessatti argamu dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3153068				0	om	$[officename] fuula Saaphaphuu ykn faayilii "duubee" keessatti fe'a, kana jechuun, osoo hin mul'isin jechuu dha. Sanduuqa tarree guddaa kan qaaqa \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Deetaa Alaa\</item\> keessatti, maqaa wardiilee maraa ykn hammangaawwan maggaafaman irraa filattu arguu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3153914				0	om	Wardiilee tokko ykn ol ykn hammangaawwan moggoofaman filadhu. Dalagaa ufmaan of fooyyessaa daqiiqaalee "n" hundaa booda kakaastees \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tole\</item\> cuqaasuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3157979				0	om	Qabiyyeewwan akka geessituu galmee $[officename] Calc keessaatti saagama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3144768				0	om	Wardii kee olkaayi. Yeroo booda bantu, $[officename] Calc gaaffii hordofuudhaan maadheelee hidhataman fooyyessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3159204				0	om	Under \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040900.xhp\" name=\"Spreadsheet - General\"\>\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Calc - General\</item\>\</link\> you can choose to have the update, when opened, automatically carried out either always, upon request or never. The update can be started manually in the dialog under \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit - Links\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
