helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153912	13			0	om	Barruu Wardii keessaa Dhangeessuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3144772				0	om	Barruu dhangeessuu barbaaddu filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3155268	15			0	om	Amaloota barruu barbaachisoo Kabala \<emph\>Dhangeessuu \</emph\> irraa filadhu. \<emph\>Dhangii - Man'eelee\</emph\> irraas filachuu dandeessa. Qaaqni \<emph\>Man'eelee Dhangeessi\</emph\> kan amaloota barruu adda addaa keessaa fuula kabala \<emph\>Bocquu\</emph\> irraa filattu ni mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149899				0	om	Barruu Wardii keessaa Dhangeessuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3159226				0	om	Maadheelee lakkoofsota dhangeessuu barbaaddu qabatan filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3150046	18			0	om	Lakkoofsota dhangii maallaqaa durtiitiin ykn akka parsantiitti dhangeessuuf, sajoolee Kabala \<emph\>Dhangeessuu \</emph\> irraa fayyadami. Dhangiilee birootiif, \<emph\>Dhangii - Man'eelee\</emph\> filadhu. Dhangiiwwan jiran keessaa filachuu dandeessa ykn kan mataa  keetii fuula caancala \<emph\>Lakkoofsa\</emph\> irratti qindeessuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153483				0	om	Handaarawwanii fi Duubeewwan Maadheelee fi Fuulotaaf Dhangeesssuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3154733				0	om	Dhangii garee man'eelee kamiifuu jalqaba man'eelee filachuudhaan(filannoo danuuf, yeroo cuqaastu furtuu\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> gad qabuudhaan) ramaduu dandeessa, achiin qaaqa \<emph\>Man'eelee Dhangeessi\</emph\> \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Dhangii - Man'ee\</item\> keessatti kakaasuu dha. Qaaqa kana keessatti, amaloota akka gaaddidduuwwan fi duubbeewwanii filachuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3145116				0	om	Amaloota dhangeessuu wardii guutuu irratti raawwachuuf, \<emph\>Dhangii - Fuula\</emph\> filadhu. Irraantotaa fi jalaantota, fakkeenyaaf, fuula maxxansaman mara irratti kan mul'atu, qindeessuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3145389				0	om	Fakkiin ati \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Dhangii - Fuula - Duubee\</item\> dhaan feete fuula maxxansaa ykn durargii keessatti qofa mul'ata. Fakkii duubee argii irratti mul'isuuf, fakkii saxaatoo \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Saagi - Fakkii - Faayilii Irraa\</item\> filachuudhaan saagiitii fakkii duubee filachuuf \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Dhangii - Qindeessi - Gara Duubee\</item\>. Use the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\> filachuudhaan fakkii maadheelee duubatti qindeessi.				20200411 15:09:53
