helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multitables.xhp	0	help	par_id3155333				0	om	Wardii hammangaa kan jalqabaa fi dhumaa ifteessuudhaan hammangaa wardiilee foormulaa keessaa wabeeffachuu dandeessa, fakkeenyaaf, \<item type=\"literal\"\>=IDA'I(Wardii1.A1:Wardii3.A1) \</item\> man'eelee A1 Wardii1 hanga Wardii3 hunda ida'a.				20200411 15:09:53
