helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3149959				0	om	Pressing the mouse button, drag a range across two cells, do not release the mouse button, and then drag back to the first cell. Release the mouse button. You can now move the individual cell by drag and drop.				20200411 15:09:53
