helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3156284				0	om	Yoo xiqqaate man'ee tokko mallatteessi. Achiin yeroo \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> gad qabdu, tokkoon tokkoo man'eelee dabalataa cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id1001200901072023				0	om	Click the STD / EXT / ADD area in the status bar until it shows ADD. Now click all cells that you want to select.				20200411 15:09:53
