helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3155064				0	om	Kabala haalataa irratti, gara haalata mallatteessuu dabarsuuf sanduuqa waayoo STD / EXT / ADD qabu cuqaasi:				20200411 15:09:53
