helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\numbers_text.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145068				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>formats; text as numbers\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>time format conversion\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>date formats;conversion\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>converting;text, into numbers\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\numbers_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id0908200901265171				0	om	\<variable id=\"numbers_text\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/numbers_text.xhp\" name=\"Converting Text to Numbers\"\>Barruu Lakkoofsotatti Geeddaruu\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\numbers_text.xhp	0	help	par_id0908200901265127				0	om	Geeddarumsi garlameelli yoo danda'ame Calc barruu man'ee keessaa gatiiwwan lakkoofsaa walsimanitti geeddara. Geeddarumsi kan hin danda'amne yoo tahe, Calc dogoggora #VALUE! kenna.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\numbers_text.xhp	0	help	par_id0908200901265196				0	om	Lakkoofsota inteegraa qofatu eksipoonentii dabalatanii geeddaramu, dabalatees guyyootaa fi yeroowwan ISO 8601 dhangiilee isaanii dheerataniin gargareessaawwan waliin. Diraan barruu gitoo biyyaatti waan hundaa'uuf, wantoonni biroo kamiyyuu, kan akka lakkoofsota eentaa gargareessaawwan kurnyee waliin ykn guyyoota ISO 8601n ala ta'an, ni geeddaramu. Iddoowwan duwwaan jalqabaa fi dhumaa ni tuffatamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\numbers_text.xhp	0	help	par_id0908200901265220				0	om	Dhangiileen ISO 8601 armaan gadii ni geeddaramu:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\numbers_text.xhp	0	help	par_id0908200901265288				0	om	CCYY-MM-DD				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\numbers_text.xhp	0	help	par_id0908200901265267				0	om	CCYY-MM-DDThh:mm				20200411 15:09:53
