helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multioperation.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145171				0	om	Dalagaalee baay'ee sarjaawwanii fi tarreewwan keessatti				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multioperation.xhp	0	help	par_id4123966				0	om	The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Data - Multiple Operations\</item\> command provides a planning tool for "what if" questions. In your spreadsheet, you enter a formula to calculate a result from values that are stored in other cells. Then, you set up a cell range where you enter some fixed values, and the Multiple Operations command will calculate the results depending on the formula.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multioperation.xhp	0	help	par_id3156424				0	om	In the \<emph\>Formulas\</emph\> field, enter the cell reference to the formula that applies to the data range. In the \<emph\>Column input cell/Row input cell\</emph\> field, enter the cell reference to the corresponding cell that is part of the formula. This can be explained best by examples:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multioperation.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159153				0	om	Fakkeenyota				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multioperation.xhp	0	help	par_id3153189				0	om	Tooyii kan tokkoo tokkoo isaa $10 tiin gurgurtu $2 qopheessita. Tokkoon tokkoo tooyii hojjechuuf baasa, gatii dhaabbataa waggaatti $10,000 dabalataan qabdu wajjin. Yoo tooyii lakkoofsa murtaa'aa gurgurte waggaa tokkotti bu'aa hangam argatta?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multioperation.xhp	0	help	par_id6478774				0	om	\<image id=\"img_id1621753\" src=\"res/helpimg/what-if.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id1621753\"\>bal'ina wardii yoo-maali\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multioperation.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145239				0	om	Foormulaa tokkoo fi jijjiiramaa tokkoon shallaguu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multioperation.xhp	0	help	par_id3146888				0	om	Bu'aa shallaguuf,jalqaba lakkoofsa kamiyyuu akka baay'inaatti(waanta gurgurame) galchi - fakkeenya kana keessatti 2000.Bu'aan foormulaa Bu'aa=Baay'ina * (Gatii gurgurtaa - gatiiwwan kallachaa) - gatiiwwan dhaabbataa irraa argama.Foormula kana B5 keessatti galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multioperation.xhp	0	help	par_id3157875				0	om	Sarjaa D keessatti gurgurtaa waggaa kenname,tokko jala tokkootti galchi;fakkeenyaaf,500 gara 5000,ejjattoowwan 500 keessatti 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multioperation.xhp	0	help	par_id3159115				0	om	Hammangaa D2:E11,akkaumas gatiiwwan sarjaa D fi man'eelee duwwaa bukkee sarjaa E keessaa filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multioperation.xhp	0	help	par_id3149723				0	om	\<emph\>Deetaa - Dalagaalee baay'ee\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multioperation.xhp	0	help	par_id3149149	46			0	om	With the cursor in the \<emph\>Formulas \</emph\>field, click cell B5.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multioperation.xhp	0	help	par_id3149355				0	om	Qaree dirree \<emph\>man'ee naqa sarjaa\</emph\> keessa kaa'iitii man'ee B4 cuqaasi.Kana jechuun B4,bal'inni,jijjiiramaa foormulaa keessatti gatiiwwan sarjaa filatamaniin bakka bu'u dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multioperation.xhp	0	help	par_id3149009				0	om	Qaaqa \<emph\>TOLE\</emph\> dhaan cufi.Bu'aalee bal'ina garaagaraa sarjaa E keessatti argita.				20200411 15:09:53
