helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multioperation.xhp	0	help	par_id3149981				0	om	With the cursor in the \<emph\>Formulas\</emph\> field, click cell B5.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multioperation.xhp	0	help	par_id3156113				0	om	Qaree dirree \<emph\>Maadhee naqa tarree\</emph\> keessa kaa'iitii maadhee B1 cuqaasi. Kana jechuun B1, gatii gurgurtaa, jijjiiramaa dalga galchame dha(gatiiwwan 8, 10, 15 fi 20 wajjin).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multioperation.xhp	0	help	par_id3154049				0	om	Qaree dirree \<emph\>Maadhee naqa sarjaa\</emph\> keessa kaa'iitii B4 keessa cuqaasi. Kana jechuun B4, baay'ina, jijjiiramaa irraan gadee galchame dha.				20200411 15:09:53
