helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_exact.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153194				0	om	\<variable id=\"print_exact\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/print_exact.xhp\" name=\"Defining Number of Pages for Printing\"\>Lakkoofsa fuulaa maxxansaaf qindeessuu\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_exact.xhp	0	help	par_id3153771				0	om	Yoo wardiin fuula baaqqee maxxansamuuf irra baay'ee guddaa ta'e, $[officename] Calc wardii ammee walqixatti hiruun fuulota baay'ee irratti maxxansa. Waan citni fuulaa ufmaa hoggayyuu qubannoo waaltawaa irraa hin jirreef, tamsa'ina fuulaa mataa keetiin qindeessuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_exact.xhp	0	help	par_id3159155				0	om	Gara wardii maxxansamuu deemi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_exact.xhp	0	help	par_id3150012				0	om	\<emph\>Argi - Durargii muraa fuulaa\</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_exact.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974				0	om	Tamsa'ina wardii ufmaa fuulota maxxansaa irraa ni argita. Hammangaan maxxansaa ufmaan uumaman sararoota cuquliisaa yabbuun yoo agarsiifaman, kanneen fayyadamaan qindaa'an sararoota cuquliisa haphiin agarsiifamu. Citoonni fuulaa(citoota sararaa fi citoota sarjaa) akka sararoota gurraachaatti mallatteeffamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_exact.xhp	0	help	par_id3152578				0	om	Sararoota cuquliisa hantuuteen deemsisuu dandeessa. Dirqaalaalee biroo baafata haallee keessaa, hammangaa maxxansaa dabalataa dabaluu, sarara harkaa dabalataa guddisuu fi saaguu balleessuu fi citoota sarjaa dabalatee argachuu dandeessa. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_exact.xhp	0	help	par_id3151073				0	om	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/03100000.xhp\" name=\"View - Page Break Preview\"\>Argi - Durargii muraa fuulaa\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\relativ_absolut_ref.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Teessoowwanii fi Wabiilee, Of danda'aa fi Hirkataa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\relativ_absolut_ref.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156423				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>teessessuu; hirkataa fi of danda'aa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>wabiilee; of danda'aa/hirkataa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>teessoowwan of danda'oo wardiilee keessaa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>teessoowwan hirkatoo\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>wabiilee of danda'oo wardiilee keessaa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>wabiilee hirkataa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>wabiilee; gara maadheeleetti\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>maadheelee; wabiilee\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\relativ_absolut_ref.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156423				0	om	\<variable id=\"relativ_absolut_ref\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/relativ_absolut_ref.xhp\" name=\"Addresses and References, Absolute and Relative\"\>Teessoowwanii fi Wabiilee, Of danda'aa fi Hirkataa\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\relativ_absolut_ref.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163712				0	om	Teessessuu Hirkataa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\relativ_absolut_ref.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	om	Maadheen sarjaa A, tarree 1 keessaa A1 ta'ee teessoo argata. Jalqaba koordineetii maadhee gubbaa bitaa bal'inaa galchuudhaan, achiin buufata xiqqaa koordineetii maadhee jala mirgaan hordofamuun hammangaa maadheelee wal cinaa teessessuu dandeessa. Fakkeenyaaf, iskuweeriin maadheelee afran jalqabaatiin xiyyoo gubbaa bitaa keessatti uumamu akka A1:B2 tti wabeeffama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\relativ_absolut_ref.xhp	0	help	par_id3154730				0	om	Bal'ina haala kanaan teessessuun, wabii hirkataa gara A1:B2 gochaa jirta. Hirkataa jechuun asitti akka wabiin gara bal'ina kanaa ufmaan yeroo foormulaawwan garagalchitu akka sirreeffamu dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\relativ_absolut_ref.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149377				0	om	Teessessuu Of danda'aa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\relativ_absolut_ref.xhp	0	help	par_id3154943				0	om	Wabiileen of danda'oo faallaa teessessuu hirkataa ti. Mallattoon doolaarii fuuldura qubee fi lakkoofsota wabii of danda'aa keessaa, fakkeenyaaf, $A$1:$B$2 taa'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\relativ_absolut_ref.xhp	0	help	par_id3147338				0	om	$[officename] wabii ammee jijjiiruu danda'a, kan qareen sarara naqaa keessa qubatu, hirkataa irraa gara of danda'aattii fi garagaltoon Shift +F4 dhiibuun. Yoo teessoo hirkataa kan akka A1 dhaan jalqabde, yeroo jalqaba makaa furtuuwwan kanaan jalqabdu, tarree fi sarjaan lamaanuu gara wabiilee of dandaa'aatti qindaa'u ($A$1). Yeroo lammaffaa, tarree (A$1) qofa, fi yeroo sadaffaa, tarree ($A1) qofa. Yoo makaa furtuuwwanii ammas dabaltee tuqxe, wabiileen tarree fi sarjaa lamaanuu gara hirkataatti deebi'u(A1)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\relativ_absolut_ref.xhp	0	help	par_id3153963				0	om	$[officename] Calc wabiilee foormulaatti jiran agarsiisa. Yoo, fakkeenyaaf foormulaa =IDA'A(A1:C5;D15:D24) man'ee keessaa cuqaaste, bal'inoonni wardii keessatti wabeeffataman lamaan halluun shoolamu. Fakkeenyaaf, qabeentaan foormulaa "A1:C5" cuquliisaan ta'uu danda'a akkasumas hammangaan man'ee gaaffii keessaa diba halluu walfakkaatuun cuquliisaan handaaramuu danda'a. Qabeentaan foormulaa ittaanu "D15:D24" diimaan haaluma kanaan mallattaa'uu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\relativ_absolut_ref.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154704				0	om	Yeroo Wabiilee Hirkatoo fi Of danda'oo Fayyadamnu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\relativ_absolut_ref.xhp	0	help	par_id3147346				0	om	Wabii hirkataa maaltu adda baasaa? Akka man'ee E1 keessatti ida'ama man'eelee hammangaa A1:B2 shallagdu jedhii yaadi. Foormulaan E1 keessatti galchitu:=IDA'A(A1:B2) dha. Yoo booda sarjaa haaraa fuuldura sarjaa A irratti saaguuf murteessitu, miseensonni dabaluu barbaaddu achiin B1:C2 keessatti ta'ee foormulaan F1 keessatti ta'a, E1 keessatti miti. Erga sarjaa haaraa saagdee booda, kanaafuu foormulaawwan wardii keessaa hunda mirkaneessuu fi sirreessuu qabda, akkasumas wardiilee biroo keessatti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\relativ_absolut_ref.xhp	0	help	par_id3155335				0	om	Carraan, $[officename] hojii kana siif hojjeta. Erga sarjaa haaraa A saagdee booda, foormulaan =IDA'A(A1:B2) ufmaan gara =IDA'A(B1:C2) fooyya'a. Lakkoofsonni tarrees ufmaan yeroo tarree1 haaraa saagamu sirreeffamu. Wabiileen of danda'aa fi hirkataa $[officename] Calc keessatti hoggayyuu yeroo bal'inni wabeeffame deemsifame ni sirreeffamu. Garuu yoo foormulaa garagalchitu waan haala kanaan wabiileen hirkatoo qofti sirreeffamaniif, wabiilee of dandaa'oo waan hin taaneef of eeggadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\relativ_absolut_ref.xhp	0	help	par_id3145791				0	om	Wabiileen of danda'oon yeroo shallaggiin maadhee murtaa'e tokko wardii kee keessatti wabeeffatu fayyadu. Yoo foormulaan sirriitti maadhee kana wabeeffatu hirkataan gara maadhee jala maadhee jalqabaatti garagalchame, wabiinis yoo koordineetii maadhee akka of danda'aatti hin qindeessine gara deema.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\relativ_absolut_ref.xhp	0	help	par_id3147005				0	om	Yeroo tarreewwanii fi sarjaaleen saagaman irraa kan hafe, wabiileen yeroo foormulaan dura man'eelee murtaa'aa wabeeffatee jiru gara bal'ina wardii biraatti garagalchamu jijjiiramuu danda'a. Akka foormulaa =IDA'A(A1:A9) tarree 10 keessa galchiteetti yaadi. Yoo ida'ama sarjaa wal cinaa gara mirgaatiif shallaguu barbaadde, salphumatti foormulaa kana man'ee keessatti gara gara mirgaatti garagalchi. Garagalchi foormulaa sarjaa B keessaa ufmaan gara =IDA'A(B1:B9) sirreeffama. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Editing Pivot Tables				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148663				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>pivot table function; editing tables\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>editing;pivot tables\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148663				0	om	\<variable id=\"datapilot_edittable\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/datapilot_edittable.xhp\" name=\"Editing Pivot Tables\"\>Editing Pivot Tables\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	om	Click one of the buttons in the pivot table and hold the mouse button down. A special symbol will appear next to the mouse pointer.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	par_id3145786				0	om	Qabduu tarree sana keessatti gara qubannoo birootti harkisuudhaan tartiiba sarjaawwanii jijjiiruu dandeessa.Yoo qabduu gara qarree bitaa gabateetti bal'ina irraantoowwan taree keessatti harkiste,sarjaa gara tarreetti jijjiiruu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	par_id1648915				0	om	In the Pivot Table dialog, you can drag a button to the \<emph\>Page Fields\</emph\> area to create a button and a listbox on top of the pivot table. The listbox can be used to filter the pivot table by the contents of the selected item. You can use drag-and-drop within the pivot table to use another page field as a filter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	par_id3147434				0	om	To remove a button from the table, just drag it out of the pivot table. Release the mouse button when the mouse pointer positioned within the sheet has become a 'not allowed' icon. The button is deleted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	par_id3156442				0	om	To edit the pivot table, click a cell inside the pivot table and open the context menu. In the context menu you find the command \<emph\>Edit Layout\</emph\>, which displays the \<emph\>Pivot Table\</emph\> dialog for the current pivot table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	par_id2666096				0	om	In the pivot table, you can use drag-and-drop or cut/paste commands to rearrange the order of data fields.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	par_id266609688				0	om	You can assign custom display names to fields, field members, subtotals (with some restrictions), and grand totals inside pivot tables. A custom display name is assigned to an item by overwriting the original name with another name.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Deetaa Cimsuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150791				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>deetaa cimsuu\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>hammangaawwan; makuu\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>makuu;hammangaawwan man'ee\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>gabateewwan; makuu\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>deetaa; hammangaawwan man'ee walitti makuu\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>walitti makuu;hammangaawwan deetaa\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150791				0	om	\<variable id=\"consolidate\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/consolidate.xhp\" name=\"Consolidating Data\"\>Deetaa Cimsuu\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3153191				0	om	Yeroo cimsuu, qabiyyeewwan maadheelee wardiilee baay'ee irraa bakka tokkotti walitti makama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	hd_id892056				0	om	Qabeentoota Man'ee Walqabsiisuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3151073				0	om	Galmee kan hammangaawwan maadhee cimsamuuf jiruu qabatu bani.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3154513				0	om	\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Deetaa - Cimsi\</item\> filachuudhaan qaaqa \<emph\>Cimsi\</emph\> bani.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3147345				0	om	Sanduuqa \<emph\>Bal'ina deetaa maddaa\</emph\> irraa bal'inoota birootiin cimsuuf hammanga maadhee maddaa filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3149209				0	om	Yoo hammangaan moggaafamuu baate, dirree cina \<emph\>Bal'ina deetaa maddaa\</emph\> cuqaasi. Qareen barruu libsuu ni mul'ata. Hammangaa deetaa maddaa jalqabaaf wabii barreessi ykn hammanagaa hantuuteen filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3155529				0	om	Hammangaa filatame dirree \<emph\>Bal'inoota cimsaa\</emph\> keessatti saaguuf \<emph\>Dabali\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3153816				0	om	Hammangaawwan dabalataa filadhuutii tokkoon tokkoo filannoo booda \<emph\>Dabali\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3157983				0	om	Bakkee bu'aa itti agarsiisuu barbaaddu hammangaa galtee sanduuqa \<emph\>Bu'aalee asitti garagalchi\</emph\> filachuudhaan ifteessi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3150215				0	om	Yoo hammangi galtee moggaafamuu baate, dirree cina \<emph\>Bu'aalee asitti garagalchi\</emph\> keessa cuqaasiitii wabii hammangaa galtee galchi. Karaa biraa, hammangaa hantuuteen fayyadamuudhaan filachuu dandeessa ykn qaree gubbaa bitaa maadhee hammangaa galtee keessa qubachiisi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3153813				0	om	Dalagaa sanduuqa \<emph\>Dalagaa\</emph\> irraa filadhu. Dalagaan akkaataa gatiiwwan hammangaawwan cimsaa geessifaman ifteessa. Dalagaan "IDA'A" qindaa'ina durtii ti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3149315				0	om	Hammangaawwan cimsuuf \<emph\>TOLE\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_idN107DE				0	om	Qindaa'inoota Dabalataa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3147250				0	om	Qindaa'inoota dabalataa mul'isuuf \<emph\>Dabalata\</emph\> qaaqa \<emph\>Cimsi\</emph\> keessaa cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3156400				0	om	Bu'aalee dhugaa osoo hin taane, foormulaawwan kan bu'aalee hammangaa galtee keessatti uuman saaguuf \<emph\>Geessisa gara deetaa maddaa\</emph\> filadhu. Yoo deetaa geessiste, gatiiwwan hammangaa maddaa keessatti fooyya'an kamiyyuu hammangaa galtee keessatti ufmaan fooyya'u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3150538				0	om	Wabiileen maadhee isaanii hammangaa galtee keessatti tarreewwan walitti aananiin saagamu, kun ufmaan tarreeffamee achiin argii irraa dhokata. Bu'aa dhumaa qofatu, dalgaa filatatame irratti hundaa'uudhaan, mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3149945				0	om	\<emph\>Cimsuu\</emph\> jalatti, yoo man'eeleen hamangaa deetaa maddaa gita qubannoo fakkaataa man'ee hammangaa keessaatiin cimsamuuf ta'uu baatan, garuu akkaataa wal gita asxaa tarreetiin ykn sarjaatiin yoo ta'e \<emph\>Asxaawwan tarree\</emph\> ykn \<emph\>Asxaawwan sarjaa\</emph\> filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3157871				0	om	Asxaawwan tarreetiin ykn sarjaatiin cimsuu yoo barbaadde, asxaan hammangaawwan maddaa filataman keessatti qabatamuu qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3150478				0	om	Akka tarreewwan ykn sarjaaleen sirriitti gituu danda'aniif, barruun asxaawwan keessaa wal fakkaachuu qabu. Yoo asxaan tarree ykn sarjaa kan hammangaa galtee keessa jiru kamiinuu waliin hin gitu ta'e, akka tarree ykn sarjaa haaraatti itti fufama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3147468				0	om	Deetaan hammangaawwan cimsaa fi hammangaa galtee irraa dhufan galmee yemmuu olkeessu olkaa'amu. Yoo booda galmee cimsi keesssatti qindaa'ee ture bante, deetaan kun ammas ni jira.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\consolidate.xhp	0	help	par_id3153039				0	om	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12070000.xhp\" name=\"Data - Consolidate\"\>Deetaa - Cimsi\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Dhangiiwwan Foormulaadhaan Ramaduu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145673				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>dhangiiwwan; foormulaawwaniin ramaduu\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>dhangiiwwan man'ee; foormulaawwaniin ramaduu\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>fakkeenya dalagaa HAALATA\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>haalatoota man'ee;assifoormulaawwaniin ramaduu\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>foormulaawwan;dhangiiwwan man'ee ramaduu\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145673	13			0	om	\<variable id=\"cellstyle_by_formula\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/cellstyle_by_formula.xhp\" name=\"Assigning Formats by Formula\"\>Dhangiiwwan Foormulaadhaan Ramaduu\</link\> \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3150275				0	om	Dalagaan HAALATA() foormulaa duraan man'ee keessa jirutti dabalamuu danda'a. Fakkeenyaaf, dalagaa AMMEE wajjin, gatii isaa irratti hundaa'uudhaan man'ee halleessuu dandeessa. Foormulaan =...+HAALATA(YOO(AMMEE()>3;"Diimaa";"Magariisa")) haalata man'ee "Diimaa" yoo gatiin irra guddaa 3 ta'e raawwata, ta'uu baannaan haalata man'ee "Magariisa" ni raawwata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3151385				0	om	Yoo foormulaa man'eelee bal'ina filatame keessaa hundatti rawwachuu barbaadde, qaaqa \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Barbaadii & Bakkabuusi\</item\> fayyadamuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
