helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3156288				0	om	Ooftuu maxxansaa fi sirna dalagaa irratti hundaa'uudhaan, maxxansaa kee gara dalgeessaatti dhangeessuuf qabduu \<emph\>Amaloota\</emph\> cuqaasuun barbaachisaa ta'uu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3149404	9			0	om	In the \<emph\>Print \</emph\>dialog in the \<emph\>General\</emph\> tab page, select the contents to be printed:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3153305	10			0	om	               \<emph\>All sheets\</emph\> - All sheets will be printed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3148871	12			0	om	               \<emph\>Selected sheets\</emph\> - Only the selected sheets will be printed. All sheets whose names (at the bottom on the sheet tabs) are selected will be printed. By pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> while clicking a sheet name you can change this selection.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3764763				0	om	               \<emph\>Selected cells\</emph\> - All selected cells are printed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id5538804				0	om	From all the paper pages that result from the above selection, you can select the range of paper pages to be printed:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id14343				0	om	               \<emph\>All pages\</emph\> - Print all resulting pages.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699	11			0	om	               \<emph\>Pages\</emph\> - Enter the pages to be printed. The pages will also be numbered from the first sheet onwards. If you see in the Page Break Preview that Sheet1 will be printed on 4 pages and you want to print the first two pages of Sheet2, enter 5-6 here.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3145076				0	om	Yoo \<emph\>Dhangeessuu - Hammangaawwan maxxansuu\</emph\> jalatti hammangaawwan maxxansaa tokko ykn ol qindeessitee jiraatte, qabiyyeewwan hammangaawwan kunneenii qofatu maxxansama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3156019				0	om	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/03100000.xhp\" name=\"View - Page Break Preview\"\>Argi - Durargii muraa fuulaa\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id8254646				0	om	\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/printranges.xhp\"\>Hammangaa maxxansuu wardii irratti qindeessi\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Dhangeessuu Otoolaa Raawwachuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149263				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>dhangeessuu otoolaa; man'eelee\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>man'eelee; dhangeessuu otoolaa\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>dhangeessuu; dhangeessuu otoolaa\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>haalatoota;haalata otoolaa\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>dhnagiiwwan man'ee;otoolaa\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>lakkoofsota tasaa;fakkeenyota\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>haalata man'ee; copying\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>garagalchuu; cell styles\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>gabateewwan; haalata man'ee garagalchuu\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149263				0	om	\<variable id=\"cellstyle_conditional\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/cellstyle_conditional.xhp\" name=\"Applying Conditional Formatting\"\>Dhangeessuu Otoolaa Raawwachuua\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3159156				0	om	Ajaja baafataa \<emph\>Dhangii - Dhangeessuu otoolaa\</emph\> fayyadamudhaan, qaaqni man'ee tokkoof haalleen hanga sadiitti qindeessuu si dandeessisa, man'eeleen filataman dhangii murtaa'aa qabaachuuf kun guutuu qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id8039796				0	om	Dhangeessuu otoolaa raawwachuuf, Ufmaa shallagni dandeessifamuu qaba. \<emph\>Meeshaalee - Qabiyyeewwan Maadhee - Ufmaa shallaggii\</emph\> filadhu(mallattoo filannoo cina ajajichaatti yeroo Ufmaa shallaguun dandeessifame argita).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3154944				0	om	Dhangeessuu otoolaatiin, fakkeenyaaf, ida'ama gatii avereejii ida'ama hundaa caalu shooluu dandeessa. Yoo ida'amni jijjiirame, dhangeessuun osoo haalata biroo harkaan raawwatin haalaan jijjiirama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	hd_id4480727				0	om	Haalota Ibsuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3154490				0	om	Maadheelee kan haalata otoolaa irratti raawwachuu barbaaddu filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3155603				0	om	\<emph\>Dhangii - Dhangeessuu Otoolaa\</emph\> filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3146969				0	om	Haala(lleen) gara sanduuqa qaaqaa galchi. Qaaqni bal'inaan \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05120000.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] Help\"\>$[officename] Help\</link\> keessatti ibsama, akkasumas fakkeenyi armaan gaditti kennameera.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155766				0	om	Fakkeenya Dhangeessuu Otoolaa: Gatii Jiddugalee Gubbaatti/Jalatti Ida'ammii Shooluu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	hd_id4341868				0	om	Ejjatoo1: Gatiiwwan Lakkoofsaa Uumi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3150043				0	om	Gatiiwwan muraasa gabatee kee keessatti xiyyeeffannaa murtaa'e kennuu barbaadda. Fakkeenyaaf, gabatee g urgurammeewwan keessatti, gatiiwwan avereejii olii hunda magariisaan akkasumas gatiiwwan avereejii gadii diimaan agarsiisuu dandeessa. Kun dhangeessuu otoolaatiin ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3155337				0	om	Dursee, gabatee gatiiwwan addaa muraasni keessaatti mul'atan barreessi. Yaalii keetiif gabateewwan lakkoofsota hin murtoofne faana uumuu dandeessa:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3149565				0	om	Man'eelee tokkoo isaanii keessatti foormulaa =RAND() galchitii, lakkoofsa hin murtoofne 0 fi 1 jidduu argatta. Yoo intiijerii jidduu 0 fi 50 barbaadde, foormulaa =INT(RAND()*50) galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3149258				0	om	Tarree lakkoofsa hin murtoofnee uumuuf foormulaa garagalchi. Xiyyoo jala mirgaa maadhee filatamee cuqaasiitii gara mirgaatti hanga haammangaan maadhee barbaadame filatamuutti harkisi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3159236				0	om	Haala walfakkaatuun akka olitti ibsametti, tarreewwan lakkoofsota hin mutoofnee uumuuf xiyyoo maadhee mirgaa gad harkisi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149211				0	om	Ejjatoo 2: Haalota Man'ee Ibsi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3154659				0	om	Ejjatoon ittaanu haalata man'ee gatiiwwan hunda kan turnover avereejii olii fi gadii bakka bu'u raawwachuu dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3150883				0	om	Maadhee duwwaa keessa cuqaasiitii ajaja \<emph\>Maadheelee Dhangeessi\</emph\> baafata haallee keessaa filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3155529				0	om	Qaaqa \<emph\>Man'eelee Dhangeessi\</emph\> keessatti caancala \<emph\>Duubee\</emph\> irratti, halluu duubee filadhu. \<emph\>TOLE\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3154484				0	om	Foddaa Haalataa fi Dhangeessuu keessatti, sajoo \<emph\>Haalata Haaraa Filannoo irraa\</emph\> cuqaasi. Maqaa haalata haaraa galchi. Fakkeenyaaf, haalata "Gubbaa" jedhii moggaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3152889				0	om	Haalata lammaffaa qindeessuuf, ammas man'ee duwwaa keessa cuqaasiitii akka armaan gadiitti ibsameen itti fufi. Man'eef haalluu duubee addaa kenniitii maqaa(fakkeenya kanaaf, "Jala") ramadi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148704				0	om	Ejjatoo: Jiddugalee Shallagi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3148837				0	om	Fakkeenya murtaawaa keenya keessatti, avereejii gatiiwwan hin murtoofnee shallagaa jirra. Bu'aan maadhee keessaa kaawwama:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3144768				0	om	Qaree man'ee duwwaa keessa, fakkeenyaaf, J14, kaa'iitii \<emph\>Saagi - Dalagaa\</emph\> filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3156016				0	om	Dalagaa AVIREEGII filadhu. Lakkoofsota tasaa kee filachuuf hantuutee fayyadami. Yoo hammangaa hunda arguu hin dandeenye, sababa Masakaan Dalagaa dhorkseef, qaaqa yeroof sajoo \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000001.xhp#eingabesymbol\" name=\"Shrink or Maximize\"\>\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Qooqsi / Guddisi\</item\>\</link\> fayyadamuudhaan suntuursuu dandeessa.       				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3153246				0	om	Masakaa Dalagaa \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tole\</item\> dhaan cufi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149898				0	om	Ejjatoo: Haalota Man'ee Fayyadami				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3149126				0	om	Amma dhangeessuu otoolaa wardiitti raawwachuu dandeessa:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3150049				0	om	Maadheelee hunda lakkoofsota hin murtoofne qaban filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3153801				0	om	Qaaqa isaa banuuf ajaja \<emph\>Dhangii - Dhangeessuu Otoolaa\</emph\> filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3153013				0	om	Haala akka armaan gadiitti qindeessi:Yoo gatiin man'ee J14 gadi ta'e, haalata man'ee "Jala" dhaan dhangeessi, akkasumas yoo gatiin man'ee irra guddaa ykn walqixa J14 ta'e, haalata man'ee "Gubbaa" tiin dhangeessi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155761				0	om	Ejjatoo: Haalota Man'ee Garagalchi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3145320				0	om	Dhangeessuu otoolaa gara maadheelee birootti booda raawwachuu:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3153074				0	om	Maadheelee dhangeessuu otoolaa fudhatanii turan keessaa tokko cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3149051				0	om	Maadhee gara gabatee muraatti garagalchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3150436				0	om	Maadheelee dhangeessuu walfakkaatu kana fudhachuuf ta'an filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3147298				0	om	\<emph\>Gulaali - Adda Maxxansi\</emph\> fili. Qaaqni \<emph\>Adda Maxxansi\</emph\> ni mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3166465				0	om	Bal'ina \<emph\>Filannoo\</emph\> keessatti, sanduuqa \<emph\>Dhangiiwwan\</emph\> qofa mallattoo itti godhi. Sanduuqotni biroo marti mallattoo qabaachuu hin qabani. \<emph\>TOLE\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
