helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\html_doc.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150542				0	om	\<variable id=\"html_doc\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/html_doc.xhp\" name=\"Saving and Opening Sheets in HTML\"\>wardiilee HTML keessaa\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\html_doc.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154124				0	om	Wardiilee HTML keessatti Olkaa'uu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\html_doc.xhp	0	help	par_id3145785				0	om	\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc wardiilee galmee Calc akka galmee HTMLtti waliin olkaa'a. Jalqaba galmee HTML irratti, matadureen tokkoofi geessituuwwan tarree tokkoo galmee keessatti wardiilee matayyaatti si geessan ofmaan dabalamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\html_doc.xhp	0	help	par_id3155854				0	om	Lakkoofsonni akka barreeffamanitti mul'atu. Dabalatees, iyyaatoo <SDVAL> HTML keessatti, galmee HTML \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>dhaan erga bantee booda gatiiwwan sirrii qabaachuu kee akka beektu gatiin lakkoofsa keessoo sirriin ni barreeffamu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\html_doc.xhp	0	help	par_id3153188				0	om	Galmee Calc ammee akka HTML olkaa'uuf, \<emph\>Faayili - Akkasitti Olkaa'i\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\html_doc.xhp	0	help	par_id3148645				0	om	Sanduuqa tarree \<emph\>Gosa faayilii\</emph\> keessatti, bal'ina gingilchaawwan Calc biraa \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> keessatti, gosa faayilii "HTML Document (\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc)" filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\html_doc.xhp	0	help	par_id3154729				0	om	\<emph\>Maqaa faayilii\</emph\> galchiitii \<emph\>Olkaa'i\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\html_doc.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149379				0	om	Wardiilee HTML keessaa banuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\html_doc.xhp	0	help	par_id3149959				0	om	\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> gingilchaawwan addaddaa faayiloota HTML, \<emph\>Faayilii - Bani\</emph\> jalatti \<emph\>Faayiloota akaakuu\</emph\> sanduuqa tarree kenna:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\html_doc.xhp	0	help	par_id3146969				0	om	\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc keessatti banuuf akaakuu faayilii "Galmee HTML (\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc)" filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\html_doc.xhp	0	help	par_id3155446				0	om	Dirqalaaleen \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc marti siif ni jiraatu. Garuu, dirqalaalee \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc gulaalliif kennu hundi dhangii HTMLtiin olkaa'amuu hin danda'an.				20200411 15:09:53
