helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multi_tables.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150769	4			0	om	\<variable id=\"multi_tables\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/multi_tables.xhp\" name=\"Navigating Through Sheet Tabs\"\>Caancaloota Wardiilee Keessa Naanna'uu\</link\> \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\multi_tables.xhp	0	help	par_id3153771				0	om	Durtiidhaan $[officename] wardiilee sadii "Wardii1" hanga "Wardii3", tokkoon tokkoo wardii haaraa keessatti agarsiisa. Caancaloota wardii jala argii irra jiru fayyadamuudhaan wardiilee tokko irraa gara biraatti taruu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
