helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_unprotect.xhp	0	help	par_id3145171				0	om	Yoo iggita kennitee jiraatte,qaaqa kana keessatti galchitii \<emph\>TOLE\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_unprotect.xhp	0	help	par_id3153771				0	om	Man'eeleen amma gulaalamuu danda'u,foormulaawwan argamuu danda'u,akkasumas man'eeleen marti amma ati dhorka lamuu wardiif yookiin galmeedhaaf kakaastutti maxxansamuu danda'u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autofilter.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Gingilcha ufmaa raawwachuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autofilter.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156423				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>gingilchoota, dalagaa gingilcha ufmaas ilaali\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>fankishinii gingilchaa ofmaa;raawwachuu\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>wardiilee; gatiiwwan gingilchaa\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>lakkoofsota; wardiilee gingilchaa\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tarjaawwan; dalagaa gingilcha ufmaa\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>baafatoota gadbuusaa sarjaawwan wardii keessatti\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>hangiilee kuusdeetaa; dalagaa gingilcha ufmaa\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autofilter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156423				0	om	\<variable id=\"autofilter\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/autofilter.xhp\" name=\"Applying AutoFilter\"\>Gingilcha ufmaa raawwachuu\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autofilter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147427				0	om	Dalagaan \<emph\>Gingilcha ufmaa\</emph\> sarjaawwan deetaa tokko yookiin ol irratti sanduuqa makaa kan tarreewwan mul'atan filachuuf si dandeessisu saaga.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autofilter.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576				0	om	Sarjaawwan gingilcha ufmaa irratti fayyadamtu filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autofilter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153157				0	om	 \<emph\>Deetaa - Gingilchi - ufmaan gingilchi\</emph\>filadhu. Xiyyootni sanduuqa makaa hammanga tarree jalqabaa filatame keessatti ni mul'atu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autofilter.xhp	0	help	par_id3154510				0	om	Xiyya gadbuusaa irraantoo sarjaa keessaa cuqaasuudhaanii fi waanta filachuudhaan gingilchaa kaachisi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autofilter.xhp	0	help	par_id3155064				0	om	Tarreewwan qabiyyeen isaanii ulaagaa gingilchaa guutu qofatu mul'ata.Tarreewwan biroo ni gingilchamu.Akka tarreewwan gingilchamanii turan lakkoofsota tarree addaan citoo irraa arguu dandeessa.Sarjaan gingilchaaf fayyadee ture qabduu xiyyaatiif halluu addaatiin addaan baafatama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autofilter.xhp	0	help	par_id9216589				0	om	Yeroo gingilcha ufmaa dabalataa sarjaa hammanga deetaa gingilchame kan biraa irratti raawwattu,achumaan sanduuqni makaa deetaa gingilchame qofa tarreessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autofilter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153714	12			0	om	Kuusaa hundaa ammas agarsiisuuf,galfata "mara\<emph\>"\</emph\> sanduuqa makaa gingilcha ufmaa keessaa filadhu. Yoo "Durtii\<emph\>"\</emph\> filatte, qaaqni \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Gingilcha Durtii\</item\> gingilcha durtii akka qindeessitu si dandeessisuuf ni mul'ata. Gatiiwwan gurguddoo 10 qofa mul'isuuf "Guguddoo 10" filadhu. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autofilter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147340				0	om	Fayyadama gingilcha ufmaa dhaabuuf,man'eelee ejjatoo 1 keessatti filataman hunda lamuu filadhuutii \<emph\>Deetaa - Gingilchi - Ufmaan gingilchi\</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autofilter.xhp	0	help	par_id4303415				0	om	Gingilcha ufmaa garaagaraa wardii garaagaraatti ramaduuf,dursitee tokkoon tokkoo wardii irratti hammanga kuusaa deetaa qindeessuu qabda.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autofilter.xhp	0	help	par_id3159236				0	om	Dalagaaleen herregaas man'eelee sababa gingilchaa raawwateen hin mul'anne xiyyeeffannaa keessa galchu.Fakkeenyaaf,ida'amni sarjaa hundaa gatii mara man'eelee filatamanii ta'a.Dalagaa \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060106.xhp\" name=\"SUBTOTAL\"\>CITA IDA'AMAA\</link\> yoo man'eeleen erga gingilchi raawwatee mul'atan qofti xiyyeeffannaa argachuuf ta'an raawwadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
