helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formulas.xhp	0	help	par_id3156281				0	om	Foormulaawwan hunduu mallattoo wal qixaatiin eegalu. Foormulaawwan lakkoofsota, barruu, qooyyaboota herregaa, qooyyaboota loojikii, ykn dalagalee qabaachuu danda'u.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formulas.xhp	0	help	par_id3145272				0	om	Akka qooyyabootni herregaa bu'uuraa (+, -, *, /) seera "Baay'isuu fi Hiruu dura Ida'uu fi Hir'isuu" fayyadamuudhaan foormulaawwan keessatti fayyaduu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formulas.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	om	Haammattuunis fayyaduu danda'a. Bu'aan foormulaa =(1+2)*3 bu'aa foormulaa =1+2*3 irraa adda dha.				20200411 15:09:53
