helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3145786				0	om	$[officename] Calc tuuta durmurtaawwaa dhamsoota dhangeessuu kan wardiilee kee irratti raawwattu wajjin dhufa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3154490				0	om	Dhamsoota gara Calc dabaluun hin danda'amu, kanaafuu fooyya'uu hin danda'an. Garuu, haalata isaanii erga wardiitti raawwattee booda fooyyeessuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3154757				0	om	Osoo wardii dhamsaan hin dhangeessin dura, yoo xiqqaate haalata maadhee tokko maadheelee wardii irraatti raawwachuu qabda. Achiin dhangeessuu maadhee dhamsa qaaqa \<emph\>Filannoo Dhamsaa\</emph\> keessaa filachuu fi raawwachuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3156382				0	om	Haalata maadhee maamiloo maadhee irratti raawwachuuf, foddaa Haalataa fi Dhangeessuu banuu dandeessa, sanduuqa tarree jalaa isaa keessatti, argii Haalata Maamiloo qindeessi. Tarreen haalata maadhee maamiloo qindaa'anii jiran ni mul'atu. Haalata kana maadheelee filatamaniif fayyadamuuf maqaa foddaa Haalataa fi Dhangeessuu irraa lamcuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3153963				0	om	Dhamsa wardiitti raawwachuu:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3146920	15			0	om	Sajoo \<emph\>Dhamsoota Filadhu\</emph\> kabala \<emph\>Meeshaalee\</emph\> keessaa filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488				0	om	Qaaqni \<emph\>Filannoo Dhamsaa\</emph\> ni  mul'ata. Qaaqni kun dhamsoota jiran wardiilee guutuuf tarreessa akkasumas foddaan Haalatootaa fi Dhangeessuu haalatoota maamiloo man'eelee murtaa'aniif tarreessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3155114	9			0	om	Qaaqa \<emph\>Filannoo Dhamsaa\</emph\> keessatti, dhamsa kan wardii irratti raawwachuu barbaadde filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3150090				0	om	TOLE cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3150201				0	om	Akkuma dhamsa biraa qaaqa \<emph\>Filannoo Dhamsaa\</emph\> keessaa filatteen, amalootni haalata maamiloo keessaa muraasni wardii ammee irratti raawwatu. Fooyyeen battalumatti wardii kee keessatti mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
