helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\integer_leading_zero.xhp	0	help	par_id3153194				0	om	Intiijeroota zeeroon jalqaban galchuuf karaalee adda addaatu jiru:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\integer_leading_zero.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	om	Lakkoofsa akka barruutti galchi. Karaan salphaan lakkoofsa hudhaan jalqabu(fakkeenyaaf, \<item type=\"input\"\>'0987\</item\>) galchuu dha. Hudhaan man'ee keessatti hin mul'atu, lakkoofsi akka barruutti dhangeeffama. Sababa dhangii barruutiin ta'eef, garuu, lakkoofsa kanaan shallaguu hin dandeessu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\integer_leading_zero.xhp	0	help	par_id3154013				0	om	Man'ee dhangii lakkoofsaa qabu kan akka \<item type=\"input\"\>\\0000\</item\> dhangeessi. Dhangiin kun dirree \<emph\>Koodii dhangii\</emph\> keessatti  caancala \<emph\>Dhangii - Man'eelee - Lakkoofsota\</emph\> jalatti ramadamuu danda'a, akkasumas argii man'ee akka " zeeroo hoggayyuu jalqaba kaayi, achiin intiijerii, bakkaa yoo xiqqaate sadii qabu, akkasumas kan bitaan zeeroodhaan yoo dijiitii sadii gad ta'e guutame" qindeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\integer_leading_zero.xhp	0	help	par_id3153158				0	om	Yoo dhangii lakkaawwii gara sarjaa lakkoofsota dhangii barruu qabaniitti raawwatte(fakkeenyaaf, barruun "000123" lakkoofsa "123" ta'a), kan armaan gadii hojjedhu:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\integer_leading_zero.xhp	0	help	par_id3149377				0	om	Sarjaa kan dijiitiiwwan dhangii barruutiin keessatti argaman filadhu. Dhangii man'ee sarjaa sana keessaa akka "Lakkoofsa" kaayi.				20200411 15:09:53
