helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3154020				0	om	Man'eelee kan gatiiwwan mul'inoota jidduutti jijjiiraman qabatan filadhu. Man'eelee baay'ee filachuuf, furtuu \<item type=\"keycode\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\</item\> yeroo man'ee hunda cuqaastu gad dhiibi. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3150364				0	om	\<emph\>Meeshaalee - Mul'inoota\</emph\> fili. Qaaqni \<emph\>Mul'ina Uumi\</emph\> ni mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3166426				0	om	Maqaa mul'inaa filiitii dirreewwan biroo gatiiwwan durtii isaa faana osoo hin jijjiiramin dhiisi. Qaaqa TOLE dhaan cufi. Mul'inni kee haaraan ufmaan kaka'a.				20200411 15:09:53
