helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3674123				0	om	Mul'ina gulaaluuf, maqaa Naannessa keessaa mirgaan cuqaasiitii \<emph\>Amaloota\</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3424481				0	om	Handaara tuuta maadheelee kan kutaa mul'inaa dhoksuuf, qaaqa \<emph\>Amaloota\</emph\> mul'ina hunda kan maadheelee irratti raawwatu baniitii sanduuqa filannoo handaara Agarsiisi qulqulleessi. Handaara dhoksuun sanduuqa tarree bakka mul'inoota filattus ni balleessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3154368				0	om	Yoo gatiiwwan kamitu mul'ina keessaa gatiiwwan biroo akka miidhu baruu barbaadde, \<emph\>Meeshaalee - Detective - Trace Dependents\</emph\> filadhu. Xiyyoota gara man'eelee kan man'ee ammee irratti kallattiin hirkatan argita.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3154484				0	om	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/06050000.xhp\" name=\"Creating Scenarios\"\>Mul'ina Uumuu\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_updatetable.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Updating Pivot Tables				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_updatetable.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150792				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>pivot table import\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pivot table function; refreshing tables\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>recalculating;pivot tables\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>updating;pivot tables\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_updatetable.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150792				0	om	\<variable id=\"datapilot_updatetable\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/datapilot_updatetable.xhp\" name=\"Updating Pivot Tables\"\>Updating Pivot Tables\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_updatetable.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684				0	om	If the data of the source sheet has been changed, $[officename] recalculates the pivot table. To recalculate the table, choose \<emph\>Data - Pivot Table - Refresh\</emph\>. Do the same after you have imported an Excel pivot table into $[officename] Calc.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\goalseek.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Barbaacha Kaayyoo Raawwachuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\goalseek.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145068				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>barbaacha kaayyoo;fakkeenya\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>qixxaattota barbaacha kaayyoo keessatti\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>shallaguu;jijjiiramoota qixxaattota keessatti\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>jijjiiramoota;qixxaattota shallaguu\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fakkeenyota;barbaacha kaayyoo\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\goalseek.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145068				0	om	\<variable id=\"goalseek\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/goalseek.xhp\" name=\"Applying Goal Seek\"\>Babrbaacha Kaayyoo Raawwadhu\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\goalseek.xhp	0	help	par_id3145171				0	om	Gargaarsa Barbaacha Kaayyootiin gatii, akka qaama foormulaatti, gara bu'aa foormulaaf ifteessituutti si geessu shallaguu dandeessa. Achiin foormulaa gatiiwwan dhaabbataa baay'eetiinii fi gatii jijjiiramaa tokkoo fi bu'aa foormulaatiin qindeessita.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\goalseek.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153966				0	om	Fakkeenya Kaayyoo Barbaachaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\goalseek.xhp	0	help	par_id3150871				0	om	Dhala waggaa(I) shallaguuf, gabatee gatiiwwan kaappitaala©, lakkoofsa waggootaa(n), fi reetii dhalaa(i) qabatu uumi. Foormulaan:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\goalseek.xhp	0	help	par_id3152596				0	om	I = C * n* i				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\goalseek.xhp	0	help	par_id3155335				0	om	Mee reetiin dhalaa \<item type=\"literal\"\>i\</item\> 7.5% fi lakkoofsi waggootaa \<item type=\"literal\"\>n\</item\> (1) dhaabbataa jennee haa fudhannu. Garuu, hanga kaappitaalli investimentii \<item type=\"literal\"\>C\</item\> deebii murtaa'aa \<item type=\"literal\"\>I\</item\> agachuuf fooyya'uu qabu ture beekuu si barbaachisa. Fakkeenya kanaaf, kaappitaala \<item type=\"literal\"\>C\</item\> hangamtu yoo deebisa waggaa $15,000 barbaadde akka si barbaachisu shallagi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\goalseek.xhp	0	help	par_id3155960				0	om	Gatiiwwan tokkoon tokkoo Kaapitaalaaf \<item type=\"literal\"\>C\</item\> (gatii tasaa kan akka \<item type=\"literal\"\>$100,000\</item\>), lakkoofsa waggootaaf \<item type=\"literal\"\>n \</item\>(\<item type=\"literal\"\>1\</item\>), fi makkii dhalannaaf \<item type=\"literal\"\>i\</item\> (\<item type=\"literal\"\>7.5%\</item\>) man'ee tokko keessatti galchi. Foormulaa dhalannaa \<item type=\"literal\"\>I\</item\> shallagu man'ee biroo keessatti galchi. Qooda \<item type=\"literal\"\>C\</item\>, \<item type=\"literal\"\>n\</item\>, fi \<item type=\"literal\"\>i\</item\> \<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/relativ_absolut_ref.xhp\"\>wabii man'ee\</link\> gatii walsimu waliin fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\goalseek.xhp	0	help	par_id3147001				0	om	Qaree man'ee dhala \<item type=\"literal\"\>I\</item\> qabatu keessa kaa'iitii, \<emph\>Meeshaalee - Barbaacha Kaayyoo\</emph\>. Qaaqni \<emph\>Barbaacha Kaayyoo\</emph\> ni mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\goalseek.xhp	0	help	par_id3150088				0	om	Man'een sirrii durumaanuu dirree \<emph\>Man'ee Foormulaa\</emph\> keessatti galchameera.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\goalseek.xhp	0	help	par_id3166426				0	om	Qaree dirree \<emph\>Man'ee Jijjiiramaa\</emph\> keessa kaa'i. Wardii keessatti, man'ee gatii jijjiiramu qabate cuqaasi, fakkeenya kana keessatti man'ee gatii kaappitaalaa \<item type=\"literal\"\>C\</item\> dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\goalseek.xhp	0	help	par_id3150369				0	om	Bu'aa eegamaa foormulaa sanduuqa barruu \<emph\>Gatii Galtee\</emph\> keessatti galchi. Fakkkeenya kana keessatti, gatiin 15,000 dha. \<emph\>TOLE\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\goalseek.xhp	0	help	par_id3146978				0	om	Qaaqni akka Barbaachi Kaayyoo galma gahe mul'isu ni mul'ata. Bu'aa maadhee kan gatii jijjiiramaa qabate keessatti galchuuf \<emph\>Eeyyee\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\goalseek.xhp	0	help	par_id3149409				0	om	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/06040000.xhp\" name=\"Goal Seek\"\>Barbaacha Kaayyoo\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\edit_multitables.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Wardiilee Baay'eetti Garagalchuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\edit_multitables.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149456				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>garagalchuu;gatiiwwan, wardiilee baay'eetti\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>maxxansuu;gatiiwwan wardiilee baay'ee keessaa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>deetaa;wardiilee baay'ee keessatti saaguu\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>wardiilee;guutinsa baay'ee altokkoo\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\edit_multitables.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149456	3			0	om	\<variable id=\"edit_multitables\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/edit_multitables.xhp\" name=\"Copying to Multiple Sheets\"\>Wardiilee Baay'eetti Garagalchuu\</link\> \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\edit_multitables.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	om	$[officename] Calc keessatti, gatiiwwan, barruu ykn foormulaawwan kan altokkotti gara wardiilee galmee kee keessaa filataman birootti garagalchaman saaguu dandeessa. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\edit_multitables.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	om	Wardiilee barbaachisoo hunda furtuu \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> gad qabuudhaanii fi caancaloota galmeessuu isaanii kan mudana jalaa bakka hojii irraa ammayyuu daalacha ta'anii argaman cuqaasuudhaan filadhu. Caancaloonni Galmeessaa filataman marti amma adiidha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\edit_multitables.xhp	0	help	par_idN10614				0	om	Wardiilee danuu gabatee cuqootiin fayyadamuudhaan filachuuf Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Page Up ykn Page Down fayyadamuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\edit_multitables.xhp	0	help	par_id3147435				0	om	Amma yeroo gatiiwwan, barruu ykn foormulaawwan wardii keessatti saagdu, wardiilee biroo filataman keessatti qubannoo walfakkaatu irratti argamu. Fakkeenyaaf, deetaa man'ee A1 wardii ka'aa keessatti galfame man'ee A1 wardii filatame kamiyyuutti ofmaan galfama.				20200411 15:09:53
