helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_value.xhp	0	help	par_id3150010				0	om	Yoo foormulaawwan man'eelee keessatti agarsiisuu barbaadde, fakkeenyaaf gita =IDA'A(A1:B5) tiin, akka armaan gadiitti itti fufi:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_value.xhp	0	help	par_id3151116				0	om	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - View\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
