helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_value.xhp	0	help	par_id3147396				0	om	Yoo foormulaawwan osoo hin ta'in bu'aalee shallaggii alerguu barbaadde, SanduuqaFoormulaawwanii mallattoo itti hin godhin.				20200411 15:09:53
