helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\value_with_name.xhp	0	help	par_id328989				0	om	Maqaaleen akka qabii man'eetti tokko ta'uu hin qaban.Fakkeenyaaf,maqaan A1 sirrii miti sababni isaas A1 wabii man'ee gubbaa bitaa ti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\value_with_name.xhp	0	help	par_id32898987				0	om	Names must not start with the letter R followed by a number. See the ADDRESS function for more information.				20200411 15:09:53
