helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\database_filter.xhp	0	help	par_id3145069				0	om	Gingilchaawwan baay'ee hammangaawwan maadhee wardiilee keessatti gingilchuuf fayyadamuu dandeessa. Gingilchaan durtii dirqaalaalee kan deetaa gingilchuuf ifteessite fayyadama. Gingilchaan ufmaa deetaa akkaataa gatii ykn diraa murtaa'eetti gingilcha. Gingilchaan olaanaa ulaagaa gingilchaa maadheelee murtaa'an irraa fayyadama.				20200411 15:09:53
