helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3156090				0	om	\<emph\>Wabiin\</emph\> (filannoowwan tarreeffaman)iddoo man'ee qoratamuuti.Yoo\<emph\>wabiin\</emph\> hammangaa ta'e,man'een gara bitaa olitti socho'a.'the cell moves to the top left of the range. If \<emph\>Reference\</emph\> is missing, $[officename] Calc uses the position of the cell in which this formula is located. Microsoft Excel uses the reference of the cell in which the cursor is positioned.				20200411 15:09:53
