helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id102720080230151				0	om	Fankishinoota lamaanuu keessatti, yoo qajeelfamni gatii o waliin saagame, yaadannoon R1C1 ni fayyada. Yoo qajeelfamni hin kennamne ta'e ykn gatii o tin ala qabaate, yaadannoon A1 ni fayyada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id1027200802301556				0	om	Dubbii yaadannoo R1C1 keessatti, TEESSOOn mallattoo raajeffannoo '!' fayyadamuun diraa teessoo akka footuu maqaa wardiitti deebisa, akkasumas SHAFFAXAAn akka wardii maqaa footuutti mallattoo raajeeffannoo eega. Faankishinootni lachanuu ammallee tuqaa '.' akka maqaa footuu wardiitti yaadannoo A1 fayyadamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id1027200802301521				0	om	Yeroo galmeewwan dhangii ODF 1.0/1.1 irraa banaman, faankishinootni TEESSOO maqaa wardii akka ulaagaa arfaffaatti jiru gara ulaagaa shanaffaatti jijjiiramuumusaa agarsiisa. Ulaagaan haaraa akka ulaagaa arfaffaatti gatii 1 waliin saagama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id1027200802301650				0	om	Yeroo galmee dhangii ODF 1.0/1.1 keessatti kuufamu, yoo faankishiniin TEESSOO ulaagaa arfaffaa qabaate, ulaagaan sun ni haqama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id102720080230162				0	om	Yoo faankishiniin TEESSOO ulaagaa arfaffaa haaraa gatii 0 waliin faayidaa kenne, dhangii durii ODF 1.0/1.1 irratti wardii hin kuusiin.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id1027200802301756				0	om	Faankishinii SHAFFAXAA gara dhangii ODF 1.0/1.1 hin jijjiiriin kuufama. Yoo ulaagaan lammaffaa hin jiraatiin, foyya'aan durii Calc faankishinii kanaaf dogoggora deebisa.				20200411 15:09:53
