helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3154047				0	om	COLUMNS(Waraantoo)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3154745	83			0	om	            \<emph\>Waraantoo\</emph\>n hangii mandhee lakkoofsi tarjaawwan isaa hundi barbaadamuu qabuuf wabiidha. Qajeelfamni mandhee qeenxees ta'uu ni danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
