helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3153060	226			0	om	            \<emph\>Wabii\</emph\>n wabii wardii ykn naannoo ti. Ulaagaan kun dirqaladha. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149766				0	om	Fakkeenya				20200411 15:09:53
