helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3144755	146			0	om	            \<emph\>Kasaa\</emph\>n wabii ykn lakkoofsa 1 fi 30 gidduu gatii kamtu tarree keessaa akka fudhatamuu qabu mul'isudha.				20200411 15:09:53
