helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147321				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>faankishinii Tarree\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147321				0	om	Tarree				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3154564				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ZEILE\"\>Lakkoofsa tarree wabii man'ee kenna.\</ahelp\> Yoo wabiin mandhee ta'e lakkoofsi tarree mandhichaa ni deebi'a; yoo ulaagaan naannoo mandhee ta'e, yoo foormulaan akka \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060107.xhp#wasmatrix\" name=\"Array\"\>waraantoo\</link\> \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060107.xhp#somatrixformel\" name=\"as an array formula\"\>akka foormulaa waraantootti\</link\> galeera ta'e lakkoofsonni tarree tarjaa qeenxee keessatti kennamu.Yoo faankishiniin ROW naannoo ulaagaa wabii keessa jiru foormulaa waraantoof hin fayyadne ta'e, lakkoofsi tarree man'ee jalqabaa naannoo sana keessa jiru qofti ni murtaa'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3158439				0	om	Caasim				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3154916				0	om	ROW(wabii)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3156336	161			0	om	            \<emph\>wabii\</emph\>n man'ee tokko, iddoo, ykn maqaa iddooti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3151109				0	om	Yoo wabii hin agarsiisnee ta'e, lakkoofsi tarree mandhee foormulaan keessa seene ni argama. \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calciin wabii ofumaan gara mandhee ammeetti qindeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155609				0	om	Fakkeenya				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3154830	205			0	om	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=ROW(B3)\</item\> 3 deebisa sababni isaas wabiin tarree sadaffaa gabatee keessaa agarsiisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3147094	206			0	om	            \<item type=\"input\"\>{=ROW(D5:D8)}\</item\> waraantoo tarjaa-qeenxee (5, 6, 7, 8) deebisa sababni isaas wabiin adda ba'e tarreewwan 5 hanga 8 of keessatti qabata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3153701	207			0	om	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=ROW(D5:D8)\</item\> 5 deebisa sababni isaaas faankishiniin ROW akka foormulaa waraantootti hin fayyadu dabalataanis lakkoofsi tarree jalqabaa wabii qofti ni deebi'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3150996	208			0	om	            \<item type=\"input\"\>{=ROW(A1:E1)}\</item\> fi \<item type=\"input\"\>=ROW(A1:E1)\</item\> lamaan isaaniyyu 1 deebisu sababni isaas wabiin gabatee keessatti akka tarjaa jalqabaatti tarree 1 qofa qabata. (Sababni isaas naannoowwan tarree-qeenxee lakkoofsa tarree tokkoo formulaan akka foormulaa waraantootti fayyadus fayyaduu baatus garaagarummaa hin uumne qofa qaba.)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3153671	209			0	om	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=ROW()\</item\> yoo foormulaan tarree 3 keessa seene 3 deebisa.				20200411 15:09:53
