helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1073E				0	om	Garaagarumma kanarraa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10744				0	om	Bu'aa tokko tokkoo irraa, gatiin wabii isaa(kana gadi ilaali) ni hir'isama, fi garaagarummaan ni agrsiifama. Ida'amtootni hundee dirreetin alaa akka bu'aawwan duwwaatti agrsiifamu.				20200411 15:09:53
