helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1074F				0	om	\<emph\>Wanta duraanii ykn Wanta itti aanuu\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10754				0	om	Yoo "wanti duraanii" ykn "wanta itti aanuu" akka hundee wantaatti ifteessite,hundee dirree durduuba tartiiba qabsiisaa keessatti, gatiin wabii bu'aa miseensa hundee dirree kan itti anuun mul'atuti.				20200411 15:09:53
