helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077D				0	om	Hundee dirree keessatti tokko tokkoon bu'aa ida'amaa bu'aawwaan wanta duraa irratti ida'amu, hundee dirree keessatti Durduubni Tartiiba Qabiinsaa, fi ida'aamni walii galaa agarsiifama. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10780				0	om	Tokko tokkoon bu'aa argachuuf yoo fankishinii ida'amaa garaagaraa fayyadamuullee, bu'aawwaan yeroo hundaa ni ida'amu.				20200411 15:09:53
