helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153301				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_BW\"\>Gatii ammee inveestimeentii kan kanfaltii yeroo hundaa irraa argame deebisa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3146099				0	om	Faankishinii kana hamma qarshii makkii dhaabataa har'a inveestiidhaaf barbaashisu shallaguuf fayyadamaa,hanga murtaa'e fudhachuuf,lakkoofsa yeroo murtaa'e irratti.Yeroo muraasaan booda qarshii hanga hafe  murteessuu ni dandeessu.Yoo hangi kanfalame jalqaba irratti ykn dhuma irratti adda baasa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153334				0	om	Enter these values either as numbers, expressions or references. If, for example, interest is paid annually at 8%, but you want to use month as your period, enter 8%/12 under \<emph\>Rate\</emph\> and \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc will automatically calculate the correct factor.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147407				0	om	Caasima				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150395				0	om	PV(Makkii; NPer; Pmt; FV; Gosa)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3151341	9			0	om	            \<emph\>Rate\</emph\> defines the interest rate per period.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153023	10			0	om	            \<emph\>NPer\</emph\> is the total number of periods (payment period).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3146323	11			0	om	            \<emph\>Pmt\</emph\> is the regular payment made per period.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150536	12			0	om	            \<emph\>FV\</emph\> (optional) defines the future value remaining after the final installment has been made.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3146883	13			0	om	            \<emph\>Type\</emph\> (optional) denotes due date for payments. Type = 1 means due at the beginning of a period and Type = 0 (default) means due at the end of the period.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B13				0	om	            \<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#optional\"/\>         				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150037				0	om	Fakkeenya				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145225				0	om	Gatiin inveestimeentii ammaa hagam,yoo 500  yuunitii maallaqaa ji'aan kanfalame fi makkiin dhala waggaa 8%?Yeroon kanfaltii ji'a 48 fi 20'000 yuunitii maallaqaa dhuma yeroo kanfaltii irratti hafa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155907	16			0	om	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=PV(8%/12;48;500;20000)\</item\> = -35,019.37 currency units. Under the named conditions, you must deposit 35,019.37 currency units today, if you want to receive 500 currency units per month for 48 months and have 20,000 currency units left over at the end. Cross-checking shows that 48 x 500 currency units + 20,000 currency units = 44,000 currency units. The difference between this amount and the 35,000 currency units deposited represents the interest paid.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149150				0	om	Osoo wabii iddoo gatii kanaa foormulaa keessa galchinee,lakkoofsa barbaadde "If-then"mul'inoota shallaguu dandeessu.Maaloo hubadhaa:wabiin dhaabataaf akka wabii guutuutti dirqama ibsamuu qaba.Fakkeenyi akkanaa kun faankishinii diprisheeshinii jalatti argama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152978				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>shallaguu;diprisheeshinii\</bookmark_value\>        \<bookmark_value\>faankishinii SYD\</bookmark_value\>        \<bookmark_value\>diprisheeshinii; lakkoofsa hir'ate\</bookmark_value\>        \<bookmark_value\>diprisheeshinii lakkoofsa hir'atee\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
