helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149886				0	om	Hanga diprisheeshinii yeroo tokkoo kan waliigala diprisheeshinii wantoo shallaguuf faankishinii kana fayyadamaa.Hir'ina lakkoofsaa diprisheeshinii hanga diprisheeshinii yeroodhaa yerootti ida'ama dhaabaaadhaan hir'isa.				20200411 15:09:53
