helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3156124				0	om	Foormulaan kun tarjaa E keessa gara gadiitti hanga E12 tti baay'ifama(E2 filadhu,sana booda xiyyoo mirgaa handaara gadii tuqaadhaan gad harkisi). 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3147270				0	om	mandheen E13 foormulaa hamma dippirisheeshinii hunda mirkaneessuuf gargaaru of keessatti qabata.Akka gatiin negatiivii E8:E11 keessa jiru yaada keessa hin galleef faankishinii SUMIF fayyadama.Haalli >0 mandhee A13 keessatti hammatameera.Foormumlaan E13 keessaa akka armaan gadiiti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152811	85			0	om	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=SUMIF(E2:E11;A13)\</item\>         				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155998				0	om	Amma dippirisheeshinii waggaa 10 agarsiisi,ykn gatii wanta balaarra hafee maallaqa 1 irratti, ykn gatii jalqabaa garaagaraa galchi, fi itti fufa.				20200411 15:09:53
