helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146995				0	om	Fakkeenya				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148834				0	om	Ittisni gaafa 2001-01-01 bitame; guyyaan bilchinaa 2006-01-01. Boonoon reetii dhalaa 8% dha. Kennuun 9.0% dha. Dhalli walakkaa waggaadhaan kaffalama (ammamtaan 2 dha). Shallaga dhala guyyaadhaan walmadaaluu (hundee 3) fayyadamuudhaan turmaatni hammamii?				20200411 15:09:53
