helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149998				0	om	DDB				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3159190				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_GDA\"\>mala artimeetikii-kuffiisuu fayyadamuudhaan yeroo adda ba'eef dippirisheeshinii qabeenyaa keenna.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152361				0	om	Gatii dippirisheeshinii jalqabaa olaanaa faallaa dippirisheeshinii liinarii ta'e yoo barbaadde unka kana fayyadami. Tokko tokkoo yerootti gatiin dippirisheeshinii hir'achaa deema dabalataanis bittaa booda qabeenyota kasaaraan gatii isaanii guddaa ta'eef (fakkeenyaaf, konkolaattota,kompiiyuutaroota) yeroo hunda fayyada.Maaloo gosa shallagii kana jalatti gatiin buukii gonkuma akka zeeroo hin taane hubadhu. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156038				0	om	Caasima				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3166452				0	om	DDB(Gatiis Salvage; Liriod; Hirmaataa)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153237	104			0	om	            \<emph\>Cost\</emph\> fixes the initial cost of an asset.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149787	105			0	om	            \<emph\>Salvage\</emph\> fixes the value of an asset at the end of its life.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152945	106			0	om	\<emph\>Jiruu\</emph\>n lakkoofsa yeroo qabeenyi yeroo hammamiif akka fayyadamamuu qabu ibsudha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149736	107			0	om	            \<emph\>Yeroo\</emph\>n turtii yeroo kan gatiin shallagamuuf ibsa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150243	108			0	om	            \<emph\>Factor\</emph\> (optional) is the factor by which depreciation decreases. If a value is not entered, the default is factor 2.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159274				0	om	Fakkeenya				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152882				0	om	Sirni kompiiyuutaraa gatiin isaa jalqabaa safartuu maallaqaa 75,000 ta'e ji'a ji'aan waggaa 5 oliif kuufamuu qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154106	111			0	om	            Safartuu maallaqaa\<item type=\"input\"\>=DDB(75000;1;60;12;2) \</item\>= 1,721.81. Kanaafuu, dippirisheeshiniin lama-kuffiisuu bittaa booda ji'a jalqabaa keessa safartuu maallaqaa 1,721.81 dha.				20200411 15:09:53
