helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149233	133			0	om	            \<emph\>Guess\</emph\> (optional) is the estimated value. An iterative method is used to calculate the internal rate of return. If you can provide only few values, you should provide an initial guess to enable the iteration.				20200411 15:09:53
