helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3150777				0	om	Saddeqni yeroo 1020 darbatame. Lakkoofsootni 1 hanga 6 saddeqa irraa si'a 195, 151, 148, 189, 183, fi 154 (gatiiwwan hubannoo) ol dhufa. Hedaatin saddeeqni dhaabbataa mitii ni yaalama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3153062				0	om	Raabsi chaay iskuweerii kan eddattoo tasaa foormulaa armaan oliitti kennameen murtaawa. Gatii eeggamaan lakkofsoota saddeeqa irratti kennamee n bay'isuu 1/6 waan ta'eef, kanaafuu 1020/6 = 170 ta'a, formulichi gatii chaay iskuuweerii 13.27 kenna.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3148806				0	om	Yoo chaay iskuuweeriin (hubatame) irraguddaa ykn walqixa CHIINV chaay iskuweerii (tiyoritikaalii) ta'e, maldhawiinsi ni gatama, garaarummaan tiyoorii fi yaalii bay'ee guuddaa waan ta'eefi dha. Yoo chaay iskuweeriin hubatame irra xiqqa CHIINV ta'e, maldhawiinsi ni dogongora pirobaabilitii eerame wajjin raggaasifama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3149763	95			0	om	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=CHIINV(0.05;5)\</item\> 11.07 kenna.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3159142	133			0	om	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=CHIINV(0.02;5)\</item\> 13.39 kenna.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3158401				0	om	Yoo pirobaabilitiin dogongoraa 5% ta'e, saddeeqni dhugaa miti. Yoo pirobaabilitiin dogongoraa 2% ta'e, sababni dhabbataa ta'uu isaa amansiisu hin jiru. 				20200411 15:09:53
