helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146084				0	om	Waraantoon maali?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154298				0	om	\<variable id=\"wasmatrix\"\>Waraantoon hammangaa geeffame kan  man'eewwan wardii irraa jiran gatii of keessaa qabaniidha.\</variable\> Hammangaan iskuweerii tarreewwan 3 fi tarjaa 3 waraantoo 3*3 ta'a:				20200411 15:09:53
