helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3153583				0	om	Waraantoo xiqqaan ta'uu danda'u waraantoo 1*2 ykn 2*1 man'eewwan walcinaa lama wajjin.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148474				0	om	Foormulaan waraantoo maali?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3155355				0	om	Foormulaan kan gatiin tokkoon tokkoon hammangaa man'ee keessaa ittiin madaalamu foormulaa waraantoo jedhama. Garaagarummaan foormulaa waraantoo fi foormulaan biroo foormulaan waraantoo iddoo gatii tokko gatiiwwan baay'ee waliin wal sima.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3151052				0	om	Foormulaa waraantoo gatiiwwan hojjii baayyee danda'u qofa osoo hin tanee, gatiiwwan bayyees kennuu danda'a. Firiin formulaa waraantoo warantoo ta'uu danda'a 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3158432				0	om	Gatiiwwan tokkoon tokkoon man'ee waraantoo armaan oli 10 baayyisuuf, tokkoon tokkoon gatiitif ykn man'eetif foormulaa fayyadamuu hin barbaachisu. Innumaa foormulaa qenxee Waraantoo fayyadamuu barbachisa. Wardii garabiraa irraati hangii man'eewwanii 3 x 3 fili, foormulaa \<item type=\"input\"\>=10*A1:C3\</item\> fi walitti dhufeenya furtuu fayyadamuun \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajajja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+Enter galchii. Firiin gatiiwwan tokkoon tokkoo hangii ma'ee waraantoo 3 x 3 (A1:C3) hirmaataa kudhaniitin baayyata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3149156				0	om	Baayyisuun alaati qoyyabota biroo hangii wabiitin(waraantoodhan) fayyadamuu dandeesa. shallagii $[officename] waliin, ida'uu (+),hir'isuu (-), baayyisu (*), hiruu (/), expoonantii fayyadamii (^), diraa (&) fi waldorgomsiistota(=, <>, <, >, <=, >=). Qoyyabonnii tokkoon tokkoon gatii hangii man'ee keessaa akka waraantooti fayyadamuun foormulaa warantoo galfamee kenna.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3166456				0	om	Qoyyaboonnii waldorgomsisa foormulaa waraantoo keessaa man'ee duwwaa furuu haluma walfakkatuun foormulaa sirri, innis, akka zerooti ykn akka akka jecha duwwati. fakkeenyaaf, yoo man'een A1 fi A2 duwwaa ta'an foormulaan waraantoo \<item type=\"input\"\>{=A1:A2=""}\</item\> fi \<item type=\"input\"\>{=A1:A2=0}\</item\> lamaanu waraantoo tarja 1 fi tarree 2 man'eewwan TRUE of keessaa qabu kenna.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150713				0	om	Yeroo kam foormulaawwan waraantoo fayyadamta?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3149787				0	om	Gatiiwwan adda addaa fayyadamuun yoo shallagii irra deebitu foormulawwan warantoo fayyadamii. Mala shallagii jijjiruuf yoo murteessiite, foormulaa waraantoo qofa haroomsita. foormulaa waraantoo ida'uuf, hangii waraantoo hunda fili itti aansuun \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060107.xhp\" name=\"make the required change to the array formula\"\>jijjirrama barbaaddame foormulaa waraantootif godhi\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3149798				0	om	Foormulaawwan waraantoo dirqala yemmuu gatiiwwan baayyeen shallagamu iddoo qusachuus danda'a, waan kuufannoo baayyee garii hin tanneef. Dabalataan shallagii walxaxaa adeemsisuuf waraantoon baayyee barbachisa dha kanaafuu shallagii kee dabalatee hangiiwwan man'ee baayyee qaachuu dandeessa. $[officename]n fankishinoota herreegaa waraantoodhaf qaba, waraantoowwan lama baayyisuu kanneen akka fankishinii MMULT ykn waraantoowwan lama kallattii malee baayyisuu fankishinii SUMPRODUCT shallaga.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155588				0	om	Foormulaawwan waraantoo $[officename] keessaa fayyadamuun shallagii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3152876				0	om	Foormulaa "baratamoo" hangii wabii keessaa uumuus ni dandeessa, kan akka ulaagaalee, foormulaa waraantoo agarsiisa. Firiin kan argamuu wal tiquu hangii wabiii fi tarjaa ykn tarree foormulaan keessat argamuuti. Yoo wal hin tuqnee ta'ee ykn yoo hangiin iddoo wal tuqiiti tarreewwan ykn tarjaawwan hundaa dhunfatee #VALUE!n ergaan dogogoraa ni mul'ata. Fakkeenyootni armaan gadii yaada kana ni ibsa:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151271				0	om	Formulawwan Waraantoo Uumuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3149102				0	om	Yoo formulaa waraantoo \<emph\>Masaka Fankishinii\</emph\> fayyadamuun uumte, sanduuqa filannoo \<emph\>Waraantoo\</emph\> yeroo hundaa akka firiiwwan waraantoo keessatti deebi'an mallattoo itti godhuu qabda. Ta'uu baannan, gatii man'ee gubbaa-bitaa kan waraantoo shallagametu deebi'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3153392				0	om	Yoo formulaa waraantoo kallatiin man'eetti galchite, furtuu Enter qofa dhiibuu irra makaa furtuu Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter fayyadamuu qabda. Foormulaan achiin foormullaa waraantoo qofa ta'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3151120				0	om	Formulaawwan waraantoo $[officename] Calc keessatti argaman. Formulaawwan waraantoo hujeekaan cuftuuwwan galchuudhan uumuu hin dandeessu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154342				0	om	Man'eewwan waraantoo firiwwanii ofumaan jijjiirraa irra dhorkamu.Haata'u malee, formulaa waraantoo man'ee hangii waraantoo mara filuudhan gulaaluu fi garagalchuu ni dandeessa. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id8834803				0	om	Waraantoo Sarkee Dhaabbataa Formuulaa keessati Fayyadamun				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id985747				0	om	Sarkee maatiksii/waraantoo dhabataa formulaa keessaa shallaguuf gargaara. sarkeen waraantoo curlii cuuftuudhan '{' and '}' deeggarama. Miseensonni tokkoon tokkoon lakkoofsa (lakkoofsa negatiivii) ta'uu danda'a, yaayaa dhabbataa (TRUE, FLASE), ykn jecha jargifaa. Himannoon dhabbataa hin tannee hin hayyamamu. waraantoon tarree ykn tarja tokkoo ykn isaa oliin galfamuu danda'a. tarreewwan hundinu lakkoofsa miseensotaa wal fakkaata qabaachuu qabu, tarjaawwan hundinuu lakkoofsa miseensotaa walfakkataa qabaachuu qabu.    				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id936613				0	om	Tarja adda baasaa(tarree tokkoo keessati addabaasuu)n buufata xiqqaaa ';'. tarree adda basaa '|' mallattoo ujumoo. Adda bastoonnii afaanii fi gitoo biyyaa miti.    				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id1877498				0	om	Waraantonni dilgataa'uu hin danda'an				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id4262520				0	om	\<emph\>Fakkeenyota:\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id9387493				0	om	={1;2;3}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id8207037				0	om	Waraantoon tarree tokkoo wajjinii lakkoofsota 1,2, fi 3 of keessaa qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id6757103				0	om	Waraantoo dhaabbataa kana galchuuf, tarree keessaa man'eewwan sadi filadhu, sana booda foormulaa \<item type=\"input\"\>={1;2;3}\</item\> cuftuu fi buufata xiqqaa, sana booda \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+Enter fayyadamuudhaan barreessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id8868068				0	om	={1;2;3|4;5;6}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id6626483				0	om	Waraantoo tarreewwan lamaa fi tokkoon tokkoo tarree keessa gatii sadi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id5262916				0	om	={0;1;2|FALSE;TRUE;"two"}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id1623889				0	om	Waraantoo deetaa walmake.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id7781914				0	om	=SIN({1;2;3})				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id300912				0	om	Akka foormulaa maatriksiitti gala, firii kan shallaggii SIN sadii qocolloo 1,2 fi 3 waliin kenna. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148660				0	om	Foormulaawwan waraantoo gulaaluu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3149241				0	om	Hammangaa man'ee ykn waraantoo foormulaa waraantoo of keessaa qabu filadhu. Waraantoo hundaa filachuuf, hammangaa man'ee keessatti qaree man'ee olkaa'i, achumaan \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+ /, eessa / dhiibuu jechuun furtuu hiruu cuqoo lakkoofsaa irraati.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3143274				0	om	F2 dhiibuu ykn qaree sarara naqaa keessa olkaa'uu. Hojiin kun lachuu foormulaa akka gulaaltu si taasisa.   				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154798				0	om	Edda jijjiirama taasiftee booda, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>+shift\</switchinline\>++Enter dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3150628				0	om	Qaamawwan waraantoo dhanga'uu dandeessa. Fakkeenyaaf, halluu bocquullee. Hammangaa man'ee filachuu fi achumaan amaloowwan barbaadde jijjiiri.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145608				0	om	Foormulaa Waraantoo garagalchuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3149585				0	om	Hammangaa man'ee ykn waraantoo foormulaa waraantoo of keessaa qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154619				0	om	F2 dhiibuu ykn qaree sarara naqaa keessa olkaa'uu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3150994				0	om	Foormulaa gara sarara naqaa keessaati \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+C dhiibuudhaan garagalchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3146787				0	om	Hammangaa man'eewwanii iddoo foormulaa waraantoo saaguu barbaaddee filachuu fi F2 dhiibuu ykn qaree sarara naqaa keessa olkaa'uu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154419				0	om	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+V dhiibuudhaab iddoo filatametti foormulaa maxxansuu fi \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+Enter dhiibuudhaan dhugoomsi. Hammangaan filatame amma foormulaa waraantoo of keessaa qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154834				0	om	Hammangaa Wataantoo qindeessuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3148679				0	om	Waraantoo bahaa yoo gulaaluu barbaadde, kan armaan gadii hojjadhu:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3151102				0	om	Hammangaa man'ee ykn waraantoo foormulaa waraantoo qabu filadhu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3147096				0	om	Filannoo gaditti, gara mirgaatti, sajoo xiqqoo kan faaraan guddisuu ykn xinneessuu dandeessu argita.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3150974				0	om	Yeroo hammangaa waraantoo qindeessitu, foormulaan waraantoo battalumatti hin qindaa'u. Hammangaa kan firiin keessatti mul'atu qofa jijjiirta.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3146080				0	om	Furtuu \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> gadi qabuudhaan, foormulaa waraantoo hammangaa kenname keessatti garagalcha uumuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN10D47				0	om	Waraantoo haalaa shallaguu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN10D4B				0	om	Waraantoo haalaa shallaguun foormulaa waraantoo ykn maatriksii kan faankishinii IF () ykn CHOOSE() dabalatuudha.				20200411 15:09:53
