helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3151260				0	om	Osoo hangii hinfilin, faankishinii MUNIT filadhu. Sanduuqa filannoo \<emph\>Waraantoo\</emph\> mallatteessi. Safartuu waraantootiif, haala kanaan \<item type=\"input\"\>5\</item\>, hammamtaa barbaadame galchiitii \<emph\>OK\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3150403				0	om	Yookan ammoo \<item type=\"input\"\>=Munit(5)\</item\> foormulaa hammangaa dhumaa filatame(E5) keessa formula galchuu dandeessa, fi  \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Shift+Ajaja+Enter \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Shift+Ctrl+Enter\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
