helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3148518				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MMULT\"\>Bu'aa waraantoo kan waraantota lamaa shallaga.\</ahelp\> Lakkoofsi tarjaawwanii kan waraantoo 1 dirqama lakkoofsa tarreewwanii kan waraantoo 2 waliin wal simachuu qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
