helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3150812				0	om	\<emph\>Waraantoon\</emph\> iddoo jalqabaa irra jiru waraantoo duraa baay'ataa waraantoo keessatti fayyadu bakka bu'a.				20200411 15:09:53
