helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152574				0	om	Fakkeenya				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3146826				0	om	Hammangaa iskuweerii filadhu. Faankishinii MMULT filadhu. \<emph\>Waraantoo\</emph\>tokkoffaa filadhu, achumaan \<emph\>Waraantoo\</emph\>lammaffaa filadhu. \<emph\>Faankishinii Wiizaardii\</emph\> fayyadamuun, \<emph\>Waraantoo\</emph\> sanduuqaa mirkaneessi. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. Waraantoon bahaa hammangaa tokkoffaa irratti filatame ni mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154970				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>Faankishinii TRANSPOSE\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
