helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3153857				0	om	\<emph\>Waraantoon\</emph\> waraantoo wardii keessa jira kan tiraanispoosid ta'an bakka bu'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN115A5				0	om	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#moreontop\"/\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159352				0	om	Fakkeenya				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3159366				0	om	Wardii keessatti, hammangaa kan waraantoon tiraanipoosid ta'e keessatti mul'atu filadhu. Yoo waraantoo duraa tarreewwan n fi tarjaawwan m qabaate, hammangaan filatte dirqama yoo xiqqaate tarreewwan m fi tarjaawwan n qabaachuu qaba. Sana booda foormulaa kallattiidhaan galchi, waraantoo duraa filachuu fi \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Shift+Ajaja+Enter\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Shift+Ctrl+Enter\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> dhiibi. Ykn, yoo \<emph\>Masaka Faankishinii\</emph\>fayyadamaa jiraatte, \<emph\>Waraantoo\</emph\> sanduuqa filannoo keessatti mallatteessi. Waraantoon tiraanspoosid ta'e hammangaa galtee filatame keessatti mul'achuu fi batalumaan jijjiirraa dhorkuu falma.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	bm_id3109846				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>Faankishinii LINEST\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3109846				0	om	LINEST				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3144733				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_RGP\"\>Gabatee xiinannoosarara sirrii kan deetaa qindaa'e kan gitu deebisa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152825				0	om	Caasima				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3152839				0	om	LINEST(Deetaa_Y; Deetaa_X; Gosasorooroo; Sadarkaa)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3152853				0	om	\<emph\>Deetaa_Y\</emph\> hangii tarree ykn tarjaa baaqqee qindeessii Y qindeessa akeektuu deetaa keessaa oifteessuu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154428				0	om	\<emph\>Deetaa_X\</emph\> (filannoo) hangii tarre ykn tarjaa baaqqee walgita qindeessii x ti. Yoo \<emph\>deetaa_X\</emph\> hafe \<item type=\"literal\"\>1, 2, 3, ..., n\</item\> tti duraantoo ta'a. Yoo jijjiiramtoota tokkoo ol qindaa'an \<emph\>deetaa_X\</emph\> hangii tarroota fi tarjoota waligitu wajjin ta'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id0811200804502119				0	om	LINEST sarara sirrii \<item type=\"literal\"\>y = a + bx\</item\> deetaa sirriitti taasisamu barbaada, sorooroo regreeshinii fayyadamuun (mala "iskuweerii xiqqaa"). Tuuta bakka bu'eewwan tokkoo ol sararichi sirrii unkaa itti aanu qabaata \<item type=\"literal\"\>y = a + b1x1 + b2x2 ... + bnxn\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154448				0	om	yoo\<emph\>Gosasorooroo\</emph\> SOBA ta'e sararri sirriin argamu dirqama xabboo keessa darbuu qaba(qabeentoon zeeroo; y=bx).Yoo dhiifame,\<emph\>Gosasorooroo\</emph\> DHUGAA tti duraantoo ta'a(sararri xabboo keessa darbuuf hin dirqamsiifamu)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154142				0	om	Yoo\<emph\>stats\</emph\> dhiifame ykn SOBA gubbaa gabatee xiinannoo qofatu deebi'a. Yoo DHUGAA ta'e gabatee guututu deebi'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id0811200804502261				0	om	LINEST gabatee (waraantoo) xinaannoo akka kana gadiitti deebisa fi akka foomulaa waraantootti galfamuu qaba (fakkeenyaaf \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+Return bakka deebisii fayyadamuun).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN11416				0	om	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#optional\"/\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN116C6				0	om	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#moreontop\"/\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154162				0	om	Fakkeenya				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154176				0	om	Faankishiniin kun waraantoo kenna faankishiniin kunis akkuma faankishinoota waraantoo kaaniitti qabama. Deebiiwwaniif hangii filadhu sana booda faankishinii filadhu. \<emph\>data_Y\</emph\> filadhu. Yoo barbaadde, ulaagota biroo galchi. \<emph\>Waraantoo\</emph\> filadhuuti \<emph\>Tole\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3155468				0	om	Firiin sirna (yoo \<emph\>stats\</emph\> = 0), dhaan kenname, yoo xinnaate dhundhula sarara rigireeshinii fi bakkatti rigireeshinichi siiqqee Y wajjiin walqaxxaamuru agarsiisa.Yoo \<emph\>stats\</emph\> 0 waliin wal qixa yoo ta'uu baate, firii biraan mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
