helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154909				0	om	Hammangawwan man'ee gamteessuu barbaadde yoo moggasawwan qabaatan kkutaa kana fayyadami.Dirqalaalee kana kan filachuun si barbaachisu hammangaan gamtaa'inaa moggaasa wal fakkataa fi deetaan qindaa'e akka garagaraatin qindaa'e qofaa dha.				20200411 15:09:53
