helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041	13			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_SCENWIN_TOP\"\>Mul'inootaaf maqaa hiiki.Mul'inoota haala salphaan adda basuu akka dandeessuuf haqii ykn maqaa addaa fayyadami.\</ahelp\>Akkasumaas maqaa mul'inoota Karaa ajaja baafata hanqara \<emph\>Amaloota\</emph\> naannessa jedhuun  foyyeessuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153954				0	om	Yaada				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411	15			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_SCENWIN_BOTTOM\"\>Odeeffanno dabbalataa mul'inootaa ifteessa. Odeeffannoon kunis \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Naanna'aa\</link\> keessatti kan agarsiifamu yommuu sajoo \<emph\>Mul'inoota\</emph\> cuuqastuu fi mul'inoota barbaaddu filtudha. \</ahelp\> Akkasumaas odeeffannoo kana karaa ajaja baafata hanqara \<emph\>Amaloota \</emph\> nanneessa keessatti foyyeessu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
