helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145367				0	om	Handaara agarsiisaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151073				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:RID_SCDLG_NEWSCENARIO:LB_COLOR\"\>mil'inoota gabatee kee keessa dangaa waliin jiruu gadii ilaala. haluun dangaa dirreewwan dirqala gara mirgaatti jiran irraatti iftaayee.\</ahelp\> Handaarri cancala mataduree maqaa mul'inaa dhumaa  agarsiisu of keessaa qaba.Yoo baay'een isaa hiikame,qabdoon gara mirgaa handaara mil'inaatti argamu mul'inoota nannoo kanatti argaman akkaa iirra gadii ilaaltuu sii heyyama.Tarree keessa mul'inoota barbaaddee ittisa malee filachuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149582				0	om	Duubatti garagalcha				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154942				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_NEWSCENARIO:CB_TWOWAY\"\>Gatiiwwan man'eewwanii mul'inoota ka'aatti jijjirtee garagalcha.Yoo dirqaalaa kana filachuu dhiiste,yommuu gatiiwwan man'ee jijjiramu mul'inni hin jijjiramu.Amalli qindaa'inaa \<emph\>Duubatti Garagalcha\</emph\> ittisa man'ee, ittisa wardii, fi qindaa'inoota \<emph\>Jijjiramoota dhorki\</emph\> irratti hundaa'a.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149402				0	om	Wardii waamaraa garagalchi				20200411 15:09:53
