helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148664				0	om	\<variable id=\"tabelletext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Protect\"\>man'eewwan wardii ammaa keessatti akka hin jijjiramneef eega.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> Qaaqa\<emph\>Wardii Eegaa\</emph\> kan  ittiin ittigaa qabachuu ykn dhiisuu isaa itti ifteessitu banuuf\<emph\>Meeshaalee - Galmee Eegaa - Wardii\</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149664				0	om	Man'eewwan gulaaltu dabalataa irraa ittisuuf,sanduuqni mirkaneessaa \<emph\>Kan Eegamee\</emph\>fuula caancalaa \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05020600.xhp\" name=\"Format - Cells - Cell Protection\"\>\<emph\>Dhangii - Man'eewwwan - Eeginsa Man'ee\</emph\>\</link\> ykn baafata halqara irraa \<emph\>Dhangii Man'eewwan\</emph\> mirkaneessuun dirqi dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154490	8			0	om	Bafatoota \<emph\>Meeshaalee - Galmee Eega - Barruu\</emph\> fi \<emph\>Dhangii - Man'eewwan - Hayyisa Man'ee \</emph\> fayyadamuun man'ewwan ykn hangiiwwan man'ee hin eegamnee barruu eegamee irratti qindeessu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149123				0	om	Man'eewwan hin eegamin fili				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150329				0	om	\<emph\>Dhangii - Man'eewwan - Hayyisa Man'ee\</emph\>fili.Sanduuqa \<emph\>Kan Eegame\</emph\> hin mallatteessin itti ansuun \<emph\>Eeyyee\</emph\>cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156384				0	om	Barrruu \<emph\>Meeshaalee - Galmee Eegaa - Barruu\</emph\>tti,barruuf eeginsa kakaasi.Ful'aa hatataman, hangii man'ee isa sadarkaa 1ffaatti filattee qofa gulaalamuu danda'a. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149566	9			0	om	Boodaa bakka hin eegamnee gara bakka eegameetti jijjiruuf,hangii fili.Itti ansuun fuula caancala\<emph\>Dhangii - Man'eewwan - Hayyisa Man'ee\</emph\> irraa sanduuqa\<emph\>Kan Eegame\</emph\> mirkaneessi.Dhumarratti barruu\<emph\>Meeshaalee - Galmee Eegaa - Barruu \</emph\> fili.Hangiin duraan gulaalamee amma hin xuqaman.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153964				0	om	Sheet protection also affects the context menu of the sheet tabs at the bottom of the screen. The \<emph\>Delete\</emph\> and \<emph\>Rename\</emph\> commands cannot be selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150301				0	om	Yoo wardiin ittifamee,akkaataalee man'ee haroomsuu ykn haquun hin dandeessu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154656				0	om	Hangaa ittisinni kun hojii dhiisuutti barruu ykn hangii man'ee ittisamee lammata hin haaromfamuu.Ittisa kana hojii dhaabsiisuuf ajaja\<emph\>Meeshaalee - Galmee eegame - Wardii\</emph\> fili.Yoo ittigaa hin qindeessine,barruun ittisaa hatattamaan agarsiifama.yoo barruun ittigaan eegamadha ta'ee,qaaqni \<emph\>Ittisni Haqii\</emph\> bakka iitti ittigaa galchitu ni banama.  				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149815				0	om	Takka ol keenyaan,barruuwwan ittisaman ajaja\<emph\>Faayilii - Akkaa olkaa'i\</emph\>qoofa lammata olka'aamu.  				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150206				0	om	Ittigaa (Dirqaala)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152990				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Protect\"\>barruu jijjiraamoota heyyaman alaa irraa ittisuuf ittigaa akka galchituuf si heeyyama.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148700				0	om	Gutummaa ittisa hojiikee kan argamu dirqalaalee laman ittisa ittigaa dabalachuun, baafata\<emph\>Meeshaalee -Galmee Eega\</emph\> irratti walitti makuun.Galmeewwan altokkoon wal faana banuu irraa dhorkuuf,qaaqa\<emph\>Olka'ii\</emph\>keessatti osoo qabdoo\<emph\>Olka'ii\</emph\>hin cuqaasin,sanduuqa\<emph\>Ittigaa waliin olkaa'ii\</emph\> mallatteessi. 				20200411 15:09:53
