helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3146984	5			0	om	Haaloota lameeniti,yoo "Dhaabbii" filattee,galmii fashalaawaan baduun gatiin darbee lamataa man'ee seena.Halaama kanaan qaaqoota "Akeekkachiisa" fi "Odeeffannoo" yoo cuftu qabdoo \<emph\>Haqii \</emph\> cuqaasi.Yoo qaaqotaa qabdoo\<emph\>Eyyee\</emph\>n cuftee,galmii fashalaawaa hin haqamu.				20200411 15:09:53
