helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060102.xhp	0	help	par_idN10600				0	om	Faankishinii maqaan isaanii _ADD wajjin dhumu firii wal fakkaatu kan Micro Excel wajjin walgitu deebisa. Firii sadarkaa addunyaa irratti hundaa'e argachuuf faankishinii _ADD ala ta'e fayyadamaa. Fakkeenyaaf,faankishiniin WEEKNUM sadarkaa addunyaa ISO 6801 irratti hundaa'udhaan lakkoofsa torbanii kan guyyaa kennamee shallaga, WEEKNUM_ADD ammoo lakkoofsa torbanii walfakkaatu akka Microsoft Exseelitti deebisa. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060102.xhp	0	help	par_id3150437				0	om	$[officename] gara keessatti gatiin guyyaa/yeroo qabata. Yoo dhangii lakkoofsaa "lakkoofsaa"guyyaadhaaf ykn yeroodhaaf hiriirsitan,gara lakkoofsaatti jijjiirama.Fakkeenyaaf,01/01/2000 12:00 PM,gara 36526.5 jijjiirama.Lakkoofsi deesimaalii dursu guyyaa bakka bu'u.Lakkoofsi itti aanu yeroo bakka bu'a. Yoo gosa lakkoofsaa guyyaa ykn yeroo bakka bu'ee arguu hin barbaadde, dhangii lakkoofsaa haala jiruun jijjiiruu qabda. Kana hojjachuuf, man'ee gatii guyyaa ykn yeroo qabu filadhu, menu galuumsaa waamuu fi \<emph\>Man'eewwan dhangii\</emph\> filachuu. \<emph\>Lakkoofsonni\</emph\> tarjaa fuulaa faankishinii dhangii ibsuudhaaf of keessaa qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
