helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060102.xhp	0	help	par_id791039				0	om	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - Calculate\</emph\> to select the date base.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060102.xhp	0	help	par_id1953489				0	om	Yoo man'eengatii guyyaa qabu wardiiwwan  adda adda gidduutti garagalchituu fi maxxansitu galmeen wardii  qindaa'uu qaba.Yoo bu'uurri guyyaa adda ta'e guyyaan mul'atu ni jijjiirama!				20200411 15:09:53
