helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060102.xhp	0	help	par_id3149720				0	om	In \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - General\</emph\> you find the area \<emph\>Year (two digits)\</emph\>. This sets the period for which two-digit information applies. Note that changes made here have an effect on some of the following functions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060102.xhp	0	help	par_id3150654				0	om	Yeroo guyyaa galchitu,haxaaroo ykn bakkaduwwaan akka adda baaftuu guyyaatti hiikama.Kanaafuu,guyyaan dhangii kana keessatti galu akka guyyaatti hin beekamu akkasumas firii dogogoraa shallaga.Guyyaan akka foormulaatti akka hiikamuuf,mallattoo waraabbii keessa kaa'i fkf "07/20/54".				20200411 15:09:53
