helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155811				0	om	ofnaa guutuun sarxaa ibsame fayyadamuudhaan gatii walfannee xumura.Walfaanneen 1,3,5 battalumatti 7,9,11,13 fi kkf wajjin xumurama.Guyyaa fi yeroon haala jiruun xumurama.Fkf 01.01.99 fi 15.01.99,guyyaa 14 fayyadama.				20200411 15:09:53
