helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155544				0	om	\<emph\>Lakkaawwii2\</emph\> lakkoofsa maalimaa tuuta keessaa filamuudha. is the number of items to choose from the set.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id1997131				0	om	COMBINA returns the number of unique ways to choose these items, where the order of choosing is irrelevant, and repetition of items is allowed. For example if there are 3 items A, B and C in a set, you can choose 2 items in 6 different ways, namely AA, AB, AC, BB, BC and CC.				20200411 15:09:53
