helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152043				0	om	\<emph\>Hammagni\</emph\> hammanga ulaagaan itti hojiirra oolfameedha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152062				0	om	\<emph\>Ulaagaan\</emph\> man'ee kan ulaagaan barbaachaa ykn ulaagaan barbaachaa matuma isaatiin, keessatti mul'atuudha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152083				0	om	\<emph\>Hammangaanida'amaa\</emph\> hammangaa kan gatiin irraa ida'amuudha. Yoo jijjiiramaan kun mul'achuu baate, gatiin hammangaa keessatti argame ni ida'ama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8347422				0	om	SUMIF wabii diraa ogeeyyii(~) ulaagaa jijjiiramaa keessa qofaa, fi yoo jijjiiramaa filannoo Hammanga ida'amaa hin kennamne deegara.				20200411 15:09:53
