helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6670125				0	om	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SUMIF(A1:A10;">0";B1:10)\</item\> - gatii hammanga B1:B2 irraa eegalee yoo gatiin gitu hammanga keessaa A1:A2 >0 ta'e ida'a.				20200411 15:09:53
