helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_workday.xhp	0	help	par_id3149893				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_WORKDAY\"\> Firiin isaa lakkoofsa guyyaa kan akka guyyaatti gulaalamuu danda'uu dha.Itti fufuun lakkoofsa guyyaa kan lakkoofsa murta'aa ta'ee tokko \<emph\>guyyaa hojiiwwaani\</emph\> \<emph\>jalqaba guyyaa\</emph\> irra adda kan ta'e.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
