helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154098				0	om	Meeshaan wajjiraa kan gatii jalqabaa safartuu sharafaa 50,000 ta'e waggoota torbaaf(7) dullatooma. Gatiin xumura dullatoomaa safartuu sharafaa 3,500 ta'a.				20200411 15:09:53
