helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3148652				0	om	Ittisni 2001-01-01 bitame; aduun bilchinaa 2006-01-01. Saffisni xiqqaan dhalaa 8%. Kennaan 9.0%. Dhallii walakkaa waggaati kanfalama (ammamtaan 2). Shallaga madaallii dhalaa (hundee 3) guyyaa guyyaanii fayyadamuudhan turmaatni fooyya'ee hagam ta'a?				20200411 15:09:53
