helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3145308				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_NBW\"\>Tartibawwan lola'ina horii callaa irraadedeebi fi hir'ina gatii irratti hunda'uudhan gatii ammaa kan investimantii kenna.Gatii dimshaashaa ammaa argachuuf, gatii piroojektii walirraa hir'isi (lolaa'ina horii callaa jalqabaa yeroo duwwaatti) kan gatii kennamee irraa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
