helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154800				0	om	Gatiin dimshashaa amma yeroo yeroon kanfalamuu 10, 20 fi 30 saffisa safartuu sharafaa 8.75%.Yommuu yeroon duwwaa ta'u gatiiwwan kanfalaman akkaa safartuu sharafaa 40ti.				20200411 15:09:53
