helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030700.xhp	0	help	par_id3151211				0	om	Haalata kana si'aa jalqabaaf yoo waamta ta'ee, faankishiinin \<emph\>Haalata Guuti\</emph\> ajaja \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/06030100.xhp\" name=\"Trace Precedent\"\>Sakkatta'ii Dursaa\</link\> waliin walfakkaata.Dirqalaalee dabalata haalata guuti fi halaata kana bahii filachuuf bafata halqara fayyadami.    				20200411 15:09:53
