helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\text2columns.xhp	0	help	hd_id2300180				0	om	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/text2columns.xhp\"\>Barru gara Tarjaawwanitti\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\text2columns.xhp	0	help	par_id655232				0	om	\<variable id=\"text2columns\"\>Qaaqa Barruu gara Tarjaawwanitti bana,iddoo itti qinda'inoota galchuudhaan qabiiyyeewwaan man'eewwaan filatamanii gara man'eewwaan baay'eetti babal'atani dha. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\text2columns.xhp	0	help	hd_id9599597				0	om	Qabiyyeewwaan man'ee gara man'ee baay'eetti babal'isuuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\text2columns.xhp	0	help	par_id2021546				0	om	Tarree walfakkaata keessatti gatii qodduun addan qoodaman gara man'eewwan baay'eetti babal'isuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\text2columns.xhp	0	help	par_id2623981				0	om	Fakkeenyaaf,man'een A1 gatii qoodduun qoodamaan\<item type=\"literal\"\>1,2,3,4\</item\>,fi man'ee barruu A2 \<item type=\"literal\"\>A,B,C,D\</item\> of keessaa qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\text2columns.xhp	0	help	par_id7242042				0	om	Man'ee ykn man'eewwan babal'isuu barbaaddu filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\text2columns.xhp	0	help	par_id6999420				0	om	\<emph\>Daataa-Barruu gara Tarjaawwanitti\</emph\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\text2columns.xhp	0	help	par_id6334116				0	om	Qaaqa barruu gara tarjaawwanittitti argita.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\text2columns.xhp	0	help	par_id9276406				0	om	Filaannoowwan gargareessaa filadhu.Durargiin akkaata man'een ammaa garaa man'eewwaan baay'eettii itti muxatan agarsiisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\text2columns.xhp	0	help	par_id8523819				0	om	Baal'inaa murta'aa filadhuu, itti aansun sarartuu duraargii irra jiru cuqasuun iddoo addaan kukutinsaa man'ee qindeessuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\text2columns.xhp	0	help	par_id1517380				0	om	Bakka tuqaa kukutinsaa arfiilee gargaaressaa filuu ykn galchuu dandeessa. Bu'aa qabiiyyeewwaan man'ee keessaa arfiileen gargaaressaa ni haqamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\text2columns.xhp	0	help	par_id7110812				0	om	Fakkeenyaa irratti, qoodduu akka arfiilee addaan citinsaatti filatte. Man'eewwaan A1 fi A2 nin gara tarjaawwan afuriitti babal'achuu danda'u. A1 nin 1 qaba, A2'n 2 qaba fi akka kanaan ittin fufa.				20200411 15:09:53
