helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150718				0	om	Lakkoofsotni hundi ulaagaa sana guutu.Gatiwwaan galan kunis kan isaan dhangaa'aan akkaataa qaaqni itti aanun dhufu waamamunidha.				20200411 15:09:53
