helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3159488				0	om	\<variable id=\"druckbereichetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EditPrintArea\"\>Qaaqa itti hangii maxxansa  itti ifteessitu dandeessu bana.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> Akkasumaas tarreewwan ykn tarjaawwan tokko tokkoo fuulaa keessatti deddebi'uu qindeeessuu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_idN105AE				0	om	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/guide/printranges.xhp#printranges\"/\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156281				0	om	Hangii Maxxansaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147228				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_AREAS:ED_PRINTAREA\"\>Hangii Maxxansaa ramadaee akka foyyeesituu si heeyyama.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145174				0	om	Wardii ammaaf hangii maxxansa ramadamee haquuf \<emph\>-Homaa-\</emph\> fili.Wardii ammaa akkaa hangii maxxansatti qindeessuuf \<emph\>-wardii waamaraa-\</emph\> fili. Bakka wardiin filame akkaa hangii maxxansatti ramaduuf \<emph\>-Filannoo-\</emph\> fili.\<emph\>-Hiika Fayyadamaa-\</emph\> filuun, akka duraa ajaja \<emph\>Dhangii - hangiiwwan maxxansuu - ramadi\</emph\> fayyadamteen hangii maxxansaa ramaduu dandeessa.Yoo maqaan hangii ajaja  \<emph\>Saagi - Maqoota - Hiiki\</emph\> fayyadamuun kenname,maqaan kun  agarsifamun  sanduuqa tarree keessa filamu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145272				0	om	Harkaa mirgaa sanduuqa barruutti,maqaan ykn wabiin hangii maxxansa galchuu dandeessa.Yoo qareen sanduuqa barruu\<emph\>Hangii Maxxansa\</emph\> keessa taate,hantuutee keetiin wardii keessatti hangii maxxansa filachuu dandessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149260				0	om	Tarrewwan irradeebi'amuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147426				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_AREAS:ED_REPEATROW\"\>Tokko tokko fuulaa irratti maxxansuuf tarrewwan tokko ykn isaa olii fili. Sanduuqa barruu sirrii keeessatti wabii tarree galchii, fakkeenyaaf, "1" ykn "$1" ykn "$2:$3".\</ahelp\> sanduuqni tarree \<emph\>-Hiika Fayyadamaa-\</emph\> agarsiisa. Akkaasumaas tarree deddebi'aa hiikamee haquuf\<emph\>-homa-\</emph\> filachuu dandeessa. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155418				0	om	Akkasumas wardii irraa hantuutee harkisuun tarreewwaan deddebi'aa hikamee ramaduu dandeessa,yoo qareen qaaqa dirree barruu\<emph\>Tarrewwan irradeebi'amuu\</emph\> keessa taate. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149581				0	om	Tarjaawwan irradeebi'amuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155602				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_AREAS:ED_REPEATCOL\"\>Tokko tokko fuulaa irratti maxxansuuf tarjaawwan tokko ykn isaa olii filiSanduuqa barruu sirrii keeessatti wabii tarjaa galchii,fakkeenyaaf,"A" ykn "AB" ykn "$C:$E".\</ahelp\> Sanduuqni tarjaa \<emph\>-Hiika Fayyadamaa-\</emph\> agarsiisa.Akkaasumaas tarjaa deddebi'aa hiikamee haquuf\<emph\>-homa-\</emph\> filachuu dandeessa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	om	Akkasumas wardii irraa hantuutee harkisuun tarjaawwaan deddebi'aa hikamee ramaduu dandeessa,yoo qareen qaaqa dirree barruu\<emph\>tarjaawwan irradeebi'amuu\</emph\> keessa taate. 				20200411 15:09:53
