helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\14020000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149687				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>ogeejjii; foormulaawwan keessa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fankishinoota istatistiiksii\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fankishinoota tirigiiniimeetirii\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fuulota;baay'ina\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>jijjiiramoota;amaloota galmee\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>ogeejjiiwwan aritimeetikii foormulaawwan keessaa\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\14020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149687				0	om	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/14020000.xhp\" name=\"Formula\"\>Foormulaa\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\14020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143270	2			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"FN_FORMULA_CALC\"\>Bafata xiqqaa, isa foormulaa man'ee gabatee keessatti irraa saaguu sidandeesiissuu bana.\</ahelp\>Qaree man'ee ykb galmee keessatti bakka bu'aan akka itti mul'atu barbaaddu kaayi. Sajoo \<emph\>Foormulaa\</emph\> cuqaasuun foormulaa barbaaddu filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\14020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149096				0	om	Foormulichii tarree naqaa keessatti mul'ata. Hangii man'eewwan gabatee tokko keessaa ifteessuuf, haantuuteen man'ee barbaaddu fili. Akkasuumas wabiiwwanii man'ee walfakkaatanii tarree naqaa keessatti mul'atu. Akka barbaachiisumaa saatitti, ulaagaalee dabailataa galchiitii, galfata kee mirkaneessuuf \<emph\>Fayyadami\</emph\> cuqaasi. Akkasuumas yoo caasimaa isa sirrii beektee, foormulaa qixxaan galchuu nidandeessa. Fakkeenyaaf, qaaqawwanii \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Insert Fields\"\>\<emph\>Dirreewwan Saagi\</emph\>\</link\> fi \<emph\>Dirreewwan Gulaali\</emph\> kun barbaachiissoodha.				20200411 15:09:53
