helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151177				0	om	Dhangii yeroo addaa tokko ramaduuf, yk deetaa yeroo amjiraa beeksiissuuf, \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> fili, akkasuumas jijjiirama barbaaddee qaaqa \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Dirreewwan\</emph\>\</link\> keessatti tolchi. Dabaaleesi, dhangiin dirree deetaa saagamee yeroo barbaaddeeti akka fooyya'uu danda'uuf, \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Fields\"\>\<emph\>Gulaali - Dirreewwan\</emph\>\</link\> filachuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
