helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030600.xhp	0	help	par_id3151392				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertTitleField\"\>Mataduree amalawwan galmichaa keessatti akka dirree tokkootti iftaa'e saaga.\</ahelp\> Dirreen kun deetaa dirree \<emph\>Dhimma\</emph\> keessatti \<emph\>Faayilii - Amalawwan - Ibsa\</emph\> jalatti gale agarsiissa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030600.xhp	0	help	par_id3148768				0	om	Yoo amala galmee addaa tokko akka dirree tokkotti saaguu barbaaddee, \<emph\>Saagi - Dirreewwan - Kabiroo\</emph\> fili, akkasuumas ijaarsa barbaaddee, qaaqa \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Dirreewwan\</emph\>\</link\> keessatti tolchi. Akaakuuwwanii \<emph\>OdeefGalmee\</emph\> dirreewwan amalawwan galmee keessatti mul'atan mara of keessaa qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
