helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149294				0	om	Yoo lakkoofsa fuulaa haalataa lakkaawwii addaa tokkoon dhangeefame qabaachuu barbaaddee, akkasuumas dirricha barbaadamu saaguuf, \<emph\>Saagi - Dirree - Kabiroo\</emph\> filadhu, ijaarsa qaaqa \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Field\"\>\<emph\>Dirree\</emph\>\</link\> keessaa ifteessi. Akkasuuma dhangiichi dirree barbaaddee, ajaja \<emph\>Lakkoofsa Fuulaa\</emph\> fayyadamuun ajaja \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Field\"\>\<emph\>Gulaali - Dirree\</emph\>\</link\> fooya'uu nidandaa'a.				20200411 15:09:53
