helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154570				0	om	Qixii qarichaa, ati iddaa duwwaa fuulaa keessatti, barruu, calaqeewwan, gabateewwan, goodayyaawwan, wantawwan kabiroo akka keessuu sihayyama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155902				0	om	Yoo qaree gidduu haandara bitaa fi mirga fuulaa ykn man'ee gabatee keesse, barruun ati gachitu ni wiirteffama. Haaluma walfakkaatuun, yoo qaree gara handaara mirgaa keesse barruun mirga hiriirfama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151255				0	om	Meeshaan OfiinSirreessaa ofumaan keewwatawwan, caancalawwan, fi iddoowwan duwwaa warra qixa qareetiin saagaman haqa. Yoo qixa qaree fayyadamuu barbaaddee, meeshaa OfiinSirreessaa dhaamsi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148982				0	om	Qixii qaree caancalawwan qubannoo qarichaa qindeessa. Yoo qubee caancalawwanii jijjiirte, qubannoon barruu fuulicha irraa akkasuuma jijjiiramuu dandaa'a.				20200411 15:09:53
