helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_small.xhp	0	help	par_id3149829				0	om	On the \<emph\>Page Layout\</emph\> tab page of the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File - Print\</item\> dialog, you have the option to print multiple pages on one sheet.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_small.xhp	0	help	par_id3156098				0	om	Choose \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\> and click the \<emph\>Page Layout\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_small.xhp	0	help	par_id3155055				0	om	Do one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_small.xhp	0	help	par_id3149603				0	om	To print two pages side by side on the same sheet, select "2" in the \<emph\>Pages per sheet\</emph\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_small.xhp	0	help	par_id3153388	22			0	om	To print multiple pages on the same sheet, select the number of pages per sheet and optionally set the order of pages. The small preview shows the arrangement of pages. 				20200411 15:09:53
