helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id3155182				0	om	Yeroo barruu barbaadduu fi galmee keessa bakka buustu turbaawwwan abbaalaa fayyadamuu dandeessa. Fakkeenyaaf, "s.n" "sun" fi "son" barbaada.				20200411 15:09:53
