helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id3153136				0	om	Mul'ina arfii duraa al zeeroo ykn isaa oliif turbaan abbaalaa urjoo dha.Fakkeenyaaf:"123*" "12" "123", fi "1233" barbaada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id3149609				0	om	Walitti qabamni turbaa abbaalaa zeeroo barbaaduuf ykn mul'ina arfii kamiiyyu tuqaa fi urjoo (.*) dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id3149854				0	om	Turbaan abbaalaa dhuma keewwataa mallattoo doolaarii ($) dha. Walitti qabamni arfii turbaa abbaalaa jalqaba keewwataa arfii hoxxee fi tuqaa (^.) dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id0509200916345545				0	om	Turbaa abbaala arfii caancalaaf \\t dha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id3153414				0	om	A search using a regular expression will work only within one paragraph. To search using a regular expression in more than one paragraph, do a separate search in each paragraph.				20200411 15:09:53
