helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id2508621				0	om	Abbimaa ijaaruuf, kan armaan gadii tokko hojjadhu:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id3856013				0	om	Faayilii*.oxt dheertoo hard drive keetitti kuusi, achumaan faayilii*.oxt faayil manager keessatti allama-cuqaasi. Karaa biraan, %PRODUCTNAME keessatti \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Meeshaalee - Manager dheertoo\</item\> Manager dheertoo banuuf filadhu, Ida'uu fi iyya'aa gara faayiliiti cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id7814264				0	om	Abbimaa faayilii *.oxt fuula saphaphuu fi hojiirra oolcha durtii waliin wal qabsiisi. Kuni iyya'aa saphaaphuu haalaan qindeeffame barbaada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	hd_id8142338				0	om	Baafata abbimaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id1917477				0	om	Any text in a Writer document can be marked with a Smart Tag, by default a magenta colored underline. You can change the color in \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Appearance\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id192266				0	om	Yeroo gara abbimaatti jaleeltu, gargaarsi gubbaa baafata abbimaa banuuf akka Ctrl-cuqaaftu si hima. Yoo hantuuttee fayyadamuu baatte, qaree barruu mallateeffame keessa kaa'uu fi baafata qabenta Shift+F10 dhaan banuu.   				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id1998962				0	om	Baafata abbimaa keessatti, gocha argamu kan abbimaa ibsame ilaaluu dandeessa. Baafata keessaa filannoo filadhu. \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>ajaja\</item\> Filannoowwan abbimaa \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040700.xhp\"\>banuuf abbima\</link\> fuulaa kan Meeshaalee - Ofiinsirreessuu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	hd_id2376476				0	om	Abbimaa dandeessisuu fi dhaamsuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id349131				0	om	Ijaarsa yoo xiqqaate dheertoo abbimaa tokko  ta'e yoo qabaatte, \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040700.xhp\"\>Fuula\</link\> Abbimaa \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Meeshaalee - Ofsirreessaa\</item\>argita. Abbimaa dandeessisuuf ykn dhaamsuuf fi iyyatoo ijaaruu qaaqee kana fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
