helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070E				0	om	Amaloota qaaqee keessatti maxxansaa keetiif, waraqaa qaabinsaa dalgessuuf qindeessi.   				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_id8947416				0	om	Maxxansaan kee yoo garlamee maxxanse, fi sababii birooshariin moodii dalgessa keessatti yeroo hundaa barreeffame, "duplex-short edge"fayyadamuun maxxansaa qaaqee qindeessaa keessatti qindeessuu qabda.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN10628				0	om	Return to \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog, and click the \<emph\>Page Layout\</emph\> tab page.				20200411 15:09:53
