helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EA				0	om	If %PRODUCTNAME prints the pages in the wrong order, open the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> tab page, select \<emph\>Print in reverse page order\</emph\>, and then print the document again.				20200411 15:09:53
