helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id611285				0	om	Galmeewwan barruu irratti jechota, dhangeessuu, akkaataaleef dabala barbaadu nidandessa. Bu'aa tokko irrra issa ittianatti naanna'u nidandessa, ykn mara bu'aa altokko Shoolu nidandessa, kana booda dhangii biroo fayyadami ykn jechota barruu birottin bakkabuusi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	hd_id6226081				0	om	Qaqaa Barbaadii Baakka Buusi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id6702780				0	om	Galmee guutuu kessatti barruu barbaaddu nidandessa, filmaata barruu ka'aa tokko male qaqaa barbaadiif baakka buusi bani. Galmee kee keesatti kutaa tokko barbaaddu yoo fete, duraa kutaa barruu fili, booda qaqaa barbaadii baakka buusi bani.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	hd_id3158970				0	om	Barruu barbaaduuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id6957304				0	om	Qaqaa barbaadii baakka buusi banuf \<emph\>Gulaali - Barbaadii Baakkabuusi\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id2164677				0	om	Sanduuqa barruu keessaa \<emph\>Barbaadi\</emph\> barbaachuf barruu galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id5684072				0	om	Tokkoon lamaanii,\<emph\>Barbaadi\</emph\> ykn \<emph\>Mara Barbaadi\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id4377269				0	om	Yammu \<emph\>Barbaadii\</emph\> cuqaastu, Barreessaan barruu itti aanuu isa galfata keetiin qixxee sitti agarsiissa, kana booda gara barruu itti aanee argamuutti deemuudhaaf, \<emph\>Barbaadi\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id1371807				0	om	Yoo qaaqa cuftee, osso qaaqa hinbanini, barruu itti aanuu argachuuf, furtuwwan (Ctrl+Shift+F) walitti gad-dhiibuudde argachuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id924100				0	om	Akka filannootti, barruu itti aanuu keessa ykn galmee keessaa wanta kabiroo kamuu keessa naanna'uuf, sajoowwan mirga gara gadii galmee irraa fayyadamuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id9359416				0	om	Yammuu ati \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Mara Barbaadii\</item\> cuqaastuu, Barreessaan barruu isa galfata keetiin qixxee tahe mara sitti agarsiissa. Amma akka fakkeenyaatti barruu argaman mara gara yabbuutti, ykn barruu maraaf altokkichaan akkaataa arfii fayyadamuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
