helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id24109				0	om	Yoo barbaadde, \<emph\>Bakkabuusi\</emph\> ykn \<emph\>Mara Bakkabuusi\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id703451				0	om	Yammuu ati \<emph\>Bakkabuusi\</emph\> cuqaastu, Barreessaan barruudhaaf sanduuqa \<emph\>Barbaadi\</emph\> keessaa bakka qaree ammaatii ka'uudhan galmee hunda keessa barbaada. Yommuu barruun argamuu, Barreessaan barrichaa shoolessee deebii kee eeggata. Barruu shoolame kan galmee barruu sanduuqa barruu \<emph\>Dhaan bakkabuusi\</emph\> dhaan bakka buusuuf \<emph\>Bakka buusi\</emph\> cuqaasi. Filannoo ammaa osoo bakka hin buusiniin dura, gara barruu argame itti aanuutti deemuudhaaf, \<emph\>Barbaadi\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id7540818				0	om	Yammuu \<emph\>Mara Bakkabuusi\</emph\> cuqaastu, Barreessaan barruu galfata keetiin walsiman mara bakkabuusa.				20200411 15:09:53
