helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149973				0	om	\<variable id=\"arrange_chapters\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/arrange_chapters.xhp\" name=\"Rearranging a Document by Using the Navigator\"\>Naanna'aa fayyadamuudhaan Galmee Qiqindeessuu\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147795	59			0	om	Matadureewwanii fi barruu hirkataa, naanna'aa fayyadamuudhaan, barruu galmee tokko keessaa olii fi gadii siqsuu nidandeessa. Akkasumas, sadarkaalee mataduree oleessuu fi gadeessuu nidandeessa. Halataa kana fayyadamuudhaaf, matadureewwan galmee kee keessaa, akkaataalee keewwataa-mataduree-durmurtaawaa tahan keessaa tokkoon dhangeessi. Mataduree tokkoof, akkaataa keewwataa maamiloo fayyadamuuf, \<emph\>Meeshaalee - Lakkaawwii Toorii\</emph\> fili, akkaataa isaa ammoo, sanduuqa \<emph\>Akkaataa Keewwataa \</emph\>keessaa filadhu, kana booda lakkoofsa tarree \<emph\>Sadarkaalee \</emph\>keessatti lama-cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3145652	62			0	om	Qaree barruu gara mataduree galmicha keessaa tokkotti ariitiidhaan siiqsuudhaaf, tarree \<emph\>Naanna'aa \</emph\>keessatti mataduricha lam-cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3155461				0	om	\<emph\>Naanna'aa\</emph\> hidhachuudhaaf, kabala matduree gara qarqara iddoohojiitti harkisi. \<emph\>Naanna'aa\</emph\> hiikachuudhaaf ammoo, goodayyaa isaa lam-cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151184				0	om	Mataduree tokko Galmicha keessatti Oli ykn Gadi Siiqsuudhaaf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id0915200809400790				0	om	Gulantaaleen mataduree hundi nannaa'aa keessatti mul'ifamuu isaanii mirkaneessi. Durtiidhaan gulantaaleen hundi ni mul'ifamu. Gulantaaleen mataduree mul'ifaman akkamitti akka jijjiiraman  dhawata ilaali.				20200411 15:09:53
