helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id5589159				0	om	To change the measurement units, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - General\</item\>, and then select a new measurement unit in the Settings area. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id9936216				0	om	Siiqsa keewwata ammaatif, ykn keewwatawwan filataman maraaf, ykn akkaataa keewwataatif geeddaruu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id7953123				0	om	Akkasumas \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/ruler.xhp\" name=\"ruler\"\>sarartuu fayyadamuun siiqsawwan qindeessi\</link\>. Sarartuu agarsiisuuf, \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Mul'annoo - Sarartuu\</item\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id4013794				0	om	Siiqsawwan keewwata ammaa ykn keewwatawwan filatamanii geeddaruf \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Dhangii - Keewwata - siiqsawwan & addaan fageenya\</item\> fili.Akkasumas \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/ruler.xhp\" name=\"ruler\"\>sarartuu fayyadamuun siiqsawwan qindeessuu dandeessa\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id1631824				0	om	Siiqsawwan keewwata akkaataa keewwataa walfakkataa qabanii geeddaruuf Keewwata mirga-cuqaasuun \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Akkaataa keewwataa gulaali - siiqsawwan & addaan baasuu\</item\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id7271645				0	om	Siiqsawwan mudanawwan fuulaa bitaa fi mirgaa irrati hunda'uun shallagamu.Yoo keewwataa gara mudanawwan fuulatti dheeressuu barbadde, lakkoofsa negaatiivii galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id2136295				0	om	Kallatti barreefamaa irratti hundaa'un siiqsaawwan garagara dha. Fakkeenyaf, gatii siiqsa \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Barruun dura \</item\> kan afaanoota mirga-gara-bitaatti ilaali. Handaarri bitaa keewwataa mudana fuulaa bitaa irratti hundaa'uun siiqa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id4186223				0	om	Siiqsa fannoof, \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Barruun dura\</item\> gatii pozitiivii fi \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Sarara tokkoffaa\</item\> gatii neegatiivii galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
