helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id5074922				0	om	Sanduuqa tarree miljalaa keessaa, agarsiisuuf "Akkaataalee Mara" fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id8491470				0	om	Akkaataa keewwataa "Sarara Dalgee" mirga cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3253883				0	om	Fooyyeessi fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3196203				0	om	Fakkeenyaf, yabbina fi akkaataa sararootaa qindeessuuf fuula caancala daangawwanii bani. Galiinsa sararaa qindeessuf fuula caancala kasaawwan fi addaa baasuu bani.				20200411 15:09:53
