helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3156103				0	om	Yoo barruu keewwata wajjiin mul'atu filatte, barichi ofumaan gara keewwata haaraatti jijjiirama.				20200411 15:09:53
