helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3154400				0	om	Sarara tokko irraa bakka barbaadduutti murfi saaguu, ykn jechoota murfisaman $[officename]n akka barbaaduuf, kana booda murfisa filatame laachuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
