helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3144764				0	om	Barruu filadhu. \<emph\>Saaguu - Kutaa - Kutaa\</emph\> filadhu, ittiaansuun\<emph\>hayyisa barreessi\</emph\> jalatti \<emph\>Hayyisa\</emph\> igita waliin\<emph\>sanduuqa filannoo\</emph\> mallattoo itti godhi.(Yoo kutaan dursee jiraate: \<emph\>Dhangii - kutaalee\</emph\>.) yoo xiqqaate, arfilee 5 galchuun iggiticha raggaasisi/dhugoomsi.				20200411 15:09:53
