helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id4395275				0	om	Iddoo qurxinsaa keessati, \<emph\>Saagii\</emph\> dandeessisi. \<emph\>Lakkoofsa fuulaa\</emph\> lakkoofsa haaraa akka qindeessu gochuuf \<emph\>Haalata Fuula Waliin\</emph\> danddeessisi. \<emph\>TOLEE\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
