helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	hd_id5051728				0	om	Haalaawwan lakkoofsa fuulaa adda addaa fayyadamuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id1558885				0	om	Fuuloota haalata lakkaawwii warra Roomaan barreefamani, kanneen hafan haalata birootin kan barreeffaman si barbaachiisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id1541184				0	om	Barreessaa Keessatti, haalatawwan Fuula adda addaa si barbaachiisa. Haalatni fuula tokkoffaa jaalantoo lakkoofsota roomaniitif dirree fuula lakkoofsatin dhanga'ee of keessaa qaba. Haalatni fuulaa itti aanuu jaalantoo dirree fuula lakkoofsatin dhangeeffame of keessaa qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id18616				0	om	Haalataaleen fuula lameenu qurxinsa fuulatin adda bahuu qabu. Barreessaa Keessatti, qurxisawwan fuulaa ofumaani fi qurxisawwan fuulaa hujekaan saagaman qabaachuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id6138492				0	om	\<emph\>qurxinsi fuulaa ofumaani\</emph\> yommuu haalatni fuulaa "akkaataa itti aanu" addummaa qabaate dhuma fuulaa irraati mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id4569231				0	om	For example, the "First Page" page style has "Default" as the next style. To see this, you may press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+T\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>F11\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> to open the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Styles and Formatting\</item\> window, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Page Styles\</item\> icon, right-click the First Page entry. Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Modify\</item\> from the context menu. On the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Organizer\</item\> tab, you can see the "next style".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id291451				0	om	\<emph\>qurxinsa fuula hujeekaan saagamee\</emph\> haalatawwan fuulaa  jijjiirun ykn osoo hin jijjiirin fayyadamuun ni danda'ama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3341776				0	om	Yoo \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+Enter\</item\> dhiibde, qurxiinsa fuulaa osoo haalatawwan hin jijjiirin fayyadamuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id5947141				0	om	Yoo \<emph\>Saagii - qurxiinsa hujeekaa\</emph\> filtee, qurxiinsa fuulaa osoo haalata hin jijjiirin ykn jijjiirun ykn fuula lakkoofsaa jijjiirun saaguun ni danda'ama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id1911679				0	om	Wanti gaarii jettu galmee kee irraati hunda'a: qurxiinsa fuulaa haalatawwan fuulaa jidduu hujeekaan saagaman fayyadamuuf, ykn ofiin jijjiiraa fayyadamuuf, fuula mata duree haalata fuuloota biroo irraa adda ta'e tokko yoo barbaadde, mala ofumaan fayyadamuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	hd_id9364909				0	om	Fuula tokkoffaadhaf haalataalee fuulaa adda addaa fayyadamuuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id4473403				0	om	Galmee kee keessaati fuula tokkoffaa irratti cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
