helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id2318796				0	om	Amma fuulli mata duree keetii haalata "First Page" qaba, akkasumas fuulootnii itti aanan ofumaan haalata "default" qabu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id399182				0	om	Amma fakkeenyaaf, haalata fuulaa "Default" tiif qofa jalaantoo saaguu/galchuu ni dandeessa, ykn haalataalee fuula lachiifuu jkalaantoo saagi, garuu dirreewwan lakkoofsaa haala addaatin dhangeeffamaniin ta'u qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
