helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3153366				0	om	Kan armaan gadii keessaa tokko hojedhu:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3153390				0	om	To remove the number while preserving the indent of the paragraph, press the Backspace key.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3154248				0	om	To remove the number and the indent of the paragraph, click the \<emph\>Numbering on/off\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Formatting\</emph\> Bar. If you save the document in HTML format, a separate numbered list is created for the numbered paragraphs that follow the current paragraph.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154856				0	om	Lakkoofsa tarreen lakkoofsaa ittiin jalqabu jijjiiruf:				20200411 15:09:53
