helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_multidoc.xhp	0	help	par_id3155895				0	om	Tokkoon tokkoo galmee dhunfaa keessatti\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120210.xhp\" name=\"index in each individual document\"\>kasaa uumi\</link\>, kasaa galmee qeenteetti garagalchuun maxxansi, sana booda gulaali.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_multidoc.xhp	0	help	par_id3147118				0	om	Tokkoon tokkoo kasaa fili, \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04020000.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Section\"\>\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Saagi - Kutaa\</item\>\</link\> fili, sana booda maqaa kasaa galchi. Galmee dhilaa keessaa,\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Saagi - Kutaa\</item\> fili, \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Kornyoo\</item\> fili, qabdoo sakatta'i (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>...\</item\>) cuqaasi, sana booda kutaa kasaa moggaasame kaa'uun saagi.				20200411 15:09:53
