helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3149578				0	om	Qabeentaata goodayyaa barruu tokko gulaaluudhaaf, goodayyiicha keessa cuqaasiitii, jijjiirama isa barbaadduu sana godhi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3156239				0	om	Goodayyaa tokko gulaaluudhaaf, goodayyiicha filadhuutii, mirga-cuqaasi, kana booda dirqala dhangii filadhu. Akkasumas, goodayyaa filatame mirga-cuqaasiitii, \<emph\>Goodayyaa\</emph\> filachuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3156261				0	om	Goodayyaa barruu tokkoof hagamtaa jijjiiruudhaaf, qaree goodayyaa cuqaasiitii, qaree ykn xiyyoo goodayyaa keessaa tokko harkiisi. Yammuu harkiistu walgitinsaa goodayyaa eeguuf, Shiftii gad-dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153386				0	om	Barruu Maxxansaa Irraa Dhoksuu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3154262				0	om	Goodayyaan barruu Barreessaa kamiyyuu, haalata isa argii irratti barruu mul'isuu hayyamuun qindaa'uu nidandaa'a, garuu barruucha maxxansuu irraa dhoksa.				20200411 15:09:53
