helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id6418042				0	om	Galmeewwan barruu Barreessaatif amaloota fuulaa hunda, fakkeenyaaf kan akka fuula qaabachiisa, haalata fuulatin hiikamu. Durtiidhan, galmee barruu haaraan fuulaawwan hundaaf haalata fuula “Durtii” fayyadama. Yoo barruu galmee jiru bante, haalataaleen fuulaa adda addaa fuuloota adda addaa irratti fayyadamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id8324533				0	om	Jijjiiramni amala fula irratti fayyadamte, fuuloota haalata fuula ammee fayyadamu qofa irratti, dhibba akka fidu beekuun baay'ee barbaachisaa dha. Haalataan fuula ammee kabala haalojii keessati gara daangaa jala foddaati tarreefame.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id7524033				0	om	Fuulaawwan hundaaf qabachiisa fuulaa jijjiiruuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id6307260				0	om	Yoo barruun galmee kee fuula haalatni fuulaa wal fakkaatu qofa qabaate, amaaloota fuulaa sirriin jijjiiruu ni dandeesa:				20200411 15:09:53
