helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067B				0	om	Keewwatoota maxxansa fayyadamaa-galmaa'e irraa hambisuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10682				0	om	Do one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10685				0	om	Keewwatoota irra darbuu barbaaddu hunda filadhu, sana booda  \<emph\>Dhangii - Keewwata - Galumsoota & Qubachiisuu\</emph\> filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN1068C				0	om	Foddaa haalataalee fi dhangi'uu bani, Haalataa keewwataa irra darbuu barbaaddu cuqaasi, Haalataa sana mirga-cuqaasi, \<emph\>Fooyyessi\</emph\> filadhu. Qaaqa keessatti, caancala \<emph\>Galumsoota & Qubachiisuu\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10698				0	om	Sanduuqa mirkanneessaa \<emph\>Fayyadamaa-galmaa'ee\</emph\> qulqulleessi.				20200411 15:09:53
