helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\reset_format.xhp	0	help	par_id3154091				0	om	Furtuu xiyya-mirgaa dhiibuudhaan dhangi'uu hujeekaa keessaa daftee bahuu dandeessa. Fakkeenyaaf, barruu barreessitetti barfuula yabbuu fayadamuuf yoo Ctrl+B dhiibdeetta ta'e, dhangii arfii durtii keewwataa deebisuuf xiyya mirgaa dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\reset_format.xhp	0	help	par_id3155854				0	om	Dhangi'uu kallattii barruu durumaan jiruu haaromsuuf, barricha filadhu, sana booda ajaja baafataa \<emph\>Dhangii - Dhangi'uu Durtii\</emph\> filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Guddiinaa fi Xinneenya Qubee Barruu jijjiiruu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155182				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>Arfiiwwan; qubee guddaa yookin qubee xiqqaa\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>barruu;  qubee guddaa yookin qubee xiqqaa\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>qubee xiqqaa; barruu\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>qubee guddaa; barruu dhanguu\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>gara qubee xiqqaatti jijjiruu\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>jijjiiruu;akkataa barruu\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>matadureen qabeenya jalqabaa\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>qabeenya xiqqaa (qajeelcha)\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155182				0	om	\<variable id=\"text_capital\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/text_capital.xhp\" name=\"Changing the Case of Text\"\>Guddiinaa fi Xinneenya Qubee Barruu jijjiiruu\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	par_id3155916				0	om	Guddiinaa fi xinneenya qubee barruu jijjiiruu, barruu qubxiqaa gugurdoodhaan dhangeessuu, filannoo keessaa tokkoon tokkoon jechootaatiif qubee jalqabaa gara qubee guguddaatti jijjiiruu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	par_idN10728				0	om	Yammuu barruu keetiif \<emph\>Dhangi'i - Arfii\</emph\> dhaan dhangeessuu fayyadamtuu, baruun akkuma sanatti tura, akkaataa kan birootiin qofa mul'ata. Karaa biraatiin ammoo, yammuu ati \<emph\>Dhangi'i - Qubee Xiqqaa fi Guddaa Jijjiirii\</emph\> filattu, barruun dhaabataan jijjiirama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155861				0	om	Barruu qubee guguddeessuuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	par_id3147420				0	om	Barruucha isa qubee guguddeessa gochuuf barbaadduu fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	par_id3149841				0	om	Kan armaan gadii keessaa tokko dalagi:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	par_id1120200910485778				0	om	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Change Case - Uppercase\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	par_id1120200910485775				0	om	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Character\</item\>, click the Font Effects tab, then select the type of capitalization in the Effects box. "Capitals" capitalizes all letters. "Title" capitalizes the first letter of each word. "Small capitals" capitalizes all letters, but in a reduced font size.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149644				0	om	Barruu gara qubee xixiqqaatti jijjiiruuf				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	par_id3149964				0	om	Barruu isa akka qubee xixiqqaatti jijjiiramuu barbaadduu fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	par_id3149606				0	om	Kan armaan gadii keessaa tokko dalagi:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	par_id112020091049000				0	om	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Change Case - Lowercase\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	par_id1120200910490034				0	om	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Character\</item\>, click the Font Effects tab, then select "Lowercase" in the Effects box.				20200411 15:09:53
