helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3154246				0	om	Dirrooleen kan fayyadan daataa warra galmeetti jijjiiraman kan akka lakkoofsa guyyaa har'a or dimshaasha fuula galmee tokko kessatti argamuu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154262				0	om	Dirroolee muli'isuu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3150509				0	om	Dirrooleen maqaa dirreef qabiyyee dirree offkeessatti qabu. Qabiyyee dirree ykn maqaa dirree gidu dirree agarsiisamu jijjiirruuf \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03090000.xhp\" name=\"View - Fields\"\>\<emph\>Mul'annoo - Maqoota Dirree\</emph\>\</link\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3150536				0	om	To display or hide field highlighting in a document, choose \<emph\>View - Field Shadings\</emph\>. To permanently disable this feature, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - Appearance\</emph\>, and clear the check box in front of \<emph\>Field shadings\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3152885				0	om	To change the color of field shadings, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01012000.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] - Appearance\"\>\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>$[officename] - Appearance\</item\>\</link\>\</emph\>, locate the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Field shadings\</item\> option, and then select a different color in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Color setting\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153166				0	om	Amaloota Dirree				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3153180				0	om	Galmee irrati akaakuuwwan dirree gara caalaa, dirreewwan kuusdeetaa dabalatee, gatiiwwan jijjiiramaa kuusin agarsiisamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3155533				0	om	Dirree yammu cuqaastu, akaakuuwwan dirree kan kannan gadi gocha kana hojjoomuu:				20200411 15:09:53
