helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3154250				0	om	Gabatee tokko irratti man'ee kessatti kolachuuf bu'aa issa gabatee garagaratti agarsiisu nidandessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150508				0	om	Galmee barruu bani, gabatee tarjaaf taree hedduu qabaataan saagi, kana booda gabatee kabiroo man'ee tokko of keessaa qabuu saagi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150528				0	om	Gabatee guddaa wara man'ee hamma tokko qabaaten lakkoofsa galchi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3155532				0	om	Man'ee tokko wajjin gabatee irratti qaree ka'i, issa boda F2 dhibii.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3155551				0	om	\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Foormuulaa Kabalaa\</item\>, faankishinii hojjechuu barbaadde galchi fakkeenyaaf, \<item type=\"literal\"\>=SUM\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3155577				0	om	Man'ee gabatee guddaa keessaa isa lakkoofsa of keessaa qabu cuqaasitii, mallattoo idaatii (+) dhiibi, kana booda man'ee adda addaa lakkoofsa of keessaa qaban keessa cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3155598				0	om	\<emph\>Galchi\</emph\> Dhibii.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3147776				0	om	Yoo barbaadde, gabatichii akka barruu baratamootti dhangeessuu nidandeessa. Gabaticha goodayyaa keessatti saagitii, kana booda goodayyaa akka arfii tokkootti korkoddi. Goodayyaan, yammuu ati barruu saagdu ykn haqtuu, barruu cinaatti akka korkoddaa'eetti taa'a.				20200411 15:09:53
