helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3153176				0	om	Akkasumaas saajoo\<emph\>Miiljalee Kallattiin Saaguu\</emph\> kan kamshaala \<emph\>Saagi\</emph\> irra jiruu cuqaasuun miiljalee saaguu dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155543				0	om	Miiljalee ykn ibsa dabalataa Gulaaluu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150167				0	om	Yommuu galmeekee keessatti korkoddii miiljalee fi ibsa dabalataa lamqiqqindessitu akeektuun hantuutee gara harkaatti jijjiramti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3155563				0	om	miiljalee ykn ibsa dabalataa Gulaaluuf,yadannoo keessa cuqaasi, ykn korkoddii yadannoof barruu keessa cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3145029				0	om	To change the format of a footnote, click in the footnote, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+T\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>F11\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> to open the Styles and Formatting window, right-click "Footnote" in the list, and then choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3145062				0	om	Barruucha keessaa, barruu miiljalee ykn ibsa dabalataa irraa gara korkoddii yadannootti utaaluuf, dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3145081				0	om	Amaloota lakkaawwii korkooddii miiljalee ykn ibsa dabalataa gulaaluuf, fuldura korkoodditti cuqaasii, \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02150000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Footnote\"\>\<emph\>Gulaaluu - Miiljalee/Ibsadabalataa\</emph\>\</link\> fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147776				0	om	Dhangiiwwan warra $[officename]n miiljaleewwan fi ibsoota dabalataatiif fayyadamu jijjiiruuf, \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/06080000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Footnotes\"\>\<emph\>Meeshaalee - Miljaleewwan/Ibsadabalataa\</emph\>\</link\> filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147813				0	om	Miiljaleewwan fi ibsoota dabalataatiif amaloota bal'ina barruu gulaaluudhaaf,  \<emph\>Dhandi'i - Fuula\</emph\> filadhu, kana booda caancala \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05040600.xhp\" name=\"Footnote\"\>\<emph\>Miiljalee\</emph\>\</link\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147232				0	om	Miiljaalee haquuf, korkooddii miiljalee barruu keessaa haqi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	tit				0	om	Galmeewwan Barruutiif, Xumuura Jechaa Sakatta'uu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148882				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>qindeessuu;xumura jechaa\</bookmark_value\>     \<bookmark_value\>xumura jechaa;qindeessuu\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>galmeewwan barruu;xumura jechaa\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>torban guyyaa; ofumaan xumuruu\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>ji'oota; ofumaan xumuruu\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	hd_id4745017				0	om	\<variable id=\"word_completion_adjust\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/word_completion_adjust.xhp\"\>Fine-Tuning the Word Completion for Text Documents\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_id4814294				0	om	If you like it that $[officename] automatically completes the words that you frequently use, you can make further adjustments to refine that behavior. If you want, you can also save the current list of collected words so that it can be used in the next session.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_id2593462				0	om	To fine-tune the word completion choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools – AutoCorrect Options - Word Completion\</item\> and select any of the following options:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN107C6				0	om	To Insert an Additional Space Character				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B03				0	om	Select \<emph\>Append space\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B0E				0	om	The space character is appended after you type the first character of the next word after the auto-completed word. The space character is suppressed if the next character is a delimiter, such as a full stop or a new line character.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN107CC				0	om	To Define the Accept Key				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B20				0	om	Choose the key to accept the suggested word using the \<emph\>Accept with\</emph\> list box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D2				0	om	To Select the Minimum Number of Characters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B36				0	om	Use the \<emph\>Min. word length\</emph\> box to set the minimum number of characters a word must have to be collected into the list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D8				0	om	To Select the Scope of Collected Words				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B4C				0	om	Disable the option \<emph\>When closing a document, remove the words collected from it from the list\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B53				0	om	Now the list is also valid for other documents that you open. When you close the last %PRODUCTNAME document, the word list is deleted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B56				0	om	If you enable the checkbox, the list is only valid as long as the current document is open.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_id2634968				0	om	Tarreen jechaa tursa %PRODUCTNAME ammaatii ol akka jiraatu yoo barbaaddee, akka kutaa armaan gadii ibsametti, akka galmeetti olkaa'i.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN107DE				0	om	To Use the Word List for Further Sessions				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B94				0	om	If the automatic spellcheck option is enabled, only the words that are recognized by the spellcheck are collected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10BA1				0	om	Use the word list to always start with a defined set of technical terms for the word completion feature.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10BA7				0	om	Open the text document that contains the terms that you want to use for word completion.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10BAB				0	om	The word completion feature collects the words.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN107ED				0	om	Select all or some of the words in the list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN107F4				0	om	Use \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+C to copy all selected words into the clipboard. Paste the clipboard into a new document and save it to get a reference list of collected words.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10BC6				0	om	Later you can open the reference list and automatically collect the words, so that the word completion feature starts with a defined set of words.				20200411 15:09:53
