helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3147110				0	om	Naannoo \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Durtii\</item\> keessaa, sajoo \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Handaarota Gubbaa fi Jalaa Sirreessi qofa\</item\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
