helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10711				0	om	Tarree lakkoofsiifaman ykn rasaaseefaman keessatti yammuu Galchii gad dhiibduu, \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> ofumaan keewwata itti aanuuf lakkoofsa lata. Keewwata haaraa kan irraa, lakkaawwii yk rasaasa hquuf, Galchii deebisii gad dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
