helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153417				0	om	To change the text that appears in the index, type the text that you want in the \<emph\>Entry\</emph\> box. The text that you type here does not replace the selected text in the document.				20200411 15:09:53
