helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147132				0	om	Gabatee qabiyeewwanii uumuuf karaa filatamaan akkaataalee keewwata mataduree durmurtaawoo, kan akka "Mataduree 1", gara keewwatawwan gabatee qabiyyeewwanii keessatti qabachuu barbaadde irratti fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
