helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150964				0	om	Akkaataa keewwata gabatee qabiyyeewwanii kee keessatti dabaluu barbaaddu kan \<emph\>Akkaataa Keewwata\</emph\> keessa jiru fili.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150523				0	om	Tarree \<emph\>Sadarkaa\</emph\> keessaa, sadarkaa sadarkaawa akkaataa keewwataa itti hojjachuu barbaaddu cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
