helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797				0	om	Barreessaa keessatti, naannoo wantoota OLE, itti suuqii, safakawwan/taattootaa, saxaatoo, fi goodayyaawwanii handaaraa qindeessu nidandessa. Maqaan baafataa fayyadamatu wantaa filatame irratti hundaa'a. 				20200411 15:09:53
