helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149578	4			0	om	Sajoo \<emph\>Handaara\</emph\> irratti kamshaa \<emph\>Wanta - OLE\</emph\> ykn kamshaa \<emph\>Goodayya\</emph\> foddaa banuuf \<emph\>Handaarotaa\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3159176				0	om	Akkaataa handaara durmurtaawaa tokko cuqaasi. Kun akkaataa handaara wanta ammee 				20200411 15:09:53
