helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797				0	om	Naannoo \<emph\>Hiika Fayyadamaa\</emph\> irratti teessuma waliinii qarqaraawwan warra akka mul'atu barbaaddu fili. Filannoon qarqaraa akka ceetuuf durargii qarqaraa keessa cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3152933				0	om	Select a line style and color for the selected border style in the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> area. These settings apply to all border lines that are included in the selected border style.				20200411 15:09:53
