helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130004.xhp	0	help	par_id3149501				0	om	Iddoo kanatti, Akkaataa Lakkaawwii tokko uumuu nidandeessa. Akkaataa Lakkaawwii kan qinda'aan, foddaa \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05140000.xhp\" name=\"Styles and Formatting\"\>Akkaataawwan fi Dhangeessuu\</link\> keessatti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130004.xhp	0	help	par_id3151390				0	om	Yammuu Akkaataan Lakkaawwii tokko uumamu, maqaan lakkaawwiitti ramadama. Kanaafituu, qajojiileen kana fakkaataan lakkaawwii "Moggaasa" kanaan waamamu. Lakkaawwiin hinmoggafamne, warri \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#formatierung\" name=\"direct formatting\"\>dhangeessuu sirriif\</link\> fayyadan, kan qaaqa yk sajoowwan \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06050000.xhp\" name=\"Numbering/bullets\"\>Rasasaa fi lakkaawwii\</link\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/main0206.xhp\" name=\"object bar\"\>kabala wanta\</link\> keessatti uumamuu danda'a.				20200411 15:09:53
