helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3153669				0	om	Galmee isa dirreewwan akka galmee HTML tokkotti qabatu yammuu olkeesu, $[officename]n adu'u, yeroo fi dirreewwan, OduGalmee gara iyyaatoowwan HTML itti, ufmaan garagalcha. Qabeentaawwan dirrichaa, banamuuf cufamuu iyyaatoowwan HTML kan dirreewwan gargalan sanaa gidduutti saagamu. Iyyaatoowwan HTML adda tahan kun iyyaatoowwan HTML wara waaltawaa tahaniin walitti hindhufu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3152960				0	om	Dirreewwan barreessaa $[officename] iyyaatoo <SDFIELD> galmee HTML tokko keessaatiin addeefamu. Akaakuu dirree, dhangii, fi maqaan dirree addaa sun iyyaatoo banamuu HTML sanaa keessatti hamatamoodha. Dhangiin iyyaatoo dirree, gingilchaa HTML tokkootiin hubatamu, akaakuu dirrichaa irratti hundaa'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154570				0	om	Dirreewwan Adu'u fi Yeroo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3149696				0	om	Dirreewwan "Adu'u" fi "Yeroo"tiif, ulaagaan TYPE, DATETIME waliin qixxeedha. Dhangiin adu'u yk kan yeroo ulaagaa SDNUM tiin himama. Fakkeenyaaf, kan adu'u GG:JJ:WW, kan yeroo ammoo HH:MM:SS ta'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3155183				0	om	Dirreewwan, kan adu'u fi yeroo dhaabatoo, adu'un yk yeroon isaanii ulaagaa SDVAL tiin himamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3149485				0	om	Fakkeenyii adu'u fi yeroo iyyaatoowwan HTML addayaa akka dirreewwantti isa $[officename] dhaan hamatame gabatee kanaan gadii irratti mul'atu:				20200411 15:09:53
