helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120227.xhp	0	help	par_id3147175				0	om	Galfatoota moorquusaa jiran tarreessa. \<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Galfata sarara Caasaatti dabaaluudhaaf, galfaticha cuqaasiitii, sarara Caasaa irraa sanduqa duwwaa keessa cuqaasi, kana booda \<emph\>Saagi\</emph\> cuqaasi.\</ahelp\> Galfatoota haaraa idaa'uuf, qaaqa \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120229.xhp\" name=\"Define Bibliography Entry\"\>Galfata Moorquusaa Ibsi\</link\> fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
