helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153527				0	om	Galfata				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151312				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_ENTRY\"\>Barruu isa galmee keessaa filatame agarsiissa. Yoo barbaade, galfata kasaaf jecha addaa adda galchu nidandeessa. Galmee keessaa barruun filatame hinjijjiiramu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154480				0	om	Furtuu 1ffaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152953				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_PRIM_KEY\"\>Filannoo ammaa isa ati bakka kanatti galchite, akka galfata xixiqqaa jechichaa godha. Fakkeenyaaf, akka furtuu 1ffaatti yoo "qorraa" filattee, "akkaataa qilleensaa" galchiitte, galfati kasaa "akkaataa qilleensaa, qorraa" taha.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154572				0	om	Furtuu 2ffaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155904				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_SEC_KEY\"\>Filannoo ammaa galfatoota xixiqqaa kan furtuu 1ffaa taasiisa. Fakkeenyaaf, akka furtuu 1ffaatti yoo "qorraa" "ganna" akka furtuu 2ffaatti filattee, galfati kasaa "akkaataa qilleensaa, ganna, qorraa" taha.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155174				0	om	Dubbisa qooqessii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149484				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_PHONETIC_READING\"\>Galfatoota walfakkiidhaaf, dubbisa qooqessii galchi. Fakkeenyaaf, Yoo jechii Jaapaanii Kaanjii akkaataa afaaneffannoo tokko ol qabaatee, jecha afaaneffannoo akka Katakanaa galchi. Jechi Kaanjii jedhamuu, akkaataa dubbisa qooqessii galfataati foo'ama.\</ahelp\> Dirqalii kun kan jiraatu, yoo gargaarsii Afaan Eeshiyaan angeefame qofa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143284				0	om	Galfata guddaaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151248				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_MAIN_ENTRY\"\>Barruu filatame galfata guuddaa kasaa aabaa keessaa taasiisa.\</ahelp\> $[officename] lakkoofsa fuulaa kan galfata guuddaa dhangii adda addaa keessaa irra caalaa, kan galfatoota ka biroo kasaa keessaa agarsiisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149821				0	om	Sadarkaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147098				0	om	Galfatoota dhangii keewwataa fayyadamuudhaan, "Mataduree X" (X = 1-10) ofumaan qabeentaatti idaa'ama. Sadarkaa galfata keessaa, kasaa sadarkaa tooriiti, kan haalata matadureetti walitti dhufaniiti.\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_LEVEL\"/\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149175				0	om	Dirqalii kun kan jiratuu galfatoota kasaa qabeentaa fi hiika-fayyadamaatiif qofa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156278				0	om	Barruuwwan walfakkatoo maraaf fayyadami				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145783				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_APPLY_ALL\"\>Ofumaan, taateewwan ka biroo mara, galmicha keessaa barruu filataman mallatteessa. Barruun, irraantoowwanii, miiljaleewwanii, goodayyaawwanii, qabiiwwanii keessaa, hin hammatamaani.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155920	21			0	om	Qaaqa kan keessatti, dalaga \<emph\>Galfata \</emph\> dhaaf hujeekaan galchitee fayyadamuu hindandeessu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147496	18			0	om	Taateewwan kan dabartii barruu tokko kasicha keessaa hundaa itti dabaaluudhaaf, barricha filiitii, \<emph\> Gulaali - Barbaadi fi Bakkabuusi\</emph\> filadhu, kana booda \<emph\>Mara Barbaadi\</emph\> irra cuqaasi. Eegasii \<emph\>Saagi - Kasaalaa fi Gabateewwan - Galfata\</emph\> filachuun \<emph\>Saagi\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
