helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145420				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:COMBOBOX:TP_INSERT_SECTION:ED_RNAME\"\>Kutaa haaraa kanaaf maqaa tokko barreessi.\</ahelp\> Durtiin, $[officename] ufmaan maqaa "Kutaa X" jedhu kutaalee haaraatti ramada, (yammuu Xn lakkoofsa tartiibaan walitti aanan jechuu ta'u).				20200411 15:09:53
