helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151310	27			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:MD_EDIT_REGION:CB_DDE\"\>Geessituu \<emph\>DDE \</emph\>tokko uuma. Saanduqa filaannoo kana erga filattee booda, \<emph\>DDE \</emph\>ajaja fayyadamuu barbaaddu saagi. filaannoon \<emph\>DDE\</emph\> kun kan jiraatus yoo saanduqii filaannoo \<emph\>Geessituu\</emph\> jedhu filatame qofa ta'a.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3143280				0	om	Caasimmi waliigalaa kan ajajii DDE tokkoo: "<Server> <Topic> <Item>" ta'a, yammuu kaadima/server jechuun maqaa DDE fayyadama isa deetaa sana qabatee; mataduree/Topic jechuun bakka Maalimichaa(irracaala maqaa faayilaa); akkasumaas Maalimaa/Item jechuun ammoo wanta qabatamaa jechuu bakka bu'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149098	35			0	om	Fakkeenyaaf, filaannoo "kutaa1" moggaafame tokko barruu galmee abc.sxw $[officename] irraa, geessituu DDEtti saaguuf, ajaja: "soffice x:\\abc.sxw Section1" jedhu fayyadami. Faayila wardii MS Ekseelii "abc.xls" jedhamu tokko keessaa qabiiyyee man'ee isa jalqabaa saaguuf, ajaja: "excel x:\\[abc.xls]Sheet1 z1s1" jedhu faayadami. Akkasumaas, miiltoowwan  saaguu barbaaddu, akka geessituu DDEtti gargalchuun booda, \<emph\>Gulaalii - Maxxansa Addaa\</emph\>rawwaachuu nidandeessa. Kana booda, qabiiyyee keessaa \<emph\>Gulaalii - Dirreewwan\</emph\> filatte ajaja DDE san dawwaachuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153640	28			0	om	Maqaa faayilii\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\> / Ajaja DDE \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145754	29			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:MD_EDIT_REGION:ED_FILE\"\>Faayilii wara saagu barbaadduuf, maqaa faayiliif xuree saagi ykn bakka qubsuma faayilii agarsiisuuf \<emph\>...\</emph\> qabduu sakattaa,ii cuqaasi. \</ahelp\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\>Yoo sanduuqii filannoo \<emph\>DDE \</emph\>filataame, ajaja DDE isa fayyadamuu barbaaddu saagi. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
