helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06180000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150995				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_LINENUMBERING:CB_COUNT_FRAMELINES\"\>Barruutti lakkoofsawwan sarara goodayyaawwan barruu keessaatti ida'a. Lakkaawwiin, tokkoon tokkoon goodayyaa barruu keessaatti lamkaa'a. Lakkaawumsa sarara, bal'ina barruu guddaa keessaa kan galmichaa irraa qoqqobamaadha.\</ahelp\> \<link href=\"text/swriter/02/03210000.xhp\" name=\"linked frames\"\>goodayyaawwan koronyate\</link\> keessatti, lakkaawwiin lamu hinka'u.				20200411 15:09:53
