helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147172				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_ENV_ENV\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Batergaaf teessoolee kennaaf deebii saagi. Kuusadeetaa irraa dirreewwan teessoo saaguu ni dandeessa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
