helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157875				0	om	To enable this feature, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Writer - Formatting Aids\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</link\>\</emph\>, and ensure that the \<emph\>Hidden paragraphs\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Display of\</emph\> area is selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154501				0	om	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"field command\"\>ajaja dirree\</link\> "Keewwata Dhokata" fayyadamtee, \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"condition\"\>haala\</link\> keewwata tokko dhoksuuf barbaachisu ramaduu ni dandeesa. Yoo haali kun hinmijaayin hafe, keewwatichatu mul'ata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3083451				0	om	Yammuu keewwata tokko dhoksitu, miiljalootaaf goodayyaalee arfiiwwantti korkodaamanis ni dhokatu.				20200411 15:09:53
