helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149844				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCRL_NAVI\"\>If you click this icon, a toolbar will appear which enables you to choose among the existing targets within a document.\</ahelp\> You can then use the up and down arrow icons to position the text cursor in the document on the previous or next target.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153293				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCRL_PAGEUP\"\>Gara fuula yk wantaa  duraanitti maruuf qabduu olii cuqaasi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156098				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCRL_PAGEDOWN\"\>Gara fuula yk wantaa  duraanitti maruuf qabduu gadii cuqaasi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155076				0	om	Duraantoon, galfata kabiirroo hamma ati hinfilaaneetti, qabduuleen xiyyaa gara fuulaa durraanii yk itti aanuu galmee keessatti utaala. Fuuloota keessaa yammuu sakattaatuu, qabduuleen xiyyaa gurraacha ta'a, wantaa kabiirrootti yammuu utaaltuu immoo cuquliisa ta'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154330				0	om	Galiinsii sanduuqa filannoo wara \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Naanna'aa\</link\> keessaatiin hedduu walgita. Ga'umsa utaaluu kabiroo filachuu nidandeessa. Fakkeenyi yaadachiisaa kanaa, wara naanna'aa sajoo  \<emph\>Yaadachiisaa Qindeessi\</emph\> keessaa wajjin qinda'aan filachuu nidandeessa. Kamshaa \<emph\>Naanna'insaa\</emph\> irraa filannoota wanta akka: gabatee, godaayyaa barruu, saxaatoo, wanta OLE, fuula, mataduree, yaadachiisaa, miseensota fakkasa, diree too,annaa, kutaalee, toorbarruu, filannoo, miiljalee, yaadannoo, galfata kasaa, foormulaa(unkulaa) gabatee, foormulaa(unkulaa) gabatee dogoggoraa filachuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148783				0	om	Formulaawwan(unkulaawwan) gabateef, gara formulaawwan gabatee mara galmee keessatti qubattani ykn gara dogoggoraa ta'aan qofatti utaaluu nidandeessa. Formulaawwan dogoggoraaf, formulaawwan wara dogoggoraa uumanii qofatti utaalta. Sagantaan formulaawwan wara dogoggoraa uumani dhiisa (formulaawwan dogoggoraa wabii ta'aan).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150031				0	om	Kamshaa Naanna'insa Waliin Hojeechu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150045				0	om	Kabala marfataa sarjaa keessatti qubattani sajoo isaa irra cuqaasuun, kamshaa \<emph\>Naanna'insa\</emph\> bani.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153141				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVI_VS\"\>Akaakuu wantaalee wara keessa sakattaa'uu barbaaddu sajoo issa cuqaasi. kana bodda qabdoota xiyya "Wanta Durraanii" ykn "Wanta Itti aanuu" tokkoon saani cuqaasi. Maqaawwanii xiyyoota kanaa Akaakuu wanta filattee eera. Qareen barruu wanta filatte irra ta'uu nidanda'a.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149968				0	om	You can configure $[officename] according to your specific preferences for navigating within a document. To do this, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06140000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Customize\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Customize\</emph\>\</link\>. The various tables for adapting \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06140100.xhp\" name=\"menus\"\>menus\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06140200.xhp\" name=\"keyboard input\"\>keyboard input\</link\> or toolbars contain various functions for navigation within the document under the "Navigate" area. In this way you can jump to the index tags in the document with the "To Next/Previous Index Tag" functions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110100.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155338				0	om	\<bookmark_value\>barbaachaa; barbaachuti irradeebiitti\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155338				0	om	Barbaadi Irra deebi'i				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155361				0	om	Sajoo \<emph\>Barbaadi irradeebi'i\</emph\> waliin kamshaa \<emph\>Naanna'insa\</emph\> irraa barbaachaa eegaltte qaaqa \<emph\>Barbaadi fi Irradeebi'i\</emph\> dhan irradeebi'u nidandeessa. kana gochuuf, sajoocha cuqaasi. Qabduulee xiyyaa cuquliisii issa kabala marfataa sarjaa irra jiru ammaa dalaga \<emph\>Barbaacha fuulduratti itti fufi\</emph\> and \<emph\>Barbaacha duubaatti itti fufi\</emph\> fudhachu jalqaba. Yoo amma diriirtoo xiyyaa tokko cuqaastee, barbaachii jecha qaaqa Barbaadi fi Bakkabuusi saagameef itti fufa				20200411 15:09:53
