helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3154471				0	om	Galmee kee keessatti, kuusadeetaa feetee irraa dirreewwwan saaguu nidandeessa, fakkeenyaaf, dirreewwwan teessoota.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id090220080439090				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Akaakuwwan dirree jiran tarreessi. Galmee keeetti dirree dabaluuf, akaakuu dirree cuqaasi, dirree tokko tarree \<emph\>Fili\</emph\> keessaa cuqaasi, kana booda \<emph\>Saagi\</emph\> cuqaasi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3154196				0	om	Akaakuu dirree				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3149484				0	om	Hika				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3149096				0	om	Kuusaa kamuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3151257				0	om	Qabeentoota kan dirree kuusadeetaa inni ati sanduuqa \<emph\>Lakkoofsa Kuusaa\</emph\> keessatti, akka dirree makiinsa ergannootti ifteessite, yoo \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"Condition\"\>\<emph\>Haala\</emph\>\</link\> inni ati galchite milkaa'e, saaga.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3147100				0	om	Kuusaawwan heddu galmee tokko keessatti saaguuf, dirree kana fayyadamuu nidandeessa. Salphatti, dirreewwan unka xalayyaa, wara kuusaa tahe tokko fayyadaman, fulduratti dirree \<emph\>Kuusaa Kamiyyuu\</emph\>jedhu saagi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3153632				0	om	Maqaa Kuusadeetaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3152776	9			0	om	Maqaa gabatee kuusadeetaa filatamee, sanduuqa \<emph\>Filannoo kuusadeetaa \</emph\> keessatti saaga. Dirreen "Maqaa Kuusadeetaa" dirree xurbeetti. kuniisi, yoo maqaa kuusadeetaa addaa adda galmee kee keessatti saagdee, qabeentootii dirreewwan "Maqaa Dirree" duraan saagamaan mari niharoomu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3149167				0	om	Dirree makiinsa ergannoo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3145779				0	om	Akka ati galmee makiinsa ergannoo tokko uumuu dandeessuuf, maqaa dirree kuusadeetaa tokko akka iddooqa tokkootti saaga. Yammuu ati unka xalayyaa maxxansiituu, qabeentaan dirree ufmaan saagama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3151372				0	om	Kuusa Ittaanuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3150114				0	om	Yoo haalii ati murteessitee milkaa'e, qabeentoota dirree makiinsa ergannoo isa itti aanuu galmee kee keessatti saaga. Kaasichi ati akka dabalamu barbaaddu, mul'anno madda deetaa keessaa filatamuu qaba.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3155861				0	om	Dirricha "Rikoordii ittaanaa" jedhu, qabeentaawwan rikoordii tartiibaan jiranii, warra dirreewwan makiinsa ergannoo galmee keessaa gidduutti saaguuf, fayyadamuu ni dandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3147412				0	om	Lakkoofsa kasaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3147495				0	om	Lakkoofsa kan rikordii kuusadeetaa filatame saaga.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149565				0	om	Filmaata Kuusa Deetaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3145268				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DB_SELECTION_TLB\"\>Gabatee kuusadeetaa ykn gaafata kuusadeetaa, isa akka dirrichi wabeefatu barbaaddu, filadhu.\</ahelp\> Dirreewwan kuusadeetaa yk gafata tokko ol irra, galmee keessatti dabaluu nidandeessa. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id0902200804391084				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Dirreewwan haala wayiitti hidhata qabaniif, ulaagaalee asitti galchi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3147739				0	om	Yoo barbaade, qabeentaawwan dirreewwan "Rikoordii Kamiyyuu" fi "Rikoordii Ittaanaa" jedhamanii saagamuu isaaniin dura, haala mirkana'uu qabu tokko ramaduu nidandeessa.Haalli durtii, yoo barruun haalaa sun hinjijjiiramu ta'ef, "Dhugaa", kunis haalichi yeroo hundaayyuuu dhugaadha jechuu taha.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146336				0	om	Lakkoofsa kasaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3149836				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:TP_FLD_DB:ED_DBSETNUMBER\"\>Lakkofsa rikoordii, isa yeroo haalli ati ifteessite galma gahu, saaguu barbaaddu galchi.\</ahelp\> Lakkoofsi rikoordii kun filannoo ammaa isa mul'annoo madda deetaa keessaatti akeekama. Fakkeenyaaf, rikordiiwwan dhuma irra jiran 5, kuusadeetaa rikoordii 10 qabate tokko keessaa yoo filatte,  rikoordii isa jalqabaatiif lakkoofsi isaa 1 taha, malee 6 hintahu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3153305				0	om	Dirreewwan, kuusadeetaa addaa keessaa (yk ammoo,gabatee yk gaafata addaa kuusadeetaa sanuma irra jiran keessaa) yoo waabeffatte, $[officename]n lakkoofsa rikoordii kallattii filannoo ammaatiin jiru addeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156109				0	om	Dhangii				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3156122				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Dhangii kan dirree isa saaguuf barbaadduu filadhu. Dirqalaan kun, dirreewwan lakkaawwii, buuliyaanii, adu'u(gaaf) fi yeroo tiif jiraata.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150904				0	om	Kuusdeetaa irraa				20200411 15:09:53
