helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_idN1076E				0	om	Browse				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_idN10772				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"878711313\"\>Bakka faayilii kuusadeetaa (*.odb) tokko itti filachu dandeessuu, qaaqa faayiliin tokko banaadha jedhu bana. Faayilichi filatamaa tarree Filannoo Kuusdeetaatti ida'ama.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
