helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156316				0	om	Tarree raasaaseefame tokko uumuudhaaf, jalqaba keewwatatti iddoo tokkoon yk caancala walitti aananii, murfi (-) tokko, urjii (*), yk mallattoo idaatii (+) barreessii.				20200411 15:09:53
