helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3153810				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_TOX_SELECT_CB_COLLECTSAME\"\>Galmee keessatti galfataalee kasaa walfakkaatoo, galfata baaqee, isa lakkofsaalee fuula galfatni irratti argamu tarreessuun bakka buusa. Fakkeenyaaf, galfataaleen "10 dawaadhu, 43 daawadhu" jedhan akka "10, 43 daawadhu" jedhanitti wal-qabsiifamu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
