helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3083451				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_TOX_SELECT_CB_USEFF\"\>Galfataalee kasaa walfakkaatoo warra fuula tokkicha irratti, yk fuula walitti aanan irratti argaman, galfata baaqee, isa lakkoofsa fuulichaa keessatti galfata yeroo jalqabatiif argamu "p" yk "pp" jedhee tarreessuun bakka buusa. Fakkeenyaaf, galfataaleen "View 10, View 11, View 12" jedhan akka "View 10pp", fi "View 10, View 11"ammo akka "View 10p" jedhanitti wal-qabsiifamu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
