helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3145825				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_TOX_SELECT_CB_USE_DASH\"\>Galfataalee kasaa walfakkaatoo warra fuula walitti aanan irratti argaman, galfata baaqee fi hangii lakkoofsaa galfatni irratti argamu ittiin bakka buusa. Fakkeenyaaf, galfataaleen  jedhan akka "10 dawadhu, 11 daawadhu, 12 daawadhu" akka "10-12 dawadhu" jedhanitti wal-qabsiifamu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154502				0	om	Qub-suukanaawaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3149880				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_TOX_SELECT_CB_CASESENSITIVE\"\>Galfataalee kasaa walfakkatoo keessatti, qubeewwan guguddaa fi xixiqqaa gidduu, adda adda baasa. Afaan Eeshiyaaa warra ta'aniif qabannaa addataatu hojjeta.\</ahelp\> Dhufaatiin yeroo jalqabaa kan galfata galmee keessaa guddina fi xiqqina qube akka murteessu yoo barbaade, \<emph\>Galfatoota walfakkaatoo wal-qabsiisi\</emph\>filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_idN10671				0	om	Foyyadeenya sadarkaawwan adda addaa afaan Eeshiyaatiif yoo fayyadamuu barbaade, \<emph\>Qub-suukanaawaa\</emph\>filadhu. Foyyadeenya sadarkaawwan adda addaa sana keessatti, guddinaa fi xiqqinni akkasumas gubjaltootni galfatoota tuffatamanii, unkaalee dakoo galfatootaa qofatu walitti madaalama. Yoo unkaaleen isaanii walfakkaatoo tahan, gubjaltoota isaantu walitti madaalama. Yoo ammaalee unkaaleen isaanii walfakkaatoo tahan, guddinaa fi xiqqina qubee, yabbina arfiiwwan  akkasumas addaddummaa Japanese Kana isaan gidduutu madalama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150569				0	om	Galfatoota OfiinQubguddaaassa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3148772				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_TOX_SELECT_CB_INITIALCAPS\"\>Jalqaba qubee galfata kasaa ofiin qubguddaaassa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155986				0	om	Furtuulee akka galfatoota foo'ameetti				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3147170				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_TOX_SELECT_CB_KEYASENTRY\"\>Furtuulee kasaa akka galfatoota kasaa foo'ameetti saaga.\</ahelp\> Furtuun tokko akka sadarkaa gubbeetti, galfatootni furtichatti ramadamn ammoo akka galumsa galfatoota xiqqatti saagama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3151184				0	om	Furtuu kasaa qindeessuuf, qaaqa \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120100.xhp\" name=\"Insert Index Entry\"\>\<emph\>Galfata Kasaa Saagi\</emph\>\</link\> filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154646				0	om	Faayilii walta'iinsa				20200411 15:09:53
