helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3147530				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_TOX_SELECT_LB_SORTALG\"\>Yoo lakkoofsoota gatiidhaan, akka 1, 2, 12 keessatti fo'uu barbaadduu, lakkoofsaan kan jedhu filadhu. Yeroo lakkoofsoota lakkaddaa arfiiwwan, akka 1, 12, 2 keessatti fo'uu barbaaddu ammoo, katabbii fayyadami.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
