helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120229.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419				0	om	Maqaa gabaabbaa tokko galchiitii, akaakuu maddaa isa mijaawwaa filadhu. Amma deetaa galfataaf dirreewwan kan isaa tahe irraa galchuu nidandeessa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120229.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154097				0	om	Maqaa gabaabaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120229.xhp	0	help	par_id3145582				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AUTH_FIELD_IDENTIFIER\"\>Galfata moorquusaatiif maqaa gabaabbaa agarsiissa. Yoo galfata moorquusaa haaraa uumaa jiraate qofa, bakka kanatti maqaa tokko galchuu nidandeessa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120229.xhp	0	help	par_id3153527				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AUTH_FIELD_CUSTOM4\"\>Bakkii kun, iddoo itti deetaa galfataa moorquusa keetiif filatuudha.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
