helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	par_id3156058				0	om	Goodayyaawwanii mudatawwan tahaan dalagaa tokkotti akka siif walqabsiiftuuf hayyamu, kuniis akka mudatichii Barreessaa $[officename]n ykn dalagaan eeggamu murteessa. Oddeefaannoo itti dabaalataatiif Gargaarsa Bu'uraa $[officename] daawwadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
