helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771				0	om	Goodayyaa yk wanta filatame tokko siqsuudhaaf, furtuu xiyya dhiibi. Pikselii tokkoon siqsuuf, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> gad dhiibitii, kana booda furtuu xiyyichaa dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150762				0	om	Goodayyaa yk wanta filatame tokko siqsuudhaaf, jalqaba Ctrl+Tab dhiibi. Yammuu kana qabannoo keessaa tokko akka filatame mul'isuuf liphata. Qabannoo kabiiroo filachuudhaaf, Ctrl+Tab dabalii dhiibi. Wanta kutaa tarsaa tokkoon hagamtaa jijjiiruudhaaf, furtuu xiyyaa dhiibi. Pikselii tokkoon hagamtaa jijjiiruudhaaf, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Dirqala \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>gad dhiibitii, kana booda furtuu xiyyichaa dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149294				0	om	The increment by which you move an object with the keyboard is determined by the document grid. To change the properties of the document grid, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01050100.xhp\" name=\"Text document - Grid\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Grid\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
