helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EF				0	om	Foddaa Akkaataa fi Dhangeessuu \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#andocken\" name=\"dock\"\>hidhuudhaaf\</link\>, kabala mataduree isaa moggaa bitaa yk moggaa mirga iddoo hojiitti harkisi. Foddaa kaafachuuf, kamshaa isaairra iddoo duwwaa tokko lama cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
