helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AA6				0	om	Durtiin, dirqalii \<emph\>Follow text flow\</emph\> kan filatamee, yammuu galmee tokko isa fooyya'aa %PRODUCTNAME kun %PRODUCTNAME %PRODUCTVERSION caalaa moofaadha, keessatti uumame bantuudha. Haa tahu malee, dirqalii kun yammuu galmee tokko uumtu, yk yamuu galmee tokko dhangii Maykirosoft Woordiin (*.doc) bantu hinfilatamu.				20200411 15:09:53
