helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149123				0	om	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090003.xhp\" name=\"Functions\"\>Dalagalee\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3150343				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_EDIT_TP_FLD_FUNC_ED_FUNCVALUE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Dirreewwaniif ulaagaalee dalaga dabalataa qindeessa. Akaakuun ulaagaa Akaakuu dirree atti filattee irratti hundaa'a.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3151242				0	om	Akaakuu dirree isa atti filattee irratti hundaa'uun, dalagalee tahaniif haalataa ramaduu nidandeessa. Fakkeenyaaf, yammuu galmee keessaa dirricha cuqaastuu, dirree isa maakroo tokko raawwattuu, yk haalaa isa milka'ee, dirricha isa dhoksuu, qindeessuu nidandeessa. Akkasumaas, galmee kee keessatti yammuu barbaachiissu, dirreewwan iddooqa isa saxaatoo, gabateewwan, goodayyaaf wantoota ka birroo isa saaguu sidandeessiissu qindeessu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id0902200804352037				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Akaakuwwan dirree jiran tarreessi. Galmee keeetti dirree dabaluuf, akaakuu dirree cuqaasi, dirree tokko tarree \<emph\>Fili\</emph\> keessaa cuqaasi, kana booda \<emph\>Saagi\</emph\> cuqaasi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3150537				0	om	Akaakuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3155623				0	om	Hika				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3152999				0	om	Barruu otoolaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3149881	6			0	om	Yoo \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"condition\"\>Haalii\</link\> hin oollee tokko milka'ee, barruu saaga. Fakkeenyaaf, sanduuqa \<emph\>Haala\</emph\> keessatti "sun 1 qixxee" dhaa galchiitii, kana booda, barruu isa yammuu gegeeddaraichii "sun" qixxee "1" sanduuqa \<emph\>Sanabooda \</emph\>keessatti yeroo haalii feetu siif milkaa'u, akkasumas sanduuqa \<emph\>Kanamalee\</emph\> keessatti haaliichi milkaa'u dhabu barruu isa mul'ifamu sanaa galchi. Gegeedaramaa "sun" qindeessuuf, caancalaa \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090005.xhp\" name=\"Variables\"\>\<emph\>Gegeedaramaawwan\</emph\>\</link\> cuqaasiitii, sanduuqa \<emph\> Maqaa\</emph\> keessaa "Gegeedaramaa Qindeessii", Akaakuu "sun" akkasumaas gatiissa sanduuqa\<emph\> Gatii\</emph\> keessaa filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3153719				0	om	Tarree naqaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147564				0	om	Tarree tokko irraa, isa maalimaa tokko mul'isu, dirree barruu tokko saaga. Tarree keessatti dirree barruuchaa; idaa'uu, gulaaluu, wantoota haquu, itti dabalataaniis, tartiiba saani jijjiirruu nidandeessa. Dirree galmee kee keessaa \<emph\>Tarree Naqaa\</emph\> cuqaasi yk Ctrl+Shift+F9 dhiibuun qaaqa \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090003.xhp\" name=\"Choose Item\"\>\<emph\>Maalimaa Filadhu\</emph\>\</link\> agarssisi. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3153146				0	om	Dirree naqaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3149287				0	om	Dirree barruu isa ati \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090100.xhp\" name=\"clicking\"\>cuqaasuun\</link\> gargaaramuudhaan galmee keessatti banuu dandeessu saaga.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3154691				0	om	Maakroo raawwadhu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147515	10			0	om	Dirree isa galmee keessaa yammuu cuqaastu, dirree barruu isa maakroo dammaqsu saaga. Dirreetti maakroo tokko ramaduuf, qabduu \<emph\>Maakroo\</emph\> cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3152946				0	om	Iddooqa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3153527				0	om	Fakkeenyaaf, saxaatoodhaaf, galmee keessatti dirree iddooqaa saaga. Galmee keessaa dirree iddooqa yammuu cuqaastu, wantaa isa bade sana akka saagdu karraa siif saaqa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3150973				0	om	Barruu dhokataa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147524				0	om	Inserts a text field that is hidden when the condition that you specify is met. To use this function, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Text Document - Formatting Aids\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</link\>\</emph\> and clear the \<emph\>Fields: Hidden text\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3154480				0	om	Keewwatoota hokataa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3153677				0	om	Hides a paragraph when the condition that you specify is met. To use this function, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Text Document - Formatting Aids\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</link\>\</emph\> and clear the \<emph\>Fields: Hidden paragraph\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3154192	39			0	om	Arfiiwwan maki				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3159199				0	om	Akka arfii tokkootti dalaguuf akka danda'aanitti, hanga arfiiwwan 6 tti waliitti camada. Amalii kun kan jiraatu, bocqubee Eeshiyaa yammuu degeeramaa ta'u qofa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id0902200804352213				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Dhangii dirree ati filatteef akka oolu barbaaddu cuqaasi, ykn dhangii maamiloo fayyadamuuf "Dhangiilee Dabalataa" cuqaasi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3151329				0	om	Dirreewwan dalagaatiif, dirreen dhangii dhangiiwwan Akaakuu iddooqaa qaban qofaaf fayyada. Asitti, dhangiichi wantaa isa iddooqaan bakka bu'uuf sana murteessa.				20200411 15:09:53
