helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3143281				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:TP_FLD_DB:ED_DBCONDITION\"\>Dirreewwan \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"condition\"\>Haala\</link\>tti koronyateef, bakka kanatti ulaagaalee galchi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151248				0	om	Sanabooda, Kanamalee				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3154830	21			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_EDIT_TP_FLD_FUNC_ED_FUNCCOND2\"\>Sanduuqa \<emph\>Sanabooda \</emph\>keessatti yeroo haalii feetu siif milkaa'u, akkasumaas sanduuqa \<emph\>Kanamalee\</emph\> keessatti haaliichi milkaa'u dhabu barruu isa mul'ifamu sanaa galchi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3146865	22			0	om	Saanduqoota \<emph\>Kanabooda \</emph\>fi \<emph\>Kanamalee \</emph\>keessatti dhangiicha "maqaakuusdeetaa.maqaagabatee.maqaadirree" fayyadamuudhaanis dirreewwan kuusdeetaa saaguu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147583				0	om	Yoo maqaan gabatichaa yk dirrichaa kuusdeetaa ta'e keessa hinjiraanne, homtuu hinsaagamu. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3152585				0	om	Yoo "maqaakuusdeetaa.maqaagabatee.maqaafaayilaa" keessaatii, waraabbii makte, himichi akka barruutti saagama.				20200411 15:09:53
