helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3155149	27			0	om	Barruu isa dirricha keessatti muli'suu barbaaddu barreeessi.Yoo dirre iddooqaa saaguuf deemte, yeroo qarree antuutee dirricha irra keessu, barruu isa akka qaccee gargaarsaatti muli'suuf barbaaddu barreessi.				20200411 15:09:53
