helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3145771				0	om	Arfiiwwan walitti camaduuf barbaaddu galchi. Baay'inni ati walitti camaduu dandeessu 6 caaluu hindanda'u. Dirqalli kun gosa dirree \<emph\>Arfiiwwan camadi\</emph\> qofaaf jiraata.				20200411 15:09:53
