helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3149494				0	om	Dirree naqaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3154829				0	om	Gegeedaramaa yk Dirree Fayyadammaa tokkoof gatii haaraa saaga.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3149098				0	om	Gatiin gegeedaramaa dirree Naqaa tokko bakka dirren itti saagamee kaasee gara fulduraatti qofa gatii qabaata. Yeroo birroo, galmee keessatti gatii gegeedaramaa jijjiiruuf, dirree Naqaa maqaan sanuuma, garuu gatiin adda tahe tokko saagi. Haa tahu malee, gatiin Dirree Fayyadammaa tokko haala xurgbee(Adunyaa mara) tiin jijjiirama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3151255				0	om	Gegeedaramaawwanii dirree \<emph\>Filannoo\</emph\> keessatti mul'atu. Yammuu qabduu \<emph\>Saagii\</emph\> cuqaastu, qaaqa \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090100.xhp\" name=\"Input Field\"\>\<emph\>Dirree Naqaa\</emph\>\</link\> jedhu, bakka ati gatii haaraa yk barruu dabalataa, akka shutamaatti, galchuu dandeessutu argama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3149034				0	om	Hangii lakkoofsaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3152772				0	om	Lakkaawwii ofumaa gabateewwan, saxaatoo, yk goodayyaawwan barruutiif saaga.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3147073				0	om	Gegeedaramaa fuulaa qindeessi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3154389				0	om	galmicha keessaa qixa wabii, bakka itti lakkaawumsa fuulaa debi'ee lamka'u saaga. Qixa wabii jiraachisuuf "Banaa", dhabamsiisuuf ammoo, "Dhaammaa" filadhu. Akkasuumas lakkaawumsa fuulaa lakkoofsa biraatti eegaluuf iddoodaa galchuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3156267				0	om	Gegeedaramaa fuulaa qindeessi				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3150588				0	om	Lakkoofsa fuulawwanii, qixa wabii "Gegeedaramaa fuulaa qindeessii" irraa gara dirree kanaatti agarsiisa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3145779				0	om	Dirree Fayyadamaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3151377				0	om	Gegeeddaramaa xurgbee maamiloo tokko saaga. Dirree Fayyadamaa, akka hima otoolaa tokkoof gegeeddaramaa murteessutti fayyadamuu dandeessa. Yeroo Dirree Fayyadamaa jijjiirtu, akka-fakkiin gegeeddaramticha martii galmee keessaa niharoomu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id0903200802243892				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Dhangii dirree ati filatteef akka oolu barbaaddu cuqaasi, ykn dhangii maamiloo fayyadamuuf "Dhangiilee Dabalataa" cuqaasi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3148886	25			0	om	Dirreewwan hiika-fayyadamaatiif dhangii maamiloo tokko murteessuuf, dhangii isa tarree \<emph\>Dhangi'i \</emph\> jedhu keessatti hojummeessuu barbaaddu cuqaasi, yk "Dhangiiwwan Dabaalataa" jedhu cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id0903200802243880				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Maqaa dirreee hiika-fayyadamaa ati uumuu feetuu barreessi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
