helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3888363				0	om	Filannoo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id7453535				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_FLD_DOK:LB_DOKSELECTION\"\>Dirree Akaakuu filatameef tarree \<emph\>Akaakuu \</emph\>jedhu keessatti dirreewwwan jiran tarreessa. Dirree tokko saaguuf, dirricha cuqaasi, dirree cuqaasiitii, itti ansiitti, \<emph\>Saagi\</emph\>cuqaasi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3326822				0	om	Atatattamman tarree irraa dirree tokko saaguudhaaf, \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Ajaja \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> dhiibitii, dirricha irra lama-cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3150696	36			0	om	Galmee HTML tokkoo keessatti, dirreewwan dabalataa lama, akaakuu dirree "Gegeedaramaa qindeessii": HTML_BANAA fi HTML_DHAAMAA jedhamaniif, ni jiraatu. Yeroo faayilichi, dirqalaa ati filatte irratti hundaa'uun, akka galmee HTML tokkootti ol-kaa'amu, barruun ati sanduuqa \<emph\>Gatiii \</emph\> keessatti barreessitu, gara banamuu iyyaatoo HTML \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#tags\" name=\"tag\"\>iyyaatoo\</link\> (<Value>) yk gara cufamuu iyyaatoo HTML (</Value>) itti jijjiirama.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3149555				0	om	Uttuu qabduu Ctrl gaddi dhibdee jirtu, yk gegeeddarama barbaaddu filattee, kabalaa iddoo dhibdee, galfaticha irra lama-cuqaastee, galfatichii akkumaa sanaan galmee kee keessatti saagama.				20200411 15:09:53
