helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145622				0	om	Galmee tokko irraa gara galmee ka birrootti akkaataalee garagalchuuf, qaaqa \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01110100.xhp\" name=\"Template Management\"\>\<emph\>Taliigaa Qajojii\</emph\>\</link\> fayyadammi.				20200411 15:09:53
