helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150529				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVI_TBX13\"\>Sajoo kana cuqaasitii, kana booda, foddaa Naanna'aa keessattti lakkoofsa sadarkaalee toorii mataduree akka mul'atuu barbaaddu filadhu.\</ahelp\> Akkasuumas, mataduree foddaa Naanna'aa keessa mirgaa cuqaasuun ajaja kana keessa seenuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
