helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145420				0	om	\<variable id=\"rahm\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertFrame\"\>Gooddayyaa tokko isa teessuma tarjaawwan tokko yk tokko ol barruu fi wantootaaf uumuu sidandeesiissuu saaga.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153678				0	om	Goodayyaa tokko gulaaluudhaaf, handaaraa cuqaasii filadhu, kana booda \<emph\>Dhangi'i - Goodayyaa/Wanta\</emph\> filadhu. Akkasuumas, goodayyaa filatamaa tokkoof, \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04130100.xhp\" name=\"shortcut keys\"\>qabduuwwan qaxxaamura\</link\> fayyadamuudhaan, hagamtaa jijjiiruu yk siqsuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152952				0	om	Goodayyaa tokko haquudhaaf, handaara goodayyaa cuqaasitii, kana booda haqi dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151311				0	om	Yoo jalqabaaf dhumaa barruu goodayyaa keessatti xiyyoota dimaa xiqqaa agarte, qabduuwwan xiyya kana barruu hafan keessa maruudhaaf, itti fayyadami.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155896				0	om	Bakka duraargii, qaaqa \<emph\>goodayyaa\</emph\> keessatti, goodayyaan rektaangilii magariisaan, bakki wabii ammoo, rektaangilii diimaadhaan bakkabuu'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149694				0	om	yammuu korkoddii goodayyaa gara "Akka Arfii" tti jijjiirtu, akkasuuma durargii galteewwanii agarsiissuu nidandeessa. "Sarjala"n halluu diimaadhaan fakkafama, "Arfii"n hojjaa bocquutti, akkasuuma "Sararii" hojjaa sararaa kan goodayyaa dabalateetti.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149107				0	om	Sajoo kamshaa Saagi irratti:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148970				0	om	\<variable id=\"syrahmentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertFrameInteract\"\>Bakka ati galmee keessatti harkisuu dandeessu, goodayyaa tokko fakkasa. Lakkoofsa tarjaawwanii goodayyaadhaaf filachuuf, xiyya isa sajoo itti aanee jiru chuqaasi.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
