helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147569				0	om	Caasaa fi Dhangeessuu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638	7			0	om	Sararichi\<emph\>Caasaa \</emph\> galfataawwan kasaa keessaa, akkamiin akka barqiifaman murteessa. Danaa galfata tokkoo jijjiiruuf, lakkadda yk barruu saanduqaawwan duwwaa sarara kana iraa jiranitti, lakkadda yk barruu galchuu ni danddeessaa. Akkasumas, saaduqa duwwaa yk lakkadda tokko keessatii cuqaasuu fi ittaansitee qabduu lakkaddaa tokko  cuqaasuu nidandeessa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3149292	35			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\> Hafaa sarara\<emph\>Caasaa \</emph\> mul'isa..\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512	8			0	om	Sarara \<emph\>Caasaa \</emph\> irraa lakkadda tokko haquuf, lakkaddicha cuqaasiitii isa booddee furtuu \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Haqi\</item\> dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3149806	9			0	om	Sarara \<emph\>Caasaa \</emph\>irraa lakkadda tokko bakka buusuuf, lakkadicha cuqaasiitii, itti aansii qabduu lakkaddaa tokko cuqaasi.				20200411 15:09:53
