helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3149490	16			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_TOX_ENTRY:PB_TAB\"\>Dhaabduu caancalaa tokko saaga. Xuqaawwan dursaa dhaabduu caancalaatti ida'uudhaaf, \<emph\>Fill character box\</emph\> keessaa arfii tokko filadhu. Qubannoo dhaabduu caancalaa jijjiiruudhaaf, saanduqa \<emph\>Qubannoo dhaabduu caancalaa \</emph\>keessaatti gatii tokko galchi, yk ammoo saanduqa filannoo \<emph\>Mirga hiriirsi \</emph\> filadhu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
