helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3150554				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_TOX_ENTRY:CB_RELTOSTYLE\"\>Dhaabduu caancalaa, gatii "galumsa bitaa irraa", isa akkaataa keewwataa caancala \<emph\>Akkaataawwani\</emph\> irratti filatameen murteeffame, waliin haala firoomeen qubachiisa. Kana malee dhaabduun caancalaa sun kallattii galumsa fuula bitaatiin qubachiifama.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
