helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145776				0	om	Barruu miiljalee yk Ibsadabalataa atattamaan utaaluuf, korkoddii yaadannoo galmee keessa cuqaasi. qubannoo qaree gara duuraa yk boodaa malkatatti gochuu ni dandeessa, isa booda Ctrl+Shift+PgDn dhiibi. Gara korkoddii  boodaa yaadannootti PgUp dhiibi. 				20200411 15:09:53
