helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147167				0	om	Dirreewwanii, odeeffannoo waa'ee galmee ammaa, fakkeenyaaf, maqaa faayilii, qajojii, xiinannoo, deetaa fayyadammaa, guyyaaf yeroo galchuuf fayyada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154470				0	om	Alaaguuf alerguu HTML kan dirreewwan guyyaaf yerootiif, \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090007.xhp#datumuhrzeit\" name=\"special $[officename] formats\"\>dhangiiwwan $[officename] addaatu\</link\>fayyadamma.				20200411 15:09:53
