helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145771				0	om	Guyyaa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3151370				0	om	Deetaa ammaa saaga. Deetaa akka dirree dhaabii tokkotti saaguu ni dandeessa - \<item type=\"literal\"\>Guyyaa (dhaabii)\</item\> - isa hin jijjiirramnee, yk akka dirree kanaatii - \<item type=\"literal\"\>Guyyaa\</item\> - isa ufmaan haaromu dha. Hujeekaan haaromsuuf, dirree \<item type=\"literal\"\>Guyyaa\</item\>, F9 dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150699				0	om	Maqaa faayilii				20200411 15:09:53
