helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3146341				0	om	Inserts fields containing user data. You can change the user-data that is displayed by choosing \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010100.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] - User Data\"\>$[officename] - User Data\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3148863				0	om	Xiinannoo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3151091	23			0	om	Inserts document statistics, such as page and word counts, as a field. To view the statistics of a document, choose \<emph\>File - Properties\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Statistics\</emph\> tab.               				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153302				0	om	Qajojiilee				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3156123				0	om	Maqaa faayilii, kan xuree, ykn maqaa faayilii dheertoo malee kan qajojii ammaa saaga. Qajojii ammaa keessatti maqoota dhangiiwwanii "Akaakuu" fi kan "Garsuu" fayyadamtee, saaguu ni dandeessa. Qajojii keessatti maqoota kan Akaakuuwwan qajojiif akkaataalee fayadamtee mul'isuuf, \<emph\>Faayilii - Qajojiilee -\</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01110100.xhp\" name=\"Organize\"\>\<emph\>Qindeessi\</emph\>\</link\> filadhu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3146939				0	om	Yeroo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154340				0	om	Yeroo ammaa saaga. Yarroo, akka dirree dhaabbii tokkotti - \<item type=\"literal\"\>Yarroo (dhaabii)\</item\> - isa hin jijjiirramnee, yk akka dirree kanaatii - \<item type=\"literal\"\>Yeroo\</item\> - isa ufmaan haaromutti saaguu ni dandeessa. Hujeekaan haaromsuuf, dirree \<item type=\"literal\"\>Yeroo\</item\>, F9 dhiibi.				20200411 15:09:53
