helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145188	39			0	om	Yoo barbaadde, lakkoofsa fuulaa agarsiisameef \<emph\>Iddooda \</emph\> galchuu nidandeessa. \<emph\>Offset\</emph\> gatiinssaa 1 waliin, dirreen kan agarsiisu, lakkoofsa isa tokko lakkoofsa fuulaa ammaa caaluu dha, haata'uu malee, fuulii lakkoofsa sana qabuu yoo jiraatte qofa. Galmee irraa fuulii dhumaa, dirreen walfakkaatu kun duwwaa ta'a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150891				0	om	Iddooda				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155312				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:TP_FLD_DOK:ED_DOKVALUE\"\>Dirree lakkoofsaa fuulatti gatii iddoodaa isa fayyadamuuf barbaaddu saagi, fakkeenyaaf, "+1".\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154948				0	om	Lakkoofsa fuulaa mul'atuu osoo hintaanee, lakkoofsa fuulaa isa dhugaa jijjiiruu yoo barbaade, gatii \<emph\>Iddoodaa\</emph\> hinfayyadamiin. Lakkoofsoota fuulaa jijjiiruu yoo barbaade, qajeelfama \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/pagenumbers.xhp\" name=\"Page Numbers\"\>\<emph\>Lakkoofsa Fuulaa\</emph\>\</link\> kana duubisi.				20200411 15:09:53
