helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150138				0	om	\<variable id=\"datumuhrzeitformat\"\>Yammuu "Dhangiiwwan dabalataa" cuqaastuu, Qaaqa, iddoo dhangii maamiloo itti hiiktu \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020300.xhp\" name=\"Number Format\"\>\<emph\>Dhangii Lakkoofsa\</emph\>\</link\> kana bana. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154867				0	om	Dirree boqonnaatiif yoo "Gargareessaa malee lakkoofsa boqonnaa" filattee, gargareessaawwan sana lakkoofsa boqonnaaf \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/06060000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Outline numbering\"\>\<emph\>Meeshaalee - Lakkaawwii toorii\</emph\>\</link\> keessatti ifteefamee hinagarsiifamu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3156079				0	om	Dirreewwan wabiif akka \<emph\>dhangii\</emph\> "lakkoofsa boqonnaatti" yoo filattee, dirree keessaa lakkoofsa kan mataduree boqonnaa wanta wabeefame of keessaa qabu qofa agarsiisa. Mataduree boqonnaa kanaaf haalata keewwataa yoo lakkoofsi hinlatamneef, dirrichii duwwaa tahe hafa.				20200411 15:09:53
