helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150786	24			0	om	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Qaaqa iddoo galfata BarruuUfmaa filatameef maqaa itti jijjiiruu dandeessu bana.\</ahelp\>Qaaqa, \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02120100.xhp\" name=\"Rename Text Block\"\>BarruuUfmaa Maqaa Jijjiiri\</link\> iddoo galfata BarruuUfmaa filatameef maqaa itti jijjiiruu dandeessu bana.				20200411 15:09:53
