helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155358				0	om	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MD_GLOS_EDIT\"\>Galmee addaa keessatti galfata BarruuUfmaa filatamee gulaaluuf bana, akkasumaas, jijjirami akka ta'uu  barabaaduuf, \<emph\>Faayilii - BarruuUfmaa Olkaa'i\</emph\> filadhuutii, kana booda, \<emph\>Faayilii - Cufi\</emph\>filadhu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
